\par }{\fs20\lang1024\langfe1024\noproof {\shp{\*\shpinst\shpleft1440\shptop2070\shpright10512\shpbottom2070\shpfhdr1\shpbxpage\shpbxignore\shpbypage\shpbyignore\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt0\shpz2\shplockanchor\shplid2049{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn fFlipH}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFlipV}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn shapePath}{\sv 4}}{\sp{\sn fFillOK}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFilled}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fArrowheadsOK}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn posrelh}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn posrelv}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}}{\shprslt{\*\do\dobxpage\dobypage\dodhgt8194\dpline\dpptx0\dppty0\dpptx9920\dppty0\dpx1190\dpy2070\dpxsize9920\dpysize0\dplinew15\dplinecor0\dplinecog0\dplinecob0}}}}{\f0\fs16  \par }}{\footerf \pard\plain \s22\ql \b\f354\fs18  Page {\field{\*\fldinst PAGE}{\fldrslt 1}}{     }\'a9 2025 \uc2 Factiva, Inc.  All rights reserved.\par }{\footer \pard\plain \s22\ql \b\f354\fs18  Page {\field{\*\fldinst PAGE}{\fldrslt 1}} of {\field{\*\fldinst NUMPAGES}{\fldrslt 1}}{     }\'a9 2025 \uc2 Factiva, Inc.  All rights reserved.\par }\pard\plain \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\fs20 {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/31: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, XRP, UNI, THETA, LTC, LINK\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,933 \uc2 words\par \uc2 31 March 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s recovery from its recent lows and the stellar performance from altcoins signal that bulls are confident BTC will retest its all-time high.\par \par \uc2 Following in the footsteps of \uc2 Morgan Stanley\uc2 , \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  has announced {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/goldman-sachs-readying-bitcoin-product-for-clients-btc-bounces-above-58k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 plans}}}\uc2  to allow its wealth management clients to trade in cryptocurrencies and other digital assets. In an interview with CNBC, Mary Rich, the global head of digital assets for \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  private wealth management division, said that the rollout may happen sometime in the second quarter of 2021.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin adoption by two of the world\u8217\'20\'19s preeminent investment banks is likely to force other banks to walk down the crypto path sooner than later. The arrival of fresh money from the clients of these legacy institutions may further increase demand and boost prices higher.\par \par \uc2 In response to a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/one-btc-will-be-worth-a-lambo-by-2022-and-a-bugatti-by-2023-kraken-ceo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 question}}}\uc2  about Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) future value, Kraken CEO Jesse Powell told Bloomberg that one Bitcoin, which currently buys a Tesla Model 3, will buy a Lamborghini by the end of the year and a Bugatti by 2023.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/e235c3b2-1800-42f4-b5a9-e78e24a11a4d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Another {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-on-inevitable-path-to-reach-gold-s-market-cap-mike-novogratz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  voice was that of Galaxy Digital CEO Mike Novogratz who said in an interview with CNBC that Bitcoin \u8220\'20\'1Cis on an inevitable path to having the same market cap and then a higher market cap as gold.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 However, not everyone is \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Bitcoin. Boris Schlossberg, the managing director of FX strategy at BK Asset Management, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2021/03/31/bitcoin-may-be-very-very-close-to-intermediate-term-top-strategist.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told CNBC}}}\uc2  said that Bitcoin was \u8220\'20\'1Cvery, very close to perhaps an intermediate-term top here.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine the trend and the path of least resistance.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been sustaining above the descending channel since breaking out of it on March 29, which is a positive sign. However, the bears have not given up yet as they are aggressively defending the $60,000 level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/71f0734b-7c6d-48f4-8a2b-491178354579.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price had turned down from $59,789 today, but an encouraging sign is that the bulls purchased the dip and did not allow the BTC/USDT pair to re-enter the channel. The bulls will now make one more attempt to rise above the all-time high at $61,825.84.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the pair could resume the uptrend and start its northward march toward the first target at $69,279 and then $79,566. The upsloping moving averages suggest the bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 However, the relative strength index (RSI) has been showing a negative divergence for the past few days. If the indicator turns down sharply from the downtrend line, it will suggest that the new uptrend may have to wait for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages. On the contrary, if the RSI rises above the downtrend line, it will indicate that the momentum has picked up, enhancing the prospects of a rally.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been knocking on the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle. A tight consolidation near a resistance increases the possibility of a break above it. The 20-day exponential moving average ($1,743) has turned up and the RSI is in the positive zone, indicating advantage to the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/65733e63-f24a-4678-9e4b-c9bf217765da.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the buyers can drive the price above the triangle, the ETH/USDT pair could retest the all-time high. If the bulls clear this hurdle, the pair could then start its rally toward the pattern target at $2,618.14.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily. They will mount a stiff resistance at $2,040.77. If the price turns down from this overhead resistance but does not re-enter the triangle, then it will suggest that bulls are buying on dips. If that happens, the pair may have a good possibility of breaking above $2,040.77.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bulls fail to sustain the price above the triangle, it will suggest that traders are squaring up their positions at higher levels. That could keep the pair range-bound for a few more days. The first sign of weakness will be when the price dips below the trendline.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to propel Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above $315. Although the price turned down from the overhead resistance today, the long tail on the candlestick suggests the bulls are buying on every minor dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/6dafeed9-3eba-455a-b334-823ccf7dc8c1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is in the positive territory, suggesting the path of least resistance is to the upside. If the bulls can drive the price above $315, the BNB/USDT pair could rally to $348.69.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above the all-time high could start the next leg of the uptrend that could reach $430. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current level and plummets below the 20-day EMA ($265).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been sustaining above the 20-day EMA ($1.16) for the past few days but the bulls have not been able to push the price above $1.30. This suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/48ccc319-465b-4756-939f-477c4a2941c4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the RSI is just above the midpoint, suggesting a balance between supply and demand. The bears will now try to sink the price below the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 If they do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to the $1.03 support. A break below this support will suggest the start of a deeper correction to $0.80.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA and the bulls push the price above $1.30, the pair could rally to $1.48.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 After a minor hesitation near the 20-day EMA ($34.35), Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has broken above the moving averages today. This shows strong demand at higher levels. The bulls will now try to push the price above the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/c96c9d6b-0678-4273-a9a5-c32ebe7c58da.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the DOT/USDT pair could retest the all-time high at $42.28. If the momentum can conquer this resistance, the pair could start the next leg of the uptrend that may reach $53.50.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price turns down from the downtrend line, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels. That could keep the pair range-bound for a few more days. The flat moving averages and the RSI above 58 suggest a minor advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  once again turned down from near the $0.60 overhead resistance. However, the positive sign is that the bulls have purchased the dip to the 20-day EMA ($0.51) as seen from the long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/82255737-dc06-4a77-a296-080a43e39846.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside. The bulls are now likely to make one more attempt to push the price above $0.60.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, a rally to $0.65 is possible. This level may act as a stiff resistance, but if the bulls can thrust the price above it, the XRP/USDT pair could pick up momentum. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price dips below the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) rebound off the 50-day simple moving average ($27.26) on March 26 has not been able to clear the 20-day EMA ($29.12) hurdle. This shows that the sentiment has changed from buy on dips to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/48e48821-c0a2-48cd-8955-47b6dd0d2108.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears now sink the price below the $25.50 support, the UNI/USDT pair could enter a corrective phase that could pull the price down to $20 and then to $18.\par \par \uc2 The marginally downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a minor advantage to the bears.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the price turns up from the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA. Such a move could extend the stay of the pair inside the range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 THETA/USDT\par \par \uc2 THETA turned down from $13.95 on March 29, which indicates the bears are aggressively defending the $14 to $14.96 resistance zone. The bears will now try to sink the altcoin to the 20-day EMA ($10.27).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/7498f639-f007-431d-a884-992f3739d317.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 THETA/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/THETAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 In an uptrend, the bulls generally buy the dips to the 20-day EMA as it offers an attractive risk to reward ratio. Therefore, if the THETA/USDT pair rebounds off this support with strength, it will suggest the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 That could keep the pair range-bound between $10.35 and $14 for a few more days. On the contrary, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest a possible change in sentiment. The pair could then drop to the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at $8.88.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) relief rally seems to have hit a wall at the 50-day SMA ($196) as the bulls have not been able to sustain the price above it. The bears will now try to sink the price to the trendline of the triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/93cad360-b948-49a8-bc17-394d2826710d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the trendline, it will indicate that the bulls continue to buy on dips. That could keep the LTC/USDT pair trading inside the triangle for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 This neutral view will invalidate after the price either breaks above or below the triangle. That could signal the possible start of a trending move.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) broke above the 20-day EMA ($27.79) on March 29 and 30 but could not climb the 50-day SMA ($29). Although the price turned down today, the bulls bought the dip as seen from the long tail on the candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/d2d0287e-7ef8-4597-ab3a-cc49b887412f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls may now make one more attempt to push the price above the 50-day SMA. If they manage to do that, the LINK/USDT pair could rise to $32. A break above this resistance will suggest advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price again turns down from the 50-day SMA, then a drop to $24 is likely. This is an important support to keep an eye on because if it cracks, the pair will complete a descending triangle pattern, which could signal a possible trend reversal. Such a move could open the doors for a decline to $14.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDMvNzgyMTJkYTUtNGJmYy00MDk2LWI3MjQtZWQ5NTVkM2QzZDU3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210331eh3v000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/29: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, XRP, UNI, THETA, LTC, LINK\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,816 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 March 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s renewed push above the descending channel trendline suggests bulls are preparing to push BTC and altcoins to new highs.\par \par \uc2 On Monday Visa {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/visa-plans-to-allow-partners-to-settle-fiat-transactions-with-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  that it had launched a pilot program with Crypto.com to enable its partners to settle fiat transactions by sending USD Coin (USDC) stablecoin to Visa\u8217\'20\'19s Ethereum address at Anchorage digital bank. This step by Visa shows that legacy finance companies are increasing their adoption of cryptocurrencies.\par \par \uc2 According to a PwC report {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-mergers-and-acquisitions-doubled-to-1-1b-in-2020-pwc-reports"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reviewed}}}\uc2  by Bloomberg, crypto mergers and acquisitions soared to $1.1 billion in 2020 compared to $481 million in 2019. The increase in these deals is likely to surpass the 2020 numbers on every single metric with the arrival of large investors and institutional players according to PwC global crypto leader Henri Arslanian.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/4bc0d133-25b2-4734-97e6-162d55c4c13a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Several investors who had previously been critical of cryptocurrencies are gradually taking the plunge. The latest to join is the Norwegian billionaire investor \u216\'00\'D8ystein Stray Spetalen, who went from a Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) basher to a crypto adopter {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/norwegian-billionaire-ditches-skepticism-invests-in-local-crypto-exchange"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 within}}}\uc2  one month. Spetalen recently announced that he has joined the board of Norway's top domestic crypto exchange MiraiEx and also purchased an undisclosed amount of Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 The arrival of new investors has increased the demand whereas the HODLers {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hodlers-are-not-selling-inactive-btc-supply-hits-3-month-low"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sitting}}}\uc2  tight with their holdings has reduced the supply. Could this result in the resumption of the uptrend? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has broken out of the resistance line of the descending channel. If the bulls can sustain the price above the channel, it enhances the prospects of a retest of the all-time high at $61,825.84.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/5c6ed3e7-be33-43ec-89f8-a9770e2a4bb4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average ($55,090) has started to turn up and the relative strength index (RSI) has risen above 59, indicating the bulls have the upper hand. A breakout and close above $61,825.84 could open the doors for a rally to $69,279 and then $79,566.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily. They are likely to pose a stiff challenge at $61,825.84. If the BTC/USD pair turns down from this level but stays above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  as traders are buying the dips.\par \par \uc2 A break below the 50-day simple moving average ($52,376) will be the first sign that bears are making a comeback.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade inside the symmetrical triangle, which usually acts as a continuation pattern. The bulls have pushed the price above the moving averages today, indicating strong buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/7426e80f-deb1-49ba-9d4f-1e15cf62b98c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now try to push the price above the downtrend line of the triangle. If they manage to do that, the ETH/USD pair could move up to $2,040.77 and then to the pattern target at $2,618.14.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the downtrend line, the pair could extend its stay inside the triangle for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The indicators are giving a mixed signal. While the flat moving averages suggest a few more days of range-bound action inside the triangle, the RSI above 57 suggests the momentum is picking up in favor of the bulls.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the downtrend line on March 27. The 20-day EMA ($256) has started to turn up and the RSI is in the positive territory, suggesting the bulls are trying to gain the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/fdc8db54-1fb4-4da8-b1ab-9fa333e7c0e4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 There is a minor resistance at $280 but the bulls are likely to push the price above it. If they do that, the BNB/USD pair could rise to $309.50 where the bears may mount a stiff resistance. If the price turns down from this resistance, the pair may spend a few more days in consolidation.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls can thrust the price above $309.50, a retest of the all-time high at $348.69 is possible. A breakout of this resistance will suggest the resumption of the uptrend, which has a target objective at $430.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) continues to consolidate in the $1.03 to $1.48 range. The bulls have been sustaining the price above the 20-day EMA ($1.15) for the past three days, which is a positive sign.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/e348a24b-f921-4f40-a0c9-4e5b46b9acf7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is rising gradually and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating a minor advantage to the bulls. If the bulls can propel the price above $1.30, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair could rally to $1.48. A breakout of this resistance could start the next leg of the uptrend that may reach $2.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be negated if the price turns down and breaks below the $1.03 support. Such a move could open the doors for a decline to $0.80.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) rebound off the $26.50 support has risen above the 20-day EMA ($34) today. This suggests the bulls have overpowered the bears and will now try to push the price to the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/8955ac04-0169-46a6-a8f9-fa048019f84f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can drive the price above the downtrend line, the DOT/USD pair may retest the all-time high at $42.28. A breakout of this resistance could open the doors for a rally to $53.50.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from the downtrend line, the pair could remain stuck inside the $26.50 to $40 range for a few more days. A break and close below $26.50 could start a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  formed an inside day candlestick pattern on March 27 and a Doji candlestick formation on March 28, both indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. Today, the bulls are trying to resolve the uncertainty in their favor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/83b9938c-8b8d-483e-8d04-e71de24959fd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can propel the price above $0.58, the XRP/USD pair could rally to $0.65. There is a minor resistance at $0.60 but that is likely to be crossed. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI above 61 suggest the bulls have the advantage.\par \par \uc2 The pair is likely to pick up momentum after breaking above the $0.65 resistance. Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the moving averages, a drop to $0.42 is possible.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls faced a stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($29.31) on March 27 and 28 but the positive thing was that they did not allow the price to dip below the 50-day SMA ($26.91). Today, the bulls are again trying to push Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/c4a64999-dde7-46fa-ad41-6876c69d0d1d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the buyers can sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest the recent break below $27.97 on March 24 was a bear trap. The UNI/USD pair could then gradually move up to the overhead resistance at $35.20.\par \par \uc2 A breakout of the $35.20 to $36.80 overhead resistance zone could start the next leg of the uptrend. Alternatively, a break below $25.52 may indicate the start of a deeper correction. Until then, volatile range-bound trading is likely to continue.\par \par \uc2 THETA/USDT\par \par \uc2 THETA is consolidating between $14.96 and 10.35. In an uptrend, when the correction stalls at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level, it shows that traders are not rushing to the exit but are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/2f803175-aec4-4090-a9f4-3d0f041152ad.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 THETA/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/THETAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the overbought zone suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside. If the bulls can drive the price above $14.96, the THETA/USD pair may start its journey toward $19.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from $14.96, the pair may extend its stay inside the range. The bears will have to sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($9.81) to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) broke below the symmetrical triangle on March 24 but the bears could not capitalize on this advantage. The bulls pushed the price back into the triangle on March 26 and this could have trapped several aggressive bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/4487a7ff-61e2-43b0-910b-95a602300c68.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 After defending the trendline of the triangle on March 27 and 28, the bulls have pushed the price above the 20-day EMA ($190.68) today. The price could now move up to the resistance line of the triangle where the bulls are likely to face stiff resistance from the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the resistance line, the LTC/USD pair could extend its stay inside the triangle for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls drive the price above the triangle, the pair may rally to $246.96 and then to the pattern target at $309. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down and plummets below $168.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) remains stuck in a range between $24 and $32. The rebound off the support of the range has reached the 50-day SMA ($29) where the bears may offer some resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/aa0ce638-b835-4945-9532-e1f30dd8cc2a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the RSI just above the midpoint do not project a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. The indicators suggest the continuation of the range-bound action for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 If the LINK/USD pair turns down from the 50-day SMA, the bears will make another attempt to sink the price below $24. If they succeed, the pair may drop to $20.11 and then to $18.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bulls can drive the price above the moving averages, the pair may rally to $32. A break above this level will increase the possibility of the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDMvNjg1YTZhZWQtMzJlMi00Y2RmLTgxMDgtMzlhOTRhYjM2MzFlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210329eh3t000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/26: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, XRP, UNI, THETA, LTC, LINK\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,945 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 March 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price bounced off the 50-day moving average but the real test is near $57,500 where the bears are likely to push back.\par \par \uc2 Glassnode {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-buyers-mean-business-as-coinbase-reserves-drop-8b-in-3-months"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 data }}}\uc2  shows Bitcoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC }}}\uc2  ) exchange reserves on \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  have dropped by about $8 billion. This indicates that institutional investors are locking away their purchases in cold storage for the long term instead of booking profits.\par \par \uc2 HODLing by institutions is a huge positive as it will continue to reduce Bitcoin's available supply, which may boost prices even if demand begins to diminish.\par \par \uc2 The news flow suggests no slowdown in institutional adoption. New Zealand Wealth Funds Management revealed that its product KiwiSaver Growth Strategy {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-zealand-retirement-fund-reportedly-allocates-5-to-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 allocated }}}\uc2  5% of its assets to Bitcoin in October 2020.\par \par \uc2 According to the firm\u8217\'20\'19s chief investment officer James Grigor, the first Bitcoin purchase took place when Bitcoin was at $10,000. This means that when Bitcoin hit an all-time high at $61,825.44, the firm was sitting on a 518% profit. Grigor also added that Bitcoin could feature in more KiwiSaver schemes within the next five years.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/5ba80a30-b34b-49dd-83aa-1eb5e52b7f5c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360 }}}\par \par \uc2 In a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/governments-are-looking-to-buy-bitcoin-nydig-ceo-confirms"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recent }}}\uc2  podcast with Raoul Pal, New York Digital Investment Group CEO Robert Gutmann said the firm has been receiving inquiries from sovereign wealth funds about possible Bitcoin investments. Pal disclosed that Singapore\u8217\'20\'19s sovereign wealth fund \uc2 Temasek\uc2  had been buying virgin Bitcoin from miners.\par \par \uc2 More investors may arrive if the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/asset-management-giant-fidelity-files-for-bitcoin-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 approves }}}\uc2  a Bitcoin exchange-traded fund. The latest to seek approval to launch a \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  is \uc2 Fidelity Investments\uc2  . This shows that legacy financial firms are aggressively adding support to Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 The arrival of all kinds of investors into the crypto space is a positive sign. While that may be \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the long term, let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine the short-term trend.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls had pushed Bitcoin above the 20-day exponential moving average ($54,426) on March 24, but they could not sustain the higher levels, as seen from the long wick and the negative close on the daily candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/5a1e8db6-7f86-41dc-80e4-95ea50d60e6d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USD pair dipped to the 50-day simple moving average ($51,282) on March 25, which is an important support to watch out for because the bears have not achieved a close below it since Oct. 9 of last year.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can sustain the current rebound and push the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair may rise to the downtrend line. The bears are likely to mount a stiff hurdle at this level.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the downtrend line, the bears will make another attempt to sink the pair below the 50-day SMA. If that happens, the pair may witness increased selling pressure from short-term traders, resulting in a drop to $46,000 and then $43,006.77.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the bulls can drive the price above the downtrend line, the pair may rise to the all-time high at $61,825.84. A breakout of this resistance will suggest the resumption of the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH }}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the moving averages for the past three days, signaling weakness. The bulls are attempting a relief rally today but the pullback may face selling by the bears at the 20-day EMA ($1,711).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/e3c46727-3430-4a28-8069-7b5569acb4f3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to sink the ETH/USD pair to $1,500 and then $1,289. The marginally downsloping 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) just below the midpoint suggest a minor advantage to the bears.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls can push the price above the moving averages, the pair may rally to the downtrend line. A breakout of this line will open the doors for a retest of the all-time high at $2,040.77. If the price turns down from the downtrend line, the pair may form a symmetrical triangle.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB }}}\uc2  ) slipped below the 20-day EMA ($251) on March 24 and bears continued their selling on March 25, but they could not break the 50-day SMA ($216) support. This attracted buying from the bulls who are currently trying to push the price back above the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/6f7a6598-efab-4fad-8927-47a7ea734f47.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. If the bulls can push the price above the downtrend line, the BNB/USD pair could rise to $309.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the downtrend line, the bears will once again try to break the 50-day SMA support. If they succeed, the pair may drop to the critical support at $189.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) repeatedly turned down from the 20-day EMA ($1.14) for the past three days, but the bears could not break the $1.03 support. This suggests accumulation by the bulls at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/94c5f930-3bc1-4b3d-8dee-b0e4a94e2f46.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls have pushed the price above the 20-day EMA today. If they can sustain the higher levels, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair may gradually move up to $1.48. The bears are again likely to pose a stiff challenge at this resistance.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flat and the RSI is just above the midpoint suggesting a possible range-bound action for a few days. This neutral view will invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below $1.03. That could signal the start of a deeper correction to $0.80.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT }}}\uc2  ) broke below the symmetrical triangle and the 50-day SMA ($32.55) on March 24, indicating the bears have overpowered the bulls. Usually, after the price breaks below an important level, it tends to retest the level. In this case, the price may rise to the breakdown point, which is close to the 20-day EMA ($34.26).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/a7fe179a-842c-41f7-a4af-c985aa8ac4c0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this resistance, it will suggest the sentiment has turned negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will then try to sink the price below $26.50. If they can pull it off, the DOT/USD pair could extend its decline to the pattern target at $18.22.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the bulls can push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest strong buying at lower levels and a possible consolidation for a few days.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP }}}\uc2  dropped below the $0.50 support and the moving averages on March 24. However, the positive thing was that the lower levels attracted strong buying from traders and the price snapped back above the $0.50 level on March 25.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/dfb69676-62ef-4714-be9b-a1e482439b3c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The RSI bounced off the midpoint and the moving averages are sloping up, indicating the sentiment has turned positive and traders view dips as a buying opportunity. If the bulls can drive the price above $0.60, the XRP/USD pair may rally to $0.65 and then $0.78.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price again turns down from $0.60, it will indicate a lack of demand at higher levels. That could keep the pair range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USD\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI }}}\uc2  ) plunged below the support of the $27.97 to $35.20 range on March 24. However, the bears could not sink the price below the 50-day SMA ($26.38), which shows the bulls are defending this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/6dd642ea-8b17-4e9d-b005-808b7ffade47.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The UNI/USD pair has bounced off the 50-day SMA and the bulls will now try to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($29.62). If they succeed, the price may once again rise to the $35.20 to $36.80 overhead resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the pair turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will once again try to sink the price below the 50-day SMA. If that happens, the pair may drop to $20.74. The 20-day EMA has started to turn down and the RSI is just below the midpoint, suggesting a minor advantage to the bears.\par \par \uc2 THETA/USD\par \par \uc2 THETA is currently consolidating in a strong uptrend. The bulls purchased the dip to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $10.31 on March 25. This shows the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying the dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/67aa8d01-1886-49e6-afe5-0813e5b8b139.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 THETA/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/THETAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls can thrust the price above the $13 to $14.96 zone, the THETA/USD pair could start the next leg of the uptrend that may reach $19. The rising moving averages and the RSI in the overbought zone suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears successfully defend the overhead resistance zone, the pair may remain range-bound between $10.31 and $14.96 for a few days. A break below $10.31 could extend the decline to the 20-day EMA ($8.74).\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC }}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($191) on March 24 and broke below the trendline of the symmetrical triangle. This is a negative sign as it suggests that the triangle is acting as a reversal pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/4e8b9a21-0908-4a75-a358-41f91a75f529.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative zone suggest the bears have the upper hand. If the price again turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to extend the correction to $152.94 and then to $120.\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls are unlikely to give up easily. They will try to push the price back above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, it will show aggressive buying at lower levels and may keep the LTC/USD pair inside the triangle for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK }}}\uc2  ) plummeted below the minor support at $26.28 on March 24 and reached the important support at $24. Although the bulls have held this support for the past two days, the rebound lacks strength, indicating a lack of confidence among buyers that the correction may be over.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/714818dd-da99-441b-93eb-37b2847575f8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($27.97) has started to turn down and the RSI has dipped into the negative territory, suggesting that bears have the upper hand. A break below $24 could intensify selling that may drag the LINK/USD pair to $20.11.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the bulls can push the price above the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest strong buying at lower levels and could keep the pair range-bound between $24 and $32 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC }}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDMvZjZjYjg1NDAtNDAyZi00M2E3LTljYTYtYzY1OGQxYzM2NTY0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210326eh3q000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/24: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, XRP, UNI, THETA, LTC, LINK\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,900 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 March 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price is still meeting strong sell pressure near a key trendline, indicating the possibility of further downside for BTC and altcoins in the coming days.\par \par \uc2 On March 24, Tesla CEO Elon Musk {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/elon-musk-says-tesla-now-accepts-bitcoin-from-us-customers"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  that U.S. buyers are now able to purchase Tesla vehicles with Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ). Musk also tweeted that Tesla will not convert BTC payments into fiat but will add to its existing treasury of about 48,000 Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Wedbush Securities {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://seekingalpha.com/news/3675697-tesla-crypto-move-called-seminal-moment-for-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 analyst}}}\uc2  Dan Ives expects Bitcoin to account for less than 5% of Tesla transactions, but the percentage could move up as \b \highlight22\uc2 crypto adoption\b0 \highlight\uc2  increases. The analyst said the move by Tesla could be a defining moment for Bitcoin from a transactional point of view.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/046179a1-3e6a-4005-9162-8b1a220ab94c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 This week, CNBC host \uc2 Jim Cramer{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-made-me-a-ton-of-money-unlike-stocks-and-gold-jim-cramer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 thanked}}}\uc2  Anthony Pompliano on the Pomp Podcast for convincing him to invest $500,000 in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) in September 2020. Cramer said his Bitcoin investment has made him "a ton of money."\par \par \uc2 However, during the same period, Cramer said his gold investment \u8220\'20\'1Clet him down.\u8221\'20\'1D Due to this, Cramer altered his age-old advice of allocating 10% of the portfolio to gold. He now recommends investors put 5% of their portfolio allocation in gold and 5% in Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 With positive news flow acting as a tailwind, could Bitcoin and major altcoins resume their uptrend? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke and closed below the pennant and the 20-day exponential moving average ($55,212) on March 22. However, the bears could not take advantage of the weakness and sink the price to the 50-day simple moving average ($50,752). This suggests a lack of sellers at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/fbf302ca-4f7c-4271-96ca-34b406acb291.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls have bought the dip aggressively and pushed the price back above the 20-day EMA today. The next hurdle is the downtrend line. If the buyers can drive the price above this resistance, the BTC/USD pair may retest the all-time high at $61,825.84.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above this level will open the doors for a rally to $72,112 and then $74,512.78.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to give up without a fight. They will try to stall the current relief rally at the downtrend line. If the price turns down from this resistance, the bears will once again try to sink the pair below the 50-day SMA. If they manage to do that, the pair could drop to $43,006.77.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 After failing to rebound off the 20-day EMA ($1,742) for a few days, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) succumbed to selling pressure and plummeted below the moving averages on March 22. The bulls are currently trying to push the price back above the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/55c60ba1-79dd-45b8-a6fe-7d57b72a6130.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the buyers are successful in their endeavor, the ETH/USD pair may again try to reach the all-time high at $2,040.77. A breakout and close above this resistance could resume the uptrend, which has a target objective at $2,614.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned negative and traders are selling on rallies to the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below $1,647, the pair could extend its decline to $1,500 and then $1,289.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is trading inside a wide range between $189 and $309.50. The bulls are attempting to keep the price above the 20-day EMA ($254.66). If they can propel the price above $280, the altcoin may rally to $309.50. A breakout of this resistance could signal an advantage to the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/988a3a49-fbab-4172-9c9b-a4c5074e5459.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from $280, it will suggest traders are booking profits on rallies. The bears will then try to capitalize on this weakness and sink the price below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If they do that, the BNB/USD pair could gradually correct to $220 and then to $189. A break below this support could start a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 Right now, the flat moving average and the RSI above 55 signal a balance between supply and demand, resulting in a few more days of consolidation.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke below the 20-day EMA ($1.14) and the price dipped close to the $1.03 support on March 22. The bulls bought the dip and are currently attempting to push the price back above the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/1c81e680-50f0-406e-8cb7-844f7225f2dd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair may start its journey toward the resistance of the range at $1.48. The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI just above the midpoint also suggest a few days of consolidation.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level and slides below $1.03, it could attract further selling from the bears. That could result in a drop to $0.80 and then $0.70.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 The failure to sustain Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle on March 20 could have trapped the aggressive bulls, which led to a correction and the price dipped to the support line of the triangle on March 23.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/8904f24e-fae5-4e4c-9a53-b557ed81dc73.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The strong rebound off the support line shows the bulls are accumulating on dips. They will now once again try to propel the price above the triangle. If they can sustain the breakout, the DOT/USD pair could move up to $40.10 and then $42.28. A breakout and close above this resistance could start the next leg of the uptrend that could reach $55.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price again turns down from the overhead resistance, the pair may extend its stay inside the range. The price has reached close to the apex of the triangle. Usually, when this happens, the setup is invalidated.\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA ($35.39) and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest a few days of range-bound action.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 The long wick on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s March 22 and 23 candlestick suggests that traders are booking profits at higher levels. However, the positive thing is that the bulls continue to buy on every minor dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/72c44e76-fa87-4b66-a116-bcf3bbc92f5f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI above 63 suggest that bulls have the upper hand. If they can push the price above $0.60, the XRP/USD pair may challenge the stiff resistance at $0.65. A breakout and close above this level could attract further buying, pushing the price to $0.78 and then $1.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages. Such a move could pull the price down to $0.42.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USD\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) broke above the $35.20 overhead resistance on March 22 but the bulls could not sustain the breakout. The bulls again tried to clear the hurdle on March 23 but met with heavy selling pressure at higher levels. That dragged the price back into the $27.97 to $35.20 range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/bd2eda87-8f08-45a4-b011-417725e2a411.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($30.41) is flattening out and the RSI is just above the midpoint, suggesting the range-bound action may extend for a few more days. The longer the time spent in a range, the stronger will be the eventual breakout from it.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above $35.20 could start the next leg of the uptrend that may drive the UNI/USD pair to $42.43 and then $46. On the contrary, a break and close below $27.97 may start a deeper correction to $20.74.\par \par \uc2 THETA/USD\par \par \uc2 THETA is in a strong uptrend but the long wick on the March 23 candlestick showed profit-booking at higher levels. However, that did not deter the bulls from pushing the altcoin to a new all-time high again today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/e121f421-7a19-4ed2-bda3-512d600138cf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 THETA/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/THETAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The failure to sustain the higher levels has formed a shooting star candlestick pattern today. This increases the possibility of a correction or a consolidation in the next few days. The RSI above 90 also shows the THETA/USD pair is overbought in the short term and may cool down.\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $10.31. If the pair rebounds off this support, it will suggest the trend remains strong as the bulls are not waiting for a deeper correction to buy. Conversely, a break below $10.31 could sink the pair to the 20-day EMA ($8).\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) formed a Doji candlestick pattern on March 23, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. This uncertainty has resolved to the upside today and the bulls are attempting to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($196).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/68aa9f0c-b7bb-41bd-94c7-6dfb5e172fa8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the price could rally to $208.10 and then to the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle. A breakout and close above this resistance will suggest that bulls may be back in command. The LTC/USD pair could then rally to $246.96 and then $300.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the bears will once again try to sink the pair below the triangle. If they manage to do that, the selling could intensify, which may pull the price down to $152.94 and then $120.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the moving averages and the trendline of the ascending triangle on March 22. However, the failure of the bears to capitalize on the weakness and sink the price to $24 indicates a lack of sellers at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/11a58c04-c982-4acf-8625-1faf7c1a3830.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to push the price back above the moving averages, but they are likely to face stiff resistance from the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the moving averages and breaks the $26.20 support, the LINK/USD pair could drop to $24 and then to $20.11. The 20-day EMA ($28.63) has started to turn down and the RSI is in the negative territory, which suggests the bears are attempting to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls push the price above the moving averages, the pair could rally to $32. A breakout of this resistance could result in an up-move to $36.93.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDMvZDE3Zjg1NjYtNGYzZS00NmNmLWJjMWEtYWIzNTI2ZDg4YmI5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210324eh3o000dy\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/22: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, XRP, UNI, LTC, LINK, THETA\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,893 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 March 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is stuck in a tight range but that has not stopped select altcoins from continuing their journey to new highs.\par \par \uc2 The Turkish lira lost 15% of its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/exchange-reserves-plunge-to-pre-61k-lows-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 value}}}\uc2  and dipped close to its all-time low after Turkey's President Erdogan fired central bank governor Naci Agbal. This resulted in a massive spike in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) searches in Turkey as investors sought to protect their wealth from devaluation. This is just another example that shows how investors may be treating Bitcoin as a possible substitute for fiat currencies.\par \par \uc2 In other news, United States Federal Reserve chairman Jerome Powell has a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-is-more-a-substitute-for-gold-than-the-dollar-fed-chair-powell"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 different}}}\uc2  view. While speaking at an event hosted by the \uc2 Bank for International Settlements\uc2 , Powell said that Bitcoin is more of a speculative asset and could act as a substitute for gold but its \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and decentralization make it difficult to use as money.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/497d1df6-b443-4de9-9b6e-2e43d437975b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, on-chain data paints a different picture. Glassnode data shows that only about 36% of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/long-term-investors-continue-to-hodl-despite-1t-bitcoin-market-cap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 supply}}}\uc2  has moved in the past six months, indicating that the current price has not tempted long-term Bitcoin investors to part with their holdings.\par \par \uc2 With supply shrinking and demand increasing due to the arrival of institutional investors, Bitcoin remains in a sweet spot. Demand for BTC could receive an additional boost if any of the recently submitted Bitcoin exchange-traded fund {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/skybridge-capital-latest-to-file-bitcoin-etf-application-with-us-sec"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 applications}}}\uc2  are approved by the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The fundamental sentiment remains positive for the crypto sector but do the technicals also project a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  picture? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has formed a pennant pattern which is usually a setup for continuation. The bulls continue to buy the dip to the 20-day exponential moving average ($55,470) as seen from the long tail on the March 21 candlestick but the buyers are struggling to sustain at the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/836b7820-bbf8-41ce-af8d-beafd8a2e285.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level and rises above the pennant, it could signal the resumption of the uptrend. The all-time high at $61,825.84 may offer resistance but if the bulls can overcome it the BTC/USD pair could rally to $72,112 and then to $74,512..\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are sloping up marginally and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the positive territory, indicating that bulls hold a slight edge.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the price below the pennant, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup, which could result in a quick drop to the 50-day simple moving average ($49,981) as the short-term traders hurry to close their positions.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been holding above the 20-day EMA ($1,764) for the past few days, but the failure of the bulls to achieve a strong rebound off this level suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/a0bd15d3-fa4e-470c-8340-df2720453008.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the price below the 50-day SMA ($1,716), the ETH/USD pair could drop to $1,500. Such a move will suggest that the pair may remain range-bound between $1,289 and $2,040 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the $1,942 to $2,040 overhead resistance zone, the pair may start the next leg of the uptrend that could reach $2,614.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) formed a Doji candlestick pattern for the past three days, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. But the only positive sign was that the price did not dip below the 20-day EMA ($255).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/b9934fdf-d422-4cd5-8dad-cde2c6664692.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently trying to expand the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  by pushing the price above the $280 overhead resistance. If they manage to do that, the BNB/USD pair could rally to $309. A breakout and close above this resistance will complete an ascending triangle pattern that has a target objective at $429.\par \par \uc2 The gradually upsloping moving averages and the RSI above 56 suggest a minor advantage to the bulls. However, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance and slides below the trendline of the triangle, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. That could pull the price down to $189.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the $1.23 support on March 20, which suggests a lack of demand. The bulls are attempting to defend the 20-day EMA ($1.16) but the lack of a strong rebound off it increases the likelihood of a break below it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/23578f1a-8365-4b48-85a2-398b0fcee4af.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair could drop to $1.03, which is a critical support to watch out for because the 50-day SMA ($0.99) is also just below it. If the price rebounds off this level, the pair could extend its range-bound action for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. The next trending move could start on a break above $1.48 or a break below $1.03.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) broke above the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle on March 20 but the long wick on the candlestick suggests the bears are selling on rallies. However, the bulls held the 20-day EMA ($35.74) on March 21 and will now again attempt to push the price above the triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/0531643d-d54b-4a75-ac77-1507bef053e2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the DOT/USD pair could retest the all-time high and if that level is conquered, the uptrend could reach the pattern target at $55. The RSI has risen above the downtrend line and the moving averages are gradually sloping up, which shows the momentum is turning in favor of the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level or the $40 to $42.28 overhead resistance zone, the bears will try to sink the pair below the support line of the triangle. If they succeed, the pair could start a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has shown signs of life after a long time. The altcoin soared above the $0.50 resistance on March 20, which shows the bulls have overpowered the bears. The bears tried to sink the price back below $0.50 on March 21 but failed.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/ccbbeb86-a148-485e-b418-fc44a1797076.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This has attracted further buying today, which has pushed the XRP/USD pair towards the overhead resistance at $0.65. If the bulls can drive the price above this level, the pair is likely to pick up momentum and rally to $0.78 and then to $1.\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have turned up and the RSI has risen close to the overbought territory, indicating the bulls are in command. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USD\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) is currently consolidating in an uptrend. The bulls attempted to thrust the price above the overhead resistance at $35.20 on March 20 but did not succeed. However, a positive is that the buyers did not allow the price to even dip to the 20-day EMA ($30.48).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/134d100d-bcac-4361-992d-df14e6e361af.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This suggests the bulls are buying on every minor dip. They are likely to make one more attempt to ascend the $35.20 resistance. If they manage to do that, the UNI/USD pair could start the next leg of the uptrend that may reach $42.43 and then $46.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI above 64 also indicate an advantage to the bulls. This positive view will invalidate if the price again turns down from $35.20 and breaks below the 20-day EMA. Such a move could keep the pair range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the 20-day EMA ($198.52) on March 21. The bears have continued their selling today and are attempting to sink the price below the 50-day SMA ($190.85).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/2fa0161f-37e1-4207-8f39-1c8f6196fdd2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the price could drop to the trendline of the triangle. This is an important support to keep an eye on because if it breaks, the LTC/USD pair could drop to $152.94 and then $120.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price rises from the current levels, the bulls will try to push it to the resistance line of the triangle. A breakout and close above the triangle could result in a retest of $246.96 and then $300.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade inside the ascending triangle but the bulls are struggling to push the price above the $32 overhead resistance. The long wick on the March 20 candlestick shows the bears are defending this resistance aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/f63020f9-ed68-495d-8dca-08811223ef82.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, a minor positive is that the bulls are not allowing the price to break below the moving averages. This suggests the bulls are accumulating at lower levels. This period of indecision is unlikely to continue for long.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up and breaks above $32, the ascending triangle will complete and that has a pattern target at $43.20. Contrary to this assumption, if the bears sink the price below the trendline of the triangle, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup will invalidate. That could pull the price down to $24 and then to $20.1111.\par \par \uc2 THETA/USD\par \par \uc2 The strong up-move of the past few days has propelled THETA into the top-10 ranking cryptocurrencies by market capitalization after Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) was nudged from its spot. Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI has risen above 86 indicating the bulls are in command.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/f5ac8eae-f460-4f70-8264-2d1a6575d387.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 THETA/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/THETAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The first target objective on the upside is a rally to $11.54 where the bears may mount a stiff resistance. However, if the momentum can push the price above $11.54, the THETA/USD pair could rally to $13.19.\par \par \uc2 It is important to note that vertical rallies usually do not have longevity. Therefore, the pair could enter a few days of consolidation or a minor correction to digest the recent gains.\par \par \uc2 A shallow correction or a tight consolidation will suggest the trend remains strong and it will enhance the prospects of the uptrend resuming. A sharp correction, breaking below the $8 support may indicate the bears could be making a comeback.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDMvNDcxZTY5ZDgtNTQ2Ni00YWQ3LThhYTAtYzY5YjRhZGE0MDNhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210322eh3m000dy\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/19: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, XRP, UNI, LTC, LINK, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,821 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 March 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Several altcoins are moving to new all-time highs as bulls struggle to lift Bitcoin price above $60,000.\par \par \uc2 A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-is-now-too-important-to-ignore-deutsche-bank-says"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 report}}}\uc2  by Deutsche Bank Research said that Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has become \u8220\'20\'1Ctoo important to ignore\u8221\'20\'1D and may attract \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the end of 2021. \uc2 Deutsche Bank\uc2  analysts expect Bitcoin to reach a turning point in about \u8220\'20\'1Ctwo or three years\u8221\'20\'1D when it will be clear whether Bitcoin will evolve into an asset class or not. In the short term, the report forecast Bitcoin to \u8220\'20\'1Cremain ultra volatile.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 A different report by \uc2 Bank of America\uc2  provided some insight into the possible reasons for Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \uc2 Bank of America\uc2  analysts estimated that Bitcoin price may {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bank-of-america-claims-it-costs-just-93-million-to-move-bitcoin-s-price-by-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rise}}}\uc2  by one percent when there is a $93 million inflow. Compared to that, gold needs about $2 billion worth of funds to move it by a single percentage point.\par \par \uc2 This large disparity in the price reaction to the inflow of funds is attributed to Bitcoin holders who have not parted with their coins during the current bull run.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/7635075c-81a8-4afe-8dfd-f69e93e094f9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While it is difficult to predict at what price the Bitcoin whales will book profits on their holdings, Kraken growth lead Dan Held said in a recent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/supercycle-may-propel-bitcoin-over-1-million-kraken-s-dan-held-says"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 interview}}}\uc2  with Cointelegraph that Bitcoin could reach $1 million during the current supercycle.\par \par \uc2 Held believes that the confluence of events such as the coronavirus crisis, money printing by central banks and the rising lack of trust in legacy financial firms are the triggers supporting the crypto bull run.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine whether the uptrend will resume or is the bull run showing signs of exhaustion?\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin rebounded off the 20-day exponential moving average ($54,844) on March 17 and rose above the $58,341.03 overhead resistance. But the advance to $60,102.15 witnessed profit-booking on March 18.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/8b0aefca-8661-4803-aae1-77afc9f547c0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the positive sign is that the bulls purchased the dip and have again pushed the price above $58,341.03. A rise above $60,102.15 could retest the all-time high at $61,825.84.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive zone suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside. A break above $61,825.84 could start the next leg of the uptrend to $72,112.\par \par \uc2 Although the RSI is showing negative divergence, traders should follow the price action closely because a sharp rally from the current levels may invalidate this \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  development.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will be the first sign of weakness. A deeper correction could be signaled if the bears sink and sustain the BTC/USD pair below the 50-day simple moving average ($48,578).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading just above the 20-day EMA ($1,756) for the past three days. This is a positive sign as it shows that the bulls are accumulating on dips to the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/1b64bf4c-61cf-462e-bdac-1a064b628d0c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can propel the price above $1,850, the ETH/USD pair could rise to $1,942.92 and then challenge the all-time high at $2,040.77. A breakout and close above this resistance could start the journey to $2,614.\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is in the positive territory, suggesting the bulls have a slight edge.\par \par \uc2 However, this positive assumption will be negated if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages. Such a move could pull the price down to $1,289 and keep the pair range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has successfully held the 20-day EMA ($251) for the past four days but the bulls are struggling to push the price above $280 and challenge the overhead resistance at $309.50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/f07dedc7-e67a-4401-a531-15ebedd891c6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the 20-day EMA is sloping up gradually and the RSI is in the positive zone, which shows a minor advantage to the bulls. A breakout and close above $309.50 will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern. This setup has a target objective at $429.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the trendline of the triangle, it will suggest the bears have overpowered the bulls. That could result in a drop to $189.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned down from the all-time high at $1.48 on March 18 as traders booked profits. However, the positive sign is that the bulls are attempting to defend the breakout level at $1.23.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/876939ff-f4f3-4a9c-a0ac-5a4c383e2c48.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A strong bounce off the current level could increase the possibility of a break above the all-time high. The next target objective on the upside is $2.\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages suggest the bulls are in command, but the negative divergence on the RSI shows the momentum is weakening.\par \par \uc2 If the bears can pull the price below the 20-day EMA ($1.14), it will indicate that supply exceeds demand. The trend may turn in favor of the bears if the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair plummets below the 50-day SMA ($0.94).\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been sustaining above the 20-day EMA ($35) for the past two days, which is a positive sign. The bulls are currently trying to push the price above the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/9c28df9e-8f6e-4f87-a839-2f8dc95695ff.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, it could resume the uptrend. The bulls may face stiff resistance at the all-time high at $42.28 but if they can thrust the price above it, the DOT/USD pair could rise to the pattern target at $55.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is moving up gradually and the RSI has risen above the downtrend line, which shows the bulls are attempting to gain the upper hand. This view will invalidate if the pair turns down and breaks below the support line of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has been trading in a tight range for the past few days as the bears are defending the overhead resistance at $0.50 and the bulls are buying on dips to $0.42. The flat moving averages and the RSI just above 52 suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/dfe8993c-6627-4066-b914-86d93c12a2b8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Usually, a tight range trading is followed by a trending move. In this case, if the bulls can propel the price above $0.50, the XRP/USD pair could rally to $0.65 where it is again likely to counter stiff resistance from the bears.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the bears sink the price below $0.42, the pair could drop to $0.36. This is a critical support to watch out for because a break below it could intensify selling and clear the path for a slide to $0.25.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USD\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) is in an uptrend and it has been holding above the 20-day EMA ($29.41) for the past few days, which shows the bulls are buying the dips to this support. If the bulls can push the price above $32, a retest of the all-time high at $34.92 is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/ea515d87-90c2-4180-866c-ef8d4570d079.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above the all-time high could start the next leg of the uptrend that may reach $46. The upsloping moving averages suggest that bulls are in control but the negative divergence on the RSI warrants caution.\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA, it could signal the start of a deeper correction. The first stop could be the 50-day SMA ($24.78) and if this support also cracks, the decline may extend to $22.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to keep \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($199.41). If they succeed, the altcoin could move up to the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle where the bears are likely to mount a stiff resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/bff4ff53-fc98-4f8e-b533-2342ff283a7d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls manage to propel the price above the triangle, it will suggest a resumption of the next leg of the uptrend. The first stop could be $246.96 and if this level is crossed, the LTC/USD pair could rally to $300.\par \par \uc2 The gradually upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive zone indicate a minor advantage to the bulls. This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below the triangle.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) once again turned down from the overhead resistance on March 18, which shows the bears are defending this level. However, the positive sign is that the bulls did not allow the price to dip below the 50-day SMA ($28.38), indicating buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/97d4fbde-8c64-46e9-b7aa-eb21926dc17b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The LINK/USD pair has formed an ascending triangle pattern that will complete on a breakout and close above $32. This setup has a target objective at $43.20.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the trendline of the triangle, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. That could result in a drop to $24 and then to $20.11.\par \par \uc2 Array\par \par \uc2 The bulls and the bears are battling it out to gain the upper hand in Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ). Although the price had dipped below the moving averages for the past four days, the bears could not capitalize on the situation. This suggests selling dries up at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/9cb751c1-9381-4393-a0d0-75b640ca5e47.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest the BCH/USD pair could remain range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 If the consolidation resolves to the downside and the price closes below $500, the pair could start a deeper correction to $440 and then to $320.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls push and sustain the price above $560, the pair may again try to rally to $631.71 and then $745.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDMvMWY5NDY5YmUtYmE1OS00NGVhLWEwMzAtZjI0ZDJjNjM0MWI5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210320eh3j00001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s $1B futures open interest shows  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2  is a serious contender\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Marcel Pechman \par \uc2 728 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 March 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cardano's \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  listing helped push the open interest on its futures contracts above $1 billion, a signal that investors are seriously interested in \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Cardano ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has had an impressive start to the year as it broke through the psychological $1 barrier and made an all-time high at $1.50. The impressive 590% year-to-date gain took place as the network transformed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-approaches-a-new-major-upgrade-as-ada-posts-an-inspired-rally"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 into a multi-asset network, similar to Ethereum }}}\uc2 , and this could bode well for Cardano's future.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/d4e59fb9-2395-4858-af50-484bcbca603e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price at Binance, USDT. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rally's final leg seems to be related to the \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  Pro listing, announced on March 16, and this resulted in a renewed push to $1.47 on March 18.\par \par \uc2 As Cardano's price increased, so did its spot trading volume and on-chain transfers, which {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/580m-open-interest-makes-cardano-ada-the-third-largest-futures-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 surpassed Litecoin }}}\uc2  ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC }}}\uc2  ). The increased interest from investors also caused Cardano's futures contracts open interest to increase by five-fold in 2021.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/e77714c2-8c2a-4bea-ba8d-1af891b23768.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano futures aggregate open interest. Source: Bybt\par \par \uc2 Make no mistake, breaking the $1 billion open interest barrier is a feat that only ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC }}}\uc2  ) and Ether ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH }}}\uc2  ) have achieved. Moreover, Ether held a $2 billion open interest just three months ago.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, to truly understand if Cardano really deserves the third position in the market capitalization ranking, one should compare its spot volume and on-chain metrics against other altcoins.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading volume and on-chain metrics strengthen\par \par \uc2 Regardless of the price movement, low trading activity reflects a small user base or a lack of new entrants. Therefore, one should expect Cardano's volume to be among the top 5.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/0540554c-8837-431f-bfd5-747e084477e2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Top 10 crypto year-to-date trading volume, USD. Source: Nomics\par \par \uc2 According to Nomics transparent exchange volume, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  had a $97.5 billion trading volume in 2021, surpassing Polkadot ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/polkadot-new/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT }}}\uc2  ), Ripple ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP }}}\uc2  ), and \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  .\par \par \uc2 Although this is promising, one should also dig into on-chain metrics to understand if futures open interest and spot volume reflect this network activity.\par \par \uc2 Daily active addresses provide a more detailed view on network usage. However, this data cannot be trusted blindly. The higher the fees, the fewer incentives there are to inflate the number.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/93f1a257-df2e-4a38-8655-34a9d473c0a5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Daily active addresses, 14-day average. Source: CoinMetrics\par \par \uc2 Cardano definitively seems to be decoupling from other altcoins, reaching 85,000 daily active addresses. Moreover, there appears to be no indication of fabricated numbers as its growth path seems organic and in line with the volume activity.\par \par \uc2 To confirm whether those addresses have been active, one should assess transfers and transactions or the total amount of value effectively circulating on each network.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/606d6331-9807-49e5-a984-c71e0c997846.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Transfers and transactions (USD) 14-day average. Source: CoinMetrics\par \par \uc2 This time around, Cardano's strength is shown in full as the network daily transfers and transactions average $4.5 billion per day. That amount is at least six times higher than the remaining competitors. Therefore, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's on-chain activity provides some support for the $45 billion market capitalization.\par \par \uc2 VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro }}}\uc2  also began to detect \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook on March 16, before the recent \b \highlight22\uc2 price rise\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 score, exclusive to Cointelegraph, is an algorithmic comparison of historical and current market conditions derived from a combination of data points, including market sentiment, trading volume, recent price movements, and \uc2 Twitter\uc2  activity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/f27bbfd7-0c30-4520-9a49-9b4824ee9554.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 score vs. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price (white). Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro }}}\par \par \uc2 As seen in the chart above, the VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 score registered a high of 66 on March 16, twelve hours before the \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  listing announcement. The cryptocurrency then hiked to $1.23, an 18% gain since the signal arose.\par \par \uc2 Volumes and on-chain data are important metrics, but Cardano might have a short window of opportunity to take advantage of challenges caused by congestion on the Ethereum network. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price might recede unless actual use cases that involve decentralized applications or interconnectivity bridges that work to solve the decentralized finance scaling problem.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/noshitcoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 author }}}\uc2  and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDMvNWUxNTE1YjktY2JiNi00OWJiLTgyY2MtMGZkODRkZjNmZWFlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210318eh3i000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/17: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, XRP, UNI, LTC, LINK, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,822 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 March 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Select altcoins could move toward new highs if Bitcoin price continues to trade in a tightening range.\par \par \uc2 Institutional investors have continued to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/digital-asset-investment-products-hit-record-4-2b-inflows-already-this-quarter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pump}}}\uc2  money into cryptocurrency investment products in Q1 of this year, according to a report by CoinShares. The inflows of $4.2 billion in the first quarter have broken the previous record of $3.9 billion made in the fourth quarter of 2020.\par \par \uc2 NYDIG CEO Robby Gutmann recently {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/nydig-head-says-major-firms-will-announce-bitcoin-milestones-next-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  listeners of the \u8220\'20\'1COn the Brink\u8221\'20\'1D podcast to brace for a slew of announcements by the firm\u8217\'20\'19s strategic partners. Gutmann said the announcements could bring new levels of \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin adoption, Bitcoin availability, Bitcoin products and services within the existing traditional financial landscape.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/93d176d7-61f7-42c4-bfa7-2216a589fd14.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While new products and services that may attract fresh investors are a positive sign, traders should also keep an eye on the price of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ). In a bull market, every positive development is cheered by a sharp rise in price.\par \par \uc2 However, when the price stops reacting positively to favorable news, it is a sign of exhaustion. That does not guarantee a change in trend, but being watchful could safeguard traders from short-term pain.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine the next possible trending move.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin rebounded off the 20-day exponential moving average ($53,739) on March 16 but the bulls are struggling to hold on to higher levels. This suggests profit-booking by traders on minor rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/d04d452c-15f4-4e4a-8816-0e3cd85109a0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls again defend the 20-day EMA, it will indicate accumulation at lower levels. That could result in a move back to the all-time high at $61,825.84. A breakout of this resistance will signal the possible start of the next leg of the up-move that may reach $72,112.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bears can sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. The BTC/USD pair could then drop to the 50-day simple moving average ($47,451) where the bulls are likely to step in.\par \par \uc2 The strength of the rebound off the 50-day SMA could provide further insights about the next possible move. A weak bounce will increase the possibility of a drop to the next support at $43,006.77. On the other hand, a strong rebound will suggest the uptrend remains intact.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are struggling to hold Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($1,743). Although the long tail on the March 16 candlestick suggests demand at lower levels, the failure to build upon that recovery today indicates hesitation by the bulls at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/5481640a-e929-4943-aacf-950633603d99.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The repeated retest of a support level, within a short duration, tends to weaken it. If the bears sink the price below the moving averages, the ETH/USD pair could gradually start its descent to $1,455 and then to the critical support at $1,289.\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are flattening out and the RSI is near the midpoint, suggesting a possible consolidation for the next few days. This neutral view will invalidate if the price bounces off the current level and breaks above the all-time high at $2,040.77.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, it will enhance the prospects of the resumption of the uptrend with the next target objective at $2,614.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the 20-day EMA ($247) for the past two days. However, the failure to rebound off it with strength indicates a lack of urgency among the bulls to buy at the current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/0e361000-8af3-4a84-99eb-2607f38957ed.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the RSI is just above the midpoint, suggesting a possible range-bound action for a few days. If that happens, the BNB/USD pair could remain stuck inside $189 and $309.50 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The next down move could start when the bears sink the price below the 50-day SMA ($179). That could result in a deeper correction to $120. Conversely, if the bulls can propel the price above $209.50, the pair may retest the all-time high at $348.69.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) soared and closed above the $1.23 overhead resistance on March 16. However, the bulls are struggling to sustain the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum today, which suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/66ebafc3-0744-4f64-82a7-bc7f47255c32.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price dips and sustains below $1.23, it will suggest that the range-bound action may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 However, the 20-day EMA ($1.11) has started to turn up and the RSI is trying to rise above 60, suggesting that the bulls are attempting to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can defend the breakout level at $1.23, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair could rise to $1.48. A breakout and close above this resistance could indicate the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has formed a symmetrical triangle pattern. Usually, this setup acts as a continuation pattern, but in some cases, it is also known to signal a reversal of the existing trend. Therefore, it is better to wait for the price to break above or below the triangle to determine the next possible trend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/bcdb33c9-259d-4d9f-8120-c7d744749aed.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA ($34.85) and the RSI near the midpoint are not hinting at a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the bears can sink the price below the support line of the triangle, the DOT/USD pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($29.46) and then to $26. The pattern target of the symmetrical triangle is much lower.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns up and breaks above the triangle, it will suggest that the bulls have overpowered the bears. That could start a rally to the pattern target at $55.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  jumped above the $0.50 overhead resistance on March 17, but the long wick on the candlestick suggests the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This shows that traders are closing their positions on every minor rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/61d83b23-9e3a-4eaa-91f8-b4338df366a4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint suggest the XRP/USD pair could remain range-bound between $0.35 and $0.50 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls want to gain the upper hand, they will have to push and sustain the price above $0.50 overhead resistance. If that happens, the pair could rally to $0.65.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the bears sink the price below the $0.35 support, it could lead to panic selling. The next support on the downside is $0.25 and then $0.17.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USD\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Uniswap\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) March 16 candlestick shows the bulls are buying the dips to the 20-day EMA ($28.91). However, the long wick on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows the bears are selling at higher levels. This suggests a tussle between the bulls and the bears at the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/1b770dca-046b-4e57-a3b6-e1a56450bc49.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The negative divergence on the RSI shows the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. Traders may aggressively book profits if the price sustains below the 20-day EMA. Such a move could pull the price down to the 50-day SMA ($24) and then to $20.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the UNI/USD pair rebounds off the 20-day EMA and rises above the all-time high at $34.92. Such a move will indicate the possible resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) is trading inside a large symmetrical triangle. The bulls are currently attempting to defend the 20-day EMA ($198) while the bears are trying to sink the price below it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/3625c073-7cb1-42e8-a450-1ed29b80eb3b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price slips below the 20-day EMA, a drop to the 50-day SMA ($183) and then to the trendline of the triangle is possible. A break below the triangle will signal advantage to the bears and open the doors for a possible fall to $153 and then $120.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will make one more attempt to push the LTC/USD pair above the triangle. If they succeed, the pair could start its upward march.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the dip below the 50-day SMA ($28) on March 16 and have followed it up with a strong up-move today. If buyers can propel Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) above the $32 overhead resistance, a rally to $36.93 is possible. A break above this resistance may start the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/7781dd17-5999-4ccd-b788-e28d3e2dd38b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price once again turns down from $32, it will indicate that bears are aggressively defending this level. The LINK/USD pair could then drop to the moving averages and stay range-bound between $24 and $32 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI just above the midpoint also suggest a few days of consolidation. The bears could gain an upper hand if they can sink and sustain the price below $24.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) has broken below both the moving averages. The bulls tried to push the price back above the 20-day EMA ($538) on March 16 but failed. Today\u8217\'20\'19s inside-day candlestick pattern indicates indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/ce6de4b0-f897-410d-aea7-1f5bd284211b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn down and the RSI is just below the midpoint, which shows the bears are attempting to gain the upper hand. If the bears can now sink the price below $502, the altcoin could start its journey to $440.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the price turns up from the current level and rises above $560. Such a move will suggest strong buying at lower levels. The BCH/USD pair could then move up to $631.71.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDMvZmRkMTI2ZDUtYjM1NC00Y2I4LThhMzgtN2YzNTAyZmIyOThjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210317eh3h000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 Altcoins spike to new highs while Bitcoin bulls aim to recapture $57K\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Jordan Finneseth \par \uc2 649 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 March 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Terra (LUNA), Basic Attention Token and Cardano spiked to new highs as Bitcoin and Ethereum attempted to recover from their recent correction.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price continues to recover from its sub-$55,000 correction and at the time of writing, traders are attempting to recapture the $57,000 level as a support.\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  shows that a wave of early morning selling pushed Bitcoin price to a daily low of $53,167 and while dip buyers did manage to step in, the lack of purchasing volume is keeping BTC pinned in what appears to be a tightening range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/4af8372b-3bd8-4eab-83f7-c88cced474ef.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDt/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin price could continue to meet overhead resistance in the $56,000 to $58,000 range, a strong \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  case still exists as a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bulls-favored-ahead-of-record-6-1b-bitcoin-options-expiry-on-march-26"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 potential $6.1 billion worth of Bitcoin options}}}\uc2  are set to expire on March 26. According to Cointelegraph contributor Marcel Pechman, derivatives data indicates that the upcoming expiry is more advantageous for the bulls as long as BTC remains above $52,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has also traded in a consolidation pattern since setting a new all-time high at $1,950 on March 13 and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-bulls-enticed-by-1-750-support-and-lack-of-eth-liquidations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 professional traders view the $1,750 level as strong support}}}\uc2  following multiple \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  retests over the past week.\par \par \uc2 Altcoins press ahead while Bitcoin price recovers\par \par \uc2 Several altcoins saw their prices breakout on Tuesday as partnership announcements and exchange listings have proven to be effective price movers.\par \par \uc2 The biggest announcement of the day came from \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  Pro, which {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CoinbasePro/status/1371869126600368128"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 revealed}}}\uc2  that it has begun accepting inbound transfers of Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and will support trading services \u8220\'20\'1Con or after 9 AM PT on Thursday, March 18, if liquidity conditions are met.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Terra (LUNA) has also put on another double-digit gain overnight, spiking more than 40% from a low of $14.60 on March 15 to a new all-time high of $20.60 on $1.4 billion in trading volume.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/5ce050ed-1521-429a-850d-724723f74077.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LUNAUSDT/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Basic Attention Token (BAT) has also seen its price surge to a new record high at $1.18 as the blockchain-based web browser continues to reap the benefits of multiple announcements, including the acquisition of a search engine provider and plans to integrate NFT functionality and a DEX aggregator.\par \par \uc2 Traditional markets take a tumble as Treasuries rise\par \par \uc2 The global financial markets fell under pressure on Tuesday as weaker than expected retail sales and a rising 10-year Treasury yield, which closed the day up 0.87% at 1.621.\par \par \uc2 Following record highs set on March 16, the S&P 500 and Dow faced dropped throughout the day and closed down 0.16% and 0.39% respectively. The NASDAQ was able to start a late-day rally that helped its price close up 0.09%.\par \par \uc2 Analysts predict accelerated growth in the crypto market\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/994c41b4-7f93-46e6-abd5-0401ccfbe117.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Despite the drawdown in both Bitcoin and Ether price, the overall outlook for the cryptocurrency market is \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  as signs of steady mainstream adoption emerge on a daily basis.\par \par \uc2 Data shows that long-term cryptocurrency holders have been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/long-term-investors-are-hodling-with-95-of-bitcoin-trades-involving-young-coins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 accumulating BTC in recent months}}}\uc2 , while short-term traders are confident that high leverage speculative trading will pay off. The steady increase in BTC accumulation suggests that the current bull market has ample room to run higher.\par \par \uc2 The overall cryptocurrency market cap now stands at $1.723 trillion and Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s dominance rate is 60.8%.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDMvYWRiNWMzZDUtYjNjMi00OWUyLWE5N2MtY2E5MjEwM2Y2ZmI3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210317eh3g00007\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/15: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, XRP, UNI, LTC, LINK, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,785 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 March 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rejection at its all-time high and a negative divergence on the RSI suggest that BTC's \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could be weakening and altcoins may see profit-booking as a result.\par \par \uc2 The 2017 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) bull run was led by retail traders, long-term crypto believers and Bitcoin whales. However, the tide turned in 2020 as institutional investors became the catalyst for the latest crypto bull run.\par \par \uc2 However, data compiled by \uc2 JPMorgan Chase\uc2  shows that retail traders have made a strong {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://ca.finance.yahoo.com/news/retail-bitcoin-traders-rival-wall-135353699.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 comeback}}}\uc2  in the first quarter of this year. \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2  analysts used data from Square and Paypal to determine that retail investors bought 187,426 BTC for Q1 2021, which is more than the institutional purchase of 172,684 BTC during the same period.\par \par \uc2 While this data may not be bulletproof, it gives a good overview of the underlying sentiment from both parties.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/679c7109-7c57-46f9-bb9a-8050764fc640.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Recent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/reported-volume-of-top-south-korean-crypto-exchanges-surpasses-that-of-the-country-s-stock-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 data}}}\uc2  from CoinMarketCap showed that the total volume of crypto transactions from major South Korean crypto exchanges during a 24-hour period on Sunday was $14.6 billion, eclipsing the $14.5 billion handled by South Korea's Composite Stock Price Index on March 12.\par \par \uc2 While increased participation is a positive sign, a strong bull market also attracts several weak hands who dump their positions on every minor news and event. This could lead to increased \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the short term.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to spot the critical support and resistance levels that may attract traders.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke out to a new all-time high at $61,825.84 on March 13, but this rally did not attract further buying from traders. On the contrary, traders booked profits after the rally and the price has dipped back below the breakout level at $58,341.03 today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/40780257-7f37-4b6d-8938-170b025f0353.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, a minor positive is that the bulls are still attempting to defend the 20-day exponential moving average ($53,231). If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will try to drive the price above $61,825.84. If they manage to do that, the next leg of the uptrend to $72,112 could begin.\par \par \uc2 While the rising moving averages favor the bulls, the negative divergence on the relative strength index (RSI) suggests the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. The bears will see an opportunity if the BTC/USD pair dips and sustains below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 The next support on the downside is the 50-day simple moving average ($46,504) and then the critical swing low at $43,006.77.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) sharp rise on March 13 could not sustain the momentum and retest the all-time high at $2,040.77. This could have attracted profit-booking from momentum traders, which has resulted in a drop to the 20-day EMA ($1,729).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/41983948-6218-46ac-9c1d-3072040e7c1e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears utilize this opportunity and sink the price below the moving averages, the selling could intensify. That could result in a decline to $1,455 and then to the critical support at $1,289.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the RSI has dropped below 53 indicating a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 This neutral to negative view will be negated if the ETH/USD pair rebounds off the moving averages and surges above the all-time high. This could start the next leg of the uptrend that may reach $2,614.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) could not sustain above the $309.50 overhead resistance on March 11. This could have attracted profit-booking from traders, which has resulted in a pullback to the 20-day EMA ($245) today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/9ee7e9f3-f466-4f07-807e-99277badb2d8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently trying to defend the 20-day EMA. A strong rebound off this support will suggest aggressive buying on dips. The bulls will then again try to push the price above $309.50.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, a retest of the all-time high is possible. A breakout of this resistance could start the next leg of the uptrend that could reach $410.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the BNB/USD pair breaks below the 20-day EMA, short-term traders may book profits and that could pull the price down to $189.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside the $1.03 to $1.23 range for the past few days. The altcoin slipped below the range on March 13 but made a strong comeback on the same day itself. Today, the price has again dipped below the support of the range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/1704e76c-c348-44db-8f9a-9882bcc22dd6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 While the bulls have been defending the $1.03 support for the past three days, the bears have not allowed the price to rise and sustain above the 20-day EMA ($1.08). This suggests the bears are attempting to make a comeback.\par \par \uc2 If the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair closes below the range, it will enhance the prospects of a deeper correction to the 50-day SMA ($0.87). If this support also cracks, the decline could extend to $0.80 and then $0.70.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up and breaks above the 20-day EMA, then the pair could rally to $1.23.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Although the bulls have successfully defended the 20-day EMA ($34.79) in the past few days, they have not been able to push Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above the $37.50 to $40 overhead resistance zone. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/82e3b32c-5b4e-44ba-9de5-d2da510a3cec.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI below 53 suggest the bulls may be losing their grip. If the price sustains below the 20-day EMA, the selling could intensify as the short-term traders may rush to the exit. This could pull the DOT/USD pair down to the 50-day SMA ($28.73).\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns up from the current level and breaks out of the $40 to $42.50 resistance zone. Such a move could start the next leg of the uptrend that may reach $52.50.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  attempted to rise above the 20-day EMA ($0.45) on March 13 but failed, which shows the bears are trying to gain the upper hand. If the sellers can sink the price below $0.42, the altcoin could drop to $0.35.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/f03f04a4-5241-4d5e-9010-d9d50cc58c6a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is sloping down marginally and the RSI is trading in the negative territory, which suggests a minor advantage to the bears.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated if the bulls can push the price above the overhead resistance at $0.50. Such a move could attract buyers who may then try to propel the XRP/USD pair to $0.65.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USD\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) again turned down from the $33 to $34.92 overhead resistance zone on March 14, which shows the bears are active at higher levels. The bulls will now try to defend the 20-day EMA ($28.70).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/477f1bfe-d49b-4ebf-b2d7-e65bae5301d7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off the 20-day EMA will suggest the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are buying on dips. If the LINK/USD pair breaks above the overhead resistance zone, the next leg of the uptrend could begin.\par \par \uc2 However, the negative divergence on the RSI suggests the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be waning. If the bears sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA, a deeper correction to the 50-day SMA ($23.40) is possible.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) break above $205.18 on March 12 sustained its momentum on March 13, but the bulls could not retest $246.96. The altcoin turned down from $230, which shows traders are exiting their positions on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/ce4e410b-208d-49f5-9123-58d9b941746a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to pull the price back below the 20-day EMA ($197) while the bulls are trying to defend it. The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI above 52 suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 This equilibrium will tilt in favor of the bulls if they can propel the price above $246.96. Conversely, the bears will gain the upper hand if the LTC/USD pair breaks and closes below the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) has broken below the moving averages and the trendline of the ascending triangle, which invalidates the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. Traders who had purchased before the breakout might cover their positions and that could result in a fall to $24.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/1d301b51-f9e0-4e93-b577-69ec996f88d9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the RSI below the center also point to a possible range-bound action in the near term with a negative bias. The trend will turn in favor of the bears if they can sustain the price below $24.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns up from the current levels and rises above $32. Such a move will suggest that the current break below the moving averages was a bear trap.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) surged above the $560 overhead resistance on March 13, but the bulls could not build on this breakout. The price quickly turned around on March 14 and the bears have dragged it back below the breakout level at $560.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/a151d12a-4258-4494-883e-cc4b7df38e60.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The sharp reversal could have trapped the aggressive bulls who were expecting the BCH/USD pair to rally to $631.71 and then $745. If the price sustains below the 50-day SMA ($528), it increases the possibility of a fall to $480 and then $440.\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the RSI just below the midpoint indicate a balance between supply and demand. The bulls will gain the upper hand if they can propel the price above $609 and the bears will be at an advantage if the price breaks below $440.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDMvYmQ2ZTA1M2ItNWJkNC00NGY2LWFmOGMtMjZhYTYxNGE2YTg4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210315eh3f000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/12: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, XRP, UNI, LTC, LINK, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,925 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 March 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bulls are attempting to push BTC price back toward $58,000 but data shows altcoins may be losing their \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) missed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-sheds-5-after-oracle-keeps-quiet-on-4b-btc-allocation-rumors"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hitting a new all-time high on March 11}}}\uc2  by just a whisker as \uc2 Oracle Corporation\uc2  denied rumors that it had purchased about 72,000 Bitcoin. This suggests that traders could be looking for signs of greater institutional adoption to boost Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price further.\par \par \uc2 One of the main factors that may have kept several institutional investors at bay is the lack of regulatory clarity but this could be on the verge of changing.\par \par \uc2 In a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/gensler-confirmation-as-sec-chair-would-be-good-for-crypto-says-hester-peirce"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recent}}}\uc2  interview on the Thinking Crypto podcast, Hester Peirce, a commissioner at the United States Securities and Exchange Commission, said that Gary Gensler\u8217\'20\'19s nomination to be the President of the SEC could lead to greater regulatory clarity being given to the crypto sector.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/234f9b5d-234b-4278-95f4-59af39e0ce07.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 If that happens, several institutional investors may jump in and purchase Bitcoin. Another possible instrument that may attract both institutions and retail investors is a \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2 . Just this week, New York-based asset manager WisdomTree joined the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/wisdomtree-bitcoin-etf-filing-joins-hopefuls-vying-for-approval"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 list}}}\uc2  of aspirants who are seeking the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s approval to launch a \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Crypto traders are likely to keep a close watch on these developments as they could prove \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for Bitcoin. Until the next trigger, will Bitcoin and altcoins remain in a range or correct to lower support levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned down from just below the all-time high today as the bears tried to pull the price down. However, the long tail on the daily candlestick shows aggressive buying on dips. The upsloping 20-day exponential moving average ($51,414) and the relative strength index (RSI) above 68 suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/1120df94-481e-4669-8873-5b3fb6405a70.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can drive and sustain the price above $58,341.03, the uptrend could resume. The next target objective on the upside is $72,112.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the BTC/USD pair once again turns down from $58,341.03, it will suggest the bears are aggressively defending the higher levels.\par \par \uc2 If the bears can sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the short-term traders may book profits and that could pull the price down to the 50-day simple moving average ($44,934).\par \par \uc2 A break below this support could result in a drop to the critical support at $41,959.63. This is an important level to watch out for because if it cracks, the advantage will shift in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 The bears are attempting to stall the relief rally at the 78.6% Fibonacci retracement level at $1,879.915. The long tail on March 11 candlestick suggests the bulls bought the dips near the 20-day EMA ($1,692), but they could not build up on the recovery as Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has turned down today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/34813986-1ab3-4966-996e-10dfbf8925af.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the moving averages, it will suggest that traders continue to buy the dips. The bulls will then again try to push the price above $1,879.91 and retest the all-time high at $2,040.77. A breakout and close above this level could clear the path for a rally to $2,614.\par \par \uc2 The marginally upsloping moving averages and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest a minor advantage to the buyers. However, if the bears sink the price below the moving averages, it may attract profit-booking from short-term traders. That could result in a fall to $1,455 and then to $1,289.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rallied above the $309.49 overhead resistance on March 11 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. The bears tried to sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($239) today but the long tail on the candlestick suggests aggressive buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/82f7b588-f0ea-43bd-90d6-2d3d85a4d32a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Traders are buying the dips and selling the rallies. This could keep the BNB/USD pair range-bound between $265 and $309.49 for a few days. Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is in the positive zone, which suggests the bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If buyers can push and sustain the price above $309.49, the pair could rally to the all-time high at $348.69. Above this level, the pair may extend its up-move to $410 and then $500.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA, the pair may drop to $215 and then $189.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has dropped to the support of the $1.0683 to $1.2303 range. This is an important level to keep an eye on, hence the bulls are likely to defend it aggressively. If the price rebounds off this level, the altcoin may consolidate in the range for a few more days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/931b2ceb-f93b-46cf-bb87-cd7d8f9b2df4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A break above or below the range could start the next trending move. The flat 20-day EMA ($1.09) and the RSI near the midpoint suggest equal opportunities to the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price rises from the current levels and breaks above $1.2303, it will suggest the bulls have the upper hand. That could result in a rally to $1.35 and then $1.4852.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bears sink and sustain the price below $1.0683, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.831).\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) breakout of the symmetrical triangle fizzled out at $39.60 on March 10. The bears dragged the price back into the triangle today, but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests the bulls are buying on dips to the 20-day EMA ($34.40).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/4697443f-62bd-4a78-8eef-8a2f7b298edf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level and rises above $39.60, it will suggest strong demand at lower levels. The pair could then retest the all-time high at $42.28. A break above this resistance may push the price to the pattern target at $52.50.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price sustains inside the triangle, the bears will try to sink the DOT/USD pair below the support line. Such a move could intensify the selling and pull the price down to the 50-day SMA ($27.65).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  turned down from the $0.50 overhead resistance and broke below the 20-day EMA ($0.464) on March 10. This suggests a lack of demand at higher levels. However, the bulls are presently trying to defend the 50-day SMA ($0.445).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/660b8199-8e38-408c-9449-354e363c8216.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they manage to push the price above the 20-day EMA, the XRP/USD pair may rise to $0.50. A break above this resistance could attract buying that may drive the price to $0.57 and then $0.65.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the bears sustain the price below the 50-day SMA, the pair could drop to $0.392 and then to $0.359. The 20-day EMA is flat and the RSI is just below the midpoint, indicating a possible range-bound action in the short term.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USD\par \par \uc2 The long tail on March 11 and today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests the bulls are buying the dips. Traders may now try to propel Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) above the $33 to $34.92 overhead resistance zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/7ff17c55-f1a9-4b62-b6cc-2b7978a9028b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the UNI/USD pair could start the next leg of the uptrend that may reach $46 and then $50. The rising moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory indicate the bulls are in command.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($27.90), short-term traders may book profits. That may drag the pair down to the 50-day SMA ($22.13).\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) tight consolidation between the $205.18 overhead resistance and the 20-day EMA ($192) resolved to the upside today. This suggests the demand from the bulls has exceeded the will of \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/afd6f785-98da-4750-94d4-84c59434ae11.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to push the price to $246.96. The 20-day EMA has started to turn up and the RSI has risen above 62, which suggests the bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the LTC/USD pair fails to sustain above $246.96, it will indicate the bears are selling at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 That may trap the aggressive bulls, who may cover their positions if the pair breaks below the 20-day EMA. The bears may gain the upper hand if the pair plummets below the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) dipped below the 20-day EMA ($28.99) today, but the bulls are defending the 50-day SMA ($27.53). A strong bounce off this level will suggest the bulls continue to buy the dip. The buyers will then try to propel the price above the $32 overhead resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/e44a0db3-ef44-4ba6-9a23-3db1203f19cf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the LINK/USD pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern that may attract buying from traders. The pattern target of this setup is $43.19, but the rise may face stiff resistance at the current all-time high at $36.93.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the price drops and sustains below the moving averages. The pair could then decline to $24 and then to $20.11. The flat moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a few days of range-bound action.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to push Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) above the $560 overhead resistance attracted profit-booking by short-term traders. However, the long tail on the daily candlestick suggests the bulls are continuing to buy the dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/7ab5ac3c-e7e1-4dda-b91a-958bb1d1eb8d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint show a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 This equilibrium may shift in favor of the bulls if they can drive the BCH/USD pair above $560. Such a move will suggest that the bulls have absorbed the supply. That could start the next leg of the up-move to $631.71 and then $745.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the pair sustains below the moving averages, it will suggest the bears have overpowered the dip buyers. Such a move could result in a drop to $472.72 and then $432.02.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDMvMTY0ZjgxZTgtMDU5OS00NzI3LWIyZGYtNmZjMGE5NDg4YTA3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210312eh3c000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/10: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, XRP, UNI, LTC, LINK, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,799 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 March 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Select altcoins could rally to new all-time highs if Bitcoin bulls successfully hold BTC above the $57,000 level.\par \par \uc2 Long-term investors use dips in a strong uptrend to buy while short-term investors are fixated on calling a top. In the past few days, data from Glassnode has shown significantly sized Bitcoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC }}}\uc2  ) outflows from \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  exchange, which is a sign of accumulation according to analysts.\par \par \uc2 It is encouraging to note that the demand is not limited to one exchange and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whales-bought-the-dip-as-orders-for-100k-or-more-hit-all-time-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 data }}}\uc2  from Material Indicators shows buy orders of $100,000 and higher are reaching an all-time high.\par \par \uc2 This shows that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-focuses-on-55k-as-bulls-ignore-a-surging-us-dollar"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 influx }}}\uc2  of institutional investors and large corporations entering the crypto sector continues to accelerate. Proof of this comes as American Residential Warranty became the latest company to buy Bitcoin in order to maximize the returns on its investment portfolio.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/4ecac965-8a73-4494-a15c-f30db87b2a5a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360 }}}\par \par \uc2 Another positive sign is the relative movement of the U.S. dollar and Bitcoin. Usually, these assets are inversely correlated, meaning when the U.S. dollar rises, Bitcoin comes under pressure and vice versa.\par \par \uc2 However, in the past few days, the rise in the U.S. dollar currency index (DXY) has not been able to stall Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. When a negative event fails to put brakes on the rally, it is a sign of strong demand.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine the possible target objectives and the critical levels on the upside.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke above the $52,040.95 overhead resistance on March 8, which completed an ascending triangle pattern. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a target objective at $61,075.13. The bears attempted to stall the up-move today, but the long tail on the candlestick shows strong buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/dd4abcc4-4f8a-4178-b77d-0c425a4329a0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average ($50,140) has turned up and the relative strength index (RSI) has risen close to the overbought territory, indicating that bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can drive the price above the all-time high at $58,341.03, the next leg of the uptrend could begin. The next major target on the upside is $72,112.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price may rise above the all-time high, but the bears will try to trap the aggressive bulls and attempt to pull the price below $52,040.95.\par \par \uc2 In order to reverse the trend, the bears will have to sink the price below the most recent swing low at $43,006.77.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to resume the uptrend in Ether ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH }}}\uc2  ) and the 20-day EMA ($1,673) has started to turn up as the RSI moves above 60.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/f461ff79-65e5-4120-9c57-a52ea7bcaf38.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can sustain the price above $1,879.915, the ETH/USD pair could retest the all-time high at $2,040.774. A breakout of this resistance could resume the uptrend with the next target objective at $2,614.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current levels or the overhead resistance and breaks below the moving averages. Such a move could keep the pair stuck inside a large range. The trend could favor the bears if the price breaks below the $1,289 support.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB }}}\uc2  ) soared above the $265 overhead resistance on March 9, which suggests the bulls are attempting to resume the uptrend. The long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows the bulls are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/259cbd3d-7bf8-4ee8-8763-0a20a040310a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now try to push the price above $309.49. If they succeed, the BNB/USD pair could rally to the all-time high at $348.69. A breakout of this resistance could start the next leg of the up-move to $410 and then $500.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI near the overbought territory also suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view could invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($231). Such a move may result in a decline to the critical support at $189.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading in a tight range between $1.0683 and $1.2303 for the past few days. A positive sign is that the bulls have not allowed the price to dip and sustain below the 20-day EMA ($1.102).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/ef67fdf5-a9a6-4e7c-85dc-0a0112e06330.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can propel the price above $1.2303, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair could start its journey to $1.35 and then to $1.48. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the range, it could signal a deeper correction. There is a minor support at $0.90 but if it cracks, the pair may drop to the 50-day simple moving average at $0.801.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT }}}\uc2  token rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($34.07) on March 8 and broke above the downtrend line of the symmetrical triangle on March 9. The altcoin could now rally to $42.2848 and then to the pattern target at $52.50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/50e517a9-e2b1-48d3-99e1-5e96bf88c7b7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI above 66 also suggest that the bulls have the upper hand. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated if the price turns down from the current levels or the overhead resistance at $42.2848 and breaks below the support line of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 Such a move could trap the aggressive bulls and result in the liquidation of long positions. If the price sustains below the triangle, the DOT/USD pair could extend its decline to the 50-day SMA ($26.90).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP }}}\uc2  has once again turned down from the $0.50 overhead resistance. This shows that the bears continue to sell on relief rallies to this level. If the bears sink the price below the trendline, it will negate the ascending triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/421212a4-d5ca-44b0-912b-758a807200b7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 A break below the 50-day SMA ($0.43) will clear the path for a possible drop to $0.359. If the price rebounds off this support, it could keep the XRP/USD pair range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break below $0.359 will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders pattern, which could result in a decline to $0.17351.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns up from the current levels and rises above $0.50. Such a move could open the doors for a rally to $0.57 and then $0.65.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USD\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI }}}\uc2  ) has dropped below the breakout level of $33 and the bears will now try to pull the price down to the 20-day EMA ($27.33). The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive zone suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/2fe6330a-880f-4e8e-8a57-98abdbf699da.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will once again try to resume the uptrend. The UNI/USD pair could pick up momentum on a break above $35. The target objective on the upside is $46.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bears sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest a possible change in trend. The next support on the downside is the 50-day SMA at $21.25 and below it $18.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC }}}\uc2  ) broke above the 20-day EMA ($189) on March 7 and has reached the $205.18 overhead resistance. This level may act as a hurdle, but if the bulls can push the price above it, a rally to $227 and then to $246.96 may be on the cards.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/ec211a83-c13d-4580-a46a-f3a75fbad73f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn up and the RSI has risen into the positive territory, indicating an advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily. If the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages, the LTC/USD pair could drop to the uptrend line. A breakdown and close below this support could intensify the selling.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK }}}\uc2  ) soared above the 20-day EMA ($28.99) on March 8 and reached the overhead resistance at $32. However, the bulls could not push the price above it, indicating selling by the bears near the resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/d69e09b4-6fc7-42cf-96f3-6beee8ab2b25.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The price has turned down from $32 and the bears are now trying to sink the LINK/USD pair below the trendline. If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern will be invalidated.\par \par \uc2 When a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup breaks down, it usually traps the aggressive buyers who are then forced to cover their positions. The support level to watch on the downside is $24 and then $20.11.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will try to push the pair above $32. If they succeed, the pair may start its rally to $36.93 and then to $43.19. The gradually rising moving averages and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest a minor advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH }}}\uc2  ) has formed an ascending triangle pattern that will complete on a breakout and close above $560. If that happens, the altcoin could start its journey to $631.71 and then to the pattern target at $688.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/beb9017a-7dc5-4a6e-b2fc-5868b853fb19.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from $560, the bears will try to sink it below the moving averages and the trendline. If they succeed, the BCH/USD pair could drop to $472.72 and then $432.02.\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are flat and the RSI has been hovering around the midpoint, which does not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC }}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDMvYzNlOWJjY2ItYmQ5Zi00OTA0LWFmOGQtMmJjY2ViMzBlMTkxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210310eh3a000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Ethereum price\par \b \uc2 Ethereum vs. Bitcoin: Did ETH/BTC just bottom as Ether eyes $2K?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe \par \uc2 828 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 March 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The price of Ether is struggling to break out against BTC once again.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price has been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-focuses-on-55k-as-bulls-ignore-a-surging-us-dollar"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 broken past a major resistance level of $52,000}}}\uc2  in the past few days and is approaching the all-time high region.\par \par \uc2 However, other cryptocurrencies are rallying heavily as well. In the recent months, the market has seen massive surges for Cardano's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22Ada\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 , Polkadot's DOT and Cosmos' {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/cosmos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Atom}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 These altcoins have been seeing impressive gains as Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) faces {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-fees-are-skyrocketing-but-traders-have-alternatives"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 scalability issues and high network fees}}}\uc2 . This is resulting in negative sentiment on social media, where some investors and traders are doubting whether a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  breakout will happen for Ether price.\par \par \uc2 But this might be exactly the period to become interested in the second-biggest cryptocurrency, especially with major upgrades expected for Ethereum in the summer.\par \par \uc2 Ether holds a critical level for continuation\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/539a9819-7030-44b9-95b6-bdf4946b8c3d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/TBYHFQKH/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar chart for Ether shows a major pullback in February and March, with ETH price dropping from $2,000 to $1,300. This was a 35% correction and was pretty healthy for the bull market before it can resume.\par \par \uc2 The bull cycle is intact as long as it doesn't lose the critical levels, namely the $1,300 region, which was confirmed during this latest pullback. Luckily for the bulls, Ether's price didn't drop below this level, as the chart above shows.\par \par \uc2 However, what comes next is debatable. There's a clear resistance zone between $1,800 and $1,900, while support levels are shown by the green boxes. The primary box is found between $1,475 and $1,550.\par \par \uc2 There are several important things to point out here. First of all, the momentum and sentiment were comparable to a funeral once Ether's price hit the $1,300 level. Usually, such rock-bottom market sentiment is a big indicator to start looking for entry positions.\par \par \uc2 Now, ETH sentiment has flipped, as the public typically becomes \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  at resistance. Therefore, the most likely case here would be range-bound action for the coming weeks before a new impulse wave can start. Such an impulse move could trigger continuation toward $2,500 or higher.\par \par \uc2 Watch the ETH/BTC pair\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/0e389c74-d5d1-4d25-a868-742792e328c9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/BTC 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/uZTabwKc/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The dollar value of altcoins can paint an inaccurate picture of a cryptocurrency\u8217\'20\'19s strength. The dollar value of a certain altcoin could be above the previous all-time highs, but the altcoin's value in BTC terms may still be far away from its peak (e.g., \b \highlight22\uc2 Ada\b0 \highlight\uc2 ).\par \par \uc2 Such an observation means that Bitcoin is showing strength, while the altcoin may actually be losing value against BTC.\par \par \uc2 Ether is no exception and isn\u8217\'20\'19t showing much momentum yet, still hovering around the 0.03 sats level. For instance, the all-time high for ETH/BTC was 0.112 sats in 2017.\par \par \uc2 The chart shows a clear rejection at the 0.035 sats level, which means further consolidation is likely before a potential shift in momentum. If the 0.03 sats area holds, additional compression and sideways action should start, which may then kick off a new impulse wave.\par \par \uc2 Currently, Ether is making another higher low in the BTC pair, which may add further strength toward a new higher high. This can then open the path toward 0.06 or 0.08 sats.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  news can also boost the value of ETH in the short to medium term. Specifically, the major upgrade {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/major-ethereum-gas-fee-overhaul-eip-1559-scheduled-for-july"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/major-ethereum-gas-fee-overhaul-eip-1559-scheduled-for-july}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/major-ethereum-gas-fee-overhaul-eip-1559-scheduled-for-july"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dubbed \u8220\'20\'1CLondon,\u8221\'20\'1D expected in July}}}\uc2 , should alleviate the high network fees and also add deflationary pressure on the ETH token.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin dominance nears critical level\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/38002fa2-ebe9-4025-810b-1f7b53c37d4b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC dominance 3-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/nOgoc1o4/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The Bitcoin dominance chart is great for gauging the strength of altcoins. In this case, BTC dominance topped out in December 2020, which was followed by a massive \u8220\'20\'1Calt season.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 But now, the Bitcoin dominance chart shows a potential bottoming construction at a key support level. In other words, after such a big multimonth rally in altcoins, a correction wouldn\u8217\'20\'19t be a surprise alongside rising BTC dominance.\par \par \uc2 This could mean that Bitcoin will rally in dollar terms. Or if BTC corrects against the dollar, altcoins will likely see an even bigger pullback than BTC.\par \par \uc2 In any case, if history repeats, the dominance will crawl up, alongside Ether testing the 0.03 sats area. After that, the summer may be a very \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  period for altcoins.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/cryptomichnl?lang=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 author}}}\uc2  and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDMvOTZlNzRlYTEtODZhOS00YWFmLWIzZjUtYTI1NDc3MWJmMjIxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210310eh3a0008f\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/8: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, XRP, UNI, LINK, LTC, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,778 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 March 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins are picking up momentum as bulls attempt to secure a daily close above the $52,000 level.\par \par \uc2 Data from Glassnode shows that Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) held on centralized exchanges has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/the-number-of-btc-held-on-exchanges-crashed-20-in-12-months"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dropped}}}\uc2  by about 20% in the past 12 months. This suggests that investors are withdrawing their Bitcoin to the cold storage with a view of possibly holding them for the long term. This has reduced the available supply while the demand has continued to increase.\par \par \uc2 The arrival of exchange-traded funds could increase the supply crunch further. After the success of the TSX Purpose Bitcoin exchange-traded fund, Canada could {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/galaxy-digital-bitcoin-etf-to-launch-this-week-as-exec-eyes-compelling-opportunities"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launch}}}\uc2  the second \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  by Galaxy Digital Capital Management, a subsidiary of Galaxy Digital. The approval of Bitcoin ETFs in Canada could place further pressure on U.S. regulators to be more accommodative in their approach of evaluating BTC ETF proposals.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/eb63716c-368a-4a85-81d8-867a08dfc313.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, companies across the globe have continued to open their coffers to buy Bitcoin. The latest listed company that plans to buy Bitcoin is the Norwegian investment {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/norwegian-investment-firm-allocates-58m-to-bitcoin-and-crypto-ventures"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 firm}}}\uc2 Aker ASA\uc2 , which intends to do it through a subsidiary company called Seetee AS. This shows that the trend has only started and several companies worldwide could allocate a portion of their reserves to be held in Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  has confirmed the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/40-of-goldman-sachs-clients-already-have-exposure-to-crypto-survey-shows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launch}}}\uc2  of its crypto desk that will support CME Bitcoin futures and non-deliverable forward (NDFs) which are cash-settled. Interestingly, an internal survey by the banking giant shows that 40% of its clients already have a crypto position. The respondents of the survey expect Bitcoin to end 2021 between $40,000 and $100,000.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to spot the critical support and resistance levels.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is currently trading between the 20-day exponential moving average ($48,701) and the overhead resistance at $52,040. This tight range trading is unlikely to continue for long.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/c1f33a75-3358-4365-9e46-f3a8cb87be22.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the 20-day EMA is flat, the relative strength index (RSI) has been gradually rising, indicating that the bulls are attempting to take control.\par \par \uc2 If bulls can push and close the price above $52,040, the BTC/USD pair will complete an ascending triangle pattern. This could result in a retest of the all-time high at $58,341 and then to $61,075, which is the pattern target of the breakout from the triangle.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the trendline, it may attract profit-booking from short-term momentum traders. The pair could then drop to $46,313 and if this support also cracks, the decline may extend to $41,959.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke above the $1,670 overhead resistance on March 7, which suggests strength. The 20-day EMA ($1,624) has started to turn up and the RSI has risen above 57, indicating a minor advantage to the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/2d98cc72-d956-46da-afbb-33e97a7d5ead.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can sustain the price above the moving averages, the ETH/USD pair could retest the all-time high at $2,040. A breakout of this resistance could start the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 50-day simple moving average at $1,572 the pair may retest the critical support at $1,289.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($217) on March 5, but the bulls have not been able to push the price to the $265 overhead resistance. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/efc335e0-4229-4c2f-8721-87d5af5db552.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA support, the BNB/USD pair could drop to $189. A breakdown and close below this support may open the doors for a decline to the 50-day SMA at $137.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will try to propel the pair above $265. If they succeed, a rally to $309.49 is possible. The gradually rising 20-day EMA and the RSI above 57 suggest a minor advantage to the bulls.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been holding above the 20-day EMA ($1.08) for the past four days, but the failure of the bulls to start a strong rebound suggests a lack of aggressive buying at the current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/fcaf590d-0f7d-456e-aa2e-c88fb2d670b0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears may now try to break the 20-day EMA support and deepen the correction to $0.9817712 and then to the 50-day SMA at$ 0.769.\par \par \uc2 However, the flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI above 58 indicates that the bulls are at a minor advantage.\par \par \uc2 If the price can rebound off the current levels and rise above $1.20, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair could rally to $1.35 and then to $1.48.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) is currently trading inside a symmetrical triangle, which generally acts as a continuation pattern. But in some cases, the symmetrical triangle plays the role of a reversal pattern, signaling a trend change.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/d6b4537a-2a10-44f1-9136-8d5bd7521f6e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the price below the support line of the triangle, the DOT/USD pair could witness selling from the short-term bulls. The pair could then drop to $26.50 and the pattern target is at $17.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the current level and rises above the triangle, the pair may retest the all-time high at $42.28. If this level is crossed, the price may extend the rally to the pattern target at $52.50.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has formed an ascending triangle pattern in the short term, which will complete on a breakout and close above $0.50. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a target objective at $0.635.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/925dd7ee-c1a2-4413-a605-8f3bc63fe0dc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the trendline of the ascending triangle, the XRP/USD pair could drop to $0.359. A breakdown and close below $0.359 will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders pattern that may pull the price down to $0.173.\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA ($0.46) and the RSI just above 52 do not foretell a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. Therefore, it is best to wait for a decisive breakout to happen before taking a positional call.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USD\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) soared to a new all-time high on March 7, but the bulls have not been able to build up on this strength. The bears are currently attempting to sink the price back below the previous resistance turned support at $33.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/0a36e38e-c2cf-4740-ac3e-9303d9ff3013.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the UNI/USD pair could correct to $30 and then to the 20-day EMA ($26.23). A strong rebound off either support will suggest that traders continue to buy the dips. The bulls will then again try to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above $35 could start the journey to $46. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the overbought zone suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA support. This could pull the price down to the 50-day SMA at $20.31.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) is currently range-bound between $24 and $32. The bulls pushed the price above the 20-day EMA at $28.46 on March 7 and that cleared the path for a possible rally to the $32 overhead resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/c5f8ed97-0dcd-4dfc-a77d-c13eb6b6e478.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the LINK/USD pair breaks and closes above $32, it will complete an ascending triangle pattern. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a target objective at $43.191. While the 20-day EMA is flat, the RSI in the positive zone indicates a minor advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price turns down sharply from $32 and breaks below the trendline of the triangle, it could extend the stay inside the range. The trend may favor the bears if the price turns down and breaks below the $24 support. Such a move could pull the price down to $20.111.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) is facing stiff resistance in the $185.58 to $196.30 zone. The altcoin has turned down from the overhead resistance today and dipped back below $185.58, which suggests profit-booking at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/702c8f15-e2c4-441f-8b03-226f6b3d2b1a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to sink the price to the 50-day SMA at $171.94 and then to the uptrend line. A break below this support could start a deeper correction to $152 and then to $120.\par \par \uc2 However, the 20-day EMA ($185) has flattened out and the RSI is near the midpoint, suggesting a range-bound action for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The trend may favor the bulls if the price turns up from the current levels and rises above $196.30. In this case, the LTC/USD pair may rally to $246.96. A breakout of this resistance could signal the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) is currently sandwiched between the uptrend line and the overhead resistance at $539. The altcoin has formed a Doji candlestick pattern today, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/55de2b3b-9823-4231-a0c8-ba114ca81a5d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the gradually downsloping 20-day EMA at $531 and the RSI below 48 suggest a minor advantage to the bears. If the sellers can sink the price below the uptrend line, the BCH/USD pair could drop to $440 and then to $370.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bulls can propel and sustain the price above $539, the pair could start its journey toward $631.71.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDMvY2Y5Yzg2NjItMGI4NC00MDc5LTk2Y2YtMThiYWU5MWFkYjQ2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210308eh38000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/5: BTC, ETH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, DOT, XRP, UNI, LTC, LINK, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,888 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 March 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Selling pressure from global equities markets continues to weigh on Bitcoin price as traders endeavor to flip the $50,000 level back to support.\par \par \uc2 Analysts expect the U.S. economy to stage a strong recovery in the second half of this year as coronavirus vaccines are distributed and economic activity begins to increase. As growth picks up, inflation concerns are also on the rise. Speculation is rife that the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2  may have to adjust its dovish stance to hold down interest rates.\par \par \uc2 In anticipation, the 10-year \uc2 U.S. Treasury\uc2  yield has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2021/03/05/us-bonds-treasury-yields-dip-ahead-of-february-jobs-report.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 jumped}}}\uc2  from about 1% at the start of the year to 1.626%. This has resulted in profit-booking in assets considered as risky and as equities pullback, a temporary pause may be put on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/b3ee696a-47c2-4df5-92c9-2f9762cd570f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The drop in \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2  has also hurt the stock prices of \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  and Tesla who have each invested in Bitcoin recently. \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s stock price has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/no-more-bitcoin-effect-microstrategy-stock-falls-by-50-in-17-days"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 plunged}}}\uc2  by over 50% from its all-time high at $1,315, even though the price of Bitcoin is currently only down about 20% from its all-time high.\par \par \uc2 Tesla, which had announced a $1.5 billion Bitcoin position on Feb. 8 has also seen its stock price plummet by over 34%. To stem the decline, longtime Tesla analyst Gary Black has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/analyst-tells-tesla-to-dump-bitcoin-for-buybacks-as-shares-plunge-alongside-mstr-s"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 suggested}}}\uc2  the electric car maker dump its Bitcoin holdings and instead use the proceeds for a stock buyback.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to spot the critical support levels where buyers may step in and arrest the current decline.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned down from the $52,040.95 overhead resistance on March 04, which suggests that traders are lightening up their positions at higher levels. The selling has continued and the price has dipped below the 20-day exponential moving average ($48,087).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/ffc3bf97-d11d-47a4-b771-13c973a7deee.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears can sustain the price below the 20-day EMA, the BTC/USD pair could now drop to the critical support at $41,959.63 where buyers are likely to step in.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this support, the pair could trade between $41,959.63 and $52,040.95 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) near the midpoint also suggest a few days of range-bound action.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current levels and rises above $52,040.95, it will open the doors for a rally to the all-time high.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bears sink and sustain the price below $41,959.63, the pair could drop to $37,000 and then to $28,050.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) relief rally from $1,289.09 on Feb. 28 hit a wall at the 20-day EMA ($1,593) on March 3. The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the negative zone, indicating a possible change in trend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/3a7061eb-4d1a-4fd4-b72b-da15d1a5332b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below $1,289, the selling could intensify and the ETH/USD pair could drop to the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at $1,220 and then to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $1,026.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the pair rebounds off $1,289 and stays range-bound for a few more days. A breakout and close above $1,670 could result in a retest of the all-time high at $2,040.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently attempting to arrest the pullback at the 20-day EMA ($1.07). This suggests that the sentiment remains positive and the bulls are viewing the dips in Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) as a buying opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/7cef1ac2-c140-4470-9216-b4144f100927.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now try to push the price above $1.23. If they succeed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair may rally to $1.35 and then to the all-time high at $1.4852896.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily. The negative divergence on the RSI shows that the momentum is weakening.\par \par \uc2 If the current rebound fails to sustain, the bears will once again try to sink the price below the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the pair could drop to $0.80 and then to the 50-day simple moving average ($0.72).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 The relief rally in Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance at $265 on March 2. This suggests that traders may be using the rallies to close their long positions. The price has again dropped to the 20-day EMA ($211).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/1c1941e4-1a61-4dec-94d6-c5644b2b0874.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA with strength, the bulls will once again try to drive the price above $265. If they manage to do that, the BNB/USD pair could start its journey to the all-time high at $348.6969.\par \par \uc2 But the 20-day EMA is gradually flattening out and the RSI continues to weaken. This points to possible range-bound action in the short term. The pair could consolidate between $189 and $265 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below the $189 support could result in panic selling that can pull the price down to the 50-day SMA ($126).\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $38.68 on March 3, which suggests that traders may have booked profits during the relief rally. The altcoin has dropped to the 20-day EMA ($32.49) and the buyers are now attempting to defend this support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/e4ead542-5830-4c93-88cd-d2c5a952b3e8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A strong bounce off the current levels will suggest that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are buying on dips. If the bulls can push the price above the downtrend line, the DOT/USD pair may retest the all-time high at $42.2848.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price breaks and sustains below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the supply has exceeded demand. In such a case, the pair may extend its decline to the 50-day SMA ($24.89).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  broke above the 20-day EMA ($0.467) on March 4, but the bulls could not maintain the momentum and thrust the price above the $0.50 overhead resistance. This attracted profit booking and the price has broken below the 20-day EMA today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/87c677de-11fa-465b-8936-ade4e7e012b0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USD pair could now drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.42) and then to $0.359. The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a range-bound action for the next few days. The price may remain stuck between $0.359 and $0.50.\par \par \uc2 A trending move could start if the bulls push the price above $0.50. That could result in a rally to $0.65. On the other hand, a break below $0.359 may sink the price to $0.25.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USD\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) is in an uptrend and the bulls have been buying the dip to the 20-day EMA ($24.05). The bulls tried to push and sustain the price above $29 on March 4 but the higher levels attracted profit-booking.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/e111ff6e-15fe-449e-b4f2-63ac064a20b5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to pull the price down to the 20-day EMA. If the UNI/USD pair again rebounds off this support, it will suggest that traders continue to buy the dips. The bulls will then try to push and close the price above $29. If they succeed, the pair could start the next leg of the uptrend that may reach $38.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the pair could drop to $20. Such a move may result in a consolidation between $20 and $29. The trend will turn negative on a break below the 50-day SMA ($18.85).\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the $185.58 resistance on March 3, but the bulls could not build upon this strength as the price turned down and dipped back below the 20-day EMA ($184.43) on March 4.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/859ce22f-cf95-4da6-bb85-8da0887515f4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently attempting to defend the 50-day SMA ($169.29) as seen from the long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. If the rebound sustains, the bulls will again try to push the price above the $185.58 to $196.30 overhead resistance zone. If they succeed, the LTC/USD pair could rally to $205 and then to $240.\par \par \uc2 However, the flat moving averages and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a possible range formation. The pair could trade between $152 on the downside and $205 on the upside. A break above or below the range could start the next trending move.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) relief rally turned down from $31.43 on March 3, which shows that traders are booking profits at higher levels. The altcoin has dipped to the 50-day SMA ($26.29) but the long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests the bulls are trying to defend this support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/99722639-2d32-42c4-a63d-83b9d3140d4a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buying on dips and selling rallies usually results in a range-bound action. The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint also suggest a balance between supply and demand. The LINK/USD pair could now consolidate between $24 and $32 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 A breakout of the range may result in a rally to $34 and a retest of the all-time high at $36.93. Conversely, a break below $24 could pull the price down to the critical support at $20.11.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 The bounce from the uptrend line stalled at the 20-day EMA ($537) on March 3, which shows the traders are selling on rallies. Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) has again dipped to the uptrend line. The repeated retest of the support at short intervals tends to weaken it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/c632806e-09fd-4cdc-925a-b03ea260f1a1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative territory suggest that bears are in control. A break below the uptrend line could sink the BCH/USD pair to $432.02 and then to the critical support at $370.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the price rises from the current levels and rises above $539. Such a move will suggest aggressive buying at lower levels. The pair could then rally to $631.71.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDMvOTFjMGEzZmQtYjI5ZC00MjdiLThjZDktOTY0MDI5NzJjNWM4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210305eh35000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/3: BTC, ETH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, DOT, XRP, LTC, LINK, BCH, XLM\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,877 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 March 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Now that Bitcoin price has flipped $50,000 back to support, small and large-cap altcoins are gearing up for a move higher.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) resilience in the face of global market uncertainty continues to attract new institutional investors. Dan Loeb, the CEO of New York-based asset management firm Third Point, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dan-loeb-s-hedge-fund-hires-pro-crypto-goldman-sachs-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  that he has been \u8220\'20\'1Cdoing a deep dive into crypto.\u8221\'20\'1D To strengthen the venture investments team, Third Point hired former pro-crypto Goldman Sachs analyst Heath Terry, according to Reuters.\par \par \uc2 Loeb\u8217\'20\'19s move into crypto seems to have prodded 'Shark Tank' star Kevin O'Leary to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/shark-tank-star-changes-tune-on-bitcoin-will-allocate-3-of-his-portfolio"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 allocate}}}\uc2  a portion of his portfolio to Bitcoin. Additionally, O'Leary hinted that every operating company that he had invested in was considering investing in Bitcoin.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/8556ccad-8b6e-448c-ba14-9bfe8c90c5a7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Billionaire Tim Draper expects Netflix to be the next Fortune 100 company to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/netflix-might-be-next-fortune-100-firm-to-buy-bitcoin-tim-draper"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 add}}}\uc2  Bitcoin to its balance sheet. Draper voiced his views while appearing on the Unstoppable Podcast. He also speculated that Amazon could start \u8220\'20\'1Caccepting Bitcoin pretty soon."\par \par \uc2 These developments show that the institutional adoption of Bitcoin is only in its infancy and it is likely to grow in the future.\par \par \uc2 It is heartening to see that former Bitcoin naysayers are now voicing their favorable opinions of the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Billionaire Mark Cuban recently {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-is-technology-but-gold-is-dead-mark-cuban-tells-peter-schiff"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 schooled}}}\uc2  gold bug Peter Schiff on \uc2 Twitter\uc2 , suggesting that gold would soon lose its status as a store of value. Cuban also highlighted the advantages Bitcoin held over gold.\par \par \uc2 With all these positives, it is no surprise that Bitcoin's price action has resumed its \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to spot the strengths and weaknesse.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin surged and closed above the 20-day exponential moving average ($48,123) on March 1. The bears tried to pull the price back below the 20-day EMA on March 2 but failed, which suggests that traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/c577aa73-942f-4c31-8fbf-a51550acebb8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers pushed the price above the $52,040.95 overhead resistance today but the bears are not ready to give up just yet. The long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests the bears are selling on rallies.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current levels and breaks below the 20-day EMA, the BTC/USD pair could drop to $41,959.63. The price could then remain range-bound between these two levels for a few days.\par \par \uc2 This neutral view will invalidate if the bulls can push and sustain the price above $52,040.95. If that happens, the pair could retest the all-time high at $58,341.03.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a break below the 50-day simple moving average ($41,921) will be the first indication of a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has broken above both moving averages today and the bulls are currently attempting to resume the uptrend. However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily as they may try to stall the up-move at the current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/f379bc95-75d0-4c20-9b56-3ca929ac0aa5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will signal that trader's sentiment is shifting from buying on dips to selling during rallies.\par \par \uc2 The bears may gain the upper hand if they can sink the price below the $1,289.098 support. If that happens, the ETH/USD pair could correct to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $1,026.776.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the bulls can push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA. If the bulls can propel the price above $1,708.391, the pair may rally to $2,000.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is currently witnessing a minor correction in an uptrend. The altcoin has formed an inside day candlestick pattern, which indicates indecision among the bulls and the bears about the next move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/c18c16db-86f6-4e1f-8912-fdc0ea7b75f5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the uncertainty resolves to the downside and the bears sink the price below $1.55, a fall to the 20-day EMA ($1.05) is possible. A rebound off this support will suggest that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  as the traders continue to buy on dips\par \par \uc2 If the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate profit-booking by traders. That could pull the price down to $0.9817712 and if this support also cracks, the decline could extend to $0.80.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current levels and the bulls push the pair above $1.30, a retest of $1.4852896 is possible. A breakout of this resistance could resume the uptrend with the next target objective at $1.83.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the downtrend line on March 1. The bears tried to sink the price back below the downtrend line on March 2 but failed, which shows that the short-term correction could be over.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/5afb944c-671e-4c29-8984-990376d5ad88.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to push the price to $281 where the bears are likely to mount a stiff resistance. If the price turns down from this level, the bears will again try to sink the price to the 20-day EMA ($208). A bounce off this support or $189 could keep the BNB/USD pair range-bound for a few days.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above $281 could ready the pair for a rally to $309.4995 and then a retest of the all-time high at $348.6969. Conversely, if the pair breaks below $189, the decline could extend to the 50-day SMA at $119.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has consistently closed in the green for the past five days, which shows that traders continue to buy at each higher level. The rising moving averages and the RSI near the overbought zone suggest an advantage to the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/6c66af30-8e07-48db-8386-83a2fb467206.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The DOT/USD pair could now rise to the all-time high at $42.2848. If the bulls can drive the price above it, the pair could start the next leg of the uptrend that may reach the psychologically critical level at $50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the pair may again correct to the 20-day EMA ($32.27). A break and close below $30 could signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  bounced off the 50-day SMA ($0.41) on March 1 and reached the 20-day EMA ($0.46) today. The bears are currently pushing back at the 20-day EMA. If the price turns down, the altcoin could remain stuck between the moving averages for a few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/1013603d-45c9-4f94-8e9e-f40b503dc187.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This view of a consolidation could invalidate if the bears sink the price below the 50-day SMA. If that happens, the XRP/USD pair could drop to $0.359 where the buyers may step in and provide support.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bulls can push the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair may reach $0.50. The bears may try to stall the rally at this resistance, but if the bulls can thrust the price above it, the pair may start its journey to $0.65.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has broken above the 20-day EMA ($186) today, which suggests that the bulls are attempting to make a comeback. If the bulls can sustain the breakout, the altcoin could rally to $205 and later to $240.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/72970b76-b1e2-4e24-b12d-12725da9b2be.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the flat 20-day EMA and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest a range-bound action for a few days. If the price turns down from $205, the LTC/USD pair could again drop to $160 and consolidate between these two levels.\par \par \uc2 The pair could turn negative if the price reverses direction from the current levels and plummets below the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 50-day SMA ($25.89) on March 1 and broke above the 20-day EMA ($28.37) on March 2. The bears tried to stall the relief rally on March 2 as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/01caac98-1b10-417b-8bdc-7d14057e12bb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls did not give up ground and have again resumed the up-move today. The LINK/USD pair will now attempt to retest the all-time high at $36.9307. A breakout of this resistance could start the next leg of the uptrend that may reach $40 and then $46.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn up and the RSI has jumped into the positive territory, indicating advantage to the bulls. This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) broke above the 50-day SMA ($515) on March 2 and reached the 20-day EMA ($547). However, the bears defended the 20-day EMA as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/f8c03a97-6a6b-49db-8eb8-8cb41efa883d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the RSI just below 49 suggest a balance between supply and demand. If the bulls can drive and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the BCH/USD pair could rally to $631.71 and then $745.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price again turns down from the current levels, the bears will try to sink the pair below the uptrend line. If they succeed, the pair could extend the decline to the next support at $370.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) has been trading close to the 20-day EMA ($0.427) for the past few days. A tight consolidation near a resistance usually results in a breakout because it shows that traders are not closing their positions in a hurry.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-03/bac10cb7-e426-4f46-a9fd-4f89a1f77aae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above the 20-day EMA, the XLM/USD pair could rise to the resistance line of the descending channel where the bears may again try to stall the relief rally. If they succeed, the pair could again drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.375) and then to $0.35.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bulls push and sustain the price above the descending channel, it will suggest that the correction has ended. The pair could then rise to $0.50 and then to $0.600681.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDMvOWU4ZjQyNzUtOTg3Yi00ODBiLTlhMDMtMzdmZWRkNjk1MWVjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210303eh33000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Hodler's\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin plunges, Ethereum suffers, Musk loses billions: Hodler\u8217\'20\'19s Digest, Feb. 21\u8211\'20\'1327\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Editorial Staff \par \uc2 2,239 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 February 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Coming every Saturday, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/hodlers-digest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Hodlers Digest}}}\uc2  will help you track every single important news story that happened this week. The best (and worst) quotes, adoption and \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  highlights, leading coins, predictions and much more a week on Cointelegraph in one link.\par \par \uc2 Top Stories This Week\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Digest_26-02_1-1024x682.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/increasing-stock-market-volatility-drags-bitcoin-and-altcoin-prices-lower"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Increasing stock market \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22  drags Bitcoin and altcoin prices lower}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has had an exceptionally trying week, and it doesnt bode well for March a month thats traditionally \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the worlds biggest cryptocurrency.\par \par \uc2 After hitting record highs of $58,300 last Sunday, Bitcoin suffered a dramatic reversal of fortunes crashing to $46,000 on Tuesday. Elon Musk might not have helped matters in the run-up to the correction, he had tweeted that BTC and ETH seemed high.\par \par \uc2 Analysts and investors alike breathed a sigh of relief on Wednesday when Bitcoin managed to retake $50,000 with some proclaiming that the asset had undergone a healthy correction. But this narrative proved shaky when BTC plunged yet again on Friday to lows of $44,454.84.\par \par \uc2 All of this comes amid a backdrop of unease in the traditional markets, and this weeks price activity suggests BTC faces an uphill struggle if its going to appreciate further. Generally, analysts are looking for $50,000 to become an established support before expecting any \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  continuation.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-purchases-another-1-billion-worth-of-bitcoin-now-owns-90-000-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MicroStrategy purchases another $1 billion worth of Bitcoin, now owns 90,000 BTC}}}\par \par \uc2 A flurry of good news throughout the week may have prevented things from going bad to worse for Bitcoin. Early in the week, two institutions announced they were doubling down on their BTC buy-ins.\par \par \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  purchased an additional 19,452 coins, with CEO \uc2 Michael Saylor\uc2  declaring that his company has no intention of slowing down. It came after Square {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/square-bought-more-bitcoin-almost-doubling-its-holdings"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  it had purchased 3,318 BTC for $170 million following on from a $50-million spending spree in October 2020.\par \par \uc2 Bitfinex\uc2  and Tether also announced that they had reached a settlement with the New York attorney general, linked to ongoing allegations that Tether {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/tether-to-report-reserves-and-pay-18-5m-fine-after-settlement-with-nyag"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 misrepresented}}}\uc2  the degree to which USDT stablecoins were backed by fiat collateral. Under the terms of the deal, both companies will have to pay $18.5 million in damages, report on their reserves periodically, and stop serving customers in the state.\par \par \uc2 On Friday, \uc2 JPMorgan{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/jpmorgan-report-endorses-1-allocation-to-bitcoin-as-a-hedge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 helped to cheer up the markets}}}\uc2  by telling clients that allocating 1% of a portfolio to Bitcoin would serve as a hedge against fluctuations in stocks, bonds and commodities.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-is-now-a-top-three-cryptocurrency-as-ada-price-soars-27-in-24-hours"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano is now a top-three cryptocurrency as \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  price soars 27% in 24 hours}}}\par \par \uc2 Moving beyond Bitcoin, theres been a lot of movement in the altcoin markets.\par \par \uc2 Last week, Binance Coin had stolen the show with a stunning triple-digit surge that helped it become the worlds No. 3 cryptocurrency. Fast forward to this week, and its now been overtaken by Cardanos \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 A fresh wave of optimism and buying volume on Friday pushed its price to a new all-time high, and momentum for the project has been building throughout February. Open interest for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures also rose to $580 million, surpassing \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  to become the third-largest derivatives market.\par \par \uc2 Despite NFTs {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-report-predicts-nfts-will-explode-in-popularity-during-2021"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 entering into a bull market}}}\uc2  with a report suggesting that theyll explode in popularity even more as 2021 continues its definitely been a week to forget for Ether. After touching new all-time highs of $2,000 last weekend, ETH has tumbled by more than 26% this week taking it below $1,500 at times.\par \par \uc2 All of this comes as an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/1inch-announces-expansion-to-binance-smart-chain-plans-to-run-bsc-node"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 exodus}}}\uc2  from the Ethereum blockchain continues, with 1inch becoming the latest DeFi project to expand to Binance Smart Chain.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/musk-no-longer-world-s-richest-man-after-tesla-and-bitcoin-slump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Musk no longer worlds richest man after Tesla and Bitcoin slump}}}\par \par \uc2 As the old saying goes: The sun dont shine on the same dogs ass every day.\par \par \uc2 The sun was certainly shining on Elon Musk when the week began. One analyst had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/tesla-made-1b-profit-on-its-bitcoin-buy-says-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 suggested}}}\uc2  that Tesla had made $1 billion in profit since making its Bitcoin investment. Thats more than the profit generated by selling electric vehicles (what its known for) across the whole of 2020.\par \par \uc2 Alas, that was before the carnage seen on the crypto markets. To make matters worse, Teslas share price has dropped by more than 20% from the highs of $890 seen on Jan. 26. These joint factors prompted Musk to lose his crown as the worlds richest man. Some analysts wasted little time in attributing TSLAs crash to its association with Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 But theres another threat on the horizon, with reports suggesting that the \uc2 U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/elon-musk-unfazed-by-rumored-possibility-of-sec-probe-into-dogecoin-tweets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 could investigate}}}\uc2  Musks alleged impact on BTC and DOGE through his many, many tweets.\par \par \uc2 The billionaire made a concerted effort to shrug off these concerns, suggesting he would even welcome such a probe.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-has-held-bitcoin-on-its-balance-sheets-since-2012"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coinbase has held Bitcoin on its balance sheets since 2012}}}\par \par \uc2 Weve been learning a lot more about \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  this week as it gears up to launch on the stock market. One particular hipster-ish announcement came when the exchange declared that its held Bitcoin and other cryptos on its balance sheet for nine years.\par \par \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  sought to package this announcement as a paean to other corporations that might be considering a similar move touting itself as an authority in advising institutions about how to deal with their own prospective investments.\par \par \uc2 In other news, the company {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-public-listing-filing-details-2020-revenue-major-a16z-stake"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 submitted}}}\uc2  its S-1 report to the \uc2 Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  this week. The filing revealed that the exchange generated revenues of $1.1 billion in 2020 96% of which came from transaction fees. Net income in 2020 came in at $327 million a stark contrast to the $46 million loss seen the year before.\par \par \uc2 Winners and Losers\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Winners-and-Losers-21-27-FEB-FEB-01-1024x826.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 At the end of the week, Bitcoin is at $46,609.99, Ether at $1,470.17 and XRP at $0.43. The total market cap is at $1,429,222,267,885.\par \par \uc2 Among the biggest 100 cryptocurrencies, the top three altcoin gainers of the week are Fantom, Pundi X and Cardano. The top three altcoin losers of the week are Dodo, Horizen and Venus.\par \par \uc2 For more info on crypto prices, make sure to read {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraphs market analysis}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Most Memorable Quotations\par \par \uc2 As gas price stays too high, we see a lot of projects, tokens and users coming to BSC, and this is the right moment for 1inch to expand to other blockchains.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/1inch-announces-expansion-to-binance-smart-chain-plans-to-run-bsc-node"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Sergey Kunz}}}\uc2 , 1inch co-founder\par \par \uc2 Since our founding in 2012, \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  has held bitcoin and other crypto assets on our balance sheet and we plan to maintain an investment in crypto assets as we believe strongly in the long-term potential of the cryptoeconomy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-has-held-bitcoin-on-its-balance-sheets-since-2012"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coinbase}}}\par \par \uc2 Incredible scale for a technology that critics claimed couldnt scale.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-on-track-to-settle-1-6-trillion-this-quarter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ryan Watkins}}}\uc2 , Messari researcher\par \par \uc2 Its very rare to see pre-GPU era bitcoins move, it only happened dozens of times in the past few years. And no, its probably not Satoshi.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whale-from-2010-moves-100-btc-for-first-time-in-11-years"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Antoine Le Calvez}}}\par \par \uc2 The company now holds over 90,000 bitcoins, reaffirming our belief that bitcoin, as the worlds most widely-adopted cryptocurrency, can serve as a dependable store of value.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-purchases-another-1-billion-worth-of-bitcoin-now-owns-90-000-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Michael Saylor}}}\uc2 , MicroStrategy CEO\par \par \uc2 [Im] very positive on Bitcoin, very happy to see a healthy correction here.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-retakes-50k-as-investor-voices-relief-at-healthy-correction"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cathie Wood}}}\uc2 , \uc2 Ark Investment Management\uc2  founder\par \par \uc2 We are now sitting on 2.35x the previous cycle ATH OF 20k. WE ARE JUST GETTING STARTED.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/altcoins-nurse-double-digit-losses-as-bitcoin-bulls-fight-to-retake-49k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin Archive}}}\par \par \uc2 Square believes that cryptocurrency is an instrument of economic empowerment, providing a way for individuals to participate in a global monetary system and secure their own financial future.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/square-bought-more-bitcoin-almost-doubling-its-holdings"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Square}}}\par \par \uc2 I think you can expect that well have a billion people storing their value in essence, a savings account on a mobile device within five years, and theyre going to want to use something like Bitcoin.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/1-billion-people-will-store-life-savings-on-their-phone-in-bitcoin-by-2026-microstrategy-ceo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Michael Saylor}}}\uc2 , MicroStrategy CEO\par \par \uc2 Weve experienced 2018 & 2019. This is nothing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-falls-to-45k-in-sequel-to-20-btc-price-crash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Michal van de Poppe}}}\uc2 , Cointelegraph Markets analyst\par \par \uc2 I do think people get drawn into these manias who may not have as much money to spare. So, Im not \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Bitcoin, and my general thought would be: If you have less money than Elon, you should probably watch out.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bill-gates-warns-bitcoin-buyers-if-you-have-less-money-than-elon-musk-watch-out"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bill Gates}}}\uc2 , \uc2 Microsoft\uc2  founder\par \par \uc2 But were now to the point where ETH 1.0 oh, we need ETH 2.0 so soon, come on, Vitalik, get it going, man ETH 1.0, most regular users are priced out of using the majority of applications on Ethereum.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-influencer-warns-ethereum-fees-will-drive-users-away"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Lark Davis}}}\uc2 , crypto influencer\par \par \uc2 I lost most of my life savings and havent received a response from a human. Id think they would refund or they would lose all their customers. Im sick to my stomach but will join the lawsuit with plenty of proof(screenshots) if not refunded.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/kraken-users-demand-refunds-over-flash-crash-liquidations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 u/dtk6802}}}\uc2 , Reddit user\par \par \uc2 In our view, many institutional investors are entering with a buy-and-hold mentality given their understanding of Bitcoin as digital gold.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sustained-institutional-buying-will-hold-bitcoin-above-50k-crosstower"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Martin Gaspar}}}\uc2 , CrossTower research analyst\par \par \uc2 I think Tesla is going to double down on its Bitcoin investment.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/up-to-5-of-public-companies-will-follow-tesla-s-bitcoin-buy-says-wedbush-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dan Ives}}}\uc2 , Wedbush analyst\par \par \uc2 Prediction of the Week\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Digest_26-02_3-1024x682.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/1-billion-people-will-store-life-savings-on-their-phone-in-bitcoin-by-2026-microstrategy-ceo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 1 billion people will store life savings on their phone in Bitcoin by 2026 MicroStrategy CEO}}}\par \par \uc2 We love an outlandish prediction here at Hodlers Digest and \uc2 Michael Saylor\uc2  certainly delivered the goods this week.\par \par \uc2 The MicroStrategy CEO declared that Bitcoin will be the savings method of choice for a staggering 1 billion people in just five years time. Thats despite the fact that just 21 million BTC exist and his company already owns 90,000 of it.\par \par \uc2 Saylors comments came after U.S. Treasury Secretary Janet Yellen launched her latest attack on Bitcoin, describing it as inefficient.\par \par \uc2 In a confident interview with CNBC, he declared that Bitcoin is the dominant digital monetary network, adding: I think you can expect that well have a billion people storing their value in essence, a savings account on a mobile device within five years, and theyre going to want to use something like Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 FUD of the Week\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bill-gates-warns-bitcoin-buyers-if-you-have-less-money-than-elon-musk-watch-out"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bill Gates warns Bitcoin buyers: If you have less money than Elon Musk, watch out}}}\par \par \uc2 Microsoft\uc2  founder \uc2 Bill Gates\uc2  had a big warning for Bitcoin buyers this week.\par \par \uc2 Speaking to Bloomberg, he warned: Elon has tons of money, and hes very sophisticated so, you know, I dont worry that his Bitcoin would randomly go up or down.\par \par \uc2 Gates said it would be a mistake for the average investor to blindly follow the mania of optimism surrounding Musks market moves, telling those who arent billionaires to watch out.\par \par \uc2 Criticizing Bitcoins energy consumption, he added: I do think people get drawn into these manias who may not have as much money to spare. So, Im not \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Bitcoin, and my general thought would be: If you have less money than Elon, you should probably watch out.\par \par \uc2 This isnt to say that Gates thinks digital currencies are a bad thing. He just believes that they should be transparent, reversible and (essentially) centralized.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/whale-who-sold-bitcoin-before-2020-crash-cashed-out-156m-before-this-week-s-20-dip"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Whale who sold Bitcoin before 2020 crash cashed out $156 million before this weeks 20% dip}}}\par \par \uc2 As youd expect, a post-mortem is now fully underway after this weeks carnage in the crypto markets.\par \par \uc2 Curiously, data from Santiment suggests that the initial crash may have been linked to a huge transaction that took place after Sundays all-time high of $58,300. The transfer of 2,700 BTC worth $156 million at the time was the second-biggest transaction of 2021.\par \par \uc2 Its possible that this whale cashing out contributed to unbearable selling pressure in the market, which snowballed into the largest one-hour candle in Bitcoins history. If enough alarm bells werent ringing, this self-same wallet also dumped 2,000 BTC just before last Marchs infamous flash crash.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-influencer-warns-ethereum-fees-will-drive-users-away"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto influencer warns Ethereum fees will drive users away}}}\par \par \uc2 A prominent crypto influencer has warned that Ethereums competitors will continue to siphon away users should Eth2 fail to launch soon amid ever-increasing gas fees.\par \par \uc2 Lark Davis said Ethereums skyrocketing fees has meant that only rich investors can afford to use the network, prompting smaller users to switch to competitors like Binance Smart Chain.\par \par \uc2 Describing the current gas fee prices as totally loco, Davis urged Ethereum developers to expedite the launch of Eth2 in response to the skyrocketing to prevent a further exodus of users to cheaper alternatives.He added: Were now to the point where ETH 1.0 oh, we need ETH 2.0 so soon, come on, Vitalik, get it going, man ETH 1.0, most regular users are priced out of using the majority of applications on Ethereum. [] A transaction on Uniswap costs $50 on average these days, and that is just crazy.\par \par \uc2 Best Cointelegraph Features\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Digest_26-02_2-1024x682.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2021/02/24/sam-bankman-fried-the-crypto-whale-who-wants-to-give-billions-away"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Sam Bankman-Fried: The crypto whale who wants to give billions away}}}\par \par \uc2 Hes just 28 years old, but Sam Bankman-Fried has already amassed a $10-billion fortune. But unlike most people in crypto, hes building up this fortune to give half of it away.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/can-t-beat-em-join-em-mastercard-and-visa-make-a-case-for-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cant beat em? Join em: Mastercard and Visa make a case for Bitcoin}}}\par \par \uc2 Mastercard\uc2  is set to open the shop doors to crypto as a means of payment in 2021, but it will likely be a challenge for the firm.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-flies-solo-institutional-crypto-push-may-be-overrated"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price flies solo? Institutional crypto push may be overrated}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoins market cap broke the $1-trillion barrier without a final push from institutions could their influence be overrated?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/21-27feb.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210227eh2r000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/26: BTC, ETH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, DOT, XRP, LTC, LINK, BCH, XLM\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,796 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 February 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most major altcoins could consolidate in a range for a few days before starting the next big move.\par \par \uc2 Every bull market witnesses periodic pullbacks, where the weaker hands sell anticipating a top and the stronger hands accumulate for the long term. Data from \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  Pro {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-nears-44k-as-large-coinbase-outflows-fail-to-stop-the-sell-off"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shows }}}\uc2  two large Bitcoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC }}}\uc2  ) outflows this week, suggesting that institutions are likely continueing to buy the current dip.\par \par \uc2 Comparing historical data, on-chain analytics resource Whalemap, recently said that previous macro tops in Bitcoin in 2017 and 2019 coincided with thousands of large Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-macro-top-not-so-fast-data-shows-the-real-fomo-isn-t-even-here"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 transactions }}}\uc2  worth $5-7 million. However, the researchers believe there is \u8220\'20\'1Cno such FOMO in sight for BTC.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/4d7ba78e-2d58-4244-85c2-e1c47142efc1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360 }}}\par \par \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2  strategists Joyce Chang and Amy Ho recently {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/jpmorgan-report-endorses-1-allocation-to-bitcoin-as-a-hedge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 endorsed }}}\uc2  a 1% allocation to Bitcoin in multi-asset portfolios \u8220\'20\'1Cto achieve any efficiency gain in the overall risk-adjusted returns of the portfolio.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 With gold and the S&P500 both seeing a downturn in the short term, investors looking to hedge their portfolios may look for alternatives such as cryptocurrencie, which may limit the downside for Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 While {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-reasons-bitcoin-price-is-quickly-recovering-from-its-severe-23-correction"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 data suggests }}}\uc2  that the downside is limited, let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine where buyers may step in.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 There is a tug of war currently going on between the bulls and the bears. The bulls attempted to resume the up-move on Feb. 25, but could not sustain the higher levels. Bitcoin reversed direction and broke below the 20-day exponential moving average ($48,159), which shows selling by the bears at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/e35922b4-9dd4-4619-8131-414556bc385d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 However, the long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that bears are not able to sustain the price below the 20-day EMA. This suggests traders are buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) near the midpoint suggest a possible consolidation in the near term. The support of the said range could be at $41,959.63, which is just above the 50-day simple moving average ($40,914).\par \par \uc2 If bears can sink the price below the 50-day SMA, the selling could intensify and the pair could even drop to $28,850.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls can propel the price above $52,040.95, a retest of $58,341.03 may be on the cards.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH }}}\uc2  ) could not rise above the 20-day EMA ($1,686) on Feb. 24, which suggests the bears are defending this level. The biggest altcoin turned south on Feb. 25 and fell to the 50-day SMA ($1,498).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/cd09ba59-d74d-4fc8-b04a-07d247fbaa40.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 Although the price dipped below the 50-day SMA today, the bears could not break the Feb. 23 intraday low at $1,350. This shows a lack of selling pressure at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 The bulls have pushed the price back above the 50-day SMA. If they can sustain the momentum and propel the ETH/USD pair above the 20-day EMA, it could enhance the prospects of retesting $2,000.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price again turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest a change in sentiment from buying the dips to selling the rallies. If the bears break the $1,350 support, the pair may drop to $1,000.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is in a strong uptrend and has broken into the top-three cryptocurrencies by market capitalization for the first time. The bulls attempted to push the price above $1.20 on Feb. 25 but failed. However, the bulls successfully flipped $0.9817712 to support today, which suggests aggressive buying on every minor dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/6ef74e17-f599-4f6f-a3a2-43ee48bc76ce.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers have driven the price above the $1.20 overhead resistance, indicating the resumption of the uptrend. The altcoin could now rally to the next target objective at $1.25.\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI in the overbought territory, suggesting that bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair fails to sustain the breakout and sharply reverses direction, breaking below the 20-day EMA ($0.92).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to push Binance Coin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB }}}\uc2  ) above the downtrend line on Feb. 24 may have attracted another bout of profit-booking by traders. The altcoin has pared most of the gains made on Feb. 19.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/353adf7e-3a9e-48e7-9ec2-6a8330736b85.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 If the current rebound sustains, the bulls will make one more attempt to push the price above the downtrend line. If they succeed, it will suggest that the short-term correction could be over. The BNB/USD pair may then rise to $300 and then to $348.6969.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($192) and the RSI in the positive zone suggest bulls have the upper hand. Falling below the downtrend line and the 20-day EMA would invalidate this \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario. Such a move could pull the price down to $118.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT }}}\uc2  ) sharp recovery on Feb. 23 faltered on Feb. 24 as the bulls could not push and sustain the price above the resistance line of the ascending channel. This may have attracted profit-booking from the dipbuyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/de174466-c506-4264-ba1c-1fada24b7749.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers are currently attempting to defend the 20-day EMA ($30.30). If they manage to sustain the bounce, the DOT/USD pair will again try to break out of the resistance line of the channel and retest the all-time high at $42.2848.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the pair again goes down below the resistance line of the channel, the bears will try to sink the price under the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the pair may drop to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is gradually sloping up and the RSI is above 61, indicating a minor advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the Feb. 23 candlestick shows buying on dips, but the bulls could not keep up the momentum and push {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP }}}\uc2  price above the 20-day EMA ($0.048) on Feb. 24. This showed that demand dried up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/ae6c059e-0a05-4929-9ce2-087e2ccc7f65.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The price has again dipped back to the 50-day SMA ($0.40). A lack of a strong rebound could attract further selling and the XRP/USD pair may drop to $0.359. A break below this support could clear the path for a fall toward $0.25.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the pair sustains the current bounce, the bulls will make one more attempt to push the price above the $0.50 overhead resistance. If they succeed, the pair may consolidate between $0.65 and $0.359 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC }}}\uc2  ) rallied above the 20-day EMA ($192) on Feb. 25, but the bulls failed to sustain the higher levels as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. This suggests that traders are booking profits at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/f42f6a6e-7278-4686-83fa-16bca05f0633.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 However, the long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bulls are buying the dips to the 50-day SMA ($166). If the bulls can push the price above the 20-day EMA and the $205.186 overhead resistance zone, the LINK/USD pair may rise to $230.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls fail to sustain the current rebound, the pair may U-turn and drop below the 50-day SMA and the uptrend line. If that happens, the pair may slide to $120.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK }}}\uc2  ) could not climb back into the ascending channel on Feb. 24, attracting profit-booking from the aggressive bulls who may have purchased the dip on Feb. 23. The altcoin turned down on Feb. 25 and dipped back to the 50-day SMA ($24.70) today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/dda09f51-f729-460b-9906-994e28821d0f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($28.80) and the RSI in the negative zone suggest bears have the upper hand. If the price slips below the 50-day SMA, the decline could extend to the critical support at $20.111.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the current rebound off the 50-day SMA sustains, the bulls will make one more attempt to push the price above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the LINK/USD pair may begin a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 The relief rally in Bitcoin Cash ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH }}}\uc2  ) could not even rise to the 20-day EMA ($578) on Feb. 24 and 25, indicating a lack of urgency among the bulls to buy at these levels. The price turned down on Feb. 25 and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-cash-is-on-the-brink-of-falling-below-1-of-bitcoin-s-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dropped to the uptrend line }}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/2e4a2a34-4a06-4e93-874f-675c11c2e482.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative zone suggest bears are in control. If the sellers sink the price below the uptrend line, the BCH/USD could start a deeper correction to $370.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bulls can build up on the current rebound off the uptrend line, the pair may rise to the 20-day EMA. A breakout of this resistance could push BCH price to $631.71.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar Lumens ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM }}}\uc2  ) could not rise above the 20-day EMA ($0.430) on Feb. 24 and 25, which shows the bears are selling on rallies to this resistance. The altcoin pulled back on Feb. 25 and fell to the critical support level at $0.35.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/927906e8-ab82-4eb4-8523-49a3b3adfddc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative territory suggest advantage to the bears. If the sellers can sink the price below the support line of the descending channel, the XLM/USD pair may decline to $0.23.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls can sustain the current rebound off $0.35, the pair may rise to the 20-day EMA. A breakout of this resistance will suggest the bulls are back in the game. The pair could then rally to the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC }}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDIvMTJhMmI0YjMtM2ZiOS00NTEwLTk2N2EtZjRjMTQyMzE1MGYxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210226eh2q000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Increasing stock market  \highlight22\uc2 volatility \highlight\uc2  drags Bitcoin and altcoin prices lower\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Jordan Finneseth \par \uc2 636 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 February 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Growing concerns over rising \uc2 U.S. Treasury\uc2  yields are putting pressure on global financial markets and possibly dragging cryptocurrency prices lower.\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency market faced another day of downward pressure as the unease in the traditional markets continues to spread following the recent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/soaring-treasury-yields-are-worrying-economists-but-what-does-this-mean-for-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 interest rate spike on the 10-year U.S. Treasury bond}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  shows that the price of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) fell to a low at $44,710 late on Feb. 25 before buying at the key support returned to help the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  recover back above $46,500 but generally, analysts are looking for $50,000 to become an established support before expecting \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  continuation.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/a0f4912d-f377-48e9-b6b6-f453c742f2d7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Despite major BTC purchases by \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2 , Tesla and MassMutual, a majority of institutional investors still have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/galaxy-digital-co-president-explains-two-things-deterring-institutional-crypto-buying"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 security and tax treatment concerns}}}\uc2  that prevent them from investing in Bitcoin, according to Galaxy Digital co-president Damien Vanderwilt.\par \par \uc2 Institutional investment has been a significant source of optimism in the cryptocurrency sector in 2021, but its influence in helping BTC reach a market cap of $1 trillion may be overstated as recent analysis shows that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-flies-solo-institutional-crypto-push-may-be-overrated"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stablecoin whales and retail traders}}}\uc2  still hold the most buying power.\par \par \uc2 Interest rate increase puts pressure on GBTC\par \par \uc2 On Feb. 25, the interest rate for the 10-year \uc2 U.S. Treasury\uc2  spiked to 1.52%, its highest level in over a year.\par \par \uc2 According to Chad Steinglass, Head of Trading at CrossTower, the move led to market-wide pressure that pushed the \u8220\'20\'1CGBTC premium down as low as negative 6% and it closed around negative 2% today.\u8221\'20\'1D The analyst sees interest rate \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  as a major source of market \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as the long end of the curve steepens while the U.S. dollar is pushed lower.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/8d8de3a1-8e94-43fe-abf3-c6bcf73388ff.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrencies fell under increased pressures as equity markets deteriorated throughout the day, possibly due to a \u8220\'20\'1Cscramble for liquidity\u8221\'20\'1D resulting from traders \u8220\'20\'1Cpushing up against margin calls and needing to free up cash.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Steinglass said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI interpret the GBTC premium collapse as a sign that either retail is dumping to free liquidity, or large fund holders like ARKW are seeing outflows, which causes them to sell GBTC along with everything else.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Traditional markets are still choppy\par \par \uc2 The 10-year Treasury yield pulled back .0582 basis points to 1.46 on Feb. 26, marking a 3.82% decrease from its high on the previous day. This leadi to a choppy day in the markets which saw the major indices close mixed.\par \par \uc2 The NASDAQ finished the day up 0.56%, recovering some of its losses from the 3.5% drop on Feb. 25. Meanwhile, the S&P 500 and DOW finished the day in the red, down 0.48% and 1.51% respectively.\par \par \uc2 A majority of the top cryptocurrencies also took on sharp losses on Friday, with the exception of Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), which {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-is-now-a-top-three-cryptocurrency-as-ada-price-soars-27-in-24-hours"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 became the third-ranked cryptocurrency by market cap}}}\uc2  after its price broke out to a new all-time high at $1.29. The current excitement for the altcoin appears to be connected to the upcoming 'Mary' mainnet launch scheduled for March 1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/ffdda09a-3d7f-4f1b-9cb6-e54797887d6f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Basic Attention Token (BAT) has also battled back against the market sell-off to post a 6.43% gain following the Feb. 23 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/AttentionToken/status/1364296860794564616"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announcement}}}\uc2  of the upcoming Brave Decentralized Exchange (DEX).\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) price is down 7.19% and trading below $1,500, while Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has dropped 8.36% to $224.14\par \par \uc2 The overall cryptocurrency market cap now stands at $1.533 trillion and Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s dominance rate is 61.3%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDIvZTBkZWY1YzUtZDQ0OC00YmQ1LThhNDctNTdkMzhmNjNmYzZlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210227eh2q00003\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 Altcoins bounce to new highs as Bitcoin price trades sideways under $50K\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Jordan Finneseth \par \uc2 569 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 February 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin struggles to hold the $50,000 level, while positive announcements help several altcoins break out to new all-time highs.\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency market recovered some of the losses from the past couple of days on Feb. 25 as Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) briefly pushed back above the $50,000 level and multiple altcoins have seen double-digit price gains.\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  shows that Bitcoin bounced off a low of $45,200 late on Feb. 24 before rallying 15% to $52,000 in the morning trading session.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/c991cbd5-9eb8-4c26-aebb-a484f2c3b6aa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 While the rebound in the cryptocurrency market is a welcome sight for \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  investors, Bitcoin price is still finding resistance above $50,000, and this level has yet to be confirmed as support.\par \par \uc2 Economists have also begun to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/soaring-treasury-yields-are-worrying-economists-but-what-does-this-mean-for-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 worry about the rising Treasury yields}}}\uc2 , which are usually a signal of weakness for the economy and can have a large impact across many markets.\par \par \uc2 Catalysts for a $100,000 Bitcoin\par \par \uc2 Now that Bitcoin has entered a slight corrective phase, analysts are debating whether or not the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be able to surpass $100,000 by the end of 2021.\par \par \uc2 According to Giles Coghlan, chief currency analyst at HYCM, the answer to that question \u8220\'20\'1Cdepends on who you ask,\u8221\'20\'1D with crypto advocates feeling \u8220\'20\'1Cvery \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8221\'20\'1D that 2021 \u8220\'20\'1Cwill be the year Bitcoin steps into the limelight,\u8221\'20\'1D while traditionalists remain skeptical about the \u8220\'20\'1Crisky, unpredictable market.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Coghlan sees the momentum behind the recent gains being driven by \u8220\'20\'1Cthe general public hype\u8221\'20\'1D following pro-crypto tweets from Elon Musk and Mark Cuban, but now the enthusiasm \u8220\'20\'1Cseems to be waning\u8221\'20\'1D as Bitcoin struggles to hold $50,000.\par \par \uc2 Due to the volatile nature of BTC, it\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1Ctoo early to tell if this will be the new baseline support level.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Coghlan said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI wouldn\u8217\'20\'19t be surprised if the price slowly drops back to $40,000 USD in the coming weeks, which seems to be a more realistic level of support. A drop below this is also plausible based on how Bitcoin performed over the course of 2020.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The analyst sees the acceptance and endorsement of Bitcoin by \u8220\'20\'1Clarge institutional funds and regulatory bodies\u8221\'20\'1D as the next big driver of new price highs, which would also end the domination of the crypto market by retail traders and could lead to a \u8220\'20\'1Cless volatile\u8221\'20\'1D market as a result.\par \par \uc2 Announcements and protocol upgrades boost altcoin prices\par \par \uc2 Several large- and mid-cap altcoins saw their prices breakout on Thursday as recent announcements and new integrations pushed trading volumes higher.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/8cdc54af-9f96-4cb2-b65e-426901051920.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  is the best performing coin in the top 10, currently up 10.4% and trading at $1.15, while Fantom (FTM) continues to benefit from its recent cross-chain integration with Ethereum and is up 31.79% to a price of $0.7755.\par \par \uc2 Other notable performers include Enjin Coin (ENJ), which is currently up 34% and trading at $0.6221. Polygon's MATIC has also increased by 27.74% and trades at $0.2023.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/ba801367-32c7-4e9b-af00-149cf28e9cb7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The overall cryptocurrency market capitalization now stands at $1.533 trillion, and Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s dominance rate is 61.3%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDIvODNiMGRiNWUtNmQwNC00MjJlLWIwYzQtNTI4ZGQ1MzgwNGZhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210225eh2p000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 $580M open interest makes Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) the third largest futures market\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Marcel Pechman \par \uc2 531 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 February 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The open interest for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures rose to $580 million, flipping \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  to become the third-largest derivatives market.\par \par \uc2 On Feb. 3, Cardano conducted a hard fork and successfully integrated the Mary upgrade to the testnet, transforming the blockchain {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-approaches-a-new-major-upgrade-as-ada-posts-an-inspired-rally"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 into a multiasset network similar to Ethereum}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 This event seems to be one of the reasons for the impressive 475% year-to-date rally of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 , and the altcoin is now causing unexpected ripples in the derivatives markets.\par \par \uc2 Since the end of December 2020, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's $81-million aggregate futures open interest hiked to the current $580 million, becoming the third-largest derivatives market, behind Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 Data indicates this was not purely a technical adjustment, as Cardano's on-chain and trading metrics vastly outperform \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 's ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/592d6218-8cf4-4185-8f7b-009e433f2328.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures aggregate open interest. Source: Bybt\par \par \uc2 A week ago, \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  led \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's open interest by a 50% or higher margin. That all changed over the past five days, as \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 's aggregate futures position was cut by 40%.\par \par \uc2 Despite facing a similar price correction to \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 's 30% one between Feb. 20 and 22, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  had $125-million long contracts liquidations, roughly 19% of the open interest at that time.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading volume and on-chain metrics strengthen\par \par \uc2 Volume is the first and foremost indicator of investors' interest. Regardless of the price movement, low trading activity reflects a small user base or a lack of new entrants, which is especially problematic for cryptocurrencies as an emerging asset class.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/cfbe64d4-bc46-4d69-af7d-313e0223aded.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  and LTC 3-day average spot trading volume, USD. Source: Messari Screener\par \par \uc2 Although starting from a much lower base three months ago, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's trading volume soared in February, while \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  was unable to surpass the $2 billion daily average mark. Meanwhile, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's aggregate spot trading volume at exchanges currently sits at $2.8 billion.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/73c6d5e7-b926-4f05-a30d-04c4c101439a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  and LTC 7-day average transfers and transactions, USD. Source: Coin Metrics\par \par \uc2 Cardano's on-chain metrics also provide insight into its rising use and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rising open interest. Data shows that up to November 2019, both networks shared a similar level of transfer and transaction value. By mid-2020, Cardano took the lead, getting 10 times more on-chain activity. This difference is now 5 times larger.\par \par \uc2 Overall, both trading data and on-chain metrics validate \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's futures open interest flipping \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 's.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/730ac98b-9c88-435a-b0b7-daee68428114.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 score (green) vs. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  illustrates that the number of tweets from unique accounts discussing Cardano is 24% higher than the 30-day average over the past 24 hours. Tweet volume is one component of the VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 score that identified \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  conditions for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Feb. 18, before the recent price surge.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/noshitcoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 author}}}\uc2  and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDIvYTZjYjA3ODUtMmE3Ni00NDYwLWI3NDEtOGRhMTIzMzc4MTVkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210225eh2p000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Cross-chain bridges and DeFi integration are pushing these 3 altcoins higher\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Jordan Finneseth \par \uc2 729 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 February 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cross-chain interoperability and lucrative DeFi yield opportunities appear to be supporting the price recovery in Cardano, Matic and Stacks.\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency market is showing signs of progress following a multiday sell-off that saw the total market capitalization drop by more than $400 billion as Bitcoin's ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price briefly fell below $46,000.\par \par \uc2 While the majority of altcoins have entered a consolidation phase that includes a retest of underlying support levels, several projects have started to regain lost ground after new developments reignited investors' optimism.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  started the year with a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  spark that saw its price increase 624% from $0.165 on Jan. 2 to a high of $1.20 on Feb. 20. This week's sharp correction pulled the price to a swing low at $0.80, but it is clear that traders bought the dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/efadfa1b-4008-48db-8b16-a655df76276d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/markets/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.tradingview.com/}}}\par \par \uc2 Since hitting a swing low at $0.80, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's price rallied 30% to $1.05 following the news that community members at Venus Protocol had approved a proposal to bring \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the Venus mainnet.\par \par \uc2 VIP-9 has passed and will be executed soon! {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Cardano?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @Cardano}}}\uc2  will become an available \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Venus?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Venus}}}\uc2 !\par \par \uc2 Get started: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/cAsPHdzOlQ"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/cAsPHdzOlQ}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/KCgHWRPlfB"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/KCgHWRPlfB}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Venus (@VenusProtocol) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/VenusProtocol/status/1364099706092216320?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 February 23, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pro.cointelegraph.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  began to detect a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Feb. 14, prior to the recent \b \highlight22\uc2 price rise\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 score, exclusive to Cointelegraph, is an algorithmic comparison of historic and current market conditions derived from a combination of data points including market sentiment, trading volume, recent price movements and \uc2 Twitter\uc2  activity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/7d3624bb-23ae-4a9b-a69a-e8cc5c9abe0a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pro.cointelegraph.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  - VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score (green) vs. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price\par \par \uc2 As the chart above shows, Binance introduced staking on Feb 10., and the VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 score for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose to a high at 88 on Feb. 14\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 On Feb. 9 the Matic network rebranded to become "Polygon" as part of a strategic change to become a layer-two aggregator. The move was done in response to the growing momentum of Polkadot and a desire to build an interoperability protocol on top of Ethereum.\par \par \uc2 High gas fees on the Ethereum network have increased the need for layer-two solutions, and Polygon has emerged as one of the top solutions with projects like Aavegochi and Golem already operating on the protocol.\par \par \uc2 The rebrand helped lift the price of MATIC from $0.07 on Feb. 9 to an all-time high of $0.197 on Feb. 20 before the market downturn pushed it back down to $0.111 on Feb. 23.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/149f611c-f49a-42fe-be5c-efb54d62678e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/markets/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.tradingview.com/}}}\par \par \uc2 Since that time the MATIC has recovered 62% to trade at $0.16 as the community and total value locked on Polygon continue to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/0xPolygon/status/1364577952449523715"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 grow}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 STX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Stacks (STX) was the breakout star on Feb. 24 as the layer-one blockchain solution designed to bring smart contracts and decentralized applications to Bitcoin saw a record $166 million in trading volume that elevated STX to a new all-time high of $1.17.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/a4891d5f-1f8a-4d2a-9b6f-eaabf14fac29.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 STX/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Excitement for the project comes after the Feb. 23 announcement that STX holders can now {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Stacks/status/1364259773215100935"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 participate}}}\uc2  in delegated staking from the Stacks wallet, allowing them to earn BTC rewards.\par \par \uc2 According to data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pro.cointelegraph.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2 , market conditions for STX have been favorable for some time.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/73ca7145-19a0-408a-a65c-74e48ca38327.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score (green) vs. STX price. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pro.cointelegraph.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\par \par \uc2 As seen in the chart above, the VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 score for STX hit a high of 87 on Feb. 23, around 30 hours before the price increased 75% to its new high of $1.17.\par \par \uc2 Interoperability, cross-bridge solutions and staking have emerged as drivers of growth that help incentivize investors to hold their tokens and also attract new participants to old and new blockchain projects.\par \par \uc2 Following the recent market downturn, it's clear that projects that offer tokenholders multiple ways to earn a yield and operate across separate blockchain networks are beginning to stand out from the rest of the field.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDIvYjVkOWIwYjAtZGMxMC00ZjM1LTkwZTEtNTZiZTg1ODQ0M2RhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210225eh2p00007\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/24: BTC, ETH, BNB, DOT,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, LTC, LINK, BCH, XLM\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 2,280 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 February 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price is attempting to flip the $50,000 level back to support, while many altcoins are capitalizing on BTC's consolidation by moving higher.\par \par \uc2 Institutional investors continue to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-purchases-another-1-billion-worth-of-bitcoin-now-owns-90-000-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pour}}}\uc2  money into the crypto sector even with the current dip below $45,000. On Feb.24, business intelligence firm \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  announced that it had recently purchased over $1 billion worth of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) at an average rate of $52,765 per coin. This takes the company\u8217\'20\'19s total holding to 90,531 Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Another company that bought Bitcoin during the current market correction is Square. The company said it had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/square-bought-more-bitcoin-almost-doubling-its-holdings"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 acquired}}}\uc2  roughly \u8220\'20\'1C3,318 Bitcoin at an aggregate purchase price of $170 million.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 These purchases by institutional investors show they are \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the long-term prospects of Bitcoin and believe that it is a good buy near $50,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/43c5c5da-b777-4f6b-83b0-e2a440efd59b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While the institutional purchases are a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign, traders must also remember that for every buyer, there is a seller. Glassnode data {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/whales-offloaded-140k-bitcoin-this-month-glassnode"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 suggests}}}\uc2  that Bitcoin whales, holding between 1,000 Bitcoin to 10,000 Bitcoin and \u8220\'20\'1Chumpback whales\u8221\'20\'1D holding more than 10,000 Bitcoin have sold more than 140,000 Bitcoin in February.\par \par \uc2 In the past, the whales swayed the crypto markets at their will. But the entry of institutional investors has reduced their dominance. Therefore, along with the whales, traders must also keep an eye on the institutional activity.\par \par \uc2 While large investors can buy and hold for the long-term, the smaller investor would do well to buy at the right time to make the most of the limited available capital. Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine the trend.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s pullback from the 20-day exponential moving average ($48,323) on Feb. 22 was greeted with aggressive selling on February 23. The bears dragged the price below the channel, but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/95b5659d-e810-4a37-94ae-2b4ca66d69d6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers are currently attempting to keep the BTC/USD pair inside the channel. However, the inside day candlestick pattern today suggests indecision among the bulls and the bears. The flat 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) just above the midpoint also suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can sustain the price above $50,000, the pair will try to rise to the resistance line of the ascending channel. The next leg of the uptrend may begin after the price breaks above the all-time high at $58,341.03.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bears again sink the price below the channel, the pair may drop to $45,000 and then to the 50-day simple moving average ($40,541). A break below this support could signal a deeper correction to $28,850.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) fell below the support line of the ascending channel and the 50-day SMA ($1,487) on Feb. 23, but the bulls purchased the dip and managed to keep the price inside the channel.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/ac2826c8-3a8e-4bd7-a047-7d2aadb128af.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently attempting to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($1,728). If they succeed, the ETH/USD pair may again try to rise to the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 However, the 20-day EMA has started to turn down and the RSI is near the midpoint, which suggests that the bears are trying to make a comeback.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will once again try to sink and sustain the pair below the 50-day SMA. If they can manage to do that, the pair may enter a deeper correction and slump to $1,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) remains volatile within a large intraday trading range. The bears pulled the price down to the 20-day EMA ($182) on Feb. 23 but the altcoin made a smart recovery as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par \uc2 VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 data from Cointelegraph Markets Pro began to detect a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook for BNB on Feb. 23 prior to the recent \b \highlight22\uc2 price rise\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 score, exclusive to Cointelegraph, is an algorithmic comparison of historic and current market conditions derived from a combination of data points including market sentiment, trading volume, recent price movements and \uc2 Twitter\uc2  activity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/0f3b59c7-34a8-411e-b81b-7e366a664c7e.PNG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  - VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score (green) vs. BNB price\par \par \uc2 Even as Binance Coin\u8217\'20\'19s price started to correct from $273 on Feb. 23, the VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 score started to turn up from 71.\par \par \uc2 The score reached 82 just after the announcement of UFT token listing on Binance and this was followed by several other revelations related to BNB\u8217\'20\'19s integration to the DeFi space. Following these announcements and the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook seen in the VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22score, BNB price started to rally from $201.\par \par \uc2 That was soon followed by a sharp recovery in the price. After a brief dip, the VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 score started to strengthen from 71 and reached 80 as the price recovered to $271 on Feb. 24.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/078388a8-885e-4caa-9fa0-98be7a263b12.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently attempting to push the price above the downtrend line, but the long wick on the candlestick shows selling at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 If the price again turns down from the downtrend line, the BNB/USD pair could drop to the 20-day EMA. A break below this support could intensify the selling and drag the price down to $118.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls can push and sustain the price above the downtrend line, the BNB/USD pair may rally to $300 and then to $348.6969.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the Feb. 22 and 23 candlesticks shows that traders are aggressively buying the dip in Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 data from Cointelegraph Markets Pro began to detect a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook for Polkadot on Feb. 23, prior to the relief rally from the intraday lows.\par \par \uc2 The VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 score, exclusive to Cointelegraph, is an algorithmic comparison of historic and current market conditions derived from a combination of data points including market sentiment, trading volume, recent price movements and \uc2 Twitter\uc2  activity\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/672a8c7c-3525-4a80-bf8d-3baae2db6500.PNG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  - VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score (green) vs. DOT price\par \par \uc2 The VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 score for DOT moved above 70 on Feb. 23 when the price was at $36.78. Even as the price continued to fall, the VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 score reached 82 when DOT\u8217\'20\'19s price was below $30. This strength in the VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 score was followed by a sharp recovery in price to $36 on Feb. 24.\par \par \uc2 DOT\u8217\'20\'19s recovery coincided with the rebound in most major cryptocurrencies, which followed Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s relief rally from the $45,000 intraday low made on Feb. 23 to about $50,000 on Feb. 24.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/847d83db-57a1-412e-adec-0dc5111e40ab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently attempting to push and sustain the price back above the resistance line of the ascending channel. If they succeed, the DOT/USD pair may rally to $42.2848.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above the all-time high could open the gates for a rally to the psychological level at $50. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI near the overbought territory suggest advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the pair turns down sharply from the current levels and plummets below the support line of the ascending channel.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 The bears once again tried to sink Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) below the 20-day EMA ($0.867) on Feb. 23 but failed. This shows the sentiment remains positive and traders are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/334af84f-d9cb-4df0-a7c1-7b86ef0e2345.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls have again pushed the price above $0.9817712. If they can sustain the price above the psychological level at $1, a retest of $1.1980811 is possible. A breakout and close above this resistance may signal the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is near the overbought territory. This suggests the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. Such a move could pull the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair down to $0.6879684.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has been all over the place in the past few days. After the bulls failed to sustain the price above $0.65 on Feb. 22, the altcoin witnessed intense selling pressure and plunged to $0.365 on Feb. 23. However, the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows aggressive buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/35821c11-a431-4951-a177-5c68fff1219c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buying on dips and selling on rallies is a sign of consolidation. The XRP/USD pair could trade between $0.359 and $0.65 for a few days. The flattish 20-day EMA ($0.499) and the RSI near 50 also point to a possible range-bound action for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move could start after the bulls push and sustain the price above $0.65 or the bears sink the pair below $0.359. Until then, volatile range-bound action is likely to continue.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to build upon \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) recovery on Feb. 22 shows a possible change in sentiment. Traders seem to be using the rallies to book profits. The altcoin turned down on Feb. 23 and this may have caught the aggressive bulls on the wrong foot, resulting in liquidation of long positions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/6215dcfa-c858-4222-84a4-48d98dd33702.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The LTC/USD pair broke below the 50-day SMA ($166) on Feb. 23, but the bulls defended the uptrend line. However, any relief rally is likely to face stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($195) that has started to turn down.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls fail to drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair may witness one more bout of selling that could pull the price down to the $120 support.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the bulls can push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA. Above this level, a retest of $246.9679 may be on the cards.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the support line of the ascending channel on Feb. 23 and this could have trapped the aggressive bulls who had purchased the dip on Feb. 22. Stop losses may have triggered below $25.2312, which pulled the price down to the critical support at $20.1111.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/8b2f91ab-c927-4657-8861-a02e3f36d953.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The dip buyers purchased the fall on Feb. 23 and are currently attempting to push the price back into the ascending channel. However, the buyers are likely to face stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($29.58).\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that traders are selling on rallies. The bears will then try to sink the price back below the 50-day SMA and retest the $20.1111 support.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the bulls can push and sustain the price inside the ascending channel. Such a move could result in a rally to $34 and then to $36.9307.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) sold off on Feb. 23 and broke below the 50-day SMA ($514). However, the bulls purchased the dip to the uptrend line and are currently attempting to push the price back above the $539 resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/95167743-efd1-4407-b9ef-79d9f5f03980.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($596) has turned down and the RSI is just below the midpoint, suggesting a marginal advantage to the bears.\par \par \uc2 The sellers are likely to defend the 20-day EMA. If the price turns down from this resistance, it will suggest that traders are selling on rallies. A break and close below the uptrend line could clear the path for a decline to $370.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls can push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the BCH/USD pair may rise to $631.71 and then to $745.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the $0.35 support on Feb. 23, but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests the bulls bought the dip. The altcoin is currently trading inside a descending channel.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/8905d47b-5f0f-4642-9674-298c5d1e4e94.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.439), the XLM/USD pair could rise to the resistance line of the channel. A breakout of the channel will indicate that the bulls are back in the game. The buyers will then try to propel the price to $0.600681.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA and plummets below $0.35, it could open the doors for a deeper correction to $0.23.\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint do not indicate a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDIvNzg2YjQ5MGMtNmI2MS00MzE1LTk4MjYtMTFiY2JjNmYzYzI4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210224eh2o000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/22: BTC, ETH, BNB, DOT,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, LTC, LINK, BCH, XLM\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,814 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 February 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins both saw a strong bounce off their intraday lows, which signals that traders still view dips as buying opportunities.\par \par \uc2 Every uptrend witnesses periodic bouts of profit-booking as short-term traders tend to unwind positions either on adverse news or at critical technical resistance levels. This occurred with Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) today as the price momentarily dropped below $48,000 and traders scrambled to close or top up positions before being liquidated.\par \par \uc2 Elon Musk\u8217\'20\'19s tweet on Feb. 20 that said Bitcoin prices \u8220\'20\'1Cseem high\u8221\'20\'1D and the U.S. Treasury Secretary Janet Yellen\u8217\'20\'19s warning today on Bitcoin being \u8220\'20\'1Cextremely inefficient\u8221\'20\'1D could have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-prints-biggest-hourly-candle-in-history-after-btc-rebounds-strongly-to-54k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dampened}}}\uc2  short-term sentiment.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/0f25d88d-cb80-45f9-bb8e-30d926941b72.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Another possible factor that may have exacerbated the fall could have been the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-prints-biggest-hourly-candle-in-history-after-btc-rebounds-strongly-to-54k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 unwinding}}}\uc2  of excessively leveraged long positions. About $1.64 billion worth of Bitcoin futures positions were liquidated during today's sharp pullback.\par \par \uc2 However, derivatives data for Bitcoin futures do not show any negative development, as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-prints-biggest-hourly-candle-in-history-after-btc-rebounds-strongly-to-54k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 highlighted}}}\uc2  by Cointelegraph Markets analyst Marcel Pechman.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to spot the critical levels on the upside and the key support levels on the downside.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke above the resistance line of the ascending channel on Feb. 19, but could not pick up momentum. This showed that the current uptrend was tiring out. Traders aggressively booked profits today, which pulled the price down to the 20-day exponential moving average ($48,081).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/a03619ba-28e2-4ccc-ac01-a3304d6077ca.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the lower levels continue to attract buyers as seen from the long tail on the daily candlestick. If the price sustains above the midpoint of the channel, the bulls will again try to push the pair above the channel.\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the BTC/USD pair could resume the uptrend. The next target on the upside is $60,974.43 and then $66,000. The upsloping moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory suggest that bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price sustains below the midpoint of the channel, the bears will again try to break the 20-day EMA support. If they manage to do that, the pair may drop to the 50-day simple moving average ($39,885).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the resistance line of the ascending channel on Feb. 20, indicating that traders booked profits after the price reached the psychologically important level at $2,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/ab962150-718b-4860-8d0d-7c41d23ed63c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The selling continued today and the ETH/USD pair dropped to the support line of the ascending channel. However, the positive sign is that the bulls purchased the dip as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par \uc2 If the buyers can push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($1,753), the positive momentum may remain intact.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price sustains below the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to sink the pair below the channel and the 50-day SMA ($1,465). If they succeed, the correction could deepen to $1,200 and then to $1,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been witnessing volatile moves in the past few days. After the sharp rally on Feb. 19, traders aggressively booked profits on Feb. 20. The bulls tried to resume the uptrend on Feb. 21, but the higher levels have again attracted profit-booking.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/464ade05-c6de-4774-a301-3423836c4d8d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently attempting to defend the zone between the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at $233.3485 and the 61.8% retracement level at $206.1262. If they succeed, the BNB/USD pair may continue the volatile range-bound action for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bears sink the price below $206.1262, the decline could extend to the 20-day EMA ($168). This is an important support to keep an eye on because a break below it will suggest a trend change and a likely fall to $118.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) broke above the ascending channel on Feb. 19 and rose to a new all-time high at $42.2848 on Feb. 20. However, the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick showed profit-booking at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/433ed135-4a97-443c-bae6-ca90c15799f4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 After forming an inside day candlestick pattern on Feb. 21, the DOT/USD pair slumped back into the channel today. However, the bulls bought the dips and have pushed the price back above the channel.\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now try to push the price above $42.2848 and resume the uptrend. On the other hand, the bears will try to sink the pair back into the channel. If they succeed, the pair may drop to the 20-day EMA ($28.89).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) surged above the $0.9817712 overhead resistance on Feb. 20 and reached $1.1980811. However, the long wick on the daily candlestick showed profit-booking at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/007fc383-44fc-4191-9134-db1dd4a11e28.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The selling intensified today and that pulled the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair down to the 20-day EMA ($0.834). However, the long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows aggressive buying at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above $1, the bulls will try to resume the up-move. A breakout of $1.1980811 could open the doors for a rally to $1.25 and then $1.50.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price slips below $0.9817712, the pair may again drop to the 20-day EMA. This is an important support to watch out for because if it cracks, the correction may deepen to $0.6879684.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  continues to trade inside the $0.50 to $0.65 range. The altcoin bucked the trend today and rallied while most other major cryptocurrencies were witnessing sharp selling.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/8a0f7bb8-c341-4e0e-ac3a-dee6cd489f36.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price had rallied to $0.65155 today but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This shows the bears have not yet thrown in the towel.\par \par \uc2 However, the upsloping 20-day EMA ($0.50) and the RSI in the positive territory suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside. If the bulls can propel and sustain the price above $0.65, the rally may extend to $0.78608.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current levels and breaks below the $0.50 support. If that happens, the XRP/USD pair may drop to $0.3855.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls could not sustain \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) above the $240 overhead resistance from Feb. 17 to Feb. 21. This failure to resume the uptrend could have attracted profit-booking from short-term traders, which resulted in a sharp fall today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/cf3d0607-c423-402a-a59c-abacdebd4665.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The LTC/USD pair broke below the 20-day EMA ($198) and the $185.5821 support today, but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows the bulls purchased this dip. The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI just above the midpoint, suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again try to resume the uptrend. On the contrary, if the price again slips below the 20-day EMA, the pair may drop to the 50-day SMA ($165). A break below this support could pull the pair down to $120.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the resistance line of the ascending channel on Feb. 20 and formed a Doji candlestick pattern on Feb. 21. The uncertainty of the Doji candlestick was resolved to the downside today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/f0a38626-92c7-435f-ad52-0317d4c995ca.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The LINK/USD pair plunged below the 20-day EMA ($30) and the support line of the channel today. However, the long tail on the candlestick shows aggressive buying by the bulls at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can sustain the price inside the channel, it will suggest that the uptrend remains intact. On the contrary, if the price again breaks below the channel, it will indicate a possible trend change.\par \par \uc2 The next critical support on the downside is the 50-day SMA ($23.82) and if this support also cracks, the decline may extend to $20.1111.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 The range-bound action in Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) resolved to the downside today when the price dipped below the $670 support. This breakdown showed that the equilibrium had tilted in favor of the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/7452f938-768d-472d-bbbe-73fff462e7c6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BCH/USD pair broke below the 20-day EMA ($610) and fell to an intraday low at $533.33 today. However, the bulls aggressively purchased the dip below the $539 support, resulting in a sharp rebound.\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again try to push the price back into the $670 to $745.39 range. If they succeed, it will suggest that the current correction could be over.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price sustains below the 20-day EMA, the pair may again drop to $539 and then to the 50-day SMA ($510).\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) failed to resume its uptrend in the past few days, which showed a lack of demand at higher levels. This could have attracted profit-booking from short-term traders who may have dumped their positions today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/5c1bd4eb-1001-4ca9-8feb-a108dd6c73a7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The XLM/USD pair broke below the 20-day EMA ($0.44) and the $0.409 support today, but the bulls purchased at lower levels. The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI below 58 suggest the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls fail to sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the bears will again try to sink the price below $0.409. If they manage to do that, the pair could slide to the $0.35 support.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price sustains above the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again try to resume the uptrend. A break above $0.535 will suggest an advantage to the bulls and may result in a retest of $0.600681.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDIvNDE3N2ZkN2ItZjQ2NC00M2JkLTkyYWYtOGZlYjY2NmRmY2EyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210223eh2m00009\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/19: BTC, ETH, BNB, DOT,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, LTC, LINK, BCH, XLM\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,930 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 February 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally to a $1 trillion market cap could attract more buyers to the crypto sector and boost the price of several altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price finally reached a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-hits-54k-reaching-a-1t-market-cap-faster-than-amazon-and-google"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $1 trillion market capitalization}}}\uc2  on Feb.19, which is an important milestone because as BTC gains size, the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue to attract new institutional investors who will consider allocating a portion to their portfolios.\par \par \uc2 Glassnode data suggests that high-net-worth individuals are continuing to pump money into Bitcoin. The number of Bitcoin addresses holding {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whales-continue-to-accumulate-despite-btc-price-holding-above-50k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 more}}}\uc2  than $1 million worth of Bitcoin has risen to 94,000.\par \par \uc2 According to data from Whalemap, another positive sign is that the number of addresses holding between 1,000 to 10,000 BTC has been increasing throughout the current bull run, whereas in the previous bull phase this figure declined.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/c561f3ae-2699-4157-82ef-41f743080a2b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Ballet crypto wallet CEO and founder Bobby Lee believes the crypto bull market could {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bobby-lee-standing-by-prediction-for-massive-btc-peak-in-december"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 continue}}}\uc2  and Bitcoin may \u8220\'20\'1Chit $200,000-$250,000 this year.\u8221\'20\'1D Lee also expects Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price to reach $500,000 and its market cap to rise above that of gold by 2028.\par \par \uc2 However, everyone is not \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Bitcoin. \uc2 JPMorgan Chase\uc2  analysts believe that Bitcoin is trading at much {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-is-poorest-hedge-for-drawdowns-in-equities-jpmorgan-analysts-say"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 higher}}}\uc2  valuations than its fair value and is behaving like a cyclical asset. They also termed crypto assets as \u8220\'20\'1Cthe poorest hedge for major drawdowns in equities.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 As the crypto bull run continues, let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to spot the critical levels on the upside.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke above the $52,599 resistance today and resumed its uptrend. The bulls are currently attempting to push the price above the ascending channel. If they manage to do that, the momentum could pick up and a rally to $60,974.43 is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/c7a06681-368f-417a-b3fe-63a25be3d962.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) in the overbought zone indicate that bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price turns down from the resistance line of the channel, the BTC/USD pair may drop to the midpoint of the channel where the bulls are likely to provide support. If this level holds, the pair could continue its upward journey towards the target objective.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a drop below the midpoint of the channel. That could drag the price to the support line of the channel. A break below this support will signal a possible trend reversal.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) resumed its uptrend by breaking above the $1,869.473 resistance on Feb. 18. The biggest altcoin is gradually marching towards the psychological level at $2,000 where the bears may again try to stall the rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/fe6358d5-dcdd-4ca8-90d7-30ab5cd7b56f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls can propel the price above the resistance line of the ascending channel, the momentum could pick up and the ETH/USD pair may rally to $2,515. The rising moving averages and the RSI in the overbought territory signal that bulls are in command.\par \par \uc2 This assumption will be negated if the price turns down from the overhead resistance and breaks below the 20-day exponential moving average ($1,714). Such a move will suggest that traders are booking profits at higher levels. The trend could turn negative if the bears sink the price below the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a vertical rally, after having risen sharply in the past few days. The RSI has risen above 94, which suggests the up-move is extremely overbought in the short-term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/de6a8156-e74a-4d58-b837-f5de5081b510.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 When traders fear missing a rally, they continue to buy at every higher level. Usually, such a rally ends with a blow-off top after the last bull has purchased. When the price starts to turn down, the momentum traders are the first to jump off the ship and that deepens the correction.\par \par \uc2 The long wick on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests traders are booking profits at higher levels. If the price dips below the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $260.5707, it will suggest the bulls are not buying the dips anymore. That could pull the price down to the 61.8% retracement level at $206.1262.\par \par \uc2 A break below this support could lead to panic selling from short-term traders. The pair may then complete a 100% retracement of the entire rally, resulting in a drop to $118. Conversely, if the bulls push the price above $348.6969, a move to $400 is possible.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 The bears defended the resistance line of the ascending channel on Feb. 17 and Feb. 18 and they tried to pull the price down today. However, Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) reversed the direction sharply from $29.50 and has currently risen above the channel.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/fabbd56f-7b5c-4035-8bd0-851c8a4f1996.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the buyers can sustain the price above the channel, the momentum could pick up and the altcoin may rally to $42.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls fail to sustain the price above the channel, the DOT/USD pair may re-enter the channel. If the bears can sink the price below $29.50, the pair may drop to the 20-day EMA ($25) and then to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off this support, it will suggest the uptrend remains intact, but a dip below the channel will signal a change in trend.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is gradually moving towards the resistance at $0.9817712. The rising moving averages and the RSI in the overbought zone suggest the possibility of a break above the overhead resistance is high.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/f9be864a-bc5c-4c98-ae03-a539833aaff4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can thrust the price above the $0.9817712 to the $1 resistance zone, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair could start the next leg of the uptrend. The target objective on the upside is $1.25 and then $1.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the pair may drop to $0.8082031 and remain range-bound between these two levels.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break below the 20-day EMA ($0.74) and the trend will tilt in favor of the bears if the pair plummets below $0.6879684.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has bounced off the 20-day EMA ($0.49) and the bulls are currently attempting to push the price to $0.65 where the bears may mount a stiff resistance. If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the altcoin may consolidate between $0.50 and $0.65 for a few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/ba090605-cfce-42a2-800d-45935fcbb6bc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below $0.50, it will suggest that bulls are not buying the dips anymore. That could pull the price down to the next support at $0.38550.\par \par \uc2 However, the upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI above 61 suggest that the bulls currently have the upper hand. If the buyers can drive the price above $0.65, the XRP/USD pair may start the next leg of the uptrend, which could reach $0.78068.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) remains in an uptrend as it continues to make new 52-week highs. The bears tried to stall the up-move on Feb. 18 but they have not been able to sustain the price below $230.5305, which suggests the bulls are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/b0130b82-98a0-4c9f-8cfc-9f37d39c3826.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is near the overbought zone, indicating advantage to the bulls. If the buyers can drive the price above $238.8071, the LTC/USD pair may rise to $256 and then $272.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level and slumps below $220, it will suggest profit-booking by short-term traders. That could pull the price down to the 20-day EMA ($191). The trend will favor the bears if the pair drops and sustains below $185.5821.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 The bears could not sustain Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) below the midpoint of the ascending channel on Feb. 17, which suggests that bulls are buying the dips and attempting to resume the uptrend today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/20152b63-629a-4a32-81be-070b88335776.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the buyers can propel the price above $35.6945 and the resistance line of the ascending channel, the LINK/USD pair could pick up momentum and rally to $46. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI near the overbought territory favor the bulls.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily. They have successfully defended the resistance line of the channel on two previous occasions, hence they will again try to reverse the direction at the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the LINK/USD pair could drop to the support line of the channel. A strong bounce off this support will keep the uptrend intact, but a break below the channel will signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) has been range-bound between $670 and $745.39 for the past few days. If the price consolidates after a strong rally, it suggests that traders are not booking profits as they expect the uptrend to resume.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/cc53d91b-44a7-43a2-8a24-a8b6a7c7a8de.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the buyers can propel the price above the $745.39 to $773.32 overhead resistance zone, the BCH/USD pair may start the next leg of the uptrend and soar to $900. The rising 20-day EMA ($589) and the RSI in the overbought zone indicate the possibility of an upside breakout.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below $670, the BCH/USD pair may start a deeper correction to the 20-day EMA ($589). A break below this support will indicate that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) has been trading close to the $0.50 resistance for the past four days, which shows a tussle between the bulls and the bears to establish supremacy. If the bulls overpower the bears and sustain the price above $0.517, a move to $0.600681 is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/f164e3a6-00db-490c-acba-c4c656f8f346.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears may again mount a stiff resistance at $0.600681, but if the bulls can push the price above it, the XLM/USD pair could rally to $0.796804. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI near the overbought zone suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the XLM/USD pair could drop to $0.50 and remain range-bound between these two levels for a few days. A break below the 20-day EMA ($0.43) will signal that bears are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDIvOWU5Y2Y3MWEtZmFhZS00YjljLThhNDktNDY4OTY1MmNkNmNmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210219eh2j000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/17: BTC, ETH, DOT,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, BNB, LTC, BCH, LINK, XLM\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,782 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 February 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has resumed its rally today, and that could eventually pull select altcoins higher.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is gradually gaining ground on gold, the traditional store of value. Data shows that one ounce of gold can only buy 0.0352 Bitcoin as of Feb. 17, the lowest amount of BTC ever. This shows that Bitcoin has been rewarding its investors much more than gold.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-buys-more-gold-than-ever-with-one-ounce-now-costing-under-0-035-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 massively outperformed gold}}}\uc2  over various time frames. Even if the latest one-year data is considered, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s risk-adjusted return is 270%, while gold's is only 24% as of Dec. 28, 2020.\par \par \uc2 The result further skews hugely in favor of Bitcoin if longer time frames of four years or eight years are compared.\par \par \uc2 In the past few years, Bitcoin has matured as an asset class. During the previous bull run in 2017, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s 60-day \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  was at 32%. But in the current bull phase, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-volatility-lower-than-2017-levels-as-price-smashes-51k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin has recorded lower \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  at 14.25%. Analysts believe that as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-raising-600m-no-900m-to-buy-more-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 institutional adoption increases}}}\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  could drop further.\par \par \uc2 And there are no signs of a slowdown in the number of institutions showing interest in Bitcoin. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/banks-increasingly-interested-in-bitcoin-says-elliptic-co-founder"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Elliptic co-founder Tom Robinson told The Telegraph}}}\uc2  that many United States financial institutions \u8220\'20\'1Care seriously considering launching some type of cryptocurrency service.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 If institutional adoption continues to grow, the sentiment is likely to remain positive. Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to spot the levels on the upside that may act as significant resistance.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The psychological level at $50,000 saw {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hits-a-new-high-of-51-3k-as-analyst-declares-historic-parabolic-advance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 only minor resistance}}}\uc2  to Bitcoin, which shows that the bulls are firmly in command and not hurrying to book profits, as they anticipate the bull run to continue.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/7b2fd369-cfec-43ea-9ff8-04d17f4819d1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A new all-time high above $51,000 is a sign of strength. The upsloping 20-day exponential moving average ($43,451) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the overbought zone suggest bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can sustain the price above $50,000 for three days, the BTC/USD pair {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-eyes-63k-next-while-rising-btc-dominance-puts-altcoins-at-risk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 could rally to $60,974.43}}}\uc2  where the bears may step in.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the first support is the 20-day EMA, and if the bears can sink the price below it, the decline could extend to the 50-day simple moving average ($37,415). This is an important level to watch because a break below it will suggest a momentum shift to the bears.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is currently range-bound between $1,658.572 and $1,869.473. The long tail on the Feb. 15 candlestick shows the bulls are buying on every minor dip. The buyers will now try to propel the price above $1,869.473.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/ea0de1a2-3d11-4021-a6fb-c5cb7ec46f0d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the ETH/USD pair could start the next leg of the uptrend, which has a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-fundamentals-signal-2-000-eth-price-is-closer-than-it-seems"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 target objective of $2,000}}}\uc2 . This is an important resistance, but if the bulls can drive the price above the channel, the momentum could accelerate. The next target objective on the upside is $2,515.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price fails to rise above $1,869.473, the pair may consolidate in the range for a few more days. A break below the 20-day EMA ($1,658) will be the first sign of weakness, and a trend change will be signaled if the bears sink the price below the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot's DOT {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/polkadot-indicator-data-shows-bitcoin-has-been-following-dot-price-for-months"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rose to a new all-time high}}}\uc2  on Feb. 16 and followed it up with another new high on Wednesda, which shows that the bulls are firmly in command. However, the bears are defending the resistance line of the channel.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/f3382301-d7e5-4a5d-89f8-6dc2908e8398.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can thrust the price above the ascending channel, the momentum could pick up and the DOT/USD pair could rally to $42. On the other hand, even if the price sustains in the upper half of the channel, the uptrend may gradually continue.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakening momentum will be a break below the midpoint of the channel. If that happens, the pair may decline to the support line of the channel. This is an important support level because a break below it could indicate a trend change.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 After the sharp rebound from the lows on Feb. 15, Cardano's \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  formed an inside day candlestick pattern on Feb. 16 and a Doji candlestick pattern today, which shows a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/bc1a4b84-040c-4e72-8852-d06cc42c5d0b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to push the price to $0.9817712. This level is likely to act as a stiff resistance, but if the bulls can drive the price above it, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair could rally to $1.25 and then to $1.50.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance, the pair may drop to $0.687. A bounce off this level could keep the price range-bound between $0.687 and $0.981.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  price attempted to bounce off $0.50 on Feb. 14 and 15, as seen from the long tails on the candlestick, but the bulls could not sustain the rebound. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/39b9e22b-e74e-4ee9-8e09-bd5848a108b5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The failure to achieve a strong rebound off a critical level suggests the momentum has weakened. The XRP/USD pair could now consolidate between $0.50 and $0.65 for a few days. A breakout of $0.65 could push the price to $0.78068.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price dips and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($0.48), the pair may decline to the 50-day SMA ($0.35).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke out of the $117.7289\u8211\'20\'13$141.32 range it had been stuck in for the past few days. The momentum picked up today, and the buyers easily propelled the price above the all-time high at $148.40.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/05b3e499-0677-4a0f-a300-e63cd0531459.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A breakout to a new all-time high after a shallow correction shows that traders are buying on every minor dip and not waiting for a deeper correction to get in. The BNB/USD pair could now rally to $200.\par \par \uc2 However, traders should keep an eye on the RSI, as it has been trading in the deeply overbought levels for the past few days. This suggests that the pair remains vulnerable to a correction or further consolidation.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break below $141.32, and the trend may favor the bears if the $117.7289 support cracks.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) completed a successful retest of the $185.5821 level on Feb. 15, and the bulls are now attempting to resume the uptrend by pushing and sustaining the price above $230.5305. If they manage to do that, the altcoin could rally to $256 and then $272.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/27620fd9-f2cf-4cf2-b169-5f68f53fbfab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the overbought zone indicate that bulls are in command. However, if the bears defend the overhead resistance, the LTC/USD pair may consolidate between $185 and $230 for a few days\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated if the pair turns down and breaks below $185.5821. Such a move would suggest that the supply exceeds demand. The next support on the downside is the 50-day SMA ($156).\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) formed a long-legged Doji candlestick pattern on Feb. 15 and an inside day candlestick pattern on Feb. 16. Both these formations indicate indecision among traders about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/013c2c16-599a-4a1d-b2b2-ae83f493c3d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the uncertainty resolves to the upside and the bulls drive the price above the $745.39\u8211\'20\'13$773.32 overhead resistance zone, the BCH/USD pair could resume the uptrend and rally to $900. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the overbought territory suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and slips below $670, the next stop could be the breakout level at $631.71. If this support also cracks, the decline may extend to the 20-day EMA ($563).\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink's LINK recovered sharply from the intraday lows on Feb. 15, but the bulls could not build upon the strength and push the price above the resistance line of the ascending channel. This attracted profit-booking from short-term traders, and that pulled the price down to the midpoint of the channel.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/29528c07-15ba-4f9c-9262-548e8c6aede8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows the bulls are buying on dips. If they can sustain the recovery, the price may again rise to the resistance line of the channel. A break above the channel may start the journey toward the next target objective at $44.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price again turns down from the resistance line, the LINK/USD pair may continue its journey inside the channel. A breakdown and close below the channel would tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar's Lumen ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) also formed an inside day candlestick pattern on Feb. 16, which shows indecision among the bulls and the bears. The bulls are currently attempting to push the price above $0.517.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/b3bdd398-79c1-4683-984e-f4b569072263.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, it will suggest that demand exceeds supply, and that could result in a retest of $0.600681. A breakout of this resistance will indicate the resumption of the uptrend. The rising moving averages and the RSI near the overbought zone suggest that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level and slips below $0.409, it will suggest weakness and open the doors for a possible drop to $0.35 and then to the 50-day SMA ($0.31).\par \par \uc