next leg of the uptrend, which has a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-fundamentals-signal-2-000-eth-price-is-closer-than-it-seems"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 target objective at $2,000}}}\uc2 . This is an important resistance but if the bulls can drive the price above the channel, the momentum could accelerate. The next target objective on the upside is $2,515.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price fails to rise above $1,869.473, the pair may consolidate in the range for a few more days. A break below the 20-day EMA ($1,658) will be the first sign of weakness and a trend change will be signaled if the bears sink the price below the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) rose {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/polkadot-indicator-data-shows-bitcoin-has-been-following-dot-price-for-months"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 to a new all-time high}}}\uc2  on Feb. 16 and followed it up with another new high today, which shows that the bulls are firmly in command. However, the bears are defending the resistance line of the channel.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/f3382301-d7e5-4a5d-89f8-6dc2908e8398.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can thrust the price above the ascending channel, the momentum could pick up and the DOT/USD pair could rally to $42. On the other hand, even if the price sustains in the upper half of the channel, the uptrend may gradually continue.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakening momentum will be a break below the midpoint of the channel. If that happens, the pair may decline to the support line of the channel. This is an important support level because a break below it could indicate a trend change.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 After the sharp rebound from the lows on Feb. 15, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) formed an inside day candlestick pattern on Feb. 16 and a Doji candlestick pattern today, which shows a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/bc1a4b84-040c-4e72-8852-d06cc42c5d0b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to push the price to $0.9817712. This level is likely to act as a stiff resistance but if the bulls can drive the price above it, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair could rally to $1.25 and then to $1.50.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance, the pair may drop to $0.687. A bounce off this level could keep the price range-bound between $0.687 and $0.981.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  price attempted to bounce off $0.50 on Feb. 14 and 15, as seen from the long tails on the candlestick, but the bulls could not sustain the rebound. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/39b9e22b-e74e-4ee9-8e09-bd5848a108b5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The failure to achieve a strong rebound off a critical level suggests the momentum has weakened. The XRP/USD pair could now consolidate between $0.50 and $0.65 for a few days. A breakout of $0.65 could push the price to $0.78068.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price dips and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($0.48), the pair may decline to the 50-day SMA ($0.35).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke out of the $117.7289 to $141.32 range it had been stuck in for the past few days. The momentum picked up today and the buyers easily propelled the price above the all-time high at $148.40.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/05b3e499-0677-4a0f-a300-e63cd0531459.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A breakout to a new all-time high after a shallow correction shows that traders are buying on every minor dip and not waiting for a deeper correction to get in. The BNB/USD pair could now rally to $200.\par \par \uc2 However, traders should keep an eye on the RSI as it has been trading in the deeply overbought levels for the past few days. This suggests that the pair remains vulnerable to a correction or further consolidation.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break below $141.32 and the trend may favor the bears if the $117.7289 support cracks.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) completed a successful retest of the $185.5821 level on Feb. 15 and the bulls are now attempting to resume the uptrend by pushing and sustaining the price above $230.5305. If they manage to do that, the altcoin could rally to $256 and then $272.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/27620fd9-f2cf-4cf2-b169-5f68f53fbfab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the overbought zone indicate that bulls are in command. However, if the bears defend the overhead resistance, the LTC/USD pair may consolidate between $185 and $230 for a few days\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated if the pair turns down and breaks below $185.5821. Such a move will suggest that the supply exceeds demand. The next support on the downside is the 50-day SMA ($156).\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) formed a long-legged Doji candlestick pattern on Feb. 15 and an inside day candlestick pattern on Feb. 16. Both these formations indicate indecision among the traders about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/013c2c16-599a-4a1d-b2b2-ae83f493c3d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the uncertainty resolves to the upside and the bulls drive the price above the $745.39 to $773.32 overhead resistance zone, the BCH/USD pair could resume the uptrend and rally to $900. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the overbought territory suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and slips below $670, the next stop could be the breakout level at $631.71. If this support also cracks, the decline may extend to the 20-day EMA ($563).\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) had recovered sharply from the intraday lows on Feb. 15, but the bulls could not build upon the strength and push the price above the resistance line of the ascending channel. This attracted profit-booking from short-term traders and that pulled the price down to the midpoint of the channel.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/29528c07-15ba-4f9c-9262-548e8c6aede8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows the bulls are buying on dips. If they can sustain the recovery, the price may again rise to the resistance line of the channel. A break above the channel may start the journey towards the next target objective at $44.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price again turns down from the resistance line, the LINK/USD pair may continue its journey inside the channel. A breakdown and close below the channel will tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) also formed an inside day candlestick pattern on Feb. 16, which shows indecision among the bulls and the bears. The bulls are currently attempting to push the price above $0.517.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/b3bdd398-79c1-4683-984e-f4b569072263.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, it will suggest that demand exceeds supply and that could result in a retest of $0.600681. A breakout of this resistance will indicate the resumption of the uptrend. The rising moving averages and the RSI near the overbought zone suggest that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level and slips below $0.409, it will suggest weakness and open the doors for a possible drop to $0.35 and then to the 50-day SMA ($0.31).\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDIvY2ZjNjZkNGEtMWFjMC00NGVmLTlkMjQtMzUyOTg2MDA1ZDIzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210217eh2h000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/15: BTC, ETH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOT, BNB, LTC, BCH, LINK, XLM\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,896 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 February 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and major altcoins have witnessed strong buying at lower levels, indicating accumulation.\par \par \uc2 A large part of the current crypto bull run has been driven by institutional demand. But for the first time, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-s-coinbase-premium-turned-negative-here-s-what-it-means-for-btc-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the institutions may be stepping back }}}\uc2 . According to CryptoQuant, the \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  Premium Index \u8212\'20\'14 the difference in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC }}}\uc2  ) price on \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  Pro and Binance \u8212\'20\'14 has turned negative, which suggests that pro traders may be taking profits.\par \par \uc2 The institutional selling needs to be monitored closely because roughly 3% of the Bitcoin in circulation {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-goes-mainstream-as-institutions-hold-3-of-btc-s-circulating-supply"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 is held by these investors }}}\uc2 . If they start to dump their positions, that could result in an exodus by other traders, leading to a sharp pullback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/b6a1748c-8571-4deb-8c76-b560d6655a7a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360 }}}\par \par \uc2 In the past 24 hours, about $1.89 billion worth of crypto futures positions has been liquidated on various exchanges. However, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/1-89-billion-liquidated-why-did-bitcoin-and-eth-price-correct-sharply-overnight"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 most liquidations have happened on Binance }}}\uc2 , considered to be dominated by retail, while \uc2 Bitfinex\uc2  has seen the least. This prompted Bitfinex chief technology officer Paolo Ardoino to suggest that \uc2 Bitfinex\uc2  traders \u8220\'20\'1Cuse leverage slightly more carefully."\par \par \uc2 One of the main reasons for the sharp fall in altcoins could be attributed to the sharp rise in funding rates on Binance Futures, which surged to 0.3% to 0.7% from the average of 0.01%, which shows rampant speculation by novice traders.\par \par \uc2 However, after the shakeout, have the altcoins changed direction? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin's ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC }}}\uc2  ) price rallied to $49,689 on Feb. 14, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/roses-are-red-violets-are-blue-bitcoin-hits-49k-and-a-new-all-time-high-too"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 just missing the psychologically important level of $50,000 }}}\uc2  by a whisker. Although the bears tried to start a correction today, the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests the bulls are in no mood to relent.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/53878f71-341e-4227-a058-073a39125496.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 A shallow correction that could not even reach the breakout level at $41,959.63 indicates strength. The upsloping moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) in the overbought zone suggest that bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can sustain the buying pressure and push the price above $50,000, the BTC/USD pair may witness a short squeeze that could quickly propel the price to $60,974.43.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price again gets rejected near the $50,000 level, it will suggest that the bears are aggressively defending this resistance.\par \par \uc2 That could attract profit-booking from short-term traders, resulting in a fall to $44,000 and then to the 20-day exponential moving average ($41,975). A bounce off this support will suggest that the sentiment remains positive.\par \par \uc2 But if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the pair may drop to the 50-day simple moving average ($36,502). A break below this critical support may signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH }}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating between $1,680.173 and $1,835.554 for the past few days. The bulls pushed the price above $1,835.554 consecutively over the past three days but could not sustain the breakout, which suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/de805979-90a3-4f77-9ac5-8703148ed91d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 As the bulls failed to achieve a breakout, the bears tried to start a correction today. The ETH/USD pair dipped below $1,680.173, but the bulls aggressively bought the decline, resulting in a sharp rebound, as seen from the long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can now thrust the price above the $1,835.554 to $1,869.473 resistance zone, the pair may rally to the resistance line of the ascending channel at $2,000. This is a psychologically critical level where the bears may again mount stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI near the overbought zone suggest that bulls are in command. This positive view will invalidate if the price again turns down from the overhead resistance and plummets below the 20-day EMA ($1,631).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano's \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell to the 20-day EMA ($0.66) today, but the bulls purchased this dip, which shows that sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The buyers will now try to push the price above the $0.9817712 resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/7bd0a605-a6ff-407a-8b5e-16b72233a47f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair may resume its uptrend, with the next target objective at $1.25 and then $1.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the pair may consolidate in a large range between $0.981 and $0.687 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be negated if the bears sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest that supply exceeds demand and will signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP }}}\uc2  price turned down from the overhead resistance at $0.65 on Feb. 14 and plummeted to the breakout level at $0.50. The retest was successful, as the altcoin bounced back sharply and has formed a long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/f8e3dcbe-601e-4dce-bc87-2494c7bad62a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above $0.65, the XRP/USD pair could rally to $0.78068. The bears are likely to defend this level aggressively, but if the bulls can propel the price above the resistance, the pair may rally to $1.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from $0.65 once again, the pair may fall to $0.50 and then remain range-bound between these two levels for a few more days. A break below the 20-day EMA ($0.47) will be the first indication of a deeper correction to $0.3855.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot's DOT turned down from the resistance line of the ascending channel on Feb. 13 and dipped to the 20-day EMA ($22.37) today. However, the sharp rebound from the 20-day EMA suggests strong demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/88a18bd5-212a-4956-a058-abc8215f8680.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The DOT/USD pair may now again move up to the resistance line of the ascending channel. If the price breaks above the channel, the DOT/USD pair could pick up momentum and rally to $41.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears defend the resistance line of the channel, the pair may gradually continue to move up. The trend will turn in favor of the bears if they can sink and sustain the price below the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB }}}\uc2  ) has been range-bound between $117.7289 and $141.32 for the past few days. A consolidation after a sharp uptrend is a positive sign, as it shows that traders are not hurrying to close their positions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/29859fc7-22c1-4601-bff4-532ada1073f7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above the $141.32 to $148.40 overhead resistance, the BNB/USD pair could resume the uptrend. The pair could then rally to the psychological resistance at $200.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the price below the $117.7289 support, the pair could drop to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $105.7886. If this support also cracks, the decline may extend to the 20-day EMA ($92).\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC }}}\uc2  ) broke out and held above the $185.5831 resistance on Feb. 12. This resumed the uptrend, and the bulls easily pushed the price above the psychological barrier of $200 on Feb. 13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/c9329966-92f5-4760-9205-939a583cfeb8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The LTC/USD pair turned down from $230.5305 on Feb. 14 and dropped to the breakout level at $185.5821 today. The long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests the retest of the breakout level was successful.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can now thrust the price above $230.5305, the uptrend could extend to the next target at $256 and then $272.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current levels or the overhead resistance, then it may drop to $185.5821 and consolidate for a few days. The first sign of weakness will be a break below the 20-day EMA ($174).\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH }}}\uc2  ) broke above the $631.71 resistance on Feb. 13 and rose to $750 on Feb. 14. The bears pulled the price below $631.71 today, but the bulls bought the dips aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/924cd8bd-6746-4400-9968-48e1dbd8ccbc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers have sustained the momentum and pushed the price to a new 52-week high at $773.32. The next target objective on the upside is $900.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls fail to sustain the price above $750, the BCH/USD pair may again turn down to $631.71 and remain range-bound for a few days.\par \par \uc2 A break below $631.71 will indicate weakness and may result in a fall to $539. Such a move could delay the start of the next leg of the up-move.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink's LINK broke above the resistance line of the rising wedge pattern on Feb. 13. This is a positive sign, as it invalidated the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. The bulls had pulled the price back into the wedge today, but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests the bulls aggressively bought the drop to the 20-day EMA ($27).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/7dddf82c-6fe0-4d0b-bc91-cba525367709.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can sustain the price above the wedge, it will indicate strength. A break above $35.6945 could resume the uptrend, with the next target objective at $41.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bears sink the price back into the wedge, it may catch several aggressive bulls off guard. That may pull the price down to the support line of the wedge. A break below this support could signal a trend change.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar's Lumen ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM }}}\uc2  ) corrected sharply today, but the long tail on the candlestick shows the bulls aggressively purchased the dip to the 20-day EMA ($0.409). In an uptrend, a strong rebound off the 20-day EMA suggests the bulls are accumulating on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/69e0a18a-7344-4503-ba5a-a3fd80dfd980.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 If the buyers can propel the price above the $0.600681 resistance, the XLM/USD pair may resume its uptrend. The next target on the upside is $0.79.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls fail to sustain the price above $0.50, the pair may again slide down to the 20-day EMA ($0.40). A break below this support could result in a fall to $0.35.\par \par \uc2 A deep correction in an uptrend usually indicates a loss of momentum. If that happens, the price may remain range-bound for a few days before starting the next trending move.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC }}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDIvMTFjMDA3NzktMzZhYy00ZmVhLTgxZGMtNmRhMzMwNzg4MDRhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210215eh2f000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Cardano approaches a new major upgrade as  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2  posts an inspired rally\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Anirudh Tiwari \par \uc2 1,592 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 February 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s Mary upgrade and token gains are poised to compete with Ethereum, while metrics suggest that Ethereum is still king.\par \par \uc2 The Cardano Foundation's coin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 , hit its all-time high of $0.97 on Feb. 12, having started the year trading at $0.18, thus entailing 438% gains year to date. Apart from the macro trends in the cryptocurrency industry driving up the price of flagship assets, such as Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) translating to other altcoins, such as LINK, DOT, etc., Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s growth could also be attributed to the network updates that Cardano has been running on its blockchain network.\par \par \uc2 On Feb. 3, Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s development firm Input Output Hong Kong successfully conducted a hard fork and also applied the Goguen native token upgrade, known as the Mary upgrade, to Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s testnet, which transforms the blockchain into a multi-asset network similar to Ethereum.\par \par \uc2 The team expects to have launched the mainnet by the end of February. The other features of the Goguen update will roll out simultaneously in accordance with the different phases of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://roadmap.cardano.org/en/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano roadmap}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In terms of functionality, this upgrade would equate Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s native tokens to ERC-20 fungible and ERC-721 nonfungible tokens on Ethereum. For the first time, users on the Cardano blockchain will be able to create their own tokens, be it fungible tokens or NFTs. In addition to these similarities with the Ethereum blockchain, there are design differences between Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s native tokens when compared to Ethereum tokens.\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s token design difference is a USP?\par \par \uc2 The first major difference following the upgrade is that there will be \u8220\'20\'1Cno execution fees,\u8221\'20\'1D which are usually charged to a user when interacting with a token smart contract on the Ethereum blockchain, known as gas fees.\par \par \uc2 The recent bull runs witnessed in Ether and other Ethereum blockchain tokens have led to extremely high gas fees due to network congestion, thus {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/whales-profit-as-high-ethereum-gas-fees-sideline-retail-defi-investors"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 discouraging retail investors}}}\uc2  from getting involved. Hinrich Pfeifer, general secretary of the Cardano Foundation, discussed with Cointelegraph how Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s native tokens would differ in this aspect: \u8220\'20\'1CNative tokens on Cardano are \u8216\'20\'18forged\u8217\'20\'19 on-chain with no need for a smart contract, and therefore, no execution fee is required to transact native tokens on Cardano.\u8221\'20\'1D He added further:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CInstead, sending tokens requires a nominal fee (called the \u8216\'20\'18min-\b \highlight22\uc2 ada\b0 \highlight\uc2 -value\u8217\'20\'19), payable in \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , to be sent alongside the tokens. You may also bundle multiple native tokens together and send them together in one transaction (this raises the \u8216\'20\'18min-\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -value\u8217\'20\'19). However, this fee does not depend on network congestion, or rely on smart contract execution.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Not needing smart contracts to forge tokens would lead to other advantages because there would be no room for fraud perpetrators to exploit smart contract vulnerabilities, human error and other risks associated with smart contracts \u8212\'20\'14 something which Ethereum co-founder Vitalik Buterin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/vitalik-says-defi-users-are-underestimating-smart-contract-risk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 warned}}}\uc2  the community against last year.\par \par \uc2 Pfeifer further elaborated on how \u8220\'20\'1Cthe opportunity to siphon funds through a smart contract exploit is eliminated\u8221\'20\'1D on the Cardano blockchain: \u8220\'20\'1CUser-defined native tokens on Cardano use the same underlying token logic as the Cardano blockchain itself. Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s scripting language does not have fixed-size integers, and the ledger itself tracks token movements and handles the token logic.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 James Beck, director of communications and content at ConsenSys \u8212\'20\'14 a blockchain technology company backing Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s infrastructure \u8212\'20\'14 told Cointelegraph of how Ethereum {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://consensys.github.io/smart-contract-best-practices/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 addresses}}}\uc2  these smart contract risks:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CEthereum has been supporting smart contracts since 2015, yet smart contract development is still a maturing field. With Ethereum, every week, bugs and security risks are discovered and added to registries of smart contract security best practices.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  fighting for No. 4 spot by market cap\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has recently hit its three-year high and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 leap-frogged}}}\uc2  Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s DOT and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  to briefly become the fourth-largest cryptocurrency currently in circulation. Unlike meme coins, such as \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ), which have recently been gaining a heap of mainstream attention from the media and even personalities like Elon Musk, Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s growth may be attributed to its sound fundamentals and working principles that it possesses.\par \par \uc2 Marie Tatibouet, chief marketing officer of Gate.io \u8212\'20\'14 a \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading platform \u8212\'20\'14 told Cointelegraph that the team led by Charles Hoskinson, the creator of Cardano, \u8220\'20\'1Chave taken a \u8216\'20\'18research-first\u8217\'20\'19 approach to solving the various issues plaguing the modern blockchain ecosystem: lack of speed, high fees, etc.\u8221\'20\'1D She added that \u8220\'20\'1Cfor example, Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s Ouroboros algorithm was the first peer-researched consensus algo in the world. [...] Their emphasis on doing the work before launching the product has helped them immensely.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Since institutional investors are a major catalyst to such markets, Cardano intends to gain more traction with them as compared to other blockchain protocols. Pfeifer stated to Cointelegraph:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe expect Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s value proposition, especially the degree of security and affordability that is guaranteed through our native tokens and focus on formal methods, will prove popular among institutions and enterprises. Other blockchain protocols have struggled with highly-publicised security issues and huge losses of value via smart contract exploits. In turn, this has prompted institutions to take a great deal of caution when exploring blockchain-based solutions.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In addition, the fact that Cardano has been implemented in Haskell, a functional programming language that is known for its high-liability applications, could open up different business use cases involving large enterprises and even governments. Pfeifer further stated: \u8220\'20\'1CCardano may stand to capture an altogether different share of the market than Ethereum \u8212\'20\'14 that of national-level identity solutions, back-end financial infrastructure and powerful enterprise use cases.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Ethereum is still king\par \par \uc2 Although the \u8220\'20\'1CEthereum killer\u8221\'20\'1D concept has been around since Ethereum has gained monopoly in blockchain use case scenarios, there haven\u8217\'20\'19t been any networks that have been able to generate users and developers as Ethereum currently boasts of. Several networks have been trying to live up to this tag for sometime now and haven\u8217\'20\'19t quite {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/devs-ditching-old-ethereum-killers-for-defi-nfts-and-newer-chains-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 gained the developer interest as expected}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 One important aspect to look at while considering the competition for Ethereum would be the scalability issues that Ethereum 2.0 proposes to solve with its move to a proof-of-stake protocol. Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s scalability is expected to arrive through {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://iohk.io/en/blog/posts/2020/03/26/enter-the-hydra-scaling-distributed-ledgers-the-evidence-based-way/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Hydra}}}\uc2 , which would have multiple heads offering high transaction throughputs, which is measured in transactions per second. Each \u8220\'20\'1CHydra\u8221\'20\'1D head can potentially process up to 1,000 TPS.\par \par \uc2 Pfeifer said that TPS can\u8217\'20\'19t be the only measure of scalability due to Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s Hydra heads structure since different types of transactions can take place on the blockchain, adding: \u8220\'20\'1CIn the future, each Cardano node (facilitated by our stake pool operators) could run a Hydra head. Therefore, the TPS of the Cardano network could scale accordingly with the number of stake pools running a Hydra head.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Currently, there are over 1,400 independent stake pools operating on the Cardano blockchain. That being said, Ethereum currently has the largest developer pool, which is building widely used applications and interfaces, such as MetaMask, Compound and Protocol, including the core Ethereum protocol itself. Beck pointed out how Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s pool stacks up against Cardano:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CEthereum is still the most actively developed blockchain protocol, with 42,457 commits to its code from an average of 220 monthly active core developers. Cardano is not that far behind, with 37,327 commits, but IOHK is also involved in Ethereum Classic, which may inflate the data the protocol is attributed to.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 This high developer activity is critical for the growth of any blockchain and its network effects. It\u8217\'20\'19s also important to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://consensys.github.io/smart-contract-best-practices/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 create}}}\uc2  smart contract standards and best practices as Ethereum attempted to do. Additionally, the scaling issue is currently being addressed by layer-two networks, such as Optimist Rollups and ZK-Rollups, and as Beck further stated, they decrease \u8220\'20\'1Cfees and congestion by increasing the throughput of the blockchain to more than 1,000\u8211\'20\'132,000 TPS.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The rollup chain can also be thought of as an independent data shard that allows experimentation through various data and execution models that still settle on Ethereum. These rollups are a part of the Eth2 roadmap and intend to make Ethereum more scalable in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Metcalfe\u8217\'20\'19s law states that the value of a particular network is directly proportional to the number of users in the network. This could perhaps be the most important metric to value a network, as it alludes to the activity happening on the network being gauged. Here is where Ethereum completely dwarfs Cardano, with daily active addresses standing at over {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://bitinfocharts.com/comparison/ethereum-activeaddresses.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 760,000}}}\uc2  in comparison to around {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://messari.io/asset/cardano/metrics"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 71,000}}}\uc2  active users on Cardano.\par \par \uc2 Regardless of their application and perceived rivalries, at this point, it\u8217\'20\'19s evident that Ethereum is still far ahead of Cardano in the blockchain race considering the users and numbers of DeFi applications based on their respective blockchains.\par \par \uc2 It is likely that Cardano can successfully catch up to Ethereum over time with its strong fundamentals, which might lead to some DeFi applications migrating from Ethereum to Cardano, as done by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://finance.yahoo.com/news/dnatags-tm-convert-ethereum-solidity-140500242.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DNATags}}}\uc2  recently. Pfeifer, however, approaches the breaking of the hegemony with a positive outlook:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt is very likely that more than one blockchain protocol will successfully co-exist in the space in the future. Every Cardano entity focuses on interoperability for the good of the entire blockchain industry, rather than direct competition and comparison. We are open to working with other blockchains.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDIvOGE2NDc0ODMtODhhMS00MGRkLTlmNzktZjRiMTU1YzNlM2EwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210214eh2e000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Cardano is soaring, but can  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2  gain another 380% to break its record high vs. Bitcoin?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe \par \uc2 697 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 February 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has surged by 170% in February to new all-time highs in U.S. dollars but is still struggling in its BTC pair.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price has been consolidating in recent days, which kickstarted the rest of the cryptocurrency market. This frequently happens as Bitcoin starts to consolidate, it gives the chance for the rest of the market to catch up.\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is one such cryptocurrency, which gained 170% in February alone with its price nearing $1 for the first time ever.\par \par \uc2 Cardano's BTC pair is showing signs of life\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/6e7b3245-e26b-4278-8105-d5ba9fd863cf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /BTC 3-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/xaMiggxm/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, lots of information can be derived from the BTC chart as it\u8217\'20\'19s just starting to wake up from its bear market slumber. The recent run created a new higher high \u8212\'20\'14 the highest since July 2018 \u8212\'20\'14 which is a big signal for the uptrend to continue.\par \par \uc2 However, the all-time high in the BTC pair is still 380% away. Such a run would, of course, push its value in USD even higher.\par \par \uc2 Altcoins have been showing massive strength in their USD pairs, as many of them are creating new all-time highs. However, the BTC pairs of these altcoins still have a lot of upside potential.\par \par \uc2 This means that the market may just be starting the new bull cycle. In Cardano's case, the BTC pair is approaching a significant resistance zone, where a breakout doesn\u8217\'20\'19t seem likely. However, once \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price breaks through this resistance zone, continuation is expected toward 0.00003500 sats.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin dominance bottoming out\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/94179d42-3805-46a8-a01f-b683640b222b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Dominance 3-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/UgSLlNYB/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A substantial correction typically occurs after a major rally. Anyone who has ever held altcoins knows this very well. The Bitcoin dominance chart can frequently tell you when those corrections are going to occur.\par \par \uc2 Historically, the best period to buy altcoins is in December. This was confirmed again recently as altcoins started to see massive gains in the new year.\par \par \uc2 However, the chart also shows that Bitcoin dominance relief rallies can occur before more downside. This often happens in February and March, during which a healthy correction could be expected.\par \par \uc2 After such a possible pullback, more upside for altcoins is likely, particularly in their respective BTC pairs.\par \par \uc2 Crucial levels to watch for Cardano\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/97e3542f-d14c-4756-91a8-7e8eaea2883a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/4yU1bwKc/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The USDT chart of Cardano shows a massive vertical move, which makes it rather difficult to establish the support and resistance levels. However, several points of interest can be found based on the daily timeframe using the Fibonacci indicator and historical price action.\par \par \uc2 The first point is found around the $0.65-0.70 area, confluent with the 0.35-0.382 Fibonacci level. The next support zones are at $0.55 and $0.42-0.46 if that level doesn't hold.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/11564175-23db-4afc-a4a0-e5fe4d2a3d35.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/NsGahZ8J/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart for Cardano shows confluence with the 1-day chart as an area of compression is seen around the $0.70 area. This support zone is in line with the daily chart as a Fibonacci level is found in this region as well.\par \par \uc2 If this first support zone doesn\u8217\'20\'19t hold as support, the next support zone is shown on the 4-hour chart. This support zone is found at $0.50-0.55.\par \par \uc2 After a correction or a test of these levels, the Fibonacci extension tool also hints at points of interest once \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  enters price discovery. If Cardano makes a renewed impulse wave, the levels to watch will be found at $1.50, $2.35 and $3.20.\par \par \uc2 Overall, the likelihood of a massive \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  year for cryptocurrencies is increasing with each day.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/cryptomichnl?lang=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 author}}}\uc2  and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDIvMzc1ZDYzMDctOTU4MC00YzRlLWI1ZTEtM2JlYmYxNWMxNTQ3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210213eh2d0008e\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/12: BTC, ETH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOT, BNB, LTC, LINK, XLM, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,830 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 February 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Altcoins are soaring to new highs while Bitcoin price trades in a sideways range near the $47,000 support.\par \par \uc2 Financial regulators across the world finally seem to be warming up to the idea that cryptocurrencies can trade in tandem with stock markets and also in exchange-traded funds (ETF). On Feb. 11, Canada\u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 Ontario Securities Commission{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/accelerate-financial-s-bitcoin-etf-approved-in-canada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 approved}}}\uc2  the proposal of a Bitcoin ETF by Accelerate Financial, which marks the first approval of a Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) ETF in North America.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Australian Securities and Investments Commission\uc2  has also softened its stance toward a Bitcoin ETF. ASIC commissioner \uc2 Cathie Armour\uc2  said a Bitcoin ETF may get the green light if the particular market has proper {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/australian-regulators-open-to-bitcoin-etf-with-rules-in-place"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rules}}}\uc2  in place.\par \par \uc2 The approval of Bitcoin ETFs by several countries will put pressure on the regulators in the U.S. to consider future proposals favorably.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/e0a24de1-04ed-4ac8-8242-ec058540d86a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-market-cap-briefly-tops-900-billion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 soared}}}\uc2  above a $900 billion market capitalization today, bringing it within a striking distance of the $1 trillion figure.\par \par \uc2 The growing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/rising-bitcoin-and-ether-derivatives-markets-are-shooting-for-the-spot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 popularity}}}\uc2  of the crypto derivatives market is another added advantage as it shows the asset class has matured. Even in legacy markets, derivatives are one of the key components that are used for the price discovery of an asset.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine the trend and spot the critical levels that may signal a trend change.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 During strong uptrends, pullbacks usually last only for one to three days because the bulls buy every minor dip as they expect higher levels in the future. The same was seen in Bitcoin as the price bounced back sharply on Feb. 11.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/8c21085f-b472-4c0e-83ba-48019187a940.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The psychological level at $50,000 may act as a resistance but if the bulls can drive the price above it, the BTC/USD pair could rally to $60,974.43.\par \par \uc2 However, the failure of the pair to pick up momentum after making a new all-time high on Feb. 11 and today shows hesitation to buy at higher levels. If the bulls do not resume the up-move in the next few days, short-term traders may book profits.\par \par \uc2 The pair could then drop to $41,959.63 and the 20-day exponential moving average ($39,895). This is a critical zone to keep an eye on because a break below it will signal that the momentum has weakened.\par \par \uc2 The bears will be back in the game if the pair slides below the 50-day simple moving average ($35,180).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is currently attempting to break out of the $1,680.173 to $1835.554 tight range it had been stuck in for the past few days. A breakout will suggest that the bulls have overpowered the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/08b32162-f22e-40ca-ad1a-a198918575ce.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) just below the overbought level suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If the bulls can sustain the price above $1,835.554, the ETH/USD pair could move up to the resistance line of the ascending channel.\par \par \uc2 A breakout of the channel will indicate a pick up in momentum. There is a psychological resistance at $2,000 but if the bulls can push the price above it, the pair may move up to $2,500.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price slips below $1,680.173, the pair may dip to the 20-day EMA ($1,568) and then to the support line of the channel. This is an important support to watch out for because if it cracks, the pair may signal a trend change.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is currently witnessing a minor correction in a strong uptrend. The shallow pullback shows that traders are not booking profits in a hurry as they expect the uptrend to resume.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/60f8324a-b0b6-4543-9bde-e7e06bbf5a94.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI above 87 suggest the trend remains firmly in favor of the bulls. The first support on the downside is the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.7230669.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this support, the bulls will again try to resume the uptrend. A breakout and close above $0.9817712 could push the price $1.25 and then to $1.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current levels and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($0.593), the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair may signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  rallied to close above the $0.50 overhead resistance on Feb. 11 and the altcoin followed it up with another up-move today. The upsloping 20-day EMA ($0.425) and the RSI in the overbought zone suggest bulls have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/413dbcd8-8a01-4d7d-8c25-3cbb50bf8687.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to push the price to $0.65 and then to $0.78068. The bears may mount a stiff resistance at $0.78068 but if the bulls can thrust the price above the overhead resistance, the XRP/USD pair may pick up momentum and rally to $1.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current levels or the overhead resistance and drops below $0.50. Such a move will suggest that traders are dumping their positions on rallies.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) is in a strong uptrend. The price has currently reached the resistance line of the ascending channel where the bears may mount a stiff resistance. Previously, when the price had reached the resistance line of the channel, the altcoin had entered a minor correction and dropped to the support line of the channel.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/05918647-4541-40d0-a490-ac303aaf6282.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls can push and sustain the price above the channel, the momentum may pick up. The first target on the upside is $33 and then $40. The rising moving averages and the RSI in the overbought zone suggest bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the DOT/USD pair turns down and breaks below the support line of the channel. Such a move will indicate the start of a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) witnessed profit-booking on Feb. 10, but the correction was short-lived as the bears could not even pull the price down to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $105.7886. A shallow correction after a sharp rally is a positive sign as it suggests that traders are not hurrying to close their position.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/498ad2ff-0b1c-4444-b283-7f2a9d667119.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently attempting to resume the uptrend by pushing the price above the $148.40 overhead resistance. If they succeed, the BNB/USD pair could start its journey towards $200.\par \par \uc2 However, the RSI is already above 88 levels, which suggests the rally is overextended. Any rise above $148.40 is likely to push the RSI deeper into the overbought zone, increasing the risk of a melt-up that may be followed by a sharp reversal.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from $148.40, the pair may remain range-bound or enter a meaningful correction.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) formed a Doji candlestick pattern on Feb. 10 and 11, which showed indecision among the bulls and the bears. If the bulls can push and sustain the price above $185.5821, a rally to $200 is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/1f244f18-854c-4092-ae2b-d0b2533b8342.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The gradually upsloping moving averages and the RSI near the overbought zone suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price again fails to sustain above $185.5821, it will suggest that demand dries up at higher levels. The LTC/USD pair could then drop to the 20-day EMA ($158).\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this support, it will indicate that bulls are buying the dips. They will then again try to propel the price above the overhead resistance and resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages, a drop to $120 is possible.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 After sustaining above $25.7824 for the past three days, Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) has resumed its uptrend today. The price has currently reached the resistance line of the rising wedge pattern, which may attract selling from the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/a047a5d7-246f-4872-b63b-620033c90b65.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 But if the bulls can push the price above the rising wedge pattern, the LINK/USD pair could pick up momentum and rally to $33 and then $36.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current levels, the pair may drop to the $25.7824 support. A break below the support line of the wedge will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup and open the doors for a fall to $20.1111.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) is in an uptrend. The rising moving averages and the RSI in the overbought zone suggest the bulls have the upper hand. However, the altcoin could face resistance at the $0.50 psychological level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/903059ba-9f95-4907-9a42-58be5d94e459.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the XLM/USD pair could drop to $0.409 and then to the 20-day EMA ($0.36). A strong bounce off this support will suggest accumulation at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will then once again try to resume the uptrend by pushing the price above $0.50. If they succeed, the uptrend could pick up momentum and reach $0.58. Conversely, a break below $0.35 could suggest a deeper correction to the 50-day SMA ($0.27).\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to sustain Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) above the $539 overhead resistance. If they succeed, the altcoin could rally to $631.71 and if this level is also scaled, the up-move may reach $745.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/4e61edfc-498b-436d-b0e0-f52a9dd845d9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI above 65 suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current levels, it will suggest the bears are aggressively defending $539. A break below the moving averages could keep the price stuck inside the $539 to $370 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDIvYzVjYWQ5MDYtYzVlYS00Yjg4LWFlZmQtYzUwZTc1NzVmMmZhLmpwZWc=.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210212eh2c000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 Ethereum killers and layer-2 tokens rally despite 5% Bitcoin  \highlight22\uc2 price drop \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Jordan Finneseth \par \uc2 593 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 February 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Altcoins offering layer-2 solutions pushed higher while profit-taking resulted in Bitcoin price pulling back to the $45,000 level.\par \par \uc2 On Feb. 10, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price pulled back 5% from its newly established $48,220 high and a number of altcoins also underwent slight corrections.\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  shows Bitcoin has declined 4.96% since yesterday\u8217\'20\'19s highs and currently trades at $44,900.\par \par \uc2 The pullback to the $45,000 level could simply be the result of traders taking recent profits from Bitcoin and altcoins as the rally appeared to be losing momentum around the $48,000 level.\par \par \uc2 A recent announcement from \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2  analysts {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/don-t-expect-large-firms-to-follow-tesla-s-bitcoin-move-jpmorgan-says"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 saying that they don\u8217\'20\'19t expect to see}}}\uc2  any large firms follow Tesla\u8217\'20\'19s recent $1.5 billion Bitcoin purchase could have caused jitters among some investors but data from Grayscale Investments shows most institutional investors are keen to learn more about investing in BTC.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/370e5d55-ef01-48aa-956d-5cd743d02409.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A bit of positive news came from Twitter CEO \uc2 Jack Dorsey\uc2 , who doubled down on his support for the crypto sector by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/jack-dorsey-commits-1m-to-coin-center-on-top-of-grayscale-s-2m-donation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 donating $1 million}}}\uc2  to Coin Center, a Washington D.C.-based advocacy group. Dorsey also revealed that \uc2 Twitter\uc2  is exploring the option of how it could {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/twitter-looking-into-bitcoin-payments-for-employees-says-cfo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pay employees in BTC}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Congestion and high transaction fees on the Ethereum network have put a spotlight on layer-2 and Ethereum Virtual Machine (EVM) compatible protocols as projects and traders alike flood to Matic (MATIC) and Avalanche (AVAX).\par \par \uc2 This steady inflow of funds to each project resulted in price rallies of more than than 200% over the past week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/16c34bb6-42cb-4bb0-8ae7-7475c3c50a28.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT vs. BNB/USDT vs Matic/USDT price growth 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has also seen significant price appreciation in recent days, reaching a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-reasons-why-binance-coin-bnb-hit-a-new-all-time-high-at-148"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new high at $148}}}\uc2  on Feb.10. The move to a new all-time high comes as the Binance Smart Chain (BSC) grows in prominence and competes with Ethereum and DeFi platforms.\par \par \uc2 Traditional markets dip after setting new all-time highs\par \par \uc2 The three major stock market indices established new record-highs in today\u8217\'20\'19s early trading hours before falling under pressure to close the day mixed.\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 and NASDAQ spent most of the day in the red and despite a late surge closed down 0.03% and 0.25% respectively while the Dow was able to hold bears off and finish up 0.20%.\par \par \uc2 While there was no specific news prompting market pressure, all three indices have seen surging prices during the first week of February, so a modest pullback is expected in a normal market cycle.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s correction weighs on altcoins\par \par \uc2 A new wave of selling hit the crypto market just as traditional markets closed and the top-25 altcoins fell under pressure.\par \par \uc2 Notable exceptions to the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  downturn include Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), which is currently up 28.11% and trading at a price of $0.892, and AVAX which is up 85.39%and trading for $58.26.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/fcdf1d19-f5b8-4cc7-985a-46e5108a263c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Celo (CELO) is also put on a strong showing, up 40% to trade at $5.00 while The Graph (GRT) has seen its price spike 26% to a new all-time high of $1.26.\par \par \uc2 The overall cryptocurrency market cap now stands at $1.37 trillion and Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s dominance rate is 61.3%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDIvZGQ5ZGZiNDMtMzIwMS00N2Q2LWE4MDItMjJkM2E1YTVhMWM4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210211eh2a00009\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/10: BTC, ETH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOT, BNB, LTC, LINK, DOGE, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,804 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 February 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins are witnessing profit-booking at higher levels, a signal that a short phase of consolidation could occur over the next few days.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) market capitalization topped $889 billion on Feb. 9, pushing BTC above the value of Tesla and the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-flippens-russian-ruble-after-tesla-purchase"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Russian ruble}}}\uc2 , according to data from AssetDash.\par \par \uc2 The current rally is longer limited to Bitcoin as several altcoins have been surging in the past few days. This shows the buying interest is broad-based and today the total crypto {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cryptocurrency-market-cap-hits-1-4t-and-surpasses-google-stock"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 market cap}}}\uc2  surpassed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/charts/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $1.4 trillion}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 While the positive news flow and \b \highlight22\uc2 price rise\b0 \highlight\uc2  in most cryptocurrencies may give the impression that the bull run will never stop, traders should be careful because every bull phase witnesses periodic corrections.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/aa50628b-7300-43e7-8b3f-3332f565d4fd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Another important thing to note is that every bull phase usually has a different set of leaders. The altcoins that have performed exceedingly well in the current bull run may not lead the next one. Therefore, traders should study their portfolio and close the positions that may not be fundamentally strong but could have risen only due to positive sentiment.\par \par \uc2 It is difficult to time the top because it is only in hindsight that one can say with conviction that a top has been made. Therefore, traders may consider keeping appropriate stop-losses on their positions to protect their paper profits.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine the strength in the trend and the critical levels to watch out for.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 After the sharp rally on Feb. 8, Bitcoin formed a Doji candlestick pattern on Feb. 9, which suggests the bulls and the bears were undecided about the next move. The indecision has resolved to the downside today, indicating profit-booking by traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/0d7a4f35-2da3-4114-a037-56b995c1ba0b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USD pair may now drop to the breakout level at $41,959.63. If the price rebounds off this support, it will suggest that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are not waiting for a deeper correction to buy.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above $48,152.84, the uptrend may resume, with the next target objective at $60,974.43.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the pair breaks and sustains below $41,959.63, it will suggest that traders are booking profits aggressively.\par \par \uc2 A break below the moving averages will be the first sign that supply exceeds demand. The bears will gain an upper hand if the pair drops below $28,850.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) made a new all-time high today, but the long wick on the candlestick suggests that traders are booking profits at higher levels. The failure of the biggest altcoin to pick up momentum after breaking above $1,757.338 indicates that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/f29386d5-4bd6-4fb1-89b5-3a5ff637a338.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USD pair may witness a minor correction or consolidation that could pull the price down to the 20-day exponential moving average ($1,514). This is an important support to watch out for because the bulls have not allowed the price to sustain below it for the past several weeks.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that traders continue to view the dips to this level as a buying opportunity. The bulls will then try to resume the uptrend and push the price to $2,000.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the bears sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA for more than two days. Such a move will signal that traders are booking profits aggressively and that could pull the price down to the 50-day simple moving average ($1,194).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a vertical rally that pushed the price to $0.8871889 today. This strong up-move of the past few days has pushed the relative strength index (RSI) deep into overbought territory.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/a94db648-aea3-41e6-aaaf-c20888d68614.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Vertical rallies are rarely sustainable and if the uptrend stalls, several momentum traders may rush to the exit, resulting in a sharp drop.\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.6646150 and then the 50% retracement level at $0.5958618.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off either support, it will suggest that bulls continue to look for buying opportunities on dips. They will then try to resume the uptrend and drive the price to the psychological level at $1.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bears sink the price below $0.5958618, the correction could deepen to the 20-day EMA ($0.51).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has been a laggard during the current crypto bull run but the bulls are trying to make amends. The buyers are currently trying to push and sustain the price above $0.50. If they manage to do that, a new uptrend is likely.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/8e8e85da-211a-4f90-91f1-ffb2887697cf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($0.39) and the RSI just below the overbought level suggests that bulls have the upper hand. The first target objective on the upside is $0.65 and if this level is scaled, the uptrend may reach $0.75.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls fail to sustain the price above $0.50, it will indicate that traders continue to lighten up their positions on rallies. Such a move could keep the price range-bound between $0.3855 and $0.50 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) remains in an uptrend but the momentum is weakening. The altcoin formed a Doji candlestick pattern on Feb. 9 and has again made one today, which suggests indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/a1426597-82cf-4b95-804f-fceb2e2bb3fc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the uncertainty resolves to the downside and the price sustains below $22, the DOT/USD pair could drop to the $19.40 support. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break below it could pull the price down to $14.7259.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns up from the current level or $19.40, it will suggest traders continue to buy the dips. If the bulls can resume the uptrend, the pair could rally to $30.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is in a strong uptrend. The vertical rally of the past few days has pushed the RSI above 91, which suggests the markets are overheated in the short-term. Such gravity-defying rallies are rarely sustainable and a correction could be around the corner.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/8e632933-3620-4aa3-8c54-73b3798306a3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long wick on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests traders are booking profits after the recent up-move. The first support on the downside is 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $105.7886 and then the 50% retracement at $92.6259.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off either support, it will suggest that traders continue to buy on dips. The buyers will then try to resume the uptrend. On the other hand, if the price breaks below $92.6259, the BNB/USD pair could drop to the 61.8% retracement level at $79.4632.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) broke above the $185.5821 overhead resistance today but the bulls are finding it difficult to sustain the breakout. This suggests the bears are selling at higher levels and are attempting to trap the aggressive bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/4d36ac0c-3c11-485b-8015-9ccfc49b083b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the LTC/USD pair fails to sustain above $185.5821, the short-term traders may book profits and that could sink the price to the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off the moving averages, the bulls will again try to propel and sustain the price above $185.5821. If they succeed, the pair may rally to $200 and then to $250.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the price below the moving averages, a drop to $120 is possible. A rebound off this level could keep the pair range-bound for a few days. A break below this support could tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) rose to a new all-time high on Feb. 9 and the up-move extended today, but the bulls are not able to sustain the momentum. This could have resulted in a few short-term traders booking profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/4203320c-fb68-460e-9c5a-642e18acc4e2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows the bulls have not given up and are buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 If the price rises from the current levels and breaks above $28.6412, the LINK/USD pair may rally to $30 and then $33.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($23.85), the pair could drop to $20.1111.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USD\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been reducing and that has resulted in successive inside day candlestick patterns in the past three days. This suggests the bulls and the bears are not taking large directional bets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/ee71c098-df1e-40c7-ac44-cfe7e01c83f9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the uncertainty resolves to the upside and the bulls push the price above the $0.0875 overhead resistance, the uptrend could resume, with the next target objective at $0.102412 and then $0.13.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price slips below $0.0625, the DOGE/USD pair could start a deeper correction that may reach the 20-day EMA ($0.44).\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance today and has formed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  engulfing candlestick pattern. The bears will now try to sink the altcoin to the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/9013762c-5274-4137-982f-72c1c9574bfe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off the moving averages will suggest the bulls are buying on dips. They will then try to once again push and sustain the price above $539. If they succeed, a rally to $631.71 is possible.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bears sink the price below the moving averages, the BCH/USD pair may drop to $370. A strong bounce off this critical support may keep the pair range-bound between $539 and $370 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDIvMjkxNjJhY2MtMWI1OS00YmU4LTgzZjEtYjlmOTkzNjEzZjkyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210210eh2a000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 BTC\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin  \highlight22\uc2 volatility \highlight\uc2  almost returned to 'Black Thursday' levels in January\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Joshua Mapperson \par \uc2 365 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 February 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  surged over 100% in January amid its rally into new all-time highs above $40,00 and subsequent 32% correction.\par \par \uc2 With {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin}}}\uc2  rallying from $30,000 to $42,000 and back again during January, BTC\u8217\'20\'19s annualized \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose to levels last seen in April 2020, according to a new {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://kraken.docsend.com/view/k72g8dnauuvd5zjs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 report}}}\uc2  from U.S. crypto exchange Kraken.\par \par \uc2 January was a roller-coaster ride for Bitcoin, with BTC rallying 46% to a new high of $41,989 before retracing 32% to below $29,000. This resulted in the annualized \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  spiking to over 100% \u8212\'20\'14 which was last seen 10 months ago during the infamous \u8216\'20\'18Black Thursday\u8217\'20\'19 price plummet.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/7c853fe1-33bd-47c2-bc8e-6f46130efc87.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price vs. \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  vs. trading volume. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://kraken.docsend.com/view/k72g8dnauuvd5zjs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kraken}}}\par \par \uc2 In early-March 2020, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price dove more than 40% in a matter of days from $9,000 to $5,200 \u8212\'20\'14 resulting in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  spiking from 60% to more than 150%.\par \par \uc2 Despite its surging \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bitcoin registered the smallest \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  spike of the top five crypto assets by market cap (excluding Tether).\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) finished the month with the largest \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  of 228%, followed by Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) with 183%, and Ethereum ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) with 160%. Unlike Bitcoin, ETH, DOT, and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  evaded heavy corrections during January, closing out the month near their respective local highs.\par \par \uc2 Looking forward, Kraken anticipates that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price will trend upwards with reduced \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  during February:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CGiven that Feb., on average, returns six percentage points more than Kan. and is 15 percentage points less volatile, one might expect Feb. to outperform Jan. and \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  to dwindle as BTC melts up.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 However, not everyone is convinced Bitcoin will continue its road to higher peaks. Famed gold-bug and notorious Bitcoin-skeptic, Peter Schiff, speculated BTC\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is unlikely to last, predicting it will be superseded by the surging meme-coin DOGE:\par \par \uc2 Being the first mover gave Bitcoin a head start, but it doesn't guarantee that it wins the race. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Bitcoin?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Bitcoin}}}\uc2  = Myspace, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Dogecoin?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Dogecoin}}}\uc2  = \uc2 Facebook\uc2 , _______ = \uc2 Instagram\uc2 , ______ = ______. Nothing will ever equal {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/gold?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #gold}}}\uc2 !\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Peter Schiff (@PeterSchiff) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/PeterSchiff/status/1358484492177014788?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 February 7, 2021}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDIvMGEwZjM1M2YtMTJkYy00YWQwLWIzNTQtNmMxMDYwNjM0MTlhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210209eh2900005\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin Price\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin price hits $46,794 as altcoins, stocks rally to new highs\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Jordan Finneseth \par \uc2 600 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 February 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price hit a new all-time high at $46,794 on the same day Tesla revealed its $1.5 billion investment into BTC and stock markets rallied to new highs.\par \par \uc2 On Feb. 8 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price broke out to a new all-time high at $46,794 after documents from Tesla revealed that the company had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/tesla-allocates-7-7-of-gross-cash-to-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 allocated 7.7% of its gross cash position}}}\uc2  to BTC. The purchase gives Tesla a sizable $1.5 billion position in the top-ranked \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  shows Bitcoin is currently up by 18.5% and trading near $46,000. Meanwhile, the majority of altcoins and DeFi tokens have also surged to notch double-digit gains for the day.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/cd2d06d5-cf32-4d00-885f-976f55a0b1a8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While some analysts are speculating on which large company will be the next to jump on the Bitcoin train, Royal Bank of Canada Dominion Securities analyst {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/will-apple-be-the-next-company-to-adopt-bitcoin-after-tesla"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Paul Steves thinks}}}\uc2  that Apple will be the next institutional player to join the trend.\par \par \uc2 According to Steves, if Apple were to launch a crypto exchange or buy Bitcoin, it could lead to an estimated $40 billion in annual revenue.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  price action came at a crucial time as the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  had seen a decline in overall sentiment in recent days as the price struggled to break above the $38,000 level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/f31acd14-6a7b-4419-9155-0df8b5a4d184.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC price vs. 30-day avg. sentiment score. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thetie.io/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TheTIE}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) also broke out as bulls pushed the popular meme coin to a new all-time high at $0.0839. This move came shortly after Mark Cuban gave a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/doge-is-not-a-bad-look-for-crypto-users-says-mark-cuban-as-price-surges-another-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 nod of approval}}}\uc2  by calling the altcoin the \u8220\'20\'1Cbest entertainment bang for your buck available\u8221\'20\'1D in the crypto market.\par \par \uc2 When a Forbes reporter asks me about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/dogecoin?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #dogecoin}}}\uc2  and whether it\u8217\'20\'19s a bad look for crypto when people are buying it {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/YGs27Vdsxo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/YGs27Vdsxo}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Mark Cuban (@mcuban) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/mcuban/status/1358811975074131975?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 February 8, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) price rose to a new mulit-year high at $0.72, an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-ada-price-rallies-139-following-smart-contract-implementation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increase of 100% since Feb. 1}}}\uc2 , after the successful testnet implementation of smart contracts and the potential of future DeFi integration boosted investors\u8217\'20\'19 outlook for the project.\par \par \uc2 Traditional markets rise on anticipated stimulus payments\par \par \uc2 Investor optimism involving the possibility of a new round of stimulus from the \uc2 U.S. government\uc2 , including direct payments of $1,400 and a tax credit of $3,000 per child, helped bolster the traditional markets on Monday.\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500, Dow and NASDAQ all established new record highs, closing the day up 0.74%, 0.76% and 0.94% respectively. The past six trading days have marked the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://finance.yahoo.com/news/stock-market-news-live-updates-february-8-2021-122925144.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 longest winning streak}}}\uc2  for the S&P 500 since August 2020, and the Dow has experienced its best start to February since 1931, rising 4.7% so far this month.\par \par \uc2 Altcoins also benefited from BTC \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum and many rallied by double-digits and standouts like Terra (LUNA) and \uc2 BitTorrent\uc2  gained in excess of 100%.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) rallied 20.23% to a new high at $23.27, while Elrond (EGLD) gained 40.7% in the last 24-hours to establish a new all-time high at $191.73. Theta (THETA) also rallied 25.55% to set a new high at $2.86.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/8fbf1041-d71c-43f9-996b-966591857841.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The overall cryptocurrency market cap now stands at $1.32 trillion and Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s dominance rate is 62.9%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9iY2JlYmY4N2M1OTg2NmY4NjBlMWE1YTMyMzlkY2YwNS5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210209eh2800007\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/8: BTC, ETH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOT, BNB, LTC, DOGE, LINK, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,729 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 February 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Strong institutional demand has propelled Bitcoin and many altcoins to new all-time highs.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) broke out to a new all-time high today, buoyed by the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hits-43k-all-time-high-as-tesla-invests-1-5-billion-in-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 news}}}\uc2  that Tesla has purchased $1.5 billion worth of Bitcoin, according to a filing with the \uc2 Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In addition to the Bitcoin purchase, Tesla also plans to offer its customers the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/tesla-expects-to-begin-accepting-bitcoin-for-payment"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 option}}}\uc2  of buying products with BTC. Instead of converting BTC payments to fiat upon receipt, Tesla may decide to add it to its reserves.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/4bd14420-6593-4269-803d-85ff0f56785c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 In addition to Tesla\u8217\'20\'19s purchase, legendary investor Bill Miller also plans to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bill-miller-plans-400m-bitcoin-investment-via-gbtc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increase}}}\uc2  his exposure to Bitcoin by investing over $300 million in \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2 . These purchases by large investors even after Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s sharp rally show they expect the up-move to continue further.\par \par \uc2 Mexico\u8217\'20\'19s third-richest person Ricardo Salinas Pliego has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/billionaires-pushing-crypto-mexico-s-third-richest-person-changes-twitter-bio-to-include-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2  the hashtag Bitcoin to his \uc2 Twitter\uc2  bio. This act by Salinas brings Bitcoin to the notice of his 840,000 followers, some of whom may want to emulate the billionaire by buying Bitcoin. Salinas had revealed back in November that 10% of his \u8220\'20\'1Cliquid portfolio\u8221\'20\'1D was invested in Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 These developments have given a positive boost to the fundamentals in the crypto sector. With a huge tailwind in place, let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to arrive at the possible target levels on the upside.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin had been stuck between $38,000 and $40,000 for the past two days. The long wick on Feb. 6 candlestick showed traders booked profits at higher levels and the long tail on Feb. 7 candlestick signaled buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/cecf6bbc-18fc-49ac-9167-3d4376425b0e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Today, the bulls have propelled the price above the $41,959.63 overhead resistance. This opens the possibility of a rally to the immediate target objective at $50,000 where the bears may again mount a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 But if the bulls can drive the price above $50,000, the BTC/USD pair may rally to $60,974.43.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls fail to sustain the breakout, it will indicate that traders are booking profits at higher levels. The bears will then try to pull the price back below $38,000.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, a retest of the moving averages is likely. A break below the 20-day exponential moving average ($36,196) will be the first sign of weakness and a drop below the 50-day simple moving average ($33,250) will increase the likelihood of a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $1,757.338 on Feb. 5 but the bulls aggressively purchased the dip to the breakout level at $1,474.096 on Feb. 7 as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/b6b206c2-71f1-499e-bf41-c243801a3d32.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can sustain the price above $1,757.338, the ETH/USD pair could resume its uptrend. The next target on the upside is $1,870 and if this level is crossed, the up-move may reach the psychologically critical level at $2,000.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level, the pair could consolidate between $1,757.338 and $1,473.096 for a few more days. A break below $1,473.096 could pull the price down to the 50-day SMA ($1,148).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) picked up momentum after breaking above the ascending channel on Feb. 5. The bulls easily pushed the price above the immediate resistance at $0.60 on Feb. 6, which opens the possibility of a rally to $0.80.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/b91219b8-a5ee-49b9-922e-01e4017bd560.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the rising moving averages suggest advantage to the bulls, the RSI in the overbought territory warns of a possible correction or consolidation in the near term.\par \par \uc2 A consolidation will indicate that traders are not booking profits in a hurry and that will enhance the prospects of the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a correction could reach the 20-day EMA ($0.454). A strong rebound off it will suggest that the uptrend remains intact, while a break below it will suggest the momentum has weakened.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has been sustaining above $0.3850 for the past few days, but the bulls are struggling to push the price above $0.50. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/a058f01f-78cc-4f7f-8cdd-65bcfb5e71fb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to sink the price below the $0.3855 support on Feb. 7 but failed. This shows the bulls are buying the dips. When bears sell on rallies and bulls buy on dips, the price gets stuck in a range.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above $0.50 could start an up-move that could reach $0.65, while a break below the 20-day EMA ($0.374) could sink the XRP/USD pair to the 50-day SMA ($0.312).\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to sink and sustain the price below $19.40 has attracted strong buying from the bulls. This has propelled Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) to a new all-time high today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/09c57796-4af5-45a6-bd8d-83b9eeb1c0d6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The immediate target on the upside is $24.08 and if this level is crossed, the uptrend may extend to $30. Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is near the overbought territory, indicating that the bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the DOT/USD pair reverses direction and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($17.91). Such a move could pull the price down to the next support at $14.7259.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) soared above the resistance line of the broadening wedge pattern on Feb. 5, which invalidated the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. The bears are trying to stall the current uptrend at $75, but the positive sign is that the bulls have not given up much ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/a99a562f-2884-46cd-a176-c813f8c77f76.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 After a shallow correction on Feb. 7, the bulls are currently attempting to resume the uptrend. A breakout and close above $75.5 could propel the BNB/USD pair to $95 and then to $100.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price again turns down from $75.5, the bears will try to sink the pair back into the wedge. If they succeed, it will suggest profit booking at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) had been consolidating between the 20-day EMA ($144.98) and $160 for the past few days. The bulls are currently attempting to resolve this tight trading range to the upside. If they manage a close above $160, the altcoin could rise to $185.5821.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/7e93a706-04e0-4c6f-adfb-79c608225a57.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can propel the price above $185.5821, the LTC/USD pair could resume the uptrend and rally to $200. Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the pair could again dip to the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 A breakdown and close below the moving averages will be the first sign of weakness. Such a move could pull the price down to $120.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USD\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s pump on Jan. 28 and 29 met with strong selling at $0.0875. Although the altcoin dropped on Jan. 30, the bears could not capitalize on this weakness. Strong buying at lower levels again resumed the up-move on Feb. 4 when the price broke and closed above the psychological barrier at $0.050.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/1acd6f43-36af-4a76-b629-27ae26544ca9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USD pair turned down from the $0.0875 overhead resistance on Feb. 7, but the long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bulls are accumulating on dips. If buyers can drive the price above $0.0875, the momentum could pick up.\par \par \uc2 The next target to watch on the upside is $0.102412 and then $0.13. Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from $0.875, the pair may consolidate in a range for a few days before starting the next trending move.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the Feb. 7 candlestick shows the bulls purchased the dip to the 20-day EMA ($23.15). If buyers can now drive Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) above the $25.7824 to $27 overhead resistance zone, the uptrend could resume.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/f12d4ae0-5e90-4251-9917-a1e66c66501a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The first target on the upside is $30 and if the bulls can thrust the price above it, the LINK/USD pair could rally to $33. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory suggest advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the bears will once again try to sink the price below the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the pair could slide to $20.1111.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) broke above the $465.02 resistance on Feb. 6 but the bulls could not sustain the breakout. This attracted profit-booking and the altcoin slipped below the 20-day EMA ($439) on Feb. 7.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/485a26eb-76f3-49f1-ac14-b238466d3579.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bears could not capitalize on the weakness on Feb. 7 and sink the price below the 50-day SMA ($422). The bulls have currently again pushed the price above $465.02. This increases the likelihood of a rally to $515.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the BCH/USD pair turns down from the current levels and breaks below the 50-day SMA, it will signal weakness.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDIvZWMxYTE2YTgtYmJiNC00Y2U5LTgzYTUtMmIzY2QxODIwMzk1LmpwZWc=.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210208eh28000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/5: BTC, ETH, XRP, DOT,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LINK, LTC, BNB, BCH, XLM\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,813 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 February 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Altcoins are reaching multi-year highs while Bitcoin price builds momentum for the next run at the $40,000 level.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) correction from its January high has not shaken the confidence of institutional investors. According to Glassnode analysts, the number of whales {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/4-reasons-bitcoin-is-about-to-reclaim-38k-putting-all-time-highs-back-in-play"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 holding}}}\uc2  more than 1,000 Bitcoin has increased by 200 this year.\par \par \uc2 Along with the institutions, several high profile investors have also committed money to the crypto sector. Hedge fund manager Paul Tudor Jones, former PepsiCo CEO Indra Nooyi, and American rapper LL Cool J have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ll-cool-j-and-paul-tudor-jones-back-72m-crypto-fund"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 invested}}}\uc2  in a new venture capital crypto fund launched by Silver Lake Partners co-founder Glenn Hutchins and his associates.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/06b9fbc4-835e-4a26-bb5c-35221d6aff87.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The steady inflow into crypto assets suggests that investors are \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the long-term. ARK analyst Yassine Elmandjra believes that Bitcoin is still in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/top-around-390k-new-chart-shows-this-bitcoin-bull-run-is-only-beginning"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 early}}}\uc2  stages of its bull phase. According to Elmandjra, if Bitcoin mimics its previous two bull runs, it could rally to about $390,000 before the current bull phase ends.\par \par \uc2 Even though Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price action attracts the bulk of the attention, several altcoins have been rallying higher. Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies and determine their target objectives on the upside.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been facing resistance at the $38,000 level for the past two days, but the shallow correction on Feb. 4 suggests traders are not closing their positions and are buying on any minor dip. This increases the possibility of a break above $38,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/11490974-96f6-4f31-97a7-6c3461a2f652.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 There is a minor resistance at $40,000, but if the bulls can drive the price above it, the BTC/USD pair could retest the all-time high at $41,959.63.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to defend this level aggressively but if the bulls do not give up much ground, it increases the likelihood of the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 The next resistance on the upside is $50,000 and then $60,000. The 20-day exponential moving average ($34,625) has turned up and the relative strength index (RSI) has climbed above 61, suggesting the bulls are back in command.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price turns down from the current levels, the pair may drop to the 20-day EMA. If the pair rebounds strongly from this level, the bulls will again try to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bears sink the price below the moving averages, the pair may consolidate between $28,850 and $38,000 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) picked up momentum after breaking out to a new all-time high on Feb. 2. There was some hesitation near the $1,675 overhead resistance but the bears could not even pull the price down to the breakout level at $1,473.096.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/adbf7246-d0f2-4e05-97f5-d0b58358ae70.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The shallow correction on Feb. 4 shows traders are in no mood to book profits as they anticipate the uptrend to extend further. Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is close to the overbought zone, indicating that the bulls are in control. The next target on the upside is $2,000.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the ETH/USD pair turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($1,385). Such a move will suggest aggressive profit-booking at higher levels and may result in a deeper correction to the 50-day simple moving average ($1,087).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  rebounded off the moving averages on Feb. 2, which suggests the selling pressure has reduced and the bulls are accumulating at lower levels. However, the bulls may not get an easy ride higher as the bears will try to stall the current rally at $0.50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/cb5c15a2-2b96-4d89-a734-30ee40fd256f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $0.50, the XRP/USD pair could again drop to $0.3855 and consolidate between these two levels for a few days.\par \par \uc2 However, the 20-day EMA ($0.35) has started to turn up and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating an advantage to the bulls. If the bulls can push and sustain the price above $0.50, the pair could rise to $0.60 and then to $0.75.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) surged and closed above the $19.40 resistance on Feb. 3, indicating the resumption of the uptrend. The bears attempted to drag the price back below $19.40 on Feb. 4 but the bulls defended the level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/127a8648-13d5-411f-974a-726dd01b9339.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls have flipped $19.40 into support and this level could now act as a launchpad for the next leg of the uptrend. If the DOT/USD pair can ascend $21,7321, the next level to watch out for is $24.08 and then $30.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated if the bears sink and sustain the price below $18.50. Such a move will suggest the current breakout was a bull trap and the pair could then remain range-bound between $14.7259 and $19.40.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has soared above the ascending channel today, which suggests a pick-up in momentum. If the bulls can sustain the price above the channel, the altcoin could extend the rally to $0.60.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/a43c471a-39ab-4c38-a5e5-068db5669aaa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to give up without a fight. They will try to stall the rally at the current levels and sink the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair back into the channel. If they succeed, it may trap the aggressive bulls and the price could dip to the 20-day EMA ($0.37).\par \par \uc2 If the pair rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest the bulls continue to buy at lower levels. On the contrary, if the bears can sink the price below the support line of the channel, it will indicate a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) rose to a new all-time high on Feb. 4 but the bulls could not hold on to the breakout. The bears tried to trap the aggressive bulls by sinking the price below the downtrend line but the buyers were unwilling to relent.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/c8aeab7b-d8dd-4540-abcc-6245951288d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the Feb. 4 candlestick showed the bulls continue to accumulate at lower levels. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI above 63 suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside. If the LINK/USD pair closes above $25.8532, a move to $30 is likely.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the pair again closes below $25.8532, it will suggest that traders are booking profits at higher levels. A break below the 20-day EMA ($22) will be the first sign of weakness that could pull the price down to $20.1111.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The correction on Feb. 4 shows the bears tried to sink \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) back below the moving averages but failed. The bulls purchased the dip to the 20-day EMA ($140), which suggests a positive sentiment.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/38cf56ec-232f-438b-88ec-d214ee4d5433.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the buyers can now drive the price above the $159 to $166 overhead resistance zone, the LTC/USD pair could retest $185.5821. The bears may defend this level but if the bulls do not allow the price to dip back below $166, it will enhance the prospects of a rally to $200.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the pair turns down from the overhead resistance and drops below the moving averages. Such a move could drag the price down to $120.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) resumed its up-move after breaking above $53 on Feb. 4. The bulls continued their buying today and pushed the price above the resistance line of the broadening wedge pattern, but the wick on the candlestick suggests the bears are selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/c1aba13f-2fb0-492d-84ac-3107e9696314.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the BNB/USD pair turns down from the current levels but the bulls do not give up much ground, it will indicate strength. The bulls will then again try to resume the uptrend. A breakout and close above $60 will open the doors for a possible rally to $80.\par \par \uc2 Although the indicators are positive, the RSI above 80 suggests the rally is overheated in the short-term. If the pair turns down from the current level and slips below $52, it could result in a drop to the 20-day EMA ($46).\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) is struggling to rise above the $450 to $465.02 overhead resistance zone, which suggests the bears are defending this region aggressively. However, the selling dries up at lower levels because the bears have not succeeded in sinking the price below the 50-day SMA ($414) support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/32e1c91d-8b2a-43c0-b036-cf71ac4dd849.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA ($430.99) and the RSI near the midpoint does not give a clear advantage to either the bulls or the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price rises from the current levels, the bulls will again try to propel the BCH/USD pair above $465.02. If they succeed, a rally to $515.35 and then to $539 is possible.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the price below the 50-day SMA, the pair could drop to the next support at $370 and then to $353.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between $0.325 and $0.35 for the past four days. A tight consolidation near an overhead resistance signals strength and usually results in an upside breakout.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/2f578891-300b-4109-88ce-e7f4291d6f6b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push and sustain the price above $0.35, the XLM/USD pair could rally to $0.409. The bears may again offer a stiff resistance at this level, but if the bulls can bulldoze their way higher, the pair may rally to $0.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bears sink the price below $0.325, a drop to the 20-day EMA ($0.30) is likely. A strong bounce will suggest a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment, but a break below it could drag the pair down to $0.26.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDIvZWRkOTdlZGEtYjIxMi00NTM5LWE5YjAtMDJkMjVjZmJkNDA0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210205eh25000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 Altcoins soar to multi-year highs while Bitcoin price gathers steam\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Jordan Finneseth \par \uc2 524 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 February 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Etheruem\u8217\'20\'19s rally to a new all-time high is being followed by equally impressive performances from the majority of altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) led the market higher as it trekked toward another {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ether-price-breakout-to-1-750-sees-ethereum-network-fees-hit-all-time-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new all-time high}}}\uc2  at $1,763. ETH CME futures are scheduled to launch on Feb. 9, leading many analysts to predict that the top-ranked altcoin will hit $2,000 before meeting any significant resistance.\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  shows Ether currently trades at $1,714, an increase of 3.27% on the 24-hour chart while Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is up 0.21% and trading at $37,633.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/a7e6fa5f-6140-4d35-8633-14770ad303c5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Gas fees on the Ethereum network also set a new all-time high this week with the average transaction cost reaching $17.5 on Feb. 3, which prompted some exchanges to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/exchange-temporarily-halts-ether-withdrawals-as-gas-fees-hit-new-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 halt ETH and ERC-20 withdrawals}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/456a2693-b7f3-4a46-811a-ea412cd94d73.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Ethereum average gas price. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://etherscan.io/chart/gasprice"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Etherscan}}}\par \par \uc2 On Feb.4 Yearn Finance (YFI) underwent an exploit which saw a hacker drain $11 million worth of DAI stablecoin from the version 1 DAI yield vault. The team has responded quickly by taking {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/after-yearn-exploit-attacker-funds-frozen-and-reimbursement-plans-developing"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 several steps}}}\uc2  to help mitigate the damage of the attack.\par \par \uc2 These included Tether freezing $1.7 million in stolen funds which will be returned to the project and a proposal from the MakerDAO community to create a purpose-built collateralized debt position (CDP) to make affected users whole.\par \par \uc2 Positive news came from Protego, a Washington-based institutional crypto custodian, who announced that it has become the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-custodian-protego-gets-national-charter-from-the-occ"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second crypto-native firm to receive national licensing}}}\uc2  from the \uc2 U.S. Office of the Comptroller of the Currency\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Democrats vote to push the stimulus bill forward\par \par \uc2 Stocks rose on Friday as U.S. lawmakers passed a key hurdle in the rollout of the next stimulus package which could see individuals making less than $50,000 per year get a $1,400 stimulus check.\par \par \uc2 A majority of the major indices finished the day in the green, with the S&P 500, Dow and NASDAQ closing the day up 0.39%, 0.30% and 0.57% respectively. Silver also saw a gain of 2.82% and closed the day at $26.98.\par \par \uc2 Altcoins push higher\par \par \uc2 As Bitcoin trades in a range between $36,000 and $38,000, altcoins are gaining momentum and multiple coins saw their prices breakout on Friday.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/f6182f30-3dea-4951-9137-0636bd28bf6f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 MakerDAO ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/maker-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MKR}}}\uc2  ) gained another 45% to establish a new all-time high of $3,099 before correcting to $2,810, while the DeFi infrastructure protocol 0x (ZRX) has seen its \b \highlight22\uc2 price rise\b0 \highlight\uc2  61% to $1.63.\par \par \uc2 Notable performers from the larger cap altcoins were Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), which is up 26.44%, and Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) which reached a new all-time high at $64.87\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/d22e47f2-2e0a-4d37-b39d-d3a5eec912c9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The overall cryptocurrency market cap now stands at $1.17 trillion and Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s dominance rate is 60.1%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDIvYzQ4NzAwNTEtZWRkNi00NmUzLWI0NWQtM2ZkOGY2NTU4N2M2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210205eh25000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 Parents, it\u8217\'20\'19s time for \u8216\'20\'18the talk\u8217\'20\'19: Did your kid trade crypto in 2020?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Jason Morton \par \uc2 1,616 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 February 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Unsuspecting parents with crypto-savvy dependents may be in danger of filing false tax returns and making inadvertently inaccurate disclosures.\par \par \uc2 The taxation of cryptocurrency is no longer just a young person\u8217\'20\'19s problem. That changed the day the \uc2 United States Internal Revenue Service\uc2  made cryptocurrency a focal point of enforcement and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/irs-tax-form-question-leaves-us-crypto-users-confused-and-concerned"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added a crypto disclosure question}}}\uc2  on its Form 1040. Unsuspecting parents with dependent children should be on guard. The IRS is looking for noncompliance, and crypto questions create a possibly perjurious trap. Noncompliance may be sleeping in the basements of many unwary parents.\par \par \uc2 As of October 2019, nearly {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/number-of-americans-owning-crypto-doubled-in-2019-finder"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 40 million Americans own}}}\uc2  some form of cryptocurrency, and the average account value is over $5,000. And Google Analytics data {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin.dance/stats/age"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shows}}}\uc2  that over 40% of all crypto owners over the age of 18 are millennials, and nearly 17% are recently out of high school. It is the latter group that should concern parents. Those numbers equate to millions of crypto owners being college-aged or younger. This creates a potential \u8220\'20\'1Ccrypto trap\u8221\'20\'1D for parents who claim crypto-savvy young persons as dependents on their tax returns.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-could-save-millennials-from-the-economy-that-failed-them"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto could save millennials from the economy that failed them}}}\par \par \uc2 Most parents claim their children under 18 as dependents, and some claim their children in college. Parents should use extra caution this tax filing season, as they may be stepping into an inadvertent nondisclosure and nonreporting of crypto \u8220\'20\'1Ckiddie\u8221\'20\'1D income.\par \par \uc2 The IRS is watching\par \par \uc2 Over the last two years, the IRS has launched a campaign to snuff out crypto tax noncompliance. It is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.lexology.com/library/detail.aspx?g=16e313eb-4737-48fd-9fa4-8f40b7c31342"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 estimated}}}\uc2  that crypto users account for a $25-billion tax gap. And because cryptocurrency is taxed as \u8220\'20\'1Cproperty,\u8221\'20\'1D unearned income may arise when dependents are trading crypto or buying and selling goods with crypto.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/tax-justice-for-crypto-users-the-immediate-and-compelling-need-for-an-amnesty-program"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tax justice for crypto users: The immediate and compelling need for an amnesty program}}}\par \par \uc2 The unsuspecting parent could have dependent children swapping crypto, trading crypto, buying and selling with crypto, and earning crypto from staking activities. In those instances, the dependent has both reportable capital transactions and unearned income \u8212\'20\'14 income that would be taxed at their parents\u8217\'20\'19 marginal tax rate.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/better-regulation-needed-to-stop-crypto-tax-evaders-from-running-wild"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Better \b  \highlight22regulation\b0 \highlight22  needed to stop crypto tax evaders from running wild}}}\par \par \uc2 Unsuspecting parents, altogether unfamiliar with Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and other digital assets, may never think to ask their children about crypto activities. It is easy to imagine a young person \u8212\'20\'14 under the shelter of their parents \u8212\'20\'14 engaging in crypto activities without telling Mom and Dad the details. It takes nothing more than a cell phone to do so. And why would young people? They are the least experienced group and the least likely to understand the tax consequences of cryptocurrency for themselves, much less their parents. It is difficult to imagine a young person coming to their parents at tax time and saying, \u8220\'20\'1CHey, Mom and Dad, your CPA might want to know about my cryptocurrency at Kraken.\u8221\'20\'1D That is about as likely as Mom and Dad understanding decentralized finance, sidechains or crypto mining.\par \par \uc2 The \u8220\'20\'1Ckiddie\u8221\'20\'1D tax\par \par \uc2 But parents with dependents should quiz their children about crypto activities. Income is one big concern. The tax code imposes a \u8220\'20\'1Ckiddie tax\u8221\'20\'1D on the unearned income of children who are under 19 (under 24, if a student). The current threshold is only $2,200. When a qualified child has unearned income in excess of $2,200, the kiddie tax may be applied to the excess at the parents' marginal tax rate instead of the child's tax rate. The kiddie tax is reportable on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.irs.gov/forms-pubs/about-form-8615"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Form 8615}}}\uc2 , \u8220\'20\'1CTax for Certain Children Who Have Unearned Income.\u8221\'20\'1D If a parent fails to report a dependent\u8217\'20\'19s crypto capital gains in excess of $2,200, then the parent is omitting taxable income from their tax return.\par \par \uc2 And a dependent child earning income is not hard to imagine. At the time of writing, Bitcoin has gone up nearly 300% in the past 12 months, and the second-most traded cryptocurrency, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), is up 700% for the same time period. One may say that BTC and ETH are too rich for the young dependent, having spot prices of around $37,000 and $1,600, respectively, but consider others: Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s DOT, number three by market capitalization, is up over 300% since December, and its price is just $20. Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 , number six by market cap, rests at about $0.45, and it is also up 700% for the same time period. If Son or Daughter buys or sells goods with crypto, and the fair market value of those goods exceeds basis, then Mom and Dad may have a taxable transaction to be concerned with. By the end of it, parents may need to parentally control their child\u8217\'20\'19s balance sheet.\par \par \uc2 The IRS has done little to advise parents with dependent children of this compliance trap. Unknowing parents will likely stay the course at tax time, giving little thought to Bitcoin or altcoin headlines. Yet if their dependent child holds it, trades it, buys and sells with it, or earns it through staking or otherwise, parents could well be filing a false tax return. Upon audit, things could get even stickier. There is no indication that the IRS is going to be forgiving about crypto noncompliance. Again, there is a $25-billion tax gap to fill \u8212\'20\'14 large enough to be intolerant.\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency disclosure question\par \par \uc2 Perhaps a bigger underlying problem lies in the cryptocurrency disclosure question on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.irs.gov/pub/irs-pdf/f1040.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Form 1040}}}\uc2 . Here, too, unsuspecting parents may be in danger. The question asks:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAt any time during 2020, did you receive, sell, send, exchange, or otherwise acquire any financial interest in any virtual currency?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Ward Cleaver would certainly look to June Cleaver and say, \u8220\'20\'1COf course we didn\u8217\'20\'19t, honey,\u8221\'20\'1D without a thought to The Beaver.\par \par \uc2 There is no guidance on what a \u8220\'20\'1Cfinancial interest\u8221\'20\'1D means or how far it extends. If a parent is required to report the crypto income of their dependent, is that parent also required to answer \u8220\'20\'1Cyes\u8221\'20\'1D to the cryptocurrency disclosure question? That question remains unanswered. But looking at it through the lens of current crypto tax enforcement policy, the answer gets murkier. The IRS may answer this question consistent with its overall crypto tax policy goals. It seeks to know about crypto positions, and it may not be satisfied only knowing obscure \u8220\'20\'1Ckiddie\u8221\'20\'1D crypto income reported through an IRS Form 8615. The IRS may want to know more.\par \par \uc2 If a parent takes \u8220\'20\'1Cownership\u8221\'20\'1D of a dependent child\u8217\'20\'19s unearned income (for tax purposes), perhaps that same parent takes similar \u8220\'20\'1Cownership\u8221\'20\'1D of the crypto positions of his or her child (for disclosure purposes). After all, it is not the parent\u8217\'20\'19s income they must report on IRS Form 8615, it is the child\u8217\'20\'19s. It may not matter that the parent does not own the crypto account outright so long as the account is owned by their dependent child and the parent has knowledge of it. Knowledge is also a tricky complication. Presently, most crypto exchanges do not issue informational tax forms to users; rather, parents must rely on their children for answers.\par \par \uc2 The kiddie tax and crypto\par \par \uc2 The policy reasons behind the kiddie tax may provide answers. The kiddie tax was implemented, in part, to close tax loopholes \u8212\'20\'14 that is, eliminate the retitling of investment property into the names of dependent children in an effort to avoid paying higher tax rates. Likewise, a similar policy argument could be made in relation to cryptocurrency disclosures. For example, if a parent were a large holder of cryptocurrency and an avid trader, they \u8212\'20\'14 without a disclosure obligation \u8212\'20\'14 could simply claim the accounts under the name of their child and avoid the crypto disclosure question entirely. That is, obscurely reporting the capital gains from crypto activities on Form 8615 but shielding the accounts from disclosure. It is unlikely the IRS would find such a tactic amenable.\par \par \uc2 Unfortunately, a rhetorical question does not answer whether a parent must disclose their dependent child\u8217\'20\'19s crypto accounts on Form 1040. Taxpayers are left guessing until more guidance is published or tax enforcement answers it. The idea that a parent would need to disclose the financial positions of a child is not a foreign one. Under the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.occ.treas.gov/topics/supervision-and-examination/bsa/index-bsa.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bank Secrecy Act}}}\uc2 , minor children have a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.irs.gov/irm/part4/irm_04-026-016"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 foreign bank account reporting}}}\uc2 , or FBAR, obligation if their foreign accounts meet certain thresholds. In that instance, if the child is unable to file the FBAR themself, the legal guardian or parent must file it for the child. If the Treasury Department expects disclosure assistance in one context, it is not difficult to see how they might expect it in another.\par \par \uc2 Income and voluntary disclosures are at the forefront of the IRS\u8217\'20\'19s crypto tax initiative, and both are potentially implicated by the kiddie tax and the 1040 crypto disclosure question. Parents need to remember that they sign tax returns under penalties of perjury. These days, Johnny is doing more than mowing lawns for extra \u8220\'20\'1Ccoin\u8221\'20\'1D in his pocket.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 Jason Morton practices law in North Carolina and Virginia and is a partner at Webb & Morton, PLLC. He is also a judge advocate in the Army National Guard. He focuses on tax defense and tax litigation (foreign and domestic), estate planning, business law, asset protection and the taxation of cryptocurrency. He studied blockchain at the \uc2 University of California, Berkeley\uc2  and studied law at the \uc2 University of Dayton\uc2  and \uc2 George Washington University\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDIvZWYyMDMzMDktZTA2OS00YTNmLTgzNmMtNDgwMDFlNWUwMThjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210204eh24000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/3: BTC, ETH, XRP, DOT,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LINK, LTC, BCH, BNB, XLM\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,883 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 February 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Ethereum's rally to a new all-time high boosted \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Bitcoin and several altcoins are now surging toward new highs.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) stellar run in the latter half of 2020 and \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s purchase of the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  appears to have attracted attention from several publicly listed companies in the United States. However, the lack of regulatory clarity could have deterred them from buying Bitcoin at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 To address this issue, business intelligence firm \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/1-400-sign-up-for-microstrategy-s-corporate-bitcoin-buying-bootcamp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hosting}}}\uc2  an online seminar on Feb. 3 and 4, where \u8220\'20\'1Cthe legal considerations firms face while integrating Bitcoin into their corporate strategy\u8221\'20\'1D will be discussed. Several major crypto firms will also make presentations to the audience.\par \par \uc2 About 1,400 firms have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-will-pitch-bitcoin-to-1-400-public-companies-how-will-btc-price-react"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 signed}}}\uc2  up for the webinar, which shows companies are deeply interested in Bitcoin. Even if a handful of these firms end up buying Bitcoin, it could start the next leg of the rally to a new all-time high.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/96183b4a-50c0-4929-a2e6-ad9dd3a546d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 U.S.-based institutional investors have shown increasing interest in Bitcoin in 2020, which has propelled \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  to the top 1,000 websites in the world and one of the top 400 in the U.S.\par \par \uc2 The popularity seems to have increased further in January of this year. Morgan Creek Digital co-founder Anthony Pompliano recently highlighted that the \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  app was downloaded 1.3 million times in January, which is greater than \u8220\'20\'1CE-trade, \uc2 TD Ameritrade\uc2 , \uc2 Charles Schwab\uc2 , Fidelity, and Sofi\u8221\'20\'1D combined.\par \par \uc2 With these positive fundamental tailwinds, let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies and determine what the technicals project.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke above the downtrend line on Feb. 2 and followed that up with another up-move today, which invalidates the short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment. The relative strength index (RSI) has jumped into the positive zone and the 20-day exponential moving average ($33,945) has started to turn up, indicating advantage to the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/5182e798-9948-494c-9c35-dbf3ed14f915.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USD pair could now rally to $38,000. If the bulls can drive the price above this resistance, the pair could retest the all-time high at $41,959.63. A breakout of this level could start the next leg of the up-move that may reach $50,000.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bears defend the $38,000 level aggressively, the price may turn down and drop to the 20-day EMA. If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will again try to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 But if the bears sink the price below the moving averages, the pair may consolidate between $28,850 and $38,000. A break below $28,850 could start a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) soared above the $1,400 to $1,473.096 overhead resistance on Feb. 2 and followed that up with another strong up-move today. This suggests that the bulls continue to buy at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/8a182b8a-daa5-454f-803d-73e778665733.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past three days has invalidated the negative divergence on the RSI. The ETH/USD pair could now rally to $1,675 and if that level is also crossed, the rally could extend to $2,000.\par \par \uc2 Any correction is likely to find strong support at the breakout level at $1,400 and below that at the 20-day EMA ($1,321). A bounce off either level will suggest that bulls remain in command.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the pair reverses direction and breaks below the uptrend line. Such a move will suggest aggressive profit-booking at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  formed a Doji candlestick on Feb. 2, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. Today, the bulls are attempting to resolve the uncertainty in their favor by pushing and sustaining the price above $0.41123.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/bcf87284-4554-47f1-b57f-9ef9ea477da8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the XRP/USD pair could rally to $0.50 and then to $0.60. The gradually upsloping 20-day EMA ($0.33) and the RSI in the positive zone suggest that the bulls are trying to make a comeback.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls fail to sustain the price above $0.41123, the bears will try to pull the pair back below $0.3855. A break below the moving averages will suggest weakness and the decline may then extend to $0.245.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($15.97) on Feb. 1 and has soared above the all-time high today. If the altcoin closes above $19.40, it will suggest the next leg of the uptrend has begun.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/31223637-1ae2-4903-b1da-ffae30bfe350.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The DOT/USD pair could then rally to $24.08 and then $30. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI near the overbought territory indicate the bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the pair reverses direction from the current levels, a few more days of range-bound action is possible. The bears will have to sink the price below the $14.7259 support to tilt the advantage in their favor.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) took support at the 20-day EMA ($0.35) and surged above the $0.38 resistance on Feb. 1. That was followed by another up-move on Feb. 2, which carried the altcoin near the resistance line of the ascending channel.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/813b8d34-36fe-493e-8b0c-116aa60315eb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the long wick on the Feb. 2 candlestick suggests traders are booking profits near the resistance line. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair has formed an inside day candlestick pattern today, which generally acts as a continuation pattern.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can thrust the price above $0.4546265, the pair could rally to the resistance line of the channel. A break above the channel can push the price to the psychological resistance at $0.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the pair turns down from the current levels and breaks below $0.38, it will suggest profit-booking at higher levels. A break below the channel will indicate a possible trend change.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($21.80) on Feb. 1 and broke above the downtrend line today. The bulls will now try to propel the price above the all-time high at $25.7824 and resume the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/0d3d299a-a628-4dc1-9340-1c5a8bc55570.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the LINK/USD pair could rally to $30. The rising moving averages and the RSI above 62 indicate advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from $25.7824, the LINK/USD pair could again drop to the 20-day EMA. A break below this support may result in a fall to $20.1111 and the pair could consolidate in this range for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The advantage will tilt in favor of the bears if the $20.1111 support cracks. Such a move could sink the price to the 50-day SMA ($17.11).\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) broke above the downtrend line and the moving averages on Feb. 2. This move invalidates the head and shoulders pattern, which suggests the selling pressure has reduced.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/3647064e-6efc-416f-b7e1-905ddb1285df.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The LTC/USD pair could now rally to $165.9709. If the price turns down from this resistance, it will point to a possible consolidation between $120 and $165.9709.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bulls can drive the price above $165.9709, the pair could retest $185.5821. A break above this resistance could resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the pair turns down from the current levels and breaks below the $120 support. Such a move will suggest that the bears are back in command.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls have pushed Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) above the downtrend line and the 20-day EMA ($431), which suggests the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment has weakened. The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the RSI is just above the midpoint, suggesting a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/643c7236-f1e7-4618-bbb8-2c035da9bb38.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls can now push the price to $465 and then to $515.35. If the price turns down from either level, it will suggest that bears are selling on rallies. The bears will then again try to sink the price below the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the BCH/USD pair could drop to the $370 to $353 support zone. A bounce off this zone will keep the pair range-bound for a few more days, but a break below it could pull the price down to $275.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) skyrocketed above the $50 psychological resistance on Feb. 1, indicating strong demand from the bulls. Another positive sign is that the altcoin has not given up much ground since then, which shows that traders are not booking profits in a hurry.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/896a0958-bfd5-43a3-bb21-491444dcc477.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 In a strong uptrend, corrections are usually shallow and last for one to three days. If the bulls can push the price above $53, the next leg of the up-move may begin. The next target objective on the upside is $60.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bears sink the price below $49, the BNB/USD pair could drop to $47. If the bulls can flip this previous resistance to support, the pair will again try to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break below $47 and the trend could turn in favor of the bears if the 50-day SMA ($39.75) cracks.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 The bears have been defending the $0.325 to $0.35 overhead resistance zone for the past few days, but they have not been able to sink and sustain Stellar ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) below the 20-day EMA ($0.29). This suggests the bulls are buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/c8ff1c63-29ba-4b5a-98a9-841320877ddb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 When the price repeatedly pierces a resistance level, it tends to weaken. Therefore, the possibility of an upward breakout in the XLM/USD pair is high. If the bulls can sustain the price above $0.35, the pair could rally to $0.409.\par \par \uc2 A breakout above this level will start the next leg of the uptrend that could reach $0.50. The rising moving averages and the RSI above 64 suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the pair breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest a change in sentiment. That could result in a drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.235).\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDIvODU5MDc1ZTgtMWYwZS00N2RiLTg2ZTEtOTdlZTgzNWU1NTI3LmpwZWc=.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210203eh23000e3\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/1: BTC, ETH, XRP, DOT,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LINK, LTC, BCH, BNB, XLM\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,915 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 February 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price is trading in a tight range, which is allowing multiple altcoins to push higher.\par \par \uc2 Tesla CEO Elon Musk recently voiced his support for Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) during a chat with Clubhouse. Musk said that his friends tried to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/elon-musk-bitcoin-and-the-reddit-raiders-6-things-to-watch-for-btc-price-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 onboard}}}\uc2  him to the Bitcoin bandwagon as early as 2013, but the world\u8217\'20\'19s richest man did not take the final step. Musk admitted that he was \u8220\'20\'1Clate to the party.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Musk also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/elon-musk-bitcoin-is-on-the-verge-of-seeing-broader-acceptance-by-finance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  that Bitcoin could be \u8220\'20\'1Con the verge of getting broad acceptance by conventional finance." While these comments by the \uc2 SpaceX\uc2  founder are positive, they did not move the markets since he did not commit to buying Bitcoin as a personal investment or for the treasury reserves for his companies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/d49ae97a-08d8-4719-9cbc-230493eaad46.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, institutional investors have continued their purchases without waiting for a deeper correction. CoinCorner CEO Danny Scott noted that recently a single entity had withdrawn $500 million worth of Bitcoin, an indication of institutional buying.\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin buyers seem to be planning to hold their positions, the same cannot be said about the pump and dump schemes that are being promoted in select altcoins. First, it was \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) and today it is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/reddit-rage-as-xrp-price-crashes-50-hours-after-hitting-two-week-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 50%}}}\uc2  fall from $0.75 that may have left several novice traders with huge losses.\par \par \uc2 These violent corrections should be a lesson to traders and remind them to follow a well thought out trading strategy instead of getting carried away by emotions and greed.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine the trend and the path of least resistance.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been hugging the downtrend line for the past three days, but the bulls have not been able to push and sustain the price above it. This shows that the bears are aggressively defending the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/06eb0c4e-822f-4434-810a-fbe3d792f2f7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average ($33,412) has flattened out and the relative strength index (RSI) is near the midpoint, suggesting a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the price below the $31,900 support, the BTC/USD pair could drop to the 50-day simple moving average ($30,920) and then to the critical support at $28,850. A break below this level will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern that could start a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls can push and sustain the price above $35,000 the pair may rally to $38,520 and then to $40,000. The next leg of the up-move could start after the bulls drive the price above the all-time high at $41,959.63.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 The bears are defending the $1,400 overhead resistance while the bulls are buying the dips to the 20-day EMA ($1,258). This suggests that Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is stuck in a tightening trading range, which is likely to expand within the next few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/900431c3-b66b-4a5a-96b2-b5cc22321383.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the resolution happens to the downside and the bears sink the price below the uptrend line, the selling could intensify. This may result in a possible drop to the 50-day SMA ($1,005) and then to the critical support at $840.93.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the ETH/USD pair turns up from the current level and breaks above the $1,400 to $1,473.096 resistance zone, it will indicate the resumption of the uptrend. The pair could then rally to $1,675.\par \par \uc2 While the upsloping moving averages suggest an advantage to the bulls, the negative divergence on the RSI favors the bears. As the indicators are sending mixed signals, it is better to wait for the price to complete a breakout before taking a directional bet.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  skyrocketed to an intraday high at $0.755 today, but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that traders used the higher levels to aggressively close their long positions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/547b7597-fc91-4bfe-8aaf-7d79265e8b32.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USD pair has plunged to the $0.3885 support. If the bears sink the price below this level, the selling could intensify and the pair could drop to the moving averages and then to $0.245, giving back all of the recent gains.\par \par \uc2 A break below $0.245 could result in a fall to $0.17351. On the other hand, if the bulls can defend the $0.3885 support, the pair may again attempt to rally to $0.60.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) rebound on Jan. 28 fizzled out at $17.7522 on Jan. 29. The failure of the bulls to push the price to the top of the $14.7259 to $19.40 range suggests demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/09ac7027-3ee2-4b87-ae4f-ca5df97d336b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($15.41) has started to flatten out and the RSI is gradually dropping towards the center, which points to a balance between supply and demand. If the price rebounds off the $14.7259 support, the consolidation may extend for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, a break below the $14.7259 support will be the first sign of weakness. That could pull the DOT/USD pair down to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $11.8383.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the bulls can push the price above the $19.40 range. Such a move will signal the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke above the downtrend line on Jan. 30, but the bulls could not push the price above the $0.38 resistance, which shows that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/b9a0db35-cbe1-469d-a22b-6b99227f1105.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the positive sign is that the bulls have not allowed the price to dip below the support line of the ascending channel. The buyers are currently attempting to defend the 20-day EMA ($0.33).\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off the current levels could reach the $0.38 overhead resistance. If the bulls can push the price above this level, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair could resume the uptrend, with the next target objective at $0.48.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears pull the price below the support line of the channel, the pair could drop to $0.28 and then to the 50-day SMA ($0.25).\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) has not been able to sustain above the $24 level for the past few days, which suggests traders are closing their long positions on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/8b5b4d1d-319a-4352-aad1-0254af7b18d3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The RSI has formed a descending triangle pattern, which will complete on a break and close below 53. Sometimes, the patterns on the indicators project the upcoming directional move in the price.\par \par \uc2 If the bears can sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($21.18), the selling could intensify and break the $20.1111 support. If that happens, the LINK/USD pair could drop to $17.7777 and then to the 50-day SMA ($16.63).\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the pair rebounds off the 20-day EMA or the $20.1111 support and sustains above the downtrend line. Such a move will enhance the prospects of the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has been facing stiff resistance at the downtrend line for the past few days. The long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests every relief rally is being sold into.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/f93ecf08-fe77-4f37-a574-6e2559a018f4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls fail to push the price above the downtrend line within the next few days, the possibility of a break below the $120 support increases. If that happens, the LTC/USD pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders pattern, which has a target objective of $55.\par \par \uc2 However, it may not be a straight fall because the bulls will try to stall the decline at $100 and then again at $70.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be negated if the bulls can push and sustain the price above the downtrend line. Such a move will suggest that the selling pressure may have ended. On the upside, a break above $150 will suggest the bulls are making a comeback.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 The relief rally in Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) is facing stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($429), which suggests the bears are attempting to defend this level. If the price turns down and breaks below the $370 to $353 support zone, the altcoin could drop to $275.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/f54050de-9f6c-4ea0-afd2-2f0bb191c789.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest the bears have a marginal edge.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls can push the price above the downtrend line, the BCH/USD pair may rally to $465 and then to $539. If the price turns down from this resistance, the pair could extend its consolidation for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) soared above the previous all-time high at $47.2187 and hit a new high at $50.60 today. Whenever the price of an asset class makes a new all-time high, it shows that the bulls are in command.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/0ab8077e-77c6-47b8-bcf5-4b82dc6fb4cf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the long wick on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests profit-booking near the psychological resistance at $50. If the price fails to rise and sustain above $50, the BNB/USD pair could consolidate in a tight range for a few days.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above $50 could start the next leg of the up-move that may reach $60. Conversely, if the bears sink the price below $46, the pair could drop to the support line of the ascending broadening wedge pattern. A break below this support could signal the start of a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls and the bears are locked in a battle for supremacy in the $0.325 to $0.35 zone for the past three days. Although the bulls pushed Stellar ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) above $0.35 on Jan. 28, 30, and today, they could not sustain the higher levels, which shows traders are booking profits on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-02/22c0f06c-a61e-4cb0-a942-f69a18446885.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls have not allowed the price to sink below the 20-day EMA ($0.28), indicating accumulation at lower levels. The bulls are currently trying to push and sustain the price above the overhead resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the XLM/USD pair could rise to $0.409. A breakout and close above this resistance may start the journey towards $0.50. The rising moving averages and the RSI above 61 suggest the bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA. Such a move could pull the price down to the 50-day SMA ($0.228).\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDIvZjAzNWFhNDMtYWNlZi00ZTA2LThjMmItOGEzM2Q4YjMyMmFhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210201eh21000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/29: BTC, ETH, DOT, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LINK, LTC, BCH, BNB, XLM\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,922 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 January 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s surprise rally to $38,500 lifted sentiment across the market but the temporary boost appears to be losing steam.\par \par \uc2 Sentiment plays a major role in the short-term price action of an asset. This truth was demonstrated today when Elon Musk, the world\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/elon-musk-adds-bitcoin-to-twitter-bio-with-43-7m-followers"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 richest}}}\uc2  man, simply wrote 'Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19 in his \uc2 Twitter\uc2  bio. Crypto traders and Musk followers immediately noticed and Bitcoin price conveniently shot up a few minutes after the tweet.\par \par \uc2 When BTC price makes a sharp directional move, traders buy into the breakout and short-sellers are squeezed out of their positions. That is what seems to have happened with Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) as the sentiment swiftly turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 It is not only Bitcoin that has seen a pick up in sentiment. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dogecoin-to-1-dollar-reddit-turns-to-doge-after-gamestop-surges-1-600-in-2-weeks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Rumors}}}\uc2  were afloat that Reddit users, who were recently responsible for \uc2 GameStop\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s massive {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/reddit-investing-group-triggers-crypto-style-860-rally-in-gamestop-stock"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 surge}}}\uc2  in price, were discussing whether or not \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) could be pushed to $1. This resulted in a huge {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dogecoin-trading-volume-hits-5b-surpassing-bitcoin-s-for-the-first-time-ever"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 spike}}}\uc2  in \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dogecoin-ranks-among-top-10-crypto-assets-for-first-time-since-2015"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 price}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/e5d02552-eec5-422b-8d1e-590ccf67f2bd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Trading with excessive greed and emotion can be risky. While professional traders may make money in such volatile environments, the novice retail trader usually gets stuck at higher levels and has to bear heavy losses. Therefore, traders should keep their greed in check and stick to their trading strategy.\par \par \uc2 In volatile environments, the price action and trends can change quickly. Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to spot the support and resistance levels that could be helpful in making trading decisions.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin held the 50-day simple moving average ($30,065) on Jan. 27 and dip buyers aggressively purchased on Jan. 28, which pushed the price to the 20-day exponential moving average ($33,555).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/0dab3cc5-1e70-48ee-9ac7-b89ae1b3278d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buying continued today and the bulls have propelled the price above the downtrend line. This move invalidates the short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view on the BTC/USD pair.\par \par \uc2 There is a minor resistance at $38,000, but if this level is crossed, the rally could extend to $40,000 and then to $41,959.63. The current all-time high may act as stiff resistance but if the momentum can push the price above it, the journey to $50,000 may begin.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from either overhead resistance, the bulls are likely to defend the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, it will suggest traders are buying on dips. The bulls will then again try to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 The trend will turn in favor of the bears if the pair turns down and plummets below the critical $28,850 support.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($1,234) on Jan. 28, which shows the bulls are aggressively buying on every minor dip and are not waiting for a deeper correction to enter long positions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/ee74da80-db2f-4f32-b193-77b75ac24a94.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls had driven the price above the $1,400 overhead resistance today but are currently struggling to hold the higher levels. If they can sustain the price above $1,400, a retest of the all-time high at $1,473.096 is possible.\par \par \uc2 A breakout to a new all-time high will open the gates for a further rally to $1,675 and then $2,000. The upsloping moving averages suggest advantage to the bulls, but the negative divergence on the relative strength index (RSI) points to a weakening momentum.\par \par \uc2 If the bears can sink and sustain the ETH/USD pair below the uptrend line, it will indicate weakness.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) strong rebound off the $14.7259 support on Jan. 28 shows the bulls are aggressively buying on dips to this level. The altcoin could now extend its stay inside the $14.7259 to $19.40 range for a few more days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/0b15b7b8-1cc7-453c-9f85-14fe0d9d58aa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A shallow correction after a strong rally and consolidation near the overhead resistance are signs of strength. This shows traders are not booking profits in a hurry as they anticipate the uptrend to resume.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above $19.40, the next leg of the uptrend could begin. The first target objective is $24 and then $27. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI above 60 suggest the bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the $14.7259 support. Such a move will suggest traders are aggressively booking profits and that could result in a drop to the 61.8% retracement at $11.8383.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls defended the $0.245 support on Jan. 27 and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  started a relief rally on Jan. 28. This shows traders are accumulating at lower levels. The flat 20-day EMA ($0.28) and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest the selling pressure has reduced.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/716287d9-301e-4ab0-a335-4caa3c5c7f94.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls had pushed the price above the downtrend line today, but they could not sustain the higher levels. This indicates, traders are offloading their positions at higher levels as they do not expect a sustained up-move.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, the bears will again try to break the $0.245 support. If they succeed, a drop to $0.17351 is possible. On the other hand, if the bulls can sustain the price above the downtrend line, the XRP/USD pair may rally to $0.3855.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) bounced off the support line of the ascending channel on Jan. 28, which shows the bulls are accumulating on dips. The buying has continued today and the altcoin has risen above the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/4e6521c1-b6ba-4c71-9a29-4c5fe7bf837f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair could now rally to $0.38 and then to $0.40. If the bulls can drive the price above this resistance, the pair may rally to the resistance line of the channel near $0.46. The momentum could pick up if the bulls propel the price above the channel.\par \par \uc2 The gradually upsloping 20-day EMA ($0.32) and the RSI in the positive zone suggest bulls have the upper hand. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  move will be negated if the price turns down and plummets below the support line of the channel. If that happens, the pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.24).\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls flipped the previous resistance at $20.1111 into support when Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off it on Jan. 27. The buyers will now try to resume the uptrend by pushing the price above the all-time high at $25.7824.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/fb0ae003-f855-4b70-80da-947db24d2362.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the LINK/USD pair could rally to $30. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory suggest the trend favors the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the pair turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below $20.1111, it will suggest the sentiment has turned negative and traders are selling on rallies. That could pull the price down to $17.7777 and then to the 50-day SMA ($16).\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) did not complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders pattern on Jan. 27 as the bears could not sustain the price below the critical $120 support. The altcoin rebounded sharply on Jan. 28, suggesting strong demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/582085ec-5d7b-4282-ab1f-91f5b1f796dd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The relief rally has reached the downtrend line, which may act as a resistance. If the price turns down from the downtrend line, the bears will again try to sink the price below the neckline of the H&S pattern at $120. If they succeed, a drop to $100 and then to $70 may be on the cards.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls can drive the price above the downtrend line, it may result in a rally to $165.9709. The bears may attempt to defend this level but if the LTC/USD pair can climb above it, a retest of $185.5821 is possible.\par \par \uc2 The price action at the downtrend line is likely to decide whether the next move will favor the bulls or the bears.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the $370 support on Jan. 28, which suggests the bulls are attempting to defend this level. The rebound is currently facing resistance at the 20-day EMA ($437).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/5fd1e193-62cc-4801-83e2-4df9f53171b4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 50-day SMA ($395), the bears will try to sink the price below the $370 to $353 support zone.\par \par \uc2 However, the 20-day EMA is flattening out and the RSI is just below the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the BCH/USD pair may rise to $465 and then to $515 and extend its consolidation by a few more days.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the support line of the ascending broadening wedge pattern on Jan. 28, which shows strong demand at lower levels. The bulls continued their purchase today and pushed the price above the $43.4241 resistance but are struggling to hold on to the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/459932d5-f8f4-4c45-9a17-62b8adb75e43.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The gradually upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside. If the bulls can sustain the price above $43.4341, the BNB/USD pair could retest the all-time high at $47.2187.\par \par \uc2 A breakout of this resistance will suggest the resumption of the uptrend with the next target objective at $50 and then $55. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the pair turns down from the current level and breaks below the support line.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) broke below the $0.26 support on Jan. 27, but the bears could not capitalize on this weakness. This attracted aggressive buying from the bulls on Jan. 28, resulting in a sharp bounce that pushed the price back above $0.26.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/dba51b7e-8170-49ec-b69f-5f7b796c537e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buying continued today and the bulls propelled the price above the $0.35 resistance but they have not been able to sustain the higher levels as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par \uc2 Aggressive buying at lower levels and selling at higher levels suggest the XLM/USD pair may remain range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 This view of a consolidation will invalidate if the bulls push and sustain the price above $0.35. Such a move will indicate the bulls have made a strong comeback. If they can push the price above $0.409, a rally to $0.50 is possible.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDEvNGIzNmYwNmUtOGM3Ny00YmE5LWJjYjEtMzM0M2VjZDVmMzQ1LmpwZWc=.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210129eh1t000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/27: BTC, ETH, DOT, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LINK, LTC, BCH, BNB, XLM\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,810 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 January 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin's dip below $30,000 triggered a sell-off in altcoins and dip-buying traders might not have enough momentum to cause a relief rally.\par \par \uc2 Public companies have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-held-by-public-companies-has-surged-400-in-12-months-to-3-6-billion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 purchased}}}\uc2  about 85,000 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) in the past year and institutional investors have pumped money into Grayscale Investments, which shows increasing institutional adoption is one of the main reasons for the recent Bitcoin rally.\par \par \uc2 However, at the moment it seems institutional investors are unlikely to chase prices higher. If the fresh inflow of money stalls or reduces drastically, it could result in a pullback in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price. If that happens, short-term traders and momentum players may book profits and trigger a deeper correction.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/e4dd798b-12ef-4c66-9bde-8634387f12f7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 A correction will be a healthy sign because it will shake out the speculators and only the long-term HODLers will be left in the market. As the price dips, additional institutional investors may start buying at lower levels. The transfer of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ownership from speculators to long-term investors will be positive in the long term.\par \par \uc2 If Bitcoin enters a deeper correction in the short term, several altcoins are likely to follow suit.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine the support levels where buyers may step in.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke above the 20-day exponential moving average ($33,254) on Jan. 25 but the traders used this rise to sell, which pushed the price down to the $30,450 support on Jan. 26. The bulls purchased this dip but could not push the price above the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/6a4dd42f-f654-4b50-af19-d470b3716990.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USD pair has resumed its correction today, which shows the bulls are not able to absorb the supply. The downsloping 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) in the negative zone suggest bears are in control.\par \par \uc2 If the bears can sink and sustain the price below the 50-day simple moving average ($29,407), the pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern. This could result in a drop to the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at 25,897.42 and then to the 61.8% retracement level at $22,106.73.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price rebounds off the current level and breaks above the downtrend line. If that happens, the pair may rally to $40,000 and then to $41,959.63.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) inability to sustain above $1,400 on Jan. 25 shows the bears were booking profits at higher levels. The bulls again attempted to regroup on Jan. 26 but the altcoin has turned down today, which suggests traders may be closing their long positions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/3401fc17-30a1-4e3b-b43e-f26dd9c1dadd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The negative divergence on the RSI shows the momentum has weakened. If the bears can pull the price below the 20-day EMA ($1,211), a retest of the uptrend line is likely. This is an important support to watch out for because a break below it will signal a possible trend change. The next support on the downside is the 50-day SMA ($928).\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bulls can sustain the current rebound, it will suggest that the bulls are buying on dips. If the bulls can push the ETH/USD pair above the $1,400 to $1,473.096 resistance zone, the uptrend could resume with the next target objective at $1,675.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance on Jan. 25 and dropped to the $14.7259 support today. The bulls are likely to defend this support aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/9ae41339-e5c6-409b-8912-b8f893a020cd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off $14.7259 will suggest traders are accumulating on dips. That could keep the DOT/USD pair range-bound between $14.7259 and $19.40 for a few more days. The gradually rising 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory suggest the bulls have a minor advantage.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bears sink the price below $14.7259, the decline may extend to the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at $13.2821 and then to the 61.8% retracement at $11.8383. A deeper correction will suggest the uptrend has lost momentum and that may result in a few days of consolidation before the next trending move starts.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 After defending the 20-day EMA ($0.28) for the past few days, the bears are currently attempting to sink {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  below the $0.245 support. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory suggest the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/7a59889a-f1f8-4f89-9772-e037bea09424.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A break below $0.245 will increase the possibility for a fall to the next critical support at $0.17351. If this support also cracks, the XRP/USD pair could resume the downtrend with the next possible stop at $0.10.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the pair rebounds off the current level, the bulls will again try to push the price above the downtrend line. If they manage to do that, the pair could remain range-bound between $0.245 and $0.3855 for a few more days.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) strong recovery on Jan. 22 fizzled out at $0.3685714 on Jan. 24, suggesting traders used the rally above $0.34 to close their long positions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/8d6d26e4-1ef6-4d0c-b114-014171ba790c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently defending the support line of the ascending channel. A strong bounce off this level will suggest the bulls are buying on dips. The bulls will then try to push the price above the downtrend line, which will be the first indication that the correction may be over.\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above the downtrend line, a retest of $0.3971995 could be on the cards. Conversely, if the bears sink the price below the support line, it will suggest a possible trend change that could result in a drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.23).\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) is currently witnessing a correction in an uptrend. The first critical support to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($20.15), which is near the breakout level at $20.1111.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/c2f13721-9a03-4e4f-956d-fc15e0d055e5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off this support will indicate the bulls are aggressively accumulating at lower levels. They will then try to resume the uptrend by pushing the price above the recent all-time high at $25.7824.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the LINK/USD pair could drop to $17.7777. A break below this support will suggest a change in trend and may pull the price down to the 50-day SMA ($15.58).\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($139) on Jan. 25, which suggests the bears are selling on relief rallies. The bulls purchased the dip to the 50-day SMA ($128) on Jan. 26 but could not push the price above the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/e98854e5-54ae-41aa-b3d0-d0b95b2f783c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Renewed selling has dragged the LTC/USD pair below the 50-day SMA today and the bears will now try to break the $120 support. If they manage to do that, the pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders pattern that may result in a fall to $100 and then to $70.\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative zone suggest the path of least resistance is to the downside. This negative view will be negated if the pair rebounds off the $120 support and rises above $148.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) failed to sustain above the 20-day EMA ($443) on Jan. 25 and that could have attracted selling from the bears who have dragged the price below the 50-day SMA ($389) today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/c9e28a38-ce8b-4ddb-b29e-fa6dcf48ce9b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative territory suggest the path of least resistance is to the downside. A break below the $370 support could pull the price down to $353 and if that level also cracks, the next stop may be $275.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the BCH/USD pair bounces off the current level or the $353 support and rises above $450.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) could not sustain above $43.0992 on Jan. 25, indicating a lack of buyers at higher levels. The altcoin formed a Doji candlestick pattern on Jan. 25 and 26, which showed indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/c1890315-5cd6-40c2-8faa-e9e3a0315de2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The sellers are attempting to gain the upper hand by sinking the price below the support line of the ascending broadening wedge pattern. If they succeed, the BNB/USD pair may drop to $35.69 and then to $30.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls can defend the support line, it will suggest demand at lower levels. The bulls will then again try to push the price above $43.0992. If they can manage to do that, the pair may rise to $47.2187.\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($40.99) and the RSI close to the midpoint does not give a clear advantage to either the bulls or the bears.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to push Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) above $0.282 may have attracted profit-booking from short-term traders who had purchased the dip on Jan. 22. The altcoin turned down and broke below the 20-day EMA ($0.261) on Jan. 25.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/2a6fc59e-17c0-4f6a-b3b6-9b859e537a8e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 When the price fails to build up momentum above the 20-day EMA, it shows a change in sentiment. The current fall indicates the traders used the recent relief rally to lighten their positions.\par \par \uc2 The XLM/USD pair can now drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.214), which may attract some dip buying. But if the pair fails to rebound off this support with strength, the correction could deepen, and a fall to $0.19 and then to $0.15 may be on the cards.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDEvMDc1MGMyMzctNzkzOC00MGIzLTk0ODQtMjM5YWRjNWNhYTk0LmpwZWc=.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210127eh1r000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/25: BTC, ETH, DOT, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LINK, LTC, BCH, BNB, XLM\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,928 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 January 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Altcoins continue to trend higher, but Bitcoin price needs to turn $35,000 to support in order for the entire market to gain momentum.\par \par \uc2 After the recent correction, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) will need aggressive inflows to absorb the possible selling from the short-term traders and momentum players as the price nears $40,000. In the past few months, Grayscale Investments has been one of the major entities responsible for the pickup in demand.\par \par \uc2 However, \uc2 JPMorgan Chase\uc2  analysts {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spectacular-bust-for-stocks-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/spectacular-bust-for-stocks-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spectacular-bust-for-stocks-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pointed out in a recent note}}}\uc2  that Grayscale inflows \u8220\'20\'1Cappear to have peaked\u8221\'20\'1D on a four-week rolling average basis. Without a strong tailwind from the institutional investors, many analysts believe Bitcoin may not break above $40,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/b7bba6db-ee07-4992-a97f-cae969f08b80.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The failure to resume the uptrend does not mean Bitcoin will plunge and enter a bear market similar to the one seen in 2018. Lower levels continue to attract investments from institutions, and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/more-institutional-adoption-as-marathon-patent-group-purchases-150m-in-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the latest to disclose a position in Bitcoin}}}\uc2  is Nevada-based crypto mining firm \uc2 Marathon Patent Group\uc2 . The company has purchased $150 million worth of Bitcoin at an average price of $31,168.\par \par \uc2 Even if Bitcoin remains range-bound for the next few days, select altcoins could continue to move toward new highs.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to spot the ones that are in a bull trend.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) broke above the 20-day exponential moving average ($33,851) today, indicating accumulation at lower levels. The current up-move could rise to the downtrend line where the bulls are likely to face stiff resistance from the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/92618fc8-0341-4def-a04a-657c3dfd8257.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) just above the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If the price reverses direction from the downtrend line, the bears will again try to sink and sustain the BTC/USD pair below the $30,450 support. If they succeed, the pair will complete a descending triangle pattern, which has a target objective of $18,940.37.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls drive the price above the downtrend line, the aggressive bears who may have sold short in the past few days could cover their positions, resulting in a short squeeze. Above the downtrend line, the pair could rise to $40,000 and then to $41,959.63.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) surged above the $1,350 resistance on Jan. 24 and followed it up with another up-move today, hitting a new all-time high at $1,473.096. However, the long wick on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests profit-booking at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/ec7c71d9-c899-4c50-b003-9ec5fdc40028.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The RSI has also formed a negative divergence, which suggests the momentum may be weakening. If the bears sink the price below the $1,350 support, the ETH/USD pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($1,195).\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off the 20-day EMA will indicate that the bulls are accumulating on dips. The buyers will then try to resume the uptrend. If they can push the price above $1,500, the pair could rise to $1,675.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bears sink the price below the uptrend line, the pair may drop to the next support at $840, signaling a trend change.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot's DOT has formed a Doji candlestick pattern today with a long wick, which suggests the bears are attempting to stall the current up-move at $19.40. However, the rising moving averages and the RSI near the overbought territory suggests the bulls are in control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/5971330b-6009-48c0-a9c4-c5421360bcfe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls do not give up much ground from the current level, it will suggest the buyers are absorbing the supply, and that will increase the possibility of a breakout above $19.40. If that happens, the DOT/USD pair could resume the uptrend and rally to the next target objective at $24 and then to $30.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bears sink the price below $16.7951, the pair may drop to the 20-day EMA ($14.51). A strong rebound off this support will keep the uptrend intact, and the bulls will again attempt to resume the uptrend. On the other hand, if bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest a trend change.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 The daily trading range for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has shrunk over the past two days. The gradually downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory suggest a minor advantage to the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/aa93c4ff-c97b-447d-87b3-20d5caa1ede6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The Doji candlestick pattern on Jan. 24 and today signals indecision among the bulls and the bears. If the uncertainty resolves to the downside and the bears sink the price below $0.25, the XRP/USD pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern that could result in a drop to $0.169.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the pair rises from the current levels and breaks above the downtrend line, it could result in a rally to $0.385.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ada\b0 \highlight\uc2  continues to trade inside the ascending channel and the price has been sustaining above the $0.34 support for the past two days, which is a positive sign. This suggests the traders are not hurrying to book profits on relief rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/afce9632-8e77-4862-9b57-a0233d2521f6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to push the price to $0.3971995. A breakout and close above the $0.40 resistance could start the next leg of the up-move that could reach $0.50. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair could further pick up momentum if the bulls can thrust the price above the channel.\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is above 60, which suggests the bulls have the upper hand. Contrary to this assumption, if the pair turns down from the current levels and breaks below $0.34, it will suggest traders are booking profits on rallies. A break below the support line of the channel may signal a trend change.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink's LINK soared to a new all-time high on Jan. 23, but the bulls have not been able to build upon the momentum since then. The altcoin formed a hanging-man candlestick pattern on Jan. 24, which suggested the bulls may be tiring out.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/03d650c5-621d-4fff-b85e-9f05b50845f7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The negative divergence on the RSI also indicates that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening.\par \par \uc2 The buyers attempted to resume the up-move today but the LINK/USD pair is facing profit-booking at higher levels. If the pair breaks below $23.1612, a drop to the critical support at $20.1111 is possible.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the pair turns up from the current level and rises above $26, it will suggest the bulls are back in command. The next target on the upside is $30.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 50-day simple moving average ($126) on Jan. 22 and broke above the 20-day EMA ($143) today, but the long wick on the candlestick suggests the bears are aggressively defending the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/2657947a-1573-49f7-a7e6-67d4713160a3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the downtrend line, the bears will again try to break the $120 support. If they succeed, the LTC/USD pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern that may pull the price down to $100 and then to $70.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls can push the price above the downtrend line, the pair may rise to $165.9709 and then retest the $185.5821 resistance. A breakout of this level could resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 However, the flat 20-day EMA and the RSI just above the midpoint are not signaling a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. The indicators suggest the pair may consolidate for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) is currently attempting to rise and sustain above the 20-day EMA ($454). If successful, the altcoin could rise to $539. A breakout and close above this resistance could result in a retest of $631.71.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/b732b0e6-3a10-41b4-88b6-263fb2e6481f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls fail to sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the bears may again sink the price to the support of the range at $370. A breakdown and close below $353 could pull the price down to $275.\par \par \uc2 The indicators are currently not indicating an advantage to either the bulls or the bears. The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint suggest the BCH/USD pair may extend its stay inside the range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the support line of the ascending broadening wedge pattern on Jan. 22, and the bulls have pushed the price above the 20-day EMA ($41), which is a positive sign.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/845658a1-e057-4407-b706-a3925d03116c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push and sustain the price above $43.0992, the BNB/USD pair could retest the all-time high at $47.2187. A breakout of this resistance could resume the uptrend, with the next target objective at $50.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is sloping up gradually and the RSI is just above the midpoint, suggesting a marginal advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated if the pair turns down from the current levels and breaks below the support line. If that happens, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern will complete and could result in a fall to $35.69 and then $30.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar's Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) re-entered the $0.26 to $0.325 range on Jan. 22 and has been sustaining above the 20-day EMA ($0.265) since then. However, the bulls have failed to sustain the recovery and push the price toward the $0.325 resistance, which suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/7363197a-2871-42d6-8482-bc0d773b8f7c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the XLM/USD pair fails to rise and sustain above $0.282 in the next few days, the bears may again try to sink the price below the $0.26 support. If they succeed, the pair may drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.211).\par \par \uc2 Such a move will suggest the momentum has weakened. The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI just above the midpoint also indicate a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls push the price above $0.282, the pair may rise to $0.30 and then to $0.325. The bears may mount a stiff resistance at this level, and if the pair turns down from $0.325, it may continue the range-bound action for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDEvYWY5YjQzMzItMjkxMi00NTNlLWFiODItMTE0ZGM4MDg5NDVjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210125eh1p000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/22: BTC, ETH, DOT, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LTC, LINK, BCH, BNB, XLM\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,835 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 January 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price has rebounded above a key trendline but resistance at higher levels may limit the recovery in altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Aggressive profit-booking sent Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) spiraling below $29,000 on Jan. 21 but was this a sign that institutional investors dumped their positions? This is one of the main questions bothering traders because large institutional inflows primarily led the run-up to $42,000.\par \par \uc2 Cointelegraph contributor Marcel Pechman {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/pro-traders-buy-the-dip-as-bears-push-bitcoin-price-to-the-edge-of-30k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 analyzed derivatives data from various exchanges,}}}\uc2  which showed professional traders might have purchased at lower levels. The fall seems to have particularly hurt the excessively leveraged traders, resulting in $460 million worth of liquidations at derivatives exchanges.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/42503b56-73ae-4167-b0e9-547a53941a88.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Data from CryptoQuant shows that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s biggest mining pool, F2Pool, witnessed daily {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-s-biggest-mining-pool-may-be-behind-the-btc-price-drop-but-buyers-stepped-in"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 outflows}}}\uc2  of 10,000 Bitcoin for three days in a row, starting Jan. 17.\par \par \uc2 Although the outflows do not mean the miner has dumped the entire quantity, it shows a possible intent to reduce a portion of the inventory. This could have attracted selling from traders, fearing a sharp fall if the miners flooded the open market with BTC.\par \par \uc2 Currently, Bitcoin is rallying back toward $34,000 but is the current rebound a dead cat bounce or a resumption of the uptrend?\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin held the 20-day exponential moving average ($34,146) on Jan. 20, but the bulls could not push the price back into the symmetrical triangle, which shows a lack of demand at higher levels. The bears renewed their selling on Jan. 21 and broke the 20-day EMA support decisively. This is the first indication that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/09ba2b85-1d23-4161-b58a-691e029de333.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USD pair has bounced off the 50-day simple moving average ($28,103) today, but the rise could face resistance at the 20-day EMA. If the pair turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest the sentiment has changed from buy on dips to sell on rallies.\par \par \uc2 If the next dip breaks below the 50-day SMA, the correction could deepen to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $22,106.73. Such a move may delay the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls can propel the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rise to the downtrend line. A breakout of this resistance could result in a retest of the all-time high at $41,959.63.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) plummeted below the $1,300 support and the 20-day EMA ($1,142) on Jan. 21, but the bulls defended the uptrend line today. The buyers are currently attempting to drive the price above the $1,300 resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/d2b490bb-2684-4cf8-a030-482e03349827.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the ETH/USD pair could retest the all-time high at $1,438. A breakout and close above this resistance will suggest the uptrend has resumed. The next target objective on the upside is $1,675.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the pair could consolidate in a range for a few days before starting the next trending move. The bears will be back in the game if the pair turns down and breaks below the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) is currently consolidating in an uptrend. The bulls have not allowed the price to dip below the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $14.7259, suggesting that the traders are not rushing to the exit as they expect the uptrend to resume.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/2c6707fc-0cfe-43c9-b64a-1cd1dd9a3457.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) near the overbought zone suggest the bulls are in command. If the buyers can thrust the price above the $18 to $19.40 overhead resistance zone, the uptrend could resume. The next level to watch on the upside is $24 and then $30.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the DOT/USD pair may remain range-bound for a few more days. The pair could turn negative if the bears sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA ($13.25).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  slipped below the $0.25 support today, but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. The bulls purchased the dip and are currently attempting to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.29).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/c16c396d-ef18-45e6-a8d4-66157360849c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the XRP/USD pair may rise to the downtrend line, which has acted as a stiff resistance on two previous occasions. If the price once again turns down from this resistance, the bears will try to sink the pair below $0.25 and complete the descending triangle pattern. If that happens, the pair could drop to $0.169.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bulls can push the price above the downtrend line, the pair may rise to $0.385. A breakout of this resistance could start a new uptrend, but if the price turns down from this level, the pair may continue to consolidate between $0.25 and $0.385 for a few more days.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke below the $0.34 support on Jan. 21 and the 20-day EMA ($0.30) today, but the bulls purchased at the support line of the ascending channel, which shows demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/da891974-38b7-41e5-b7e7-5cc13bfdf033.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers are currently attempting to sustain the price above the $0.34 overhead resistance. If they succeed, a retest of $0.3971995 is likely. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive zone suggest bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above $0.40 could resume the uptrend with the next target objective at $0.50. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate the price turns down and breaks below the channel. The next support on the downside is the 50-day SMA at $0.22.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has formed a head and shoulders pattern that will complete on a breakdown and close below $120. The strong rebound off the 50-day SMA ($122.80) today suggests the bulls are defending the $120 support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/38d86052-21bb-4d26-8cac-0e4d31a5470a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The current bounce could face selling at the downtrend line. If the price turns down from this resistance, the bears will again try to break the neckline at $120 and complete the head and shoulder pattern. If they succeed, the LTC/USD pair could drop to $100 and then to $70.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the bulls push the price above the downtrend line. The momentum could pick up above $160 and result in a retest of $185.5821. A breakout of this resistance may resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) rebounded sharply from just below the 20-day EMA ($18.18) today, which shows the bulls are actively buying on dips. The upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory suggest bulls are in command.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/760f52d8-ee2e-4061-9453-e50e5692057b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can sustain the price above $22, the LINK/USD pair could retest the all-time high at $23.767. A breakout and close above this resistance may resume the uptrend, with the next target at $27 and then $30.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, a few days of consolidation is possible. The trend will turn in favor of the bears if they can sink the pair below $17.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) broke below the uptrend line on Jan. 21, and the altcoin dropped close to the 50-day SMA ($375) today. The 20-day EMA ($459) has flattened out, and the RSI near the midpoint suggests a few days of range-bound action.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/7f335b96-7d0f-4e8b-93e2-51b8b8f6339c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls push the price back above the 20-day EMA, the BCH/USD pair could rise to $539. The bears are likely to mount a strong defense at this level. If the price turns down from this resistance, the pair may remain stuck between $539 and $370 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the current bounce turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will again try to sink the price below the $370 support. If they succeed, the pair may correct to $275.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls defended the 20-day EMA ($40.82) on Jan. 20 but renewed selling on Jan. 21 sent Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) tumbling to the support line of the ascending broadening wedge pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/f4082b63-1a9a-4ade-87b4-eeed7f327881.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to sink the price below the pattern today but strong buying by the bulls has pushed the price to the 20-day EMA. If the bulls can propel the price above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate accumulation at lower levels. This could result in a rally to $44 and then to $47.2187.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current levels and breaks below the support line, it will suggest traders are selling at the 20-day EMA, which indicates a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment. If the 50-day SMA ($35.95) cracks, the BNB/USD pair could correct to $30 and then to $26.7273.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the $0.26 to $0.325 range on Jan. 21, indicating the balance had shifted in favor of the bears. The sellers tried to sink the price to the 50-day SMA ($0.205) today, but the buyers arrested the decline at $0.228112.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/295e37d6-68ea-452a-b6f4-5aa2bf34d120.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently attempting to push the price back inside the range. If they succeed in sustaining the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.264), it will suggest the break below the range was a bear trap.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can sustain their buying and push the price above $0.325, the XLM/USD pair could resume the uptrend and rally to $0.40\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the pair again turns down and breaks below $0.26, it will suggest the sentiment has turned negative, and traders are selling on minor rallies. This could pull the price down to the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDEvZDY2ZDEyODAtM2NiNi00ODdjLWE2YmItZmYzZmI1Y2NiNDFiLmpwZWc=.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210122eh1m000dy\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/20: BTC, ETH, DOT, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LTC, BCH, LINK, XLM, BNB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,993 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 January 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price continues to drop, pushing select altcoins closer to their critical support levels.\par \par \uc2 When an asset is in an overbought condition and traders are sitting on large profits, even minor negative news and events could trigger profit-booking. This seems to have happened following Janet Yellen\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-and-altcoins-correct-after-yellen-s-illicit-financing-critique"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 adverse}}}\uc2  comments on cryptocurrencies during a virtual hearing with the U.S. Senate Finance Committee.\par \par \uc2 In the same meeting, Yellen also told Congress to \u8220\'20\'1Cact big\u8221\'20\'1D in order to support the U.S. economy. Another round of stimulus would probably further weaken the U.S. dollar and drive investors into assets that are considered as a store of value. This means Yellen's comments may have inadvertently boosted the sentiment surrounding gold and Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/1bf8c813-aa05-4874-94f6-423e9061b82a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 As the fundamental factors supporting the current bull run are still intact, the institutional investors who had missed out on the rally at lower levels may use the current dip to build positions.\par \par \uc2 Glassnode data shows that large investors have been aggressively adding Bitcoin to their portfolios and the number of wallets {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whales-are-betting-40k-isn-t-the-top-as-data-hints-bull-run-is-only-beginning"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 holding}}}\uc2  over 1,000 Bitcoin has risen to a new all-time high. Since the start of 2021, 164 new wallets with over 1,000 Bitcoin have been created, indicating that whales are \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  despite the current BTC price correction.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to spot the critical support levels where buyers may start cherry-picking.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has broken below the symmetrical triangle pattern but the bulls are currently attempting to defend the 20-day exponential moving average ($34,626). In an uptrend, traders buy the dip to the 20-day EMA as it offers a low-risk entry opportunity and a bounce off it reiterates the strength in the trend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/f3ba0a37-485a-4cb4-8bcd-c4a5f63e8acb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the relative strength index (RSI) has gradually dropped from the deeply overbought territory to the midpoint, which suggests a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If the BTC/USD pair sustains below the 20-day EMA, it could drop to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $29,688.10. The bulls are likely to defend this support aggressively. If they succeed, this level may act as the support of the range while $40,000 could act as the resistance.\par \par \uc2 The positive view could be negated if the bears sink the price below the 50-day simple moving average ($27,596). Such a move could open the possibility of a fall to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $22,106.73.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rallied to a new all-time high on Jan. 19, indicating that the bulls are in command. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI near the overbought territory suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/25d767e0-74b0-46ac-878a-99660c035f32.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Usually, after every breakout from a resistance, the price returns to retest the level. The same has happened in the ETH/USD pair where the bulls are trying to flip $1,300 into support. If they succeed, this level will act as a new floor.\par \par \uc2 The long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests traders are buying on dips below $1,300. If they manage to close the price above $1,300, the pair may attempt to resume the uptrend. If the bulls push the price above $1,438.318, the pair could rally to $1,675.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the pair sinks and sustains below $1,300, the next drop is likely to be the 20-day EMA ($1,129). A bounce off this support will suggest the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but if the bears sink the pair below the 20-day EMA a short-term top may be in place.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 After the sharp rally of the past few days, Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has entered a minor correction. The altcoin had today dipped to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $14.7259, which is acting as a strong support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/ba95cdc0-57e2-484c-bd03-47912563a4dd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that traders are not waiting for a deeper correction to buy as they anticipate higher levels in the future. If the bulls can push the price above $19.40, the uptrend could resume with the next target objective at $24 and then $30.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bears sink the price below $14.7259, the selling may intensify and the pair could drop to the 50% retracement level at $13.2821 and then to the 20-day EMA ($12.32).\par \par \uc2 If the pair rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest the uptrend remains intact but if this support cracks, the decline could extend to $11.8383. The deeper the correction, the longer it is likely to take for the uptrend to resume.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  rose above the 20-day EMA ($0.297) on Jan. 19 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels, indicating traders are offloading their positions on every minor attempt to rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/915c1af9-6255-4012-a23d-b2f20e643082.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days has formed a descending triangle pattern. If the bears sink the price below the $0.25 support, the XRP/USD pair could drop to the critical support at $0.169. A break below this level could resume the downtrend with the next target objective at $0.10.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bulls defend the $0.25 support and push the price above the downtrend line, the pair may rise to $0.385 and stay range-bound between these two levels for a few more days. A new uptrend could begin on a breakout and close above $0.385.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has pulled back from the stiff overhead resistance at $0.40, which shows short-term traders may be booking profits. The shallow correction and the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick show the bulls are attempting to flip the previous resistance at $0.34 into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/b0637d51-a884-4a97-a659-169322edee69.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the bulls will make one more attempt to thrust the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair above the $0.40 resistance and resume the uptrend. If they manage to do that, the next stop could be the psychological resistance at $0.50.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages suggest the trend remains in favor of the bulls but the negative divergence on the RSI indicates the momentum may be weakening. If the price sustains below $0.34, a drop to the 20-day EMA ($0.30) is likely.\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off this support will indicate the uptrend remains intact but a break below it will suggest the possibility of a deeper correction to $0.26.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) above the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $157.6904 on Jan. 19 but could not sustain the higher levels due to the bear onslaught, as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/26d5d023-bdf2-4a19-9b6a-134d919a1bf8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears can sustain the price below the 20-day EMA ($145), the LTC/USD pair could drop to $130 and then to $120. This is an important support to watch out for because a break below it could signal the bears are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI close to the midpoint suggests a balance between supply and demand. This could keep the pair range-bound between $130 and $160. On the upside, a breakout and close above $160 may resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) broke above the $539 resistance on Jan. 19, but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests the bears had other plans as they sold aggressively, trapping the bulls who may have purchased the breakout.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/dea11a56-cb2f-45da-b4f9-a25e2cda417f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BCH/USD pair dipped to the uptrend line but the long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests the bulls aggressively defended this support. If the bulls can push the price above $539, a rally to $630 is possible.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the pair breaks below the uptrend line, it will suggest the bears have overpowered the bulls. This will signal a possible trend change and the pair could then drop to the next critical support at $370.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) is currently correcting the sharp up-move of the past few days. Aggressive profit-booking by traders had pulled the price below $20.1111, but the long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests strong buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/21d1bc63-bab9-4db9-8886-54561a43b4a7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive zone suggest bulls have the upper hand. If the LINK/USD pair rebounds off the current levels, the bulls will try to push the price above $23.767 and resume the uptrend. The next level to watch on the upside is $27 and then $30.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bears sustain the price below $20.1111, the pair may drop to $17.7777, which is just above the 20-day EMA ($17.58). If the pair rebounds off this level and rises above $20.1111, the bulls will try to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the selling breaks the 20-day EMA support. Such a move will indicate the bulls are not buying the dips anymore, signaling a change in sentiment.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade inside the $0.26 to $0.325 range. The bulls tried to push the price above the range on Jan. 19 but failed, which shows the bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/25048963-2c5c-4005-b671-fe518fcd9142.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The sellers will now try to sink the XLM/USD pair below the support of the range, but they are likely to encounter strong buying from the bulls. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive zone suggest the bulls are unlikely to give up easily.\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off the 20-day EMA ($0.263) could extend the consolidation by a few more days. Contrary to this assumption, if the bears sink the price below the $0.26 support, the selling could intensify and that may pull the pair down to the 50-day SMA ($0.201).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) tried to resume the uptrend on Jan. 18 and 19 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. Aggressive profit-booking on Jan. 19 started a correction that has reached the 20-day EMA ($40.99).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/235b661e-a88b-49a6-ba39-f30d4ac2392e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears can sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA, the BNB/USD pair may drop to the support line of the ascending broadening wedge pattern. The bulls will attempt to defend this support and if they succeed, the pair may extend its stay inside the pattern.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the price below the support line, it will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup, which has a target objective at $26.7273. But the pair is unlikely to plunge to the target level in a hurry because the bulls could offer strong support at $35.69.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDEvYjk0NDcyMzAtNzUyMS00ODU4LWEzNjUtMDA5OGEyMjExMjFjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210120eh1k000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 All-time high social activity accompanies 100% rally in Cardano price\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Jordan Finneseth \par \uc2 801 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 January 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cardano price has doubled since the start of 2021, and the move coincides with a new all-time high in Cardano-related \uc2 Twitter\uc2  mentions.\par \par \uc2 Social media mentions about Cardano have been growing since the beginning of the year, and during this time, the price of its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  token has more than doubled, in the process {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-s-market-cap-flips-bitcoin-cash-bch-after-ada-rallies-by-100"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 surpassing Bitcoin Cash}}}\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) to become the sixth-largest cryptocurrency by market capitalization.\par \par \uc2 A deeper dive into data from \uc2 Twitter\uc2  data failed to identify a specific driver of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  price action, but data from The Tie did show that Cardano mentions recently reached an all-time high, with the price tracking the increase.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/b8c898e3-a49c-4f7f-af19-a389f7a87229.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano 30-day average tweet volume vs. price. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://thetie.io/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TheTIE}}}\par \par \uc2 Keyword analysis of Cardano-related tweets also failed to identify the motivating factor behind the recent social media surge but terms like "pool," "stake" and "staking pools" were the most frequent trigger words in the majority of discussions led by community members.\par \par \uc2 In private comments with Cointelegraph, Joshua Frank, founder of The Tie, said that chatter regarding an \u8220\'20\'1Cinteroperability bridge between Cardano and IOTA\u8221\'20\'1D that began making the rounds on Jan. 2 seems to have corresponded with the upward price movement and a relatively large increase in tweets.\par \par \uc2 This is referring to a recent discussion on Iota's discord in which project co-founder Dominik Schiener was asked if the Iota Foundation was interested in developing a \u8220\'20\'1Cbridge to Cardano.\u8221\'20\'1D In response, Schiener stated, \u8220\'20\'1CYeh 100%. Once we\u8217\'20\'19re ready I\u8217\'20\'19ll reach out to Charles again.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 According to Frank:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C24 hours after the idea started being discussed Cardano saw a 63% increase in tweet volume and price surged 27% vs. USD and 25% vs. BTC, suggesting that this was an uncorrelated move.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/845320bd-b6de-43ad-b301-b2f81bfbafd0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price vs. tweet volume. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://thetie.io/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://thetie.io/}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://thetie.io/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The Tie}}}\par \par \uc2 Development enters the Gougen phase\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s roadmap indicates that the project recently transitioned from the Shelly era to the Goguen era.\par \par \uc2 The Shelly era brought decentralization to the core of the network and enabled \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  holders to stake and delegate their tokens to earn rewards.\par \par \uc2 Now that the project has entered the Goguen era, the focus of development is on the integration of smart contracts and the ability to build decentralized applications, or DApps, on the network.\par \par \uc2 The addition of smart contracts and DApps opens a whole new realm of functionalities for the Cardano network, including the ability to create decentralized finance applications.\par \par \uc2 In a recent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/africa-to-bring-100-million-users-to-defi-in-three-years-from-now-says-founder-of-cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 conversation with Cointelegraph}}}\uc2 , Cardano founder Charles Hoskinson opined on the future of DeFi and how the team plans to \u8220\'20\'1Ctake the lead in the DeFi space by developing partnerships in the African continent.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 According to Hoskinson, the real potential of DeFi will be realized in developing countries where he sees the potential to acquire 100 million new users within the next three years.\par \par \uc2 Hoskinson said Cardano was:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBuilt for the purpose of creating liquidity for the poorest people in the world and allow them to build wealth and protect the wealth that they've acquired.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Staking backs \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s rally\par \par \uc2 On Jan. 1, prior to any well-known mentions of a bridge between Cardano and Iota, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  was trading at $0.173, with a 24-hour trading volume of $1 billion.\par \par \uc2 Over the past two weeks the price and volume increased by more than 200%, with the current daily trading volume averaging $3 billion and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading near $0.358.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/d8071eb7-afcd-41c0-b97d-23c55e168832.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/IWVb7gIX/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 One possible source of the upward price pressure is a decrease in the circulating supply due to a large number of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  holders staking on the network.\par \par \uc2 Data from Staking Rewards indicates that 70% of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s total supply (21.84 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is being staked on the network. Investors who stake earn 4.28% APY for each epoch (5 days), and payouts are automatically distributed at the protocol level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/b905c8e4-994f-40b1-b25d-fd4f13ccedab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Total \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  staked. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.stakingrewards.com/earn/cardano/metrics"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Staking Rewards}}}\par \par \uc2 There are currently 1,468 active validators on the network serving 140,130 total delegators, with the largest validation pool holding 1.77% of the total \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  supply being delegated by 851 unique wallet addresses.\par \par \uc2 A continued uptrend in the staking participation rate over the past month, as seen in the chart above, has the potential to lead to further price appreciation as the number of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  available for trading slowly dwindles.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDEvMmQ0OGJiMTYtZjliMy00MjkyLTllNWEtYmViMjdjOWJmNTNkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210120eh1k000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 1/18: BTC, ETH, DOT, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LTC, BCH, LINK, XLM, BNB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,983 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 January 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Altcoins are beginning to lose \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum as Bitcoin price struggles to reclaim $40,000.\par \par \uc2 Investors are beginning to worry that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) uptrend could be in peril after the top-ranked cryptocurrency failed to pull above the $40,000. Some traders are afraid that a repeat of the crushing 2018 bear market is on the cards again if BTC fails to find \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum.\par \par \uc2 However, a study of both the bull markets shows distinct differences that are noteworthy. Research from Pantera Capital found that after the current bull move, 86% of the crypto market's value is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/hedge-fund-predicts-115k-bitcoin-price-and-the-fall-of-speculative-altcoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 concentrated}}}\uc2  in Bitcoin and Ethereum, largely because institutional funds have flowed into each cryptocurrency.\par \par \uc2 In 2017, the top two coins only held about 52% of the value, with the rest being held in several altcoins that turned out to be "non-functioning" coins. In the current bull market, retail investors seem to be largely absent so the type of speculation witnessed in 2017 has yet to appear in 2021.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/071e9c77-9b74-4bfe-9d14-03f4799f8903.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Guggenheim Partners\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 chief investment officer \uc2 Scott Minerd\uc2  recently said that his long-term Bitcoin price {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/guggenheim-cio-speculative-frenzy-to-die-down-but-400k-target-still-on"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 target}}}\uc2  of $400,000 remains and his recent tweet asking his followers to \u8220\'20\'1Ctake some money off the table\u8221\'20\'1D was based on the short-term price movement.\par \par \uc2 Although Minerd has not included Bitcoin in his mutual fund portfolios, he said purchases have been done in some private funds managed by Guggenheim.\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin consolidates after the recent bull phase, select altcoins are extending their up-move. Can this continue? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is attempting to rebound off the 20-day exponential moving average ($34,380) but the weak bounce suggests a lack of urgency among bulls to accumulate on dips. As the price is stuck inside a symmetrical triangle, technical traders may wait for the price to break out of the pattern before buying.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/0d066737-abd8-4f2c-abf5-8a8d0bf849f6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price does not rise to the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle, the bears may smell an opportunity and will try to sink the price below the triangle. If they succeed, the BTC/USD pair may drop to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $29,688.10.\par \par \uc2 This is an important level to watch out for because, if the bears sink the price below this support, the drop could extend to the 50-day simple moving average ($26,932). The deeper the fall, the longer it is likely to take for the uptrend to resume because every rise will be met with a wave of selling by traders who are stuck at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 Another sharp correction could be avoided if bulls thrust the price above the triangle. The all-time high at $41,959.63 may act as a stiff resistance but if the bulls can drive the price above it, the pair could reach $50,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) remains in a strong uptrend and is currently consolidating near the $1,300 to $1,349.10 overhead resistance. The upsloping moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) near the overbought zone suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/4c896021-681c-4d2e-9cc8-a189eafa3694.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USD pair formed a Doji candlestick pattern on Jan. 17 and again today, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears. If the uncertainty resolves to the upside and the bulls push the price above the overhead resistance, the uptrend could resume. The next target is $1,420 and then $1,675.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current levels and breaks below $1,152, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($1,079). A strong rebound off this support will suggest accumulation at lower levels and the bulls will again try to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the decline could deepen to $1,000 and then to $900.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) is in a strong uptrend and the momentum picked up after the altcoin broke above the $10.68 resistance on Jan. 13. The up-move reached $19.40 on Jan. 16, recording a 143% rally in four days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/617d27c7-0295-411c-9fba-33163ee74555.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Some short-term traders may have booked profits after the sharp rally, but the shallow correction suggests that the majority of the traders are not panicking. If the bears fail to pull the price below the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $14.7259, the uptrend could resume.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above $20, the DOT/USD pair could rally to $24 and then to $30. However, if the bears sink the price below $14.7259, the pair may consolidate the recent gains for a few days before starting the next trending move. The bears will signal a comeback if they can sustain the price below the 20-day EMA ($11.47).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 The bears have been defending the 20-day EMA ($0.297) for the past few days but they have not been able to capitalize on the weakness and sink {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  below $0.25, which suggests a lack of sellers at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/76ae38e3-8b75-433e-b5ce-1be858bd4787.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now attempt to push the price above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the XRP/USD pair may rally to $0.385. The bears are likely to defend this resistance aggressively.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this resistance, the pair could extend its stay inside the range for a few more days. On the other hand, if the bulls push the price above the range and the 50-day SMA ($0.406), a new uptrend could begin.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) soared above the downtrend line on Jan. 16, signaling the resumption of the uptrend. The bulls pushed the price near the overhead resistance at $0.40 on Jan. 17, which may act as a stiff barrier.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/10aaf81c-d0e8-4668-8206-fa0f58f10c42.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the overbought zone suggest that bulls are in command. If the bulls do not allow the price to dip and sustain below $0.34, the likelihood of a break above $0.40 increases. The next target on the upside is $0.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bears sink the price below $0.34, it will suggest aggressive profit-booking at higher levels. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair could then drop to the 20-day EMA ($0.288).\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off the 20-day EMA could keep the uptrend intact but a break below it may signal a short-term top.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls and the bears have been battling it out near the 20-day EMA ($144) for the past few days. The buyers are currently trying to push \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) above the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $157.6904.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/6351f5dc-08d9-40e4-8c25-698fd8ae75e1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the LTC/USD pair could rally to $170 and then to $185.5821. A breakout of this resistance could open the doors for a rally to $225.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to give up without a fight. They will pose a stiff challenge at $157.6904. If the price turns down from this resistance, the pair may remain range-bound between $130 and $160 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The trend will turn in favor of the bears if they can sink and sustain the price below the 50-day SMA ($118).\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 The bears are defending the $515.35 resistance but they have not been able to sink Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) below the uptrend line. This shows the bulls are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/b47f499c-58b2-4175-bb25-3f15c7c2bb6f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push and sustain the price above the $515.35 to $539 resistance zone, the BCH/USD pair could rally to $631.71. The bears may defend this level aggressively but if the bulls can propel the price above it, the uptrend could reach $833.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance and breaks below the uptrend line, it will suggest the sentiment has turned negative and traders are closing their positions on a rally. This could result in a fall to $370.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) is in a strong uptrend, making a new all-time high at $23.767 on Jan. 17. The upsloping 20-day EMA ($16.91) and the RSI near the overbought territory suggest bulls are in control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/bc887909-3a9c-490d-bb29-0c218d2facc4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, bears are not willing to give up easily. They had attempted to stall the rally on Jan. 16 as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick and they are again trying to pull the price down today. The bears will have to sink and sustain the price below $20.1111 to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 But if the LINK/USD pair rebounds off $20.1111, it will suggest the level has flipped to support and may act as a floor during future declines. If the bulls can push the price above $23.767, the uptrend could reach $27 and then $30.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside the $0.26 to $0.325 range for the past few days, but the upsloping 20-day EMA ($0.257) and the RSI in the positive territory suggest bulls have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/3607bfff-3de4-4b14-9859-1b49576c4e3c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the buyers can push the price above $0.325, the XLM/USD pair may rally to $0.409 and if this level is also scaled, the up-move may reach $0.50. The longer the time spent in the range, the stronger will be the breakout from it.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bears sink the price below the range and the 20-day EMA, it could attract profit-booking by traders and the pair could drop to the 50-day SMA. Such a move will indicate advantage to the bears.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rose to a new all-time high on Jan. 17 and followed it up with another new high today at $46.8888. However, the bulls are struggling to sustain the higher levels, which suggests some traders are booking profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/93940b03-b1a3-4216-ad3f-23753c63d576.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USD pair has formed an ascending broadening wedge pattern and the RSI is also showing signs of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence. Both these suggest the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening.\par \par \uc2 However, in a strong uptrend, \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  developments get negated as bulls resume their purchases after a break. Traders can watch the price action near the 20-day EMA ($40) because, if this support cracks, the bears will try to sink the price below the wedge.\par \par \uc2 But if the BNB/USD pair rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that traders continue to buy on dips. Such a move could resume the uptrend with the next target at $50.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDEvZjY4N2ZlZTEtZWUzNC00ZmU4LTk0YmEtOWFlMDFmNWQzNDlkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210118eh1i000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/15: BTC, ETH, XRP, DOT,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LTC, BCH, LINK, XLM, BNB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,820 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 January 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Altcoins have entered a slight correction after Bitcoin's relief rally lost steam and the price dropped below $35,000.\par \par \uc2 Grayscale products witnessed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-inflows-hit-3-3b-in-record-breaking-fourth-quarter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $3.3 billion}}}\uc2  in inflows in the fourth quarter of 2020, a large jump over the $1.05 billion seen in the preceding quarter. According to Grayscale, institutional investors accounted for 93% of the new investments.\par \par \uc2 The significance and magnitude of the investments can be gauged from the fact that in 20, Grayscale received $5.7 billion in investments, which is four times the cumulative inflow between 2013 and 2019\par \par \uc2 Data from Glassnode also shows that since July 2020, only about one-third of the 900 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) mined each day have made their way to exchanges. During that period, Grayscale alone {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/did-grayscale-push-bitcoin-back-up-to-the-40k-mark"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 purchased}}}\uc2  about 1,200 Bitcoin every day. This shows how demand exceeded supply by a huge margin, resulting in the sharp rally which was ignited in the latter half of 2020.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/b8dbba47-342f-48bc-a948-57bdfbba28da.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, after Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s recent rise, larger inflows are needed to sustain the momentum. If this does not happen, select investors may be tempted to lock in their gains and that could start a correction with speculators and short-term traders rushing to the exit.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine the path of least resistance.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s recovery hit a barrier at $40,0129 on Jan. 14 and the price has again turned down today. The bulls are currently attempting to defend the 20-day exponential moving average at $33,795.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/8cea69a9-f205-4676-90d3-589542ae1d7a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days has formed a symmetrical triangle, which generally acts as a continuation pattern. If the bulls can drive the price above the triangle, the uptrend could resume. The pattern target of the setup is $52,000.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bears sink the price below the triangle, the selling could intensify and the BTC/USD pair may drop to the 50-day simple moving average at $25,826. Even if the price falls to this level, the uptrend will not be broken.\par \par \uc2 Lower levels are likely to attract fresh buying from traders and that could result in a few days of consolidation where the bulls gradually accumulate before starting the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rebound off the 20-day EMA ($1,024) is facing resistance at $1,258.30. However, the long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that traders are buying on dips to the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/434b3a5b-f602-402d-afc7-ca7e2a42cfbb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory suggest that bulls are in command. If the buyers can propel the price above the $1,258.30 to $1,349.10 overhead resistance zone, the ETH/USD pair could rally to $1,462.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls fail to push the price above the overhead resistance zone, it may attract profit-booking from short-term traders and that could pull the price below the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the pair may drop to the critical support at $840.93.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls could not push {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  above the 20-day EMA ($0.30) in the past four days, suggesting bears are defending this resistance. If the sellers can sink the price below $0.25, the altcoin could drop to $0.169.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/f6117e5e-8d6c-4b5c-a3f0-3f0ce45ca754.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off $0.169 will suggest that the bulls are accumulating at lower levels. If the buyers can then push the price above the 20-day EMA, the XRP/USD pair may extend its stay inside the $0.169 to $0.385 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 This view of a range-bound action will invalidate if the bears break the $0.169 support. Below this level, the downtrend could resume with the next target objective at $0.10.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) surged to a new high on Jan. 13 and followed it up with another strong rally on Jan. 14. The altcoin is currently facing resistance near $15 but the shallow correction suggests traders are not booking profits in a hurry.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/8ee0e2f3-59fb-4f91-9761-e1152e789cf8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the DOT/USD pair does not break below the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $11.9819, the bulls will attempt to resume the uptrend. If they can scale the price above $15, the next stop could be $18 and then $20.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bears sink and sustain the price below $11.9819, the pair could drop to the 61.8% retracement level at $10.1422. A deep correction will suggest the momentum has weakened and that could keep the pair range-bound for a few days.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rose above the downtrend line today but the bulls could not sustain the breakout, which suggests profit-booking at higher levels. The bears will now try to sink the altcoin to the 20-day EMA ($0.259).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/8a00d697-de6b-4e55-9496-6c88ccdab7df.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory indicate bulls have the upper hand. If the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will attempt to push the price above the downtrend line and resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 A break above $0.3542857 could push the price to $0.40 where the rally may again hit a roadblock. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current levels and breaks below the 20-day EMA. Such a move could pull the price to the 50-day SMA ($0.192).\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) attempt to recover after the sharp fall from $185.5821 on Jan. 10 to a low at $112.5672 on Jan. 11 hit a barrier near the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $157.6904.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/52801e01-a1cb-4a60-bf2d-5a85ece9fb49.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 After a deep correction, the price usually consolidates in a range for a few days before starting the next trending move. The flat 20-day EMA ($143) and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If the LTC/USD pair sustains below the 20-day EMA, a drop to $120 is possible. A bounce off this support could keep the pair range-bound between $120 and $160.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the pair rebounds off the current levels, the bulls will try to push the price to $185.5821. A break above this resistance could resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) rose above the $515.35 overhead resistance on Jan. 14 but the bulls could not sustain the breakout, which shows that bears are active at higher levels. The sellers are currently attempting to sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($443) and the uptrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/0a3adca6-555b-4e0b-a1e9-6501f7b93eec.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the BCH/USD pair could drop to $370. This level is likely to act as a strong support and a rebound could keep the price between $370 and $515.35 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls can build up on the rebound off the 20-day EMA, a rise above $515.35 is likely. Such a move could increase the possibility of a rally to $600. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory suggest advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) rallied for the past two days and closed above $17.7777 on Jan. 14, indicating strong demand at lower levels. The bulls continued their purchase today and drove the price to a new high at $21.4533.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/a79fd770-6918-4163-9dc3-cd5d414df4e1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the long wick on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests profit booking at higher levels. If the bulls do not allow the price to dip back below $17.7777, it will suggest buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds sharply from $17.7777, the bulls will try to resume the uptrend with the next target objective at $27. The upsloping 20-day EMA ($15.07) and the RSI above 65 suggest bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily. They are currently attempting to sink the price back below $17.7777. If they succeed, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) broke above $0.2864 on Jan. 13 but the Doji candlestick pattern on Jan. 14 suggested indecision among the bulls and the bears. The uncertainty has resolved to the downside today and the bears are currently trying to sustain the price below $0.2864.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/66f4c08a-79df-4591-b839-9102ab1f2e4d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the XLM/USD pair may drop to the 20-day EMA ($0.24). A strong rebound off this level will suggest that traders continue to accumulate at lower levels. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive zone suggest bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above $0.32, the pair could rally to $0.35. The bears are likely to mount a stiff resistance at this level but if the bulls can push the price above it, the rally could extend to $0.409 and then to $0.50.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke above the 20-day EMA ($39) on Jan. 13, indicating that the selling pressure had reduced. However, the bears are unwilling to give up without a fight and they are selling above $42.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/44f59c9e-1376-481e-ba69-d93f7d1602cd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears can sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA, the BNB/USD pair may drop to the $35.69 support. A bounce off it could keep the pair range-bound between $35.69 and $43 for a few days as both the bulls and the bears try to establish their supremacy.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the pair rises from the current levels, the bulls will make one more attempt to push the price to $45.1620. If they succeed, the pair may reach $50.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDEvYTZlOGUyZTgtYTA1MS00MDI5LWI1MmItYTY5MWQyODE2NTcxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210115eh1f000dz\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/13: BTC, ETH, XRP, LTC,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BCH, DOT, XLM, LINK, BNB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,895 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 January 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Traders are shifting funds into select altcoins as Bitcoin price trades in a sideways range.\par \par \uc2 The top 100 richest Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) addresses have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/top-100-bitcoin-addresses-accumulated-11b-more-btc-in-the-past-30-days"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2  334,000 Bitcoin to their existing holdings over the past 30 days, a clear signal that whales and institutional-size investors bought the dip. A positive sign is that most of them have not reacted to the recent fall in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price. This suggests that large investors are \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Bitcoin for the long term rather than looking to make a quick gain.\par \par \uc2 An important element in the recent rally is many of the purchases have come from institutional investors who were critical of Bitcoin in the past. The list is likely to get bigger as Oaktree Capital\u8217\'20\'19s co-chairman and co-founder Howard Marks is revisiting his previous \u8220\'20\'1Cskeptical view\u8221\'20\'1D on Bitcoin. In his latest investor memo, Marks said that \u8220\'20\'1Cthankfully,\u8221\'20\'1D his son had purchased a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/thankfully-my-son-owns-bitcoin-says-140b-asset-management-ceo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 meaningful}}}\uc2  amount of Bitcoin for the family.\par \par \uc2 Several institutional investors have been critical of the central banks\u8217\'20\'19 expansionary monetary policies but until now, they primarily used gold to hedge their portfolios. The ones who shifted even a small portion of their gold portfolio into Bitcoin are reaping huge gains.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/db011152-4914-4372-bd2a-2ac1265d8519.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 One such firm, Ruffer Investment had redeployed 2.5% of its Multi-Strategies Fund from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-is-non-sensical-asset-that-still-makes-sense-says-uk-investment-manager"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 gold to Bitcoin}}}\uc2  in November, and since then, gold has returned a meager 4%, and Bitcoin, even after the recent fall is still up by about 92%.\par \par \uc2 These outsized gains, even on a small percentage of the portfolio, can easily outperform the peers. To keep up with the competition, institutional investors who may have missed buying earlier could quietly open Bitcoin positions on each new correction.\par \par \uc2 Many analysts have suggested that institutional investor inflow propelled the current Bitcoin rally and for this reason, traders will be looking out for signals that large investors are buying again.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the Jan. 11 candlestick shows the bulls aggressively purchased the dip below the 20-day exponential moving average ($32,705). However, the failure of the bulls to resume the uptrend on Jan. 12 shows the bears continue to sell on every minor rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/e91e6f47-7d91-4178-9c62-8930318a6c5a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears want to break and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA while the bulls are attempting to defend it. If the BTC/USD pair does not rebound sharply within the next few days, it may lead to capitulation from buyers and the short-term traders stuck at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 If the selling intensifies, the BTC/USD pair may break below the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $29,688.10 and fall to the 50-day simple moving average ($24,983). Such a move will suggest the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened and that may lead to a few days of range-bound action.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the pair rebounds off the current levels, the bulls will try to resume the uptrend. The momentum could pick up if the bulls drive the price above $41.959.63.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls aggressively purchased Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) during the dip below the 20-day EMA ($982) on Jan. 11 but they could not sustain the recovery on Jan. 12, suggesting that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/211d6a77-d84b-429e-b19a-e2c88801150e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the positive sign is that the bulls again bought the dip to the 20-day EMA today. The buyers will now try to push the price above $1,150 and if they succeed, the ETH/USD pair may rise to $1,300. A breakout of this resistance may resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the pair turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, the decline could extend to $840.93 and then to the 50-day SMA ($732). A break below this support will signal that the bears are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  is currently range-bound in a downtrend. The price is oscillating between $0.169 and $0.384998. The flat 20-day EMA ($0.30) and the relative strength index (RSI) just below the midpoint, suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/e6ec0560-5fef-43de-bfa4-1a8bddab1913.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above the 20-day EMA, the XRP/USD pair may rise to $0.384998. A breakout and close above this level will form an inverse head and shoulders pattern, indicating a possible reversal.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current levels or the overhead resistance, then the pair may remain range-bound for a few more days. A break below $0.169 could resume the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 50-day SMA ($110) on Jan. 11 but the bulls could not push the price back above the 20-day EMA ($142) on Jan. 12, indicating selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/ff027424-5737-4176-9c1f-3d3311088e6e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests buying at lower levels. The bulls will once again try to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the LTC/USD pair may move up to $160 and then to $180.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears successfully defend the 20-day EMA, the pair may trade between the moving averages for a few days. The flat moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint also suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) strong rebound off the 20-day EMA ($0.247) on Jan. 11 suggests the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  as traders are buying on dips. But the long wick on the Jan. 12 candlestick suggests the bears are unlikely to give up without a fight.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/236a9c42-d64d-43da-8300-7312074bcaee.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Today\u8217\'20\'19s inside day candlestick pattern suggests indecision about the next directional move. However, the upsloping moving averages and the RSI in positive territory suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above $0.3141252, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair may rally to $0.3542857. A break above this level may result in a rally to $0.40.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the pair turns down from the current levels or the overhead resistance and breaks below the 20-day EMA. Such a move could pull the price down to the 50-day SMA ($0.186).\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) rebounded from just below the 20-day EMA ($427) on Jan. 11 but the bulls could not sustain the recovery and push the price back above $515.35 on Jan. 12, indicating selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/007d590b-5850-4f24-90f4-88a2fd176338.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Today, the bulls have again defended the 20-day EMA and will now try to push the price back above $515.35. If they succeed, the BCH/USD pair may pick up momentum and rally to $631.71.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the up-move turns down from $515.35, the pair may drop to the 20-day EMA and remain range-bound between these two levels for the next few days.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) completed a successful retest of the breakout level on Jan. 11 when it rebounded sharply from $7.1642. The sharp recovery from the intraday lows carried the price back above the 20-day EMA ($8.39), which is a positive sign.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/a518bf09-c167-403d-ab48-a448dec2acf4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The DOT/USD pair formed an inside day Doji candlestick pattern on Jan. 12, indicating indecision about the next directional move. This uncertainty resolved to the upside today and the bulls are currently attempting to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 The up-move may face resistance in the $10 to $10.68 resistance zone, but if the bulls can thrust the price above it, the pair could rally to $12.50. Conversely, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the pair may consolidate near the highs for a few days.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the Jan. 11 candlestick shows the bulls aggressively purchased the drop to the 20-day EMA ($0.23). Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) attempted to extend the recovery on Jan. 12 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows profit booking at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/af29f5d5-643c-4c77-bc89-87d278ba7d0b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently trying to sustain the price above $0.2864. If they are able to do that, the XLM/USD pair may move up to $0.35 where it is likely to hit a roadblock.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this resistance, a few days of range-bound action between $0.35 and $0.25 is possible.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price fails to sustain above $0.2864, the pair may retest the 20-day EMA. A break below this support could tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) had dipped below the 50-day SMA ($13.21) on Jan. 11 but the bears could not capitalize on this weakness, resulting in a strong rebound. Today again, the altcoin has bounced off the 50-day SMA, suggesting strong buying at this support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/3d62c8b2-edba-4b7f-99e3-c53ec927b924.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls push the price above $15.50, the LINK/USD pair may rise to $17.7777 where it is likely to face stiff resistance from the bulls.\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $15.50, the pair may consolidate in a tight range for a few days. The trend will turn in favor of the bears if the price breaks below the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the $35.69 support on Jan. 11, indicating accumulation at lower levels. However, the bulls could not build up on the recovery on Jan. 12 and the altcoin formed a Doji candlestick pattern, suggesting indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/3ac4584a-1503-4c88-abe0-7a3d975438f7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers are currently trying to push the price back above the 20-day EMA ($38.74). If they succeed the BNB/USD pair could move up to the 50% Fibonacci retracement of the most recent leg of the fall at $40.0997.\par \par \uc2 Above this level, the up-move could reach the 61.8% retracement at $41.2944 and then to $45.1620.\par \par \uc2 However, the flat 20-day EMA and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest a possible range-bound action in the near term. The trend could turn in favor of the bears if the pair slips below $35.0374.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDEvZTEyNzhiMTAtYjRkOC00YTJmLWFkMzUtYmJlNWQzYTMxNDlkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210113eh1d000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin Price\par \b \uc2 BTC price eyes 30% correction: 5 things to watch in Bitcoin this week\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 1,363 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 January 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 A strengthening dollar combines with profit-taking by miners to create a "short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 " environment for Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) heads into a new week after another weekend of major \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 but this time, the way was down, not up.\par \par \uc2 As the asset loses $7,000, the most since the \u8220\'20\'1Cvertical\u8221\'20\'1D price rises began, Cointelegraph presents five things that could keep it moving in the coming days.\par \par \uc2 BTC dip makes Guggenheim want to sell\par \par \uc2 Top on the list of topics among Bitcoiners will be the cryptocurrency\u8217\'20\'19s sudden fall over Saturday and Sunday.\par \par \uc2 From highs of near $42,000, BTC/USD faced a sell-off out of hours, with bears driving down the pair to current local lows of $32,300.\par \par \uc2 The drop is the largest this year and most significant since the coronavirus pandemic caused a cross-asset crash in March 2020, but it was widely predicted by analysts, who argued that Bitcoin had become overextended.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C#Bitcoin crashes >10%: The worst Bitcoin plunge since March is reminiscent of the last halving cycle in 2016/2017. The rally was followed by a slump of more than 50% in 2017,\u8221\'20\'1D financial commentator Holger Zschaepitz {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Schuldensuehner/status/1348537911894024192"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2  in cautious words on \uc2 Twitter\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/97223220-a2c1-4a07-9871-94bca5a367d1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 In fact, a 23% drop is nothing new for long-term Bitcoin hodlers, and the lack of more significant losses suggests that even above $30,000, buyer support remains strong.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThese and upcoming dips are the opportunities you where looking for during the #FOMO feelings you had at $40,000. Use them,\u8221\'20\'1D Cointelegraph Markets analyst Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe meanwhile continued.\par \par \uc2 As of publication, Bitcoin was already rebounding, with $35,000 swiftly following the lows. This was not enough for institutional Bitcoin-buyer Guggenheim, however, with chief investment office Scott Minerd suddenly signalling that the fund would sell some of its BTC position.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin's parabolic rise is unsustainable in the near term. Vulnerable to a setback,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/ScottMinerd/status/1348493010338803713"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 claimed}}}\uc2  on Monday.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe target technical upside of $35,000 has been exceeded. Time to take some money off the table.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Others noted the potential bargain for large-volume buyers.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CInstitutions are really shaking out all the weak hands to acquire more #Bitcoin,\u8221\'20\'1D David Gokhshtein, founder of Gokhshtein Media, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/davidgokhshtein/status/1348523548999102464"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2  about the current status quo.\par \par \uc2 Biden talks $3 trillion money printing\par \par \uc2 In the United States, a potential bull sign for Bitcoin in the form of a massive $3 trillion stimulus program from the incoming Biden administration is being masked by a recent rebound in the strength of the dollar.\par \par \uc2 A classic inverse correlation for Bitcoin, the U.S. dollar currency index (DXY) continued its gains over recent days, heading back above the 90 mark after hitting its lowest levels since March 2018.\par \par \uc2 Last year often saw dollar-weakening give Bitcoin a boost, at a time when other price relationships were steadily breaking down.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe dollar is so extremely oversold, over-hated, and over-shorted that it all but has to rally for a while at some point soon,\u8221\'20\'1D \uc2 Matt Maley\uc2 , chief market strategist at \uc2 Miller Tabak + Co\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2021-01-11/hedge-funds-head-for-cover-as-dollar-rebound-gathers-pace"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  Bloomberg.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe dollar is getting very ripe for a tradable bounce \u8212\'20\'14 one that will last at least several weeks and maybe even a couple of months.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/cb31c8eb-fd57-4ba6-a8f9-1e4fda6d76da.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar currency index 1-day candle chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Looking to the long term, however, it was clear for many this week that the U.S. was simply kicking its real economic hardship further down the road. Incoming President Joe Biden intends to give Americans stimulus checks worth $2,000 as part of a giant money-printing exercise, which could be worth $3 trillion.\par \par \uc2 Should it pass, liquidity from the central bank will expand the most in a single instant since the coronavirus pandemic began, and it will take U.S. federal debt above $30 trillion for the first time in history.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CTime for Plan B,\u8221\'20\'1D Danny Scott, CEO of United Kingdom exchange CoinCorner, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CoinCornerDanny/status/1347912727977742337"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 responded}}}\uc2  to the plans.\par \par \uc2 Stocks grind upward\par \par \uc2 Equities traders are beginning to raise their hopes of incoming profits this week, thanks to the shock of recent events in the United States adding to markets\u8217\'20\'19 existing gains.\par \par \uc2 On Monday, it was India\u8217\'20\'19s turn in the spotlight, with stocks racing toward new all-time highs. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/all-time-highs-meet-altseason-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 As Cointelegraph reported}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/all-time-highs-meet-altseason-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/all-time-highs-meet-altseason-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week}}}\uc2 , other markets are already at or near records of their own. Elsewhere in Asia and beyond, Hong Kong and South Korea made gains while Australia saw losses.\par \par \uc2 With U.S. futures down prior to Wall Street opening, a broadly mixed picture greeted market participants, with gold also struggling but oil advancing.\par \par \uc2 The extent of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s reliance on stock market movements is again in doubt as the weekend\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  looks nothing like the current macro environment. Since outperforming every major equity play except Tesla as markets rebounded from their crash in March 2020, Bitcoin has increasingly forged its own path, unhindered by the macro.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI am expecting Bitcoin and tech stocks to double again in the next 6-9 months,\u8221\'20\'1D Immad Akhund, CEO of startup-focused bank Mercury, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/immad/status/1347204454601220101"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 predicted}}}\uc2  over the weekend.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s clear we are in an asset bubble fueled by fiscal stimulus, low interest rates and ironically higher disposable income in pandemic. Probably won\u8217\'20\'19t end well but enjoy the ride on the way up!\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Akhund, like various others, added that his timeline coincided with the rollout of mass vaccinations against the coronavirus, news of which has further fuelled stocks' all-round rise in recent weeks.\par \par \uc2 Miners take serious profits\par \par \uc2 One explanation for the Bitcoin \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2  lies firmly within the Bitcoin network itself. A classic setup, miners appear to be selling holdings at significant rates once again.\par \par \uc2 According to data from on-chain monitoring resource CryptoQuant, those sales have now reached their highest since July 2019, even surpassing those that followed the latest block subsidy halving in May 202.\par \par \uc2 CryptoQuant used its Miner Position Index (MPI) to determine miners\u8217\'20\'19 decreasing stocks of BTC, with CEO Ki Young Ju {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/ki_young_ju/status/1348226974045544450"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 describing}}}\uc2  the current situation as a \u8220\'20\'1Cshort-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSince December last year, they had been selling $BTC, but the correction was tiny due to institutional buying power,\u8221\'20\'1D he added in comments.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/d9db1806-81cf-4f60-b546-95d17ad02c61.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin MPI 30-day moving average chart. Source: Ki Young Ju/ Twitter\par \par \uc2 Cointelegraph in-house analyst Joseph Young had further thoughts. For him, Bitcoin at its all-time highs of $42,000 came at the end of a period during which the market had simply overexerted itself. A period of taking stock \u8212\'20\'14 perhaps literally \u8212\'20\'14 was more than necessary.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C$2.7 billion was liquidated today,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/iamjosephyoung/status/1348544119279243264"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noted}}}\uc2  on Monday.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSimple answer is the market was overleveraged, got greedy, continue to buy first dips below $39k.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 No "alt season 2.0" just yet\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s lower levels may end up being a gift to altcoin hodlers, who have eagerly awaited a lessening of the bull run\u8217\'20\'19s intensity to allow other tokens breathing space.\par \par \uc2 As Coitelegraph's van de Poppe often notes, altcoins do not do well during parabolic episodes in Bitcoin, with their main performance occurring after Bitcoin has cooled down.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe #altcoin market capitalization still looks great,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1348449552102158336"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 commented}}}\uc2  on Monday.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe first level of the impulse wave was hit at $320 billion. As long as it remains above $225 billion, then the next run will bring the #altcoin capitalization towards new all-time highs.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 On Monday, however, it was clear that that pattern had yet to play out, with altcoins following Bitcoin downward and even outpacing its losses.\par \par \uc2 Of the top 10 cryptocurrencies by market capitalization, many lost between 17% and 20% on the day, with market leader Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) nearing the $1,000 support. Despite the drawdowns, many still retained solid gains on longer time frames. In the case of the top 10, it was Cardano's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  in the lead overall, still up 27% versus a week ago.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDEvMzRmZTg3OTQtN2FhNi00NGY0LTk4OGItMjc0ZWI2OTkwMjliLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210111eh1b0008n\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin Price\par \b \uc2 BTC price eyes 30% correction: 5 things to watch in Bitcoin this week\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 1,334 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 January 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 A strengthening dollar combines with profit-taking by miners to create a "short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 " environment for Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) heads into a new week after another weekend of major \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 but this time, the way was down, not up.\par \par \uc2 As the market loses $7,000 \u8212\'20\'14 the most since the \u8220\'20\'1Cvertical\u8221\'20\'1D price rises began \u8212\'20\'14 Cointelegraph presents five things which could keep it moving in the coming days.\par \par \uc2 BTC dip makes Guggenheim want to sell\par \par \uc2 Top on the list of topics among Bitcoiners will be the cryptocurrency\u8217\'20\'19s sudden fall over Saturday and Sunday.\par \par \uc2 From highs of near $42,000, BTC/USD faced a sell-off out of hours, with bears driving down the pair to current local lows of $32,300.\par \par \uc2 The drop is the most this year and since the Coronavirus caused a cross-asset crash in March 2020, but was widely predicted by analysts, who argued that Bitcoin had become overextended.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C#Bitcoin crashes >10%: The worst Bitcoin plunge since March is reminiscent of the last halving cycle in 2016/2017. The rally was followed by a slump of more than 50% in 2017,\u8221\'20\'1D financial commentator Holger Zschaepitz {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Schuldensuehner/status/1348537911894024192"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2  in cautious words on \uc2 Twitter\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/97223220-a2c1-4a07-9871-94bca5a367d1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 In fact, a 23% drop is nothing new for long-term Bitcoin hodlers, and the lack of more significant losses suggests that even above $30,000, buyer support remains strong.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThese and upcoming dips are the opportunities you where looking for during the #FOMO feelings you had at $40,000. Use them,\u8221\'20\'1D Cointelegraph Markets analyst Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe meanwhile continued.\par \par \uc2 At press time, Bitcoin was already rebounding, with $35,000 swiftly following the lows. This was not enough for institutional Bitcoin buyer Guggenheim, however, with CIO Scott Minerd suddenly signalling that the fund would sell some of its BTC position.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin's parabolic rise is unsustainable in the near term. Vulnerable to a setback,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/ScottMinerd/status/1348493010338803713"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 claimed}}}\uc2  on Monday.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe target technical upside of $35,000 has been exceeded. Time to take some money off the table.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Others noted the potential bargain for large-volume buyers.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CInstitutions are really shaking out all the weak hands to acquire more #Bitcoin,\u8221\'20\'1D David Gokhshtein, founder of Gokhshtein Media, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/davidgokhshtein/status/1348523548999102464"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2  about the current status quo.\par \par \uc2 Biden talks $3 trillion money printing\par \par \uc2 In the United States, a potential bull sign for Bitcoin in the form of a massive $3 trillion stimulus program from the incoming Biden administration is being masked by a recent rebound in the strength of the dollar.\par \par \uc2 A classic inverse correlation for Bitcoin, the U.S. dollar currency index (DXY) continued its gains over recent days, heading back above the 90 mark after hitting its lowest levels since March 2018.\par \par \uc2 Last year often saw dollar weakening give Bitcoin a boost, at a time when other price relationships were steadily breaking down.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe dollar is so extremely oversold, over-hated, and over-shorted that it all but has to rally for a while at some point soon,\u8221\'20\'1D \uc2 Matt Maley\uc2 , chief market strategist at \uc2 Miller Tabak + Co\uc2 ., {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2021-01-11/hedge-funds-head-for-cover-as-dollar-rebound-gathers-pace"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  Bloomberg.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe dollar is getting very ripe for a tradable bounce \u8212\'20\'14 one that will last at least several weeks and maybe even a couple of months.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/cb31c8eb-fd57-4ba6-a8f9-1e4fda6d76da.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar currency index 1-day candle chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Looking to the long term, however, and it was clear for many this week that the U.S. was simply kicking its real economic hardship further down the road. Incoming president Joe Biden intends to give Americans stimulus checks worth $2,000 as part of a giant money printing exercise, which could be worth $3 trillion.\par \par \uc2 Should it pass, liquidity from the central bank will expand the most in a single instant since the Coronavirus pandemic began, and will take U.S. federal debt above $30 trillion for the first time in history.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CTime for Plan B,\u8221\'20\'1D Danny Scott, CEO of U.K. exchange CoinCorner, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CoinCornerDanny/status/1347912727977742337"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 responded}}}\uc2  to the plans.\par \par \uc2 Stocks grind upwards\par \par \uc2 Equities traders are beginning to raise their hopes of incoming profits this week, thanks to the shock of recent events in the United States adding to markets\u8217\'20\'19 existing gains.\par \par \uc2 On Monday, it was India\u8217\'20\'19s turn in the spotlight, with stocks racing towards new all-time highs. As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/all-time-highs-meet-altseason-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , other markets are already at or near records of their own. Elsewhere in Asia and beyond, Hong Kong and South Korea made gains while Australia saw losses.\par \par \uc2 With U.S. futures down prior to Wall Street opening, a broadly mixed picture greeted market participants, with gold also struggling but oil advancing.\par \par \uc2 The extent of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s reliance on stock market movements is again in doubt as the weekend\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  looks nothing like the current macro environment. Since outperforming every major equity play except Tesla as markets rebounded from their crash last March, Bitcoin has increasingly forged its own path, unhindered by macro.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI am expecting Bitcoin and tech stocks to double again in the next 6-9 months,\u8221\'20\'1D Immad Akhund, CEO of startup-focused bank Mercury, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/immad/status/1347204454601220101"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 predicted}}}\uc2  over the weekend.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s clear we are in an asset bubble fueled by fiscal stimulus, low interest rates and ironically higher disposable income in pandemic. Probably won\u8217\'20\'19t end well but enjoy the ride on the way up!\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Akhund, like various others, added that his timeline coincided with the rollout of mass vaccination against Coronavirus, news of which has further fuelled stocks all-round rise in recent weeks.\par \par \uc2 Miners take serious profits\par \par \uc2 One explanation for the Bitcoin \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2  lies firmly within the Bitcoin network itself. A classic setup, miners appear to be selling holdings at significant rates once again.\par \par \uc2 According to data from on-chain monitoring resource CryptoQuant, those sales have now reached their highest since July 2019, even surpassing those which followed the latest block subsidy halving in May last year.\par \par \uc2 CryptoQuant used its Miner Position Index (MPI) to determine miners\u8217\'20\'19 decreasing stocks of BTC, with CEO Ki Young Ju {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/ki_young_ju/status/1348226974045544450"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 describing}}}\uc2  the current situation as a \u8220\'20\'1Cshort-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSince December last year, they had been selling $BTC, but the correction was tiny due to institutional buying power,\u8221\'20\'1D he added in comments.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/d9db1806-81cf-4f60-b546-95d17ad02c61.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin MPI 30-day moving average chart. Source: Ki Young Ju/ Twitter\par \par \uc2 Cointelegraph in-house analyst Joseph Young had further thoughts. For him, Bitcoin at its all-time highs of $42,000 came at the end of a period during which the market had just overexerted itself. A period of taking stock \u8212\'20\'14 perhaps literally \u8212\'20\'14 was more than necessary.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C$2.7 billion was liquidated today,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/iamjosephyoung/status/1348544119279243264"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noted}}}\uc2  on Monday.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSimple answer is the market was overleveraged, got greedy, continue to buy first dips below $39k.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 No "altseason 2.0" just yet\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s lower levels may end up being a gift to altcoin hodlers, who have eagerly awaited a lessening of the bull run\u8217\'20\'19s intensity to allow other tokens breathing space.\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph\u8217\'20\'19s Van de Poppe often notes, altcoins do not do well during parabolic episodes in Bitcoin, with their main performance occurring after Bitcoin has cooled down.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe #altcoin market capitalization still looks great,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1348449552102158336"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 commented}}}\uc2  on Monday.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe first level of the impulse wave was hit at $320 billion. As long as it remains above $225 billion, then the next run will bring the #altcoin capitalization towards new all-time highs.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 On Monday, however, it was clear that that pattern had yet to play out, with altcoins following Bitcoin downwards and even outpacing its losses.\par \par \uc2 Out of the top ten cryptocurrencies by market cap, many lost between 17% and 20% on the day, market leader Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) nearing $1,000 support. Despite the drawdowns, many still retained solid gains on longer timeframes. In the case of the top ten, it was Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) in the lead overall, still up 27% versus a week ago.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDEvMzRmZTg3OTQtN2FhNi00NGY0LTk4OGItMjc0ZWI2OTkwMjliLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210111eh1b0002v\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Top 5 cryptocurrencies to watch this week: BTC,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , EOS, THETA, AAVE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,790 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 January 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Altcoins rallied strongly over the past week, but Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s current consolidation could be a sign that the trend may reverse soon.\par \par \uc2 During an interview with Bloomberg, Grayscale CEO Michael Sonnenshein said that in addition to hedge funds, pension funds and endowments had also started {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/pension-funds-are-getting-in-on-bitcoin-according-to-grayscale"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 investing}}}\uc2  in the Grayscale family of products. This suggests that a broad spectrum of institutions are accumulating Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 As this trend gathers speed, investment banks have also decided that they do not want to be left behind. A recent filing from \uc2 Morgan Stanley\uc2  shows a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/morgan-stanley-buys-10-stake-in-michael-saylor-s-microstrategy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 purchase}}}\uc2  of a 10.9% stake in business intelligence firm \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2 , a move that was likely made in order to gain exposure in Bitcoin. With 70,470 Bitcoin in their possession, \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  has become a proxy play on Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Several analysts suspect that the current demand could also be coming from investors who have been closing their gold positions and buying Bitcoin. On a query about the recent underperformance of gold, CNBC Mad Money show host \uc2 Jim Cramer{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/as-gold-crashes-jim-cramer-says-money-is-all-going-to-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 speculated}}}\uc2  that institutional money may be flowing into cryptocurrency.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/eae7d99e-5988-4485-a954-b90c2d19baf6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While there have been positive reports about institutional purchases, traders should also keep track of the people who have been selling because at some point the rally will lose momentum and investors will look to book profits.\par \par \uc2 Analysts at Material Indicators suggest that mega whales may have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-volatility-spikes-as-btc-whales-sell-each-new-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 booked}}}\uc2  profits on Jan. 7 when Bitcoin hit $40,000 and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/key-bitcoin-price-metric-signals-btc-may-be-near-a-local-top"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 further selling from whales}}}\uc2  could also be the reason for the \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2  seen today. However, aggressive buying at lower levels resulted in a strong rebound.\par \par \uc2 But that has not deterred the whales from selling. Bitcoin whales in South Korea have been dumping their positions over the past few days, as seen from the multiple $100 million {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/another-84m-deposit-begs-the-question-why-are-bitcoin-whales-in-korea-selling"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 deposits}}}\uc2  to exchanges. While the selling has not caused a massive rush to the exit, traders should be careful with their positions because even if a couple of large investors in the U.S. rush to the exit, it could result in a sharp fall.\par \par \uc2 If Bitcoin corrects sharply, most altcoins are also likely to follow suit, but if Bitcoin remains strong, these top-5 cryptocurrencies could outperform in the short term.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze their charts to spot the critical levels to watch.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been in a strong uptrend for the past few weeks, but the rally has pushed the relative strength index (RSI) into overbought territory. While markets can remain overbought for a long time, with every rise, the risk of a sharp correction increases.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/03836279-072d-4f47-a2f0-96cb0f30136c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is the intraday low made on Jan. 8 at $36,518.73. If the price rebounds off this level, it will suggest that traders are not booking profits in a hurry and are buying on minor dips.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls propel the price above $41,959.63, the uptrend could resume with the next target objective at $45,000 and then $50,000.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears sink the price below $36,518.73, the BTC/USD pair could drop to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of the most recent leg of the up-move at $32,816.03.\par \par \uc2 This is a crucial support to monitor because if it cracks, several traders may start to panic and dump their positions, which may result in a deeper correction to the 61.8% retracement level at $27,167.10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/0a69a1e9-5d6f-4a95-bcdb-b3a8b790c51a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that the price is currently stuck inside a $38,000 to $41,959.63 range. If the bulls can push the price above the range, the uptrend may resume.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bears sink the price below the support of the range, it will suggest profit-booking by traders.\par \par \uc2 The next support on the downside is the 50-simple moving average, which has not been breached decisively during previous corrections in this leg of the uptrend. Thus, if this support cracks, it will signal a possible trend change.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is currently consolidating in an uptrend. The altcoin has been stuck between $0.2632811 and $0.3542857 for the past few days, which has pulled down the RSI from deeply overbought levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/64531bbf-00c5-487b-9476-e5d69803b7a5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently facing stiff resistance near the $0.34 level but one positive sign is that there are no signs of panic selling yet. If the bulls can drive the price above the overhead resistance, the next leg of the uptrend could resume.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair has a target objective at $0.449 but the bears are likely to mount a stiff resistance near $0.40. However, if the bulls can push the price above the resistance levels, the pair could rally to the psychological level at $0.50.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the pair turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($0.234). Such a move will suggest that the uptrend may have topped out.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/0d0b0ca7-fe3f-43fa-90e0-33abee1715e9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows the formation of a symmetrical triangle, which usually acts as a continuation pattern. The bulls are currently attempting to defend the 20-EMA. If the price rebounds off the current levels, the bulls will try to push the pair above the triangle.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the pair may rally to $0.525. However, if the pair drops below the triangle, the next support is at the 50-SMA, but if this support also cracks, the decline could extend to $0.20.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  has been trading inside a large range between $2.20 and $3.949. The altcoin turned down sharply from the overhead resistance today, which shows aggressive selling by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/f593eace-ac3b-4661-b7db-46b6c8dabd98.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls defend the moving averages, the EOS/USD pair may again attempt to rise to the overhead resistance near $3.949. A breakout of this level will suggest the start of a new uptrend that may reach $5.698.\par \par \uc2 This view will be invalidated if the bears sink and sustain the price below the moving averages. Such a move could result in a fall to the support of the range at $2.20 and that may keep the pair range-bound for a few more days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/8d80d6ae-b42e-42fe-901b-f7d3fba1b20a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that the price turned down sharply from the overhead resistance and broke below both moving averages. This suggests aggressive selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price rebounds off the current level and rises above the 20-EMA, it will suggest that the selling may be over. The bulls may then again try to carry the price to the overhead resistance.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sustain the price below $3, the pair may drop to $2.50 and then to $2.20.\par \par \uc2 THETA/USD\par \par \uc2 THETA is currently consolidating in an uptrend for the past few days. The price has been making lower highs, which suggests that every attempt to rally is being met with selling from the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/74d7d5ca-b54a-4993-b0b7-773df23edef7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 THETA/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/THETAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, a minor positive is that the bulls have not allowed the price to dip below the $1.7611 support. The 20-day EMA ($1.74) is just below this level and the bulls are likely to defend it aggressively.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above $2.20, the THETA/USD pair may rise to $2.51. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory suggest bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 If the bears continue their selling and sink the pair below the 20-day EMA, it may open the gates for a drop to the 50-day SMA ($1.12).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/13a15b90-523a-4a2b-8c94-54f1ab25e760.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 THETA/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/THETAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows a descending triangle formation. The flat moving averages and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If the bears can sink and sustain the price below $1.7611, the descending triangle pattern will complete and that could drag the price down to $1.01.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bulls can push the price above the triangle, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern. This could push the price to $2.51 and if the bulls can thrust the price above this resistance, the up-move could reach $2.95.\par \par \uc2 AAVE/USD\par \par \uc2 AAVE is currently in an uptrend as it continues to make higher highs and higher lows formation. However, the long wick on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that bears are aggressively selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/50bfc13c-e9f8-4a4b-9bc6-d66f3c85c6d6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AAVE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/AAVEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI near overbought territory suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside. If the AAVE/USD pair corrects further, a rebound off the 20-day EMA ($99.93) will confirm that traders are continuing to buy on dips.\par \par \uc2 If the buyers can push the price above $135.99, the uptrend could resume with the next likely target at $150.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($85). A break below this support could result in a fall to $70 and then to $60.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/2d120a5f-f0d3-4ae7-ad43-1ab468a00c6c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AAVE/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/AAVEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that the pair is trading inside an ascending channel. The bulls are currently attempting to defend the 20-EMA. A strong bounce could carry the price to the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 A break above the channel could result in a sharp up-move but if the price turns down from the resistance line of the channel, the pair may trade inside the channel for a few days.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below the 20-EMA, a drop to the support line of the channel is possible. A strong rebound off this support will keep the uptrend intact but a break below it could signal a trend change.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDEvYTFkMTliZjEtOGY3My00MDE2LWFkOTctMDA5ZjRkY2M3NTYxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210110eh1a0008d\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/8: BTC, ETH, XRP, LTC,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, BCH, XLM, LINK, BNB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,837 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 January 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Traders are buying every dip and pushing Bitcoin price to new highs on a daily basis, triggering many altcoins to follow suit.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) again rose to a new all-time high on Friday as bulls continued to buy on every minor dip. As the price reached a new high, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s market capitalization soared above {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/bitcoin-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $775 billion}}}\uc2 , taking it past \uc2 Facebook\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s market cap, according to the website Companies Market Cap. This means, there are only {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-quickly-rebounds-to-reach-41-000-as-market-cap-passes-tencent"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 six companies}}}\uc2  in the world that currently have a greater market cap than Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 The pace of the rally seems to have caught several traders off guard. Popular analyst {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-buying-algos-seldom-care-about-price-in-2021-says-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 flibflib told}}}\uc2  Cointelegraph that the sustained rise points to \u8220\'20\'1Caccumulation algorithms and that accumulation algorithms seldom care about the price when their goal is to invest X$ in Y time period.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/d2b916c5-91f4-4417-b6fc-f63b9d4c1d90.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The bull market has attracted huge trading activity that has smashed all previous {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-s-real-volume-doubles-previous-all-time-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 volume}}}\uc2  records. Along with the spot markets, Bitcoin futures trading volume has also surged, hitting over $97 billion in a 24-hour period, according to data from Skew.\par \par \uc2 Traders must keep in mind that when the market reverses course, there will be a lot of selling to deal with and that could result in a sharp correction. On the way to new all-time highs, the market did not stop at resistance levels and during the fall, these same support levels may prove useless. Therefore, traders must follow their money management principles and not be blinded by greed.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to spot any topping patterns or levels where the markets may reverse direction.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears tried to start a pullback but the bulls thwarted their attempt and purchased the intraday dip. The trend has been so strong that there hasn\u8217\'20\'19t been a consecutive three-day correction since Dec. 12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/0850a5b7-89e2-49ff-b83e-df77b0f494b9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The vertical rally of the past few days has pushed the relative strength index (RSI) deep into the overbought territory but that has not lowered the demand from the bulls.\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USD pair could next rally to $45,000 and if that resistance is scaled, the uptrend could extend to $50,000. This psychological level could offer stiff resistance and that may result in a correction.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the first support is the 20-day exponential moving average ($30,539). A strong rebound off this support will keep the uptrend intact.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the decline could deepen with the next support at the 50-day simple moving average near $23,218.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) made a long-legged Doji candlestick on Jan. 7, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears about the next directional move. That uncertainty resolved to the downside today and the bears pulled the price down to $1,063.322.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/d01d6eea-4ee4-4e34-8575-fef8d47589ee.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls aggressively purchased the dip resulting in the formation of the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above $1,288.668, the ETH/USD pair could rally to $1,420. The bears may try to pose a stiff challenge at this level but if crossed, the momentum could pick up and the pair could rise to $2,000.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current levels and plummets below $1,063.322, the pair may drop to the 20-day EMA ($886).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  is the only major cryptocurrency that has not participated in the ongoing bull run. Traders sensed an opportunity and pushed the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.30) on Jan. 7, but selling near the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level is preventing the price from pushing above $0.358202.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/45fe6de9-383b-4259-bd7b-b7041a27e3e6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are currently trying to sink the price below the 20-day EMA. This suggests that the sentiment on the XRP/USD pair remains negative, and traders are selling on rallies. The pair could now remain range-bound between $0.169 and $0.385.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls can push the price above $0.385, it will suggest that the downtrend is over. That may result in a rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.45).\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) formed a Doji candlestick pattern on Jan. 7, suggesting profit-booking by traders near the stiff overhead resistance at $180. The bears sensed an opportunity to stall the uptrend and attempted to trigger a correction today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/0627cc8b-048c-48b8-876f-c9daa1780c83.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls are in no mood to relent and they aggressively purchased the dip today, as seen from the long tail on the candlestick. If the LTC/USD pair climbs above the stiff overhead resistance at $180, the LTC/USD pair could rally to $200.\par \par \uc2 The RSI remains in the overbought territory, suggesting that the bears may again try to raise a roadblock at $180. If the price turns down from this resistance, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($138).\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off the 20-day EMA will suggest that the trend remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but a break below it will increase the possibility of a deeper correction.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls attempted to extend the uptrend on Jan. 7, but the bears aggressively sold above $0.340. Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) corrected to the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.2614241 today, where buying emerged.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/c280ed3d-20b8-426e-bd1e-51a184e7a871.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that traders are using the dips to accumulate as the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . If the bulls can thrust the price above the overhead resistance, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD may resume the uptrend and rally to $0.40 and then to $0.50.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears again successfully defend the overhead zone, the pair may remain range-bound between $0.26 and $0.35 for a few days. A break below $0.26 could start a deeper correction to the 20-day EMA ($0.21).\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) attempted to resume the uptrend on Jan. 7, but traders booked profits at higher levels. The bears tried to start a correction, but the altcoin bounced off $8.7788 today, from just above the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $8.5515.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/b4dcdd29-399e-464f-a936-0e648df2abc9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory suggest an advantage to the bulls. The DOT/USD pair may again rise to $10.68. If the bulls can thrust the price above this resistance, the uptrend may resume with the next target objective at $12.39 and then $15.\par \par \uc2 However, if the pair turns down from the overhead resistance, that could result in a few days of consolidation. A break below $8.5515 and the 20-day EMA ($7.92) may indicate the start of a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) formed a long-legged Doji candlestick pattern on Jan. 7, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears about the next directional move. The bears pulled the price down today, but they could not sustain the lower levels, as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/49e3795a-6984-4c65-98ed-2662ebd94843.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price again turns down from the $497 to $515.35 overhead resistance zone, it will suggest traders are booking profits at higher levels. That could keep the BCH/USD pair range-bound between $370 and $500 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 However, the upsloping moving averages and the RSI near the overbought zone suggest bulls are in command. If they can push the price above the resistance zone, the pair may start a new uptrend with the first target at $640.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the Jan. 6 and 7 candlestick shows that traders booked profits at higher levels. However, the bulls continue to buy at lower levels, as seen from Stellar Lumens\u8217\'20\'19 ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) bounce off the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.266547 today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/553d45e5-9fc7-4b64-9feb-0fce8870a310.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 After the large range days of the past few days, the XLM/USD pair may enter a few days of consolidation as traders digest the recent gains and decide on the next course of action.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above $0.409, the pair could resume the uptrend that may reach $0.50.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price slips and sustains below $0.266547, the pair may drop to the 61.8% retracement level at $0.232828 and then to the 20-day EMA ($0.19).\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the $17.7777 overhead resistance on Jan. 7, and that attracted profit-booking by short-term traders who dragged the price down to the 20-day EMA ($13.54) today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/42c07c9d-4665-4d1e-b8c1-e9daae0edf7f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive zone suggest bulls have the upper hand. Thus, traders used the dip to aggressively buy at lower levels, resulting in a long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can propel the price above $17.7777, the LINK/USD pair could rally to $20.1111. If this level is also scaled, then LINK price could extend toward $25.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears successfully defend the overhead resistance once again, then the pair may consolidate between $14 and $17.7777 for a few days. A break below the moving averages will signal that bears are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 The candlesticks of the past few days show long tails, which indicate traders have been booking profits at regular intervals. Although dip buyers have continued to push Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) higher, the up-move lacks conviction.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/f579da76-2fe2-4e02-a884-63209c3ad344.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the momentum does not pick up within the next few days, the BNB/USD pair will be at risk of a correction or consolidation. A break below the 20-day EMA ($37.93) will be the first sign of a possible deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls can drive the price above $45, the pair could rally to $50, where the bears may try to stall the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDEvOTUyZmVhN2EtNDQyNi00MmY2LTk3YWItOTY3ZmQxMmIyMzgxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210108eh18000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 The rise of crypto: Bitcoin sets landmarks but alts can go independent\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Shiraz Jagati \par \uc2 1,407 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 January 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 On Dec. 8, exactly one month ago, Bitcoin was hovering around the $18,700 range, with many analysts debating as to whether the flagship asset would be able to sustain its \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum and cross its all-time high value close to $20,000. Well, how quickly things have changed since then because within a period of just 30 days, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-quickly-rebounds-to-reach-41-000-as-market-cap-passes-tencent"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 repeatedly scaled up to new ATHs}}}\uc2 , even surpassing the $41,000 barrier.\par \par \uc2 Over the course of the last seven days, BTC has exhibited a substantial growth of around 41%, with the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  seemingly breaking new ground with each passing day. However, this has led to investors becoming increasingly nervous since there are many who immediately are given flashbacks of the 2018 crash that resulted in most cryptocurrencies crashing hard within a matter of days.\par \par \uc2 In this regard, Cointelegraph Markets contributor Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe believes that while 2020 was an amazing year for crypto, everyone should {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-now-within-10-of-40-000-after-ranging-flips-to-new-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 brace for a \u8220\'20\'1Chealthy correction\u8221\'20\'1D in the near future}}}\uc2 . That being said, for many, that can serve as an opportunity like no other because there is an increasing population of budding crypto enthusiasts who now want a piece of the action, and not just Bitcoin. On the matter, van de Poppe opined: \u8220\'20\'1CThe higher Bitcoin goes, the more money comes into the market and more money can flow towards altcoins.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 What\u8217\'20\'19s causing BTC to soar?\par \par \uc2 The reasons for Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s momentum are manifold, starting with the fact that the industry as a whole had been in a prolonged bear market all through 2018 and 2019, but despite the slumps, accumulation had never really stopped.\par \par \uc2 Another often overlooked narrative is related to the recent BTC halving, as time and again, historical data has indicated that approximately four to six months after every cycle, the value of the premier digital currency takes a sharp upward turn \u8212\'20\'14 something that has happened this time around as well.\par \par \uc2 Not only that, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  seems to be right {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/100trillionUSD/status/1347170578495635456"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 on track}}}\uc2  with the stock-to-flow model, which was created by Dutch institutional investor PlanB. According to the S2F model, scarcity is used as the defining metric to quantify the value of Bitcoin. And while most people use the setup to assess BTCs future valuation, PlanB claims that the S2F model can also be used in relation to gold and silver, as well as other assets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Bitcoin?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Bitcoin}}}\uc2  Stock-to-Flow model on track .. like clockwork {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/x7o8mwbzj7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/x7o8mwbzj7}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 PlanB (@100trillionUSD) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/100trillionUSD/status/1347170578495635456?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 January 7, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Ben Zhou, CEO of cryptocurrency exchange Bybit, confirmed that it\u8217\'20\'19s the \u8220\'20\'1Cinstitutional inflow fueling Bitcoin,\u8221\'20\'1D adding that there is now a level of consensus, or at the very least, peer pressure among certain corners of the institutional world to have Bitcoin in their portfolio: \u8220\'20\'1CCertainly, those that have a younger clientele feel the need to increase their exposure to BTC.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Omar Chen, CEO of the ZB.com exchange, believes that institutional buying has simply served as a catalyst for Bitcoin and has not been the primary driver for its \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. He told Cointelegraph that investors, both from the traditional and the crypto sectors, are in fact on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ft.com/content/566dd8f7-7efe-45b6-8a44-b20f7f0f283e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lookout}}}\uc2  for alternative safe havens, pointing toward gold and its rally during the start of the COVID-19 pandemic:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAs people and institutions learn more about its attributes and benefits, Bitcoin has become another haven of choice for money. Combined with the recent spate of negative news about COVID-19 vaccines, investors are increasingly losing faith in traditional finance and the global economic recovery, making the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  case for Bitcoin even louder.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Are altcoins inextricably linked to BTC?\par \par \uc2 As Bitcoin marches on, even crossing the $41,000 threshold, there is no denying that the surge has also seen a number of prominent altcoins soar to new heights. In this regard, over the course of the past week, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), Stellar ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) have showcased prominent gains of 70%, 128% and 70%, respectively.\par \par \uc2 But will the financial destiny of the market\u8217\'20\'19s top-10 altcoins always be linked to Bitcoin? So far, the value of ETH and \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) have continued to showcase heavy correlation with BTC whenever the latter witnesses any major market movement. However, Ether may be coming into its own as an independent asset, even though it has yet to break past its 2018 ATH of $1,448.\par \par \uc2 Thor Chan, CEO of \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchange AAX, opined that even though the term \u8220\'20\'1Calt season\u8221\'20\'1D is often used whenever Ether or some other altcoins start to surge, its meaning has changed over time. He pointed to the 2017 market when everything had to do with an explosion in innovation around initial coin offerings and about people \u8220\'20\'1Cgetting rich as quickly as possible.\u8221\'20\'1D Since then, he believes the market has evolved greatly: \u8220\'20\'1CNow, the growth in altcoins is more about portfolio diversification, risk management and rebalancing as traders realize their Bitcoin profits.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 It is worth recognizing that most altcoins, barring a few such as ETH, still largely fall outside the radar of institutional interest. However, with Bitcoin being promoted the way it has been, many mid- to large-scale investors might be looking at ETH and other prominent alts as potential candidates for the next wave of adoption. In this regard, Jay Hao, CEO of cryptocurrency exchange OKEx, highlighted to Cointelegraph:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt is natural that there will be some spillover into other cryptocurrencies with Ethereum being the first in line as a well-established and long-term project in the industry. While BTC most certainly has the strongest brand recognition, Ethereum has not gone unnoticed, being used by the largest FSIs like \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2  and Santander.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 He further noted that Ether has very strong fundamentals and, as a result, has piqued the interest of serious institutional investors, such as \uc2 TD Ameritrade\uc2  and Arca Labs. Not only that, but Ethereum is the platform of choice for many cryptocurrency projects and has been behind the huge DeFi momentum that took off in earnest last year.\par \par \uc2 Hao believes that while Bitcoin has effectively been given the green light, as has Ether to a certain degree, from institutional investors, the same cannot be said for all other cryptocurrencies: \u8220\'20\'1CI don\u8217\'20\'19t believe that we can say with confidence that the alt season will be as large or as long as the previous, as the majority of the institutional dollars are still flowing into BTC.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Is the crypto hype real?\par \par \uc2 While the narrative of \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin being a bubble\u8221\'20\'1D is yet to play out, there are still those from the traditional finance sphere who continue to reiterate the statement as a mantra, hoping that their anti-crypto sentiments do come true at some point.\par \par \uc2 For example, just last month, renowned economist David Rosenberg {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2020-12-17/bitcoin-is-in-a-massive-bubble-economist-rosenberg-says-video"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  Bloomberg that he believes Bitcoin is in a bubble and investors don\u8217\'20\'19t understand how its supply works, adding: \u8220\'20\'1CEverybody seems to believe that we\u8217\'20\'19re going to get to that 21 million cap on the supply constraint, but there\u8217\'20\'19s really nothing in the protocol to suggest that the supply of Bitcoin can\u8217\'20\'19t go up once we hit that limit.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-bitcoin-price-highs-revive-old-misconceptions-about-btc-and-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 New Bitcoin price highs revive old misconceptions about BTC and crypto}}}\par \par \uc2 As a wise man once said, \u8220\'20\'1CFacts don\u8217\'20\'19t care about your feelings,\u8221\'20\'1D as is highlighted by the fact that the crypto industry is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-buys-the-dip-now-has-more-btc-than-us-govt"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seeing unprecedented institutional demand for Bitcoin}}}\uc2 , especially with the entrance of many key players, such as \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2 , Guggenheim, \uc2 SkyBridge Capital\uc2 , Square and \uc2 PayPal\uc2  into the space. Additionally, the \uc2 Office of the Comptroller of the Currency{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/occ-greenlights-national-banks-to-run-nodes-and-stablecoin-networks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 has recently given U.S. banks the authorization}}}\uc2  to treat public blockchains as another form of settlement infrastructure and also allowed for banks to offer custody services of digital assets.\par \par \uc2 When it comes to altcoins, the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest financial derivatives exchange, the Chicago Mercantile Exchange group, has finally announced its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-smashes-past-600-as-cme-unveils-eth-futures-product"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 plans to launch a new ETH futures product}}}\uc2  in early 2021. As a result of this development, come February, traders will have the opportunity to speculate on Ether\u8217\'20\'19s future monetary valuation using a fully regulated setup.\par \par \uc2 The offering, referred to as the CME CF Ether Reference Rate, will help expose crypto to a wide array of investors, traders and investors, allowing for better price discovery and, eventually, increased adoption within institutional circles.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDEvMTRiZTQyODAtMGVjMy00NjQ4LThlYjMtOGIzYzE4NWMzN2FjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210108eh180008d\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/6: BTC, ETH, XRP, LTC,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, BCH, XLM, LINK, BNB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,851 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 January 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin's slow crawl toward $36,000 has given select altcoins the green light to rally higher.\par \par \uc2 Aggressive buying by institutional investors is one of the main reasons for the current Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) bull run. Some investors expressed their intent to hold their positions for a few years, but it is also prudent to note that many of these investors have recently developed a love for Bitcoin and their conviction to HODL may not resemble that of the early Bitcoin whales.\par \par \uc2 The current bull market could also differ from the last as institutional investors simply cannot hold on to their positions if Bitcoin unexpectedly enters a sharp correction. These fund managers will have to face angry clients if Bitcoin's performance wanes, thus it's important to keep a level head when considering the lofty price estimates being thrown out by analysts.\par \par \uc2 Bitpay\u8217\'20\'19s chief commercial officer Sonny Singh said in an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitpay-s-cco-says-bitcoin-could-hit-45k-in-a-month-but-there-s-a-catch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 interview}}}\uc2  with Bloomberg that if Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally continues, the institutional investors may be tempted to lock in their gains and are unlikely to HODL for the long term.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the markets may have to deal with a huge amount of selling, which could result in a sharp fall unless new institutional investors or long-term Bitcoin whales step in and buy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/7a9d4e5b-1d0d-4a7f-9925-80dc019f2666.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 A few {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/overheated-rally-3-warning-signs-emerge-for-bitcoin-as-funding-rate-soars"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 metrics}}}\uc2  such as rising futures open interest and a high funding rate suggest that traders are taking aggressive \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  bets on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally continuing. As has occurred in the past, a sharp downturn in Bitcoin price could result in leveraged players facing a massive long liquidation.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, it only makes sense that at this juncture, traders exercise caution and use proper money management principles to protect their paper profits.\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally toward $36,000 may have slowed down, several altcoins are skyrocketing. Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine the possible target levels on the upside.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The long tails on the Jan. 4 and 5 candlesticks suggest that the bears tried to start a correction but the bulls aggressively purchased the dips. Bitcoin has resumed the uptrend today by pushing the price above the previous all-time high at $34,786.04.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/828f1067-c09c-4c17-b10b-04e2c8742753.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The next target objective on the upside is $37,000 and if that level is scaled, the BTC/USD pair could rise to $45,000.\par \par \uc2 However, the relative strength index (RSI) remains in overbought territory indicating the risk of a correction. The first support on the downside is the 20-day exponential moving average ($28,213).\par \par \uc2 If the pair rebounds off this support, it will suggest that traders continue to buy the dips and that could keep the uptrend intact.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, it could result in panic selling that could sink the pair to the 50-day simple moving average ($22,285).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has resumed the uptrend today as the bulls have pushed the price above the Jan. 4 intraday high at $1,156.456. However, the RSI above 88 suggests that the biggest altcoin is overbought in the short term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/0718c93f-55e8-4053-8492-137bb09c39b5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price does not sustain above $1,156.456, the ETH/USD pair could consolidate in a tight range for a few days before attempting the next trending move.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the pair sustains above $1,156.456, it will suggest that the melt-up is likely to continue. In such a case, the pair may rally to $1,260 and then to $1,420.\par \par \uc2 The pair will signal a possible change in trend if the price turns down and plummets below the $840.93 support.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 While most major altcoins have been surging, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has been languishing near its recent lows, suggesting that traders are not aggressively buying at the current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/870aabf3-c8e0-4d61-92e8-a154efa87a22.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The consolidation also suggests that the bears are taking it easy. This lack of interest from the bulls and the bears could extend the range-bound action for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The next leg of the down move could start if the bears sink the price below the $0.169 support. Such a move could trigger panic selling that may result in a decline to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, a break above the 20-day EMA ($0.30) will be the first sign of strength and the recovery could pick up steam above $0.385.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 After the large range day on Jan. 4, \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) formed an inside day candlestick pattern on Jan. 5, which showed indecision among the bulls and the bears. The uncertainty has resolved to the upside and the bulls are currently attempting to resume the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/e744d5ff-d5e9-4a9f-8501-2a6a27655afe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can propel the price above $173.3312, the LTC/USD pair could rally to $180 and then to $200.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price turns down from $173.3312, then the pair could drop to $140 and remain range-bound between these two levels for a few days.\par \par \uc2 A breakdown below the $140 support and the 20-day EMA ($130) may shift the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is currently in a strong uptrend that has a target objective of $0.40. If this level is scaled, the altcoin could even rally to $0.50. However, the sharp rally since Jan. 3 has pushed the RSI deep into the overbought territory.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/9d2f00ab-dc96-4cdf-b794-5ea25f43a04c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 History suggests that whenever the RSI rises above 80, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair has witnessed a minor correction or consolidation. Therefore, traders may prepare for a minor pullback in the next few days.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls do not give up much ground and the pair rebounds off the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.2757469, it will suggest that traders are not booking profits in a hurry. The bulls could then attempt to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears pull the price below the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.2552813, it will suggest aggressive profit booking at higher levels and such a move could deepen the correction or keep the pair range-bound for a few days.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) recovered from $8.70 on Jan. 4, just above the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $8.4507. This shallow correction suggests traders are aggressively buying on every minor dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/48cdd3eb-c193-446a-8986-ea0ee413e284.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can thrust the price above $10.5169, the DOT/USD pair could pick up momentum and rally to $12.39 and then to $15.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price turns down from $10.5169, the pair may drop to $8.70 and remain range-bound between these two levels for a few days. A consolidation near the overhead resistance is a positive sign and increases the possibility of the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the bears sink the price below $8.70. Such a move could pull the price down to the 20-day EMA ($7.59).\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls did not allow Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) to plummet back below the $370 breakout level on Jan. 4 and 5. This shows accumulation by traders at lower levels. The bulls are currently attempting to resume the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/8a69e2ee-05e3-4f69-bb5c-ea97b6657afb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above $467.67, the BCH/USD pair may rally to the stiff overhead resistance at $515.35.\par \par \uc2 The previous two rallies had reversed direction from the $497 to $515.35 resistance zone. Thus this zone is likely to attract aggressive selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls can absorb the selling and drive the price above $515.35, it may signal the start of a new bull run.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from $467.67, the pair may consolidate between $370 and $467.67 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) has picked up momentum in the past three days. The altcoin broke above the descending channel on Jan. 05 and soared today, pushing the price above the $0.35 overhead resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/f029af3b-52fa-4b2d-87d2-c6c382d5667f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests profit booking above $0.35. The bears will now try to pull the price back below $0.2864. If they succeed, the XLM/USD pair may enter a minor correction.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls flip $0.2864 to support, the pair may resume its uptrend. If the price breaks above $0.391, the rally could extend to $0.50.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($13) on Jan. 4 and the 50-day SMA ($13.07) on Jan. 5, which shows strong buying on dips. The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover, suggesting buyers are in control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/b61e033e-253b-48a9-b839-271ec4275dba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can sustain the LINK/USD pair above $16.39, the rally could extend to $20.1111. The bears are likely to defend this resistance aggressively.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls do not give up much ground, the possibility of a break above $20.1111 increases and the next target objective on the upside is $25.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current levels or the overhead resistance and breaks below the $13.28 support. Such a move will suggest a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) made a long-legged Doji candlestick pattern on Jan. 4 and followed it up with an inside day candlestick pattern on Jan. 5 that had a long tail. This suggests that the bears tried to pull the price down but the bulls purchased at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/0b1c2e8d-dac1-4db9-ad21-6f629ef9f0d2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers can drive the price above $43.2039, the BNB/USD pair may resume the uptrend and rally to $50. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the overbought territory suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the pair again turns down from the overhead resistance level and breaks below $38, it will suggest that the bears have overpowered the bulls. That could result in a correction to $32.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDEvOTBlMmFjMTYtMWI1Yi00MWUxLWFmMWEtYzRhNDI1NzRlOWNlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210106eh16000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/4: BTC, ETH, XRP, LTC, DOT, BCH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, LINK, BSV\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,880 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 January 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 After today\u8217\'20\'19s sharp downside move, Bitcoin and altcoins could trade in a sideways range as bulls and bears fight to control the market\u8217\'20\'19s momentum.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price plunged by about $3,400 in an hour, warning traders that corrections during a parabolic move are likely to be sharp. Data from Glassnode shows that the fall resulted in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-dip-to-27k-costs-binance-long-traders-a-record-190m-in-liquidations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 liquidation}}}\uc2  of Bitcoin futures long positions worth about $190 million on Binance within an hour, the largest to date.\par \par \uc2 In a strong uptrend, corrections are swift but short-lived because investors who expect the rally to continue use the dips to buy.\par \par \uc2 Binance US CEO Catherine Coley believes the Bitcoin could {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-us-ceo-predicts-100k-bitcoin-by-2022"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 climb}}}\uc2  to \u8220\'20\'1C$75,000 to $100,000\u8221\'20\'1D by the end of this year. Meanwhile, investor Raoul Paul is even more {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/mike-novogratz-attributes-btc-s-rise-past-30k-to-institutional-adoption"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 positive}}}\uc2  as he anticipates Bitcoin to hit anywhere between \u8220\'20\'1C$400,000 to $1.2 million\u8221\'20\'1D in 2021 if the bull trend continues.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/7a4af1ce-ee8c-4543-8066-ea7ac837a2be.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The huge \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  projection in BTC price is largely due to the institutional adoption of Bitcoin. In a recent interview with BBC, \uc2 Galaxy Digital\uc2  founder and CEO \uc2 Mike Novogratz\uc2  said: \u8220\'20\'1CAs the institutions move in, there just is not a lot of supply [...] There are a lot more than 21 million millionaires out there.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 While the retail traders may have missed out on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally, they are coming back with a vengeance by buying altcoins that have surged to multiyear highs in the past few days. This has pulled Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s dominance to below 69%.\par \par \uc2 However, will the rally in Bitcoin and the altcoins continue or is it time for a few days of consolidation or correction? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin's most recent leg of the uptrend had pushed the relative strength index (RSI) deep into the overbought territory, suggesting frenzied buying by the traders. Usually, such a phase is followed by a shakeout and that is what happened today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/b7fa0627-1eb6-49c3-8b67-fb3d1b17dbad.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USD pair plummeted to an intraday low at $27,762.34, just below the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $28,382.75. This sharp fall was aggressively purchased by the bulls as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls manage to sustain the price above the 20-day exponential moving average ($26,737), it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and the bulls are buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 However, after the large range day today, the pair may enter a period of consolidation for a few days before starting the next trending move. The pair may remain range-bound between $34,786.04 and $26,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that traders are rushing to the exit and that could pull the pair to the 50-day simple moving average at $21,578.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) easily surmounted the $800 to $840.93 overhead resistance on Jan. 3, which shows aggressive buying by the bulls. The momentum continued today and the biggest altcoin reached an intraday high at $1,156.456.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/afd05967-57db-4c53-b19d-e723247a8552.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can sustain the price above $1,000, it will increase the prospects for a rally to $1,260 and then to the all-time high at $1,420.\par \par \uc2 However, the long upper and lower shadows on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggest profit booking at higher levels and accumulation at lower levels. After the large range today, the ETH/USD pair may consolidate in a tight range for a few days before starting the next trending move.\par \par \uc2 If the price does not dip below $840.93, it will suggest that traders are not closing their positions. In such a case, the bulls may attempt to resume the uptrend. This positive view will invalidate if the pair breaks below the 20-day EMA ($731).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  is currently consolidating in a downtrend. After a sharp fall, if the price fails to rebound, it suggests a lack of urgency among traders to buy. A consolidation near the support increases the risk of a breakdown.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/152be209-edf1-415f-b557-4199fa135ed2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.322) and the RSI near the overbought territory suggest that the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below the $0.169 support, the XRP/USD pair could resume the downtrend towards the next target at $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the consolidation resolves to the upside and the pair rises above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the selling has exhausted and a relief rally may be underway.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the $124.1278 support on Jan. 2 and resumed the uptrend. The altcoin surged above the first target objective at $160 and hit an intraday high at $173.3312 today where it witnessed profit booking.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/58f3d967-d39c-4e39-808e-daf1595f0591.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the positive thing is that the bulls aggressively purchased the dip to $140, which suggests that the sentiment remains positive. The rising moving averages and the RSI close to the overbought territory suggest bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 After the large range day today, \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  may contract and the LTC/USD pair may consolidate in a tight range for the next few days.\par \par \uc2 If bulls can push the price above $173.3312, the pair could rally to $184.7940. The first sign of weakness will be a break below the 20-day EMA ($122.96).\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) resumed the uptrend when it broke above the $9.50 to $9.89 overhead resistance on Jan. 3, but the rally hit a roadblock above $10.50 from where the price reversed direction today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/8c9af732-625c-4c3d-aa55-fa68c04b7250.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If traders buy the dip to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $8.4507, it will indicate strength. The bulls will then try to resume the uptrend. If they can push the price above $9.50, a retest of $10.5169 will be on the cards.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bears sink the price below the $8.4507 support, the correction could extend to the 50% retracement level at $7.8125. A break below this support will suggest that the momentum has weakened.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($340.94) on Jan. 2 and soared above the $370 overhead resistance on Jan. 3. That opened the gates for a rally to the $497 to $515.35 resistance zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/7227b08a-8f73-4bcc-8c6f-f14728e3f4c8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, traders aggressively booked profits at higher levels today, which has dragged the price back towards the breakout level at $370.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory suggest that bulls have the upper hand. If the BCH/USD pair rebounds off this support, the bulls may again attempt to push the price to $515.35.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated if the bears sink and sustain the price below $353. Such a move will suggest that the markets have rejected the higher levels and that could lead to a range-bound action.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($0.173) on Jan. 2 and resumed the uptrend on Jan.3 when it broke above $0.1966315. Today, the altcoin surged to an intraday high at $0.2399022, but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/8adeba34-889c-4a95-9c31-fe1aa488e628.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The Doji candlestick pattern today suggests indecision among the bulls and the bears. While the bears are selling at higher levels, the bulls continue to buy on dips.\par \par \uc2 After the large range day today, the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  could subside in the next few days as the bulls and the bears battle it out for supremacy.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI close to the overbought zone suggest advantage to the bulls. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair may resume its up-move if the bulls can sustain the price above $0.21.\par \par \uc2 A break below the 20-day EMA will be the first sign of weakness and the correction could deepen if the 50-day SMA ($0.155) support cracks.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down sharply from the $43.2029 levels today, which suggests profit booking at higher levels. However, the upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive zone suggest that the trend remains up.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/a7f56474-2ffc-4909-80a1-256012fbc0b5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA ($35), it will suggest that traders continue to accumulate on dips. The bulls will then try to resume the uptrend and propel the price to the target objective at $50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bears sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the momentum has weakened and traders are not buying on dips. That could pull the price down to $32 and result in a few days of range-bound action.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) broke above the descending channel and the $13.28 overhead resistance on Jan. 3. This opened the doors for a rally to $16.39 and the altcoin hit an intraday high at $15.644 today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/e8dbcdf7-2fa4-47e7-93fc-dc58970db9bf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the long wick on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that traders aggressively booked profits at higher levels but the positive sign is that the LINK/USD pair found buying support near the 20-day EMA ($12.36).\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above $13.28, the bulls will again try to push the price to $16.39 and then to $20.1111. Conversely, if the price slides below the moving averages, the pair may drop to $11.29 and then to $10.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 The long wick on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that the bulls failed to sustain Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) above the $181 overhead resistance as the bears defended this level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/0817a65a-21fa-41b2-81c0-2b2907713f13.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price has currently dropped below the moving averages. If the bears sink the price below $160, the BSV/USD pair may drop to the support of the range at $146.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the current levels and rises above $175, the bulls will make one more attempt to propel the pair above $181. If they succeed, a rally to $215 is possible.\par \par \uc2 However, the flat moving averages and the RSI just below the midpoint are not signaling an advantage either to the bulls or the bears.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDEvYmFmMjJlYjctMmJmMC00Mjc0LThjZWEtZTYyNjViMDNiYTIxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210104eh14000dz\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin Price\par \b \uc2 Ethereum targets $1K after ETH, altcoins rally versus Bitcoin\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 466 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 January 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 ETH is making serious inroads in both BTC and USD terms in what a Cointelegraph analyst says is a classic sign that altcoins are coming back from the dead.\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has broken a critical price point against Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), signalling that altcoins may be about to see huge gains.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/1861be88-ee9a-4fc5-998e-0d2b24572b8e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrency market overview. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 I'd take Ether bet "all day long" \u8212\'20\'14 Winklevoss\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed ETH/BTC pass the essential 0.026 level in just one daily candle on Jan. 3.\par \par \uc2 After staying weak throughout December, Ether has rebounded in the first few days of 2021, and Sunday's performance could be the start of something much bigger.\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph Markets analyst {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/authors/michael-van-de-poppe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe}}}\uc2  noted last week, 0.026 BTC is a significant breakout point, and flipping it to support {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-tumbles-below-600-as-xrp-debacle-takes-a-toll-on-altcoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 indicates}}}\uc2  "strength and continuation" of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  resurgence.\par \par \uc2 "It\u8217\'20\'19s time for #Ethereum, #Polkadot, #Cardano, #Chainlink and more to break all-time highs," he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1345659279727067138"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2 Twitter\uc2  followers on Sunday.\par \par \uc2 "I do believe that we're seeing money shift from BTC towards altcoins and that Ether has bottomed out on the BTC pair," explained Van de Poppe. "So probably continuation of altseason in this quarter with the topping out of Bitcoin dominance." He added:\par \par \uc2 "But hey, a Bitcoin correction would be appreciated too."\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/0541fbbf-5a90-4f76-a39a-c19cd517824f.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/BTC 1-day candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 At press time, ETH/USD was approaching landmark price levels of its own, taking aim at $1,000 on the back of 21% daily gains. The last time that the pair traded at four figures was in January 2018.\par \par \uc2 "$ETH was the best performing asset (up 450%) of 2020 hands down and still below its all-time high," Cameron Winklevoss, entrepreneur and co-founder of exchange Gemini, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/cameron/status/1345148329840132097"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2  on \uc2 Twitter\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "Today it\u8217\'20\'19s the equivalent of 15K #Bitcoin I would take that bet all day long."\par \par \uc2 Altseason is here at least?\par \par \uc2 With the prospect of "altseason" now firmly {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/4-reasons-why-ethereum-options-traders-expect-eth-price-to-reach-880"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 back on the menu}}}\uc2 , top ten market cap altcoins are showing signs of life against Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) is up 18% against the largest cryptocurrency, while Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) is 13.3% higher and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) 9.7%.\par \par \uc2 Even {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2 , still struggling on the back of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/moneygram-distances-itself-from-ripple-says-it-doesn-t-utilize-ripplenet"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 legal action against Ripple}}}\uc2 , is finding its feet again with 3.5% daily progress in BTC terms. Bitcoin's overall market cap dominance remains above 70%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/6704e698-91f4-4a52-88b9-c5252127963a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin market cap dominance historical chart. Source: CoinMarketCap\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-tumbles-below-600-as-xrp-debacle-takes-a-toll-on-altcoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , meanwhile, a longer-term commitment to altcoins may also prove lucrative this year. Mining Ether, for example, could net over $120,000 per annum.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDEvODU1ZDJiY2ItMjY2MC00NmUzLTkwMmQtYzBjMDk5ODAxYmU5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210103eh130008g\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/1: BTC, ETH, XRP, LTC, DOT, BCH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, LINK, BSV\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,908 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 January 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is in a melt-up that could top out at $37,000 and lift many altcoins with it\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) rallied from an intraday low at $17,573.29 on Dec. 11 to an intraday high at $29,310.19 on Dec. 31, a 66.78% rally in a short span. This shows strong demand from traders at every higher level.\par \par \uc2 Institutional crypto investment giant Grayscale {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-supply-squeeze-heats-up-as-grayscale-buys-nearly-3x-the-btc-mined-in-december"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bought}}}\uc2  72,950 Bitcoin in December, which was 159.49% more than the 28,112 Bitcoin mined during that period, according to data from Coin98 Analytics.\par \par \uc2 It is not only the institutions buying \u8212\'20\'14 a strong bull run also attracts speculators and momentum traders who try to piggyback on the up-move. This can be seen from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/high-volume-surge-propels-bitcoin-price-to-a-new-all-time-high-at-29-000"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the surge in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s transaction volume}}}\uc2  in December 2020, according to on-chain analytics resource Digital Assets Data.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/8cddb121-df68-42ea-bb34-bed86558e4a8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, at some level, buyers will stop chasing prices higher, and that could cause the rally to turn down. When it does, the speculators and momentum traders may rush to the exit, and the buyers are likely to wait for lower levels to purchase again. This scenario could result in a sharp pullback. Hence, traders should employ suitable risk management strategies.\par \par \uc2 In a strong bull run, traders may watch the resistance levels for signs of a possible turnaround, but when the levels are scaled with ease, it shows that the trend remains strong. Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to identify the critical resistance levels on the upside.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is in a strong uptrend, and traders are buying every intraday dip without waiting for a deeper correction. The long-legged Doji candlestick pattern on Dec. 31 suggests that bears tried to start a correction but the bulls bought the dip aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/34a121fd-5fdf-4df6-a6c4-36be08c27862.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the strong up-move of the past few days has pushed the relative strength index (RSI) deep into the overbought territory. This suggests the BTC/USD pair could enter a minor consolidation or correction near the $30,000 mark.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls drive the price above $30,000, the pair could continue its rally and rise to $37,000. But with every leg up, the risk to the downside increases.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $30,000, the pair could drop to the 20-day exponential moving average ($24,842). A strong rebound off this level will suggest that the uptrend remains intact, but a break below it could pull the pair down to the 50-day simple moving average ($20,614).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been facing resistance near the $750 level for the past few days, but the positive sign is that the bulls have not given up much ground. This suggests that traders are not booking profits aggressively, as they expect the uptrend to resume.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/91f65da4-56ad-4792-aabf-4f94e539e96e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push and sustain the price above $750, the ETH/USD pair may rally to $800 where the bears may again try to stall the uptrend. The rising moving averages and the RSI near the overbought zone suggest that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 However, if the pair dips below $717, the correction could deepen to the 20-day EMA ($663). If the price rebounds off this support, it will suggest that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, a break below the 20-day EMA will suggest that traders are not buying the dips and are booking profits aggressively. That could signal the start of a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  formed an inside day candlestick pattern on Dec. 30 and 31, which shows indecision among the bulls and bears. The uncertainty resolved to the upside today, and the bulls have started a relief rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/c4239ff9-db34-4d1b-b632-97a335ad425f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 In a strong downtrend, traders use rallies to establish short positions or close their long positions. The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI near the overbought territory suggest that bears are in command.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, the current attempt to move up may face strong resistance at the 20-day EMA ($0.357). If the price turns down from this level, the bears will try to resume the downtrend. If they can sink the price below $0.172536, the XRP/USD pair could fall to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated if the bears push the price above the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest that selling has exhausted, and a few days of range-bound action could follow.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has held above $124.1278 for the past few days, which suggests that the bulls are attempting to flip this level to support. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive zone suggest that the bulls are in control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/100647b3-2446-4723-9a80-c4e54ed42c9e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can propel the price above the $140 resistance, the LTC/USD pair may resume its uptrend. The bears may again try to stall the rally at the psychological resistance at $150, but if this level is scaled, the up-move could reach $160.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bears sink and sustain the price below $124.1278, the pair may drop to the 20-day EMA ($113.79).\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will again try to resume the uptrend. However, a break below the 20-day EMA will open up the possibilities for a deeper correction to the 50-day SMA ($91.96).\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) resumed its up-move after a one-day minor correction on Dec. 30. The 28.145% rally on Dec. 31 shows that the altcoin is backed by strong momentum.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/296ccaf5-c385-472e-a79c-93bc9ae124c9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the uptrend has pushed the RSI into the overbought territory, and the bears are currently trying to stall the up-move in the $9.51 to $10 overhead resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 If the DOT/USD pair again witnesses a minor correction and turns up from the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $7.7614, it will suggest that traders are not closing their positions in a hurry and are buying on every minor dip. This may push the pair to $11.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears pull the price below $7.7614, a retest of the breakout level at $6.8619 is possible.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the $370 overhead resistance on Dec. 28 and slipped below the $353 support on Dec. 31. The bulls are currently attempting to sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($323).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/5db9e4a3-a597-4fbb-b649-94dde00ff6ca.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current levels, the bulls will make one more attempt to drive the price above $370. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive zone suggest that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above $370 could resume the up-move, and the BCH/USD pair could reach $430 and then $500. This positive view will be invalidated and the pair may remain stuck in the range if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  has been holding above the $0.175 support for the past two days, which suggests that the bulls have been purchasing the dips to this level. However, the failure to resume the up-move indicates that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/59f97cf4-0795-4c23-b54c-acd1baa81577.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The range has contracted for the past two days, and soon, this will be followed by a range expansion. If the range resolves to the upside and the bulls push the price above $0.1966315, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair could rally to $0.22 and then to $0.235.\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the RSI in the positive zone suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside. This positive view will be invalidated if the bears sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.165). If that happens, it will suggest that the recent breakout was a bull trap.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) did not even correct to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of the latest leg of the rally, and it turned up from $36.5157 on Dec. 31. This suggests that traders aggressively bought the dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/266b776d-a66f-470a-8a8e-45578b5f3fc1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above the $40 resistance, the BNB/USD pair could resume its rally and reach $45 and then $50. The rising moving averages and the RSI near the overbought territory indicate bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price again turns down from $40, the pair may remain range-bound between $35.69 and $40 for a few days. The trend could change if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($34).\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink's LINK is trading inside a descending channel. The failure of the bears to sink and sustain the price below the $11.29 support has attracted buyers today who are attempting to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($12.13).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/795636ca-8917-4810-9cae-9ed6851d35aa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the LINK/USD pair could rise to the resistance line of the channel. A break above the channel and the $13.28 resistance could start a new uptrend that could reach $16.39.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price turns down from the current levels or the resistance line of the channel, then the bears will again try to break the $11.29 support. If they manage to do that, the pair could drop to $10 and then to the support line of the channel near $9.60.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are struggling to push Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bsv-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($167), and the bears are not able to sustain the price below $160. This suggests a balance between supply and demand, but this tight range action may not continue for long.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-01/2d5aa564-d84e-4d00-8462-3dc43cfaca53.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls push the price above the moving averages, the BSV/USD pair could rally to $181 where the bears are likely to mount a stiff resistance. If the price turns down from this level, the range-bound action is likely to extend for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the pair dips below $160, the pair could drop to $146 where the buyers may step in. A strong bounce could keep the price inside the angle for some more time. The indicators are not showing a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDEvOGIxNjE2OTQtNjIwOC00ZDYzLWFhOTctNjdhNGJlZjkxZDI3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210101eh11000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/30: BTC, ETH, XRP, LTC, BCH, DOT,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, LINK, BSV\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,814 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 December 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price continues to chase after $30,000 but continued rejections below the key level is negatively impacting altcoin prices.\par \par \uc2 On-chain data suggests that high-net-worth individuals continued to buy Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) after Christmas. Analysts at Santiment said that smaller traders sold about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whales-are-buying-more-aggressively-since-christmas-data-finds"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $647 million}}}\uc2  worth of Bitcoin and this sum may have been bought up by Bitcoin whales.\par \par \uc2 Data also signals that large investors have been buying and holding their purchases throughout 2020, without booking profits in an aggressive manner. According to Glassnode analysts, this has caused the number of Bitcoin in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-liquidity-crisis-btc-is-becoming-harder-to-buy-on-exchanges-data-shows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 circulation}}}\uc2  to decline by about 1 million.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/9b60f281-a8e2-490b-97c6-9a8fc3d94846.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 That means, out of the total available supply, 14.5 million Bitcoin are considered illiquid. Glassnode analysts say that this leaves only 4.2 million Bitcoin in constant circulation that are available for trading..\par \par \uc2 This could further increase the imbalance in the demand and supply equation boosting Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price higher.\par \par \uc2 However, every bull market goes through periodic corrections and Bitcoin may also be due for one. Therefore, traders should weigh the risks before buying at the current levels.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find the altcoins that may join Bitcoin in the breakout.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin had formed a gravestone Doji candlestick pattern on Dec. 27 but the bears could not pull the price down on Dec. 28. The bears again tried to start a correction on Dec. 29 but the hammer candlestick formation suggests strong buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/559b7cfe-bfb7-4c7e-86fe-01d08f23d9eb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls have pushed the BTC/USD pair to a new all-time high at $28,587.67 today. This suggests that the uptrend has resumed. The next level to watch on the upside is the psychological barrier at $30,000.\par \par \uc2 Although the rising moving averages suggest an advantage to the bulls, the relative strength index (RSI) has risen deep into overbought territory, which suggests that a correction could be around the corner.\par \par \uc2 Overbought levels at the start of a rally is a sign of accumulation, but after a mature rally, an RSI above 80 suggests buying due to FOMO and this usually leads to a correction. Therefore, traders should remain cautious and protect their paper profits with a suitable stop-loss.\par \par \uc2 A break below $25,800 could signal the start of a deeper correction to the 20-day exponential moving average ($23,836) and then to the 50-day simple moving average ($20,077).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) formed an inside day long-legged Doji candlestick pattern on Dec. 29. This suggests that the bears tried to pull the price down but the bulls absorbed all the selling and staged a strong recovery by the end of the day.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/0551cf2e-ca57-411c-8aa7-baaa450e62d9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently attempting to push the price above $750 but the Doji candlestick pattern suggests indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 If this uncertainty resolves to the upside and the ETH/USD pair rises above $750, the uptrend could reach $800 where the bears may again mount a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI near the overbought territory suggest that bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls fail to drive the price above $750, the pair could attract profit booking by the short-term traders. If the bears sink the price below $$680, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($645).\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off the 20-day EMA will suggest that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are buying on dips. On the other hand, a break below the 20-day EMA may signal the start of a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  continues to be in a strong downtrend and every attempt to start a relief rally is facing aggressive selling by the bears. The altcoin dipped to $0.172536 on Dec. 29 but the long tail on the candlestick suggests that bulls are attempting to defend this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/cadb38fb-f496-44f0-922a-6d0192673dfd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The relief rally could face stiff resistance at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.358202. If the price turns down from this level, the bears will again try to resume the downtrend. A break below $0.172536 could result in a fall to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls defend the $0.169 support, the XRP/USD pair could consolidate in a tight range for a few days before starting the next trending move.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls have managed to keep \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) above the $124.1278 support for the past few days but the failure to resume the uptrend suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/ce5a632f-6136-4965-9899-1bd61ee1bd22.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 When the price fails to rise, it could attract selling by short-term traders and that may pull the price down to the 20-day EMA ($110).\par \par \uc2 If the LTC/USD pair rebounds off this support, the bulls will again try to resume the uptrend. If they succeed in driving the price above $140, the pair could rally to $160.\par \par \uc2 However, the RSI has formed a negative divergence, which suggests that the momentum is weakening. A break below the 20-day EMA could drag the price down to $95.40.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) is struggling to rise above the $370 overhead resistance but the positive thing is that the price has not given up much ground. This suggests that traders are not closing their positions in a hurry.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/5f103963-b175-4edc-8ab0-ca8405404abd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI above 60 suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If the bulls can push and sustain the price above $370, the BCH/USD pair may rise to $430 and then to $500.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be negated if the pair drops below the 20-day EMA ($317). Such a move could keep the pair range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) soared above the $5.60 to $6.0857 overhead resistance zone on Dec. 28 and followed it up with another sharp up-move on Dec. 29 that carried the altcoin to $7.70, just above the $7.67 target objective mentioned in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-12-28-btc-eth-xrp-ltc-bch-dot-ada-bnb-link-xlm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous}}}\uc2  analysis.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/43461dfe-fbe8-4023-ad6d-507d743b8a95.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are currently attempting to defend the $7.70 level but the long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests aggressive buying by the bulls on intraday dips.\par \par \uc2 If the price does not drop below the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement of $6.6428, the DOT/USD pair could resume the uptrend, with the next target at $10.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bears pull the price below $6.6428, a drop to $6.3163 and then to $5.9897 is possible. Such a move will suggest that the momentum has weakened and that could keep the pair range-bound for a few days.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke above the $0.175 to $0.1826315 overhead resistance zone on Dec. 29 but the bulls have not been able to sustain the breakout. The price has dipped back below $0.1826315 today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/d9d01adc-90fa-4de6-89d4-54fc6ffbc8a3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive zone suggest that bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 If the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair rebounds off the current levels, it will suggest that $0.175 has flipped to support. The bulls will then try to push the price above $0.1966315, which could result in a rally to $0.22 and then to $0.235.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price dips and sustains below $0.175. Such a move could result in a drop to the 20-day EMA ($0.161).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) closed above the $35.69 overhead resistance on Dec. 28 and followed it up with another sharp up-move on Dec. 29 that pushed the price to a new all-time high at $39.99.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/a49a25dc-d342-4825-9a96-acefc191c2d3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the RSI in the positive zone suggest that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 The bears are currently attempting to stall the up-move near $40 but if the price does not dip below $35.69, it will increase the possibility of the resumption of the uptrend. If that happens, the BNB/USD pair could rise to $50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price dips back below $35.69, a drop to the 20-day EMA ($33) is likely.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls could not propel Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) above the $13.28 overhead resistance on Dec. 27 and the altcoin turned down on Dec. 29. The bears are currently attempting to sink the price below the $11.29 support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/a53337bb-e039-44bd-bca7-ec6c67017dea.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the LINK/USD pair could drop to $10 and if this support also gives way, the decline may extend to $8. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($12.24) and the failure of the RSI to sustain above 50 suggests that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated if the pair rebounds off the current levels and rises above the $13.28 resistance. If that happens, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. The pair could then rally to $16.39.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) has been range-bound between $146 and $181 for the past few weeks. The flat moving averages and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/db07632c-fb64-463c-8d60-7451667469fa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 In a well-defined range, traders buy the dips to the support and sell near the resistance. Thus, the BSV/USD pair may rebound off $146 and extend its stay inside the range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The longer the consolidation, the stronger will be the breakout from it. If the pair rises above the moving averages, the bulls will once again try to push the price above $181. If they succeed, a rally to $216 and then to $227 is possible.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bears sink the price below $146, the trend will shift in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjAtMTIvOWE0NzBkMjgtMzkzMC00YTllLTlkZjItNTE5N2EyYWNiZmE4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020201230egcu000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/28: BTC, ETH, XRP, LTC, BCH, DOT,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, LINK, XLM\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,812 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 December 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is facing selling near $27,000, but several altcoins have seen fresh buying that has propelled them above their overhead resistance levels.\par \par \uc2 Several central banks have resorted to unprecedented monetary expansion and aggressive rate cuts to support their respective economies badgered by the coronavirus pandemic. Record liquidity has resulted in sharp rallies in the S&P 500, gold, and Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), which suggests that investors are plowing money into assets of their choice.\par \par \uc2 While gold is way below its all-time high set in August, both the S&P 500 and Bitcoin are near their all-time high.\par \par \uc2 The last five trading days of the year and the first two of the next year have historically been \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the S&P 500, dubbed as the "{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Santa_Claus_rally"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Santa Rally}}}\uc2 ." It will be interesting to see whether Bitcoin continues its Santa rally into 2021 with the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whales-selling-to-institutions-as-grayscale-adds-7-188-btc-in-24-hours"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 arrival of institutional investors}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/f66c3e62-c99e-4b02-b023-e8e404f61320.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Another interesting thing to note is that Bitcoin has rallied from a low at $10,377.10 in October to a high at $28,419.94 in December, a 173.87% rally in three months. Although the sentiment is \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the institutional inflows are accelerating, every bull market witnesses strong corrections and Bitcoin is unlikely to be an exception.\par \par \uc2 Traders should protect their paper profits and not get carried away with greed because corrections after vertical rallies can be ruthless. Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine the overhead levels that may act as a strong resistance that can trigger a correction.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin formed a Doji candlestick pattern on Dec. 27 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-crashes-by-6-5-in-minutes-after-hitting-28-4k-sell-wall"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 with a long wick}}}\uc2 , which suggests profit booking above the $27,000 level. The bulls are again struggling to sustain the price above $27,000 today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/801d72dc-bb09-498b-8eee-6e28d7037409.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the price below $25,819.69, the BTC/USD pair could drop to the immediate support at $24,302.50 and then to the 20-day exponential moving average at $22,951.\par \par \uc2 A strong bounce off this support will suggest that the uptrend remains intact and the bulls are buying on dips. If that happens, the bulls will attempt to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest the formation of a short-term top. The correction could then deepen to the 50-day simple moving average at $19,577.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls push and sustain the price above $28,419.94, the pair {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/altseason-and-30k-in-sight-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-as-2020-ends"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 could rally to $30,000}}}\uc2 , which is likely to act as a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 50-day SMA ($566) on Dec. 23, which suggests that the bulls are accumulating on dips. The buyers again pushed the price back above $622.807 on Dec. 25, indicating that the correction could be over.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/c0cdd80e-1c83-4e36-9995-6419880f4d27.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USD pair picked up momentum on Dec. 27 and cleared the $676.325 overhead resistance. This suggests that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-surges-past-730-what-comes-next-after-the-massive-rally"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the uptrend has resumed}}}\uc2 . The next target objective on the upside is $800.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) close to the overbought territory suggest that bulls are in command. This positive view will invalidate if the pair turns down and plummets below the $622.807 support.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  is in a downtrend. The altcoin broke below the critical support at $0.435 on Dec. 23 and this intensified the selling, resulting in a sharp fall to $0.2132.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/05e76275-be0c-47ce-acf5-c1b933ea4cb2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.426) and the RSI in the negative territory suggest that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 When the sentiment is \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , minor rallies are sold into and that is what happened on Dec. 25. The XRP/USD pair turned down from $0.384998, just above the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of the most recent leg of the decline.\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls are currently trying to keep the pair above the $0.25 support. If they succeed, the pair may remain range-bound between $0.25 and $0.38 for a few more days. The first sign of strength will be a break above the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) broke above a flag pattern and the overhead resistance at $124.1278 on Dec. 25, which indicated the resumption of the uptrend. The breakout of this setup has a target objective of $160.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/aa7f7b62-2283-4ab5-971c-4732ab0e0e08.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are not willing to throw in the towel as they are currently attempting to stall the up-move at the $140 overhead resistance. If they can sink and sustain the price below 124.1278, a drop to the 20-day EMA ($107) may be on the cards.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bulls can defend the $124.1278 level, it will suggest that this level has flipped to support. That could enhance the prospects of a break above the $140 to $145 overhead resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the RSI near the overbought territory suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently trying to propel Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) above the $370 overhead resistance. If they succeed, it will be a huge positive because during the previous two attempts, the price had quickly reversed direction from this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/fbcc2823-ed4a-4323-85a9-de2bffdcefb7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI above 64 suggest that bulls are in command. If they can drive the price above $$370 and sustain the breakout, the BCH/USD pair could rise to $409 and then to $430.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bears again defend the $370 resistance and the price turns down sharply, it could keep the pair range-bound between $370 and $255 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) had been trading in a range between $3.53 and $5.60 for the past few weeks. The bulls have pushed the price above the $5.60 to $6.0857 overhead resistance zone today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/dd149508-14b6-4ffd-aff0-44cf6ee62ffe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can sustain the price above $6.0857, it will suggest the start of a new uptrend that could retest $6.8619 and then rally to $7.67. The gradually upsloping moving averages and the RSI above 68 suggest bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to defend the $6.8619 level aggressively but if the bulls do not allow the price to dip below $6, it will suggest that the uptrend remains intact. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the DOT/USD pair re-enters $5.60.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the $0.13 support on Dec. 24 and the bulls have been sustaining the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.154) since then. This is a positive sign as it prepares a launchpad to thrust the price above the $0.175 to $0.1826315 overhead resistance zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/a5c3dc05-f7e6-48da-bd41-6542d9d6e3bb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The RSI has risen into positive territory and the 20-day EMA has started to turn up gradually. This suggests that bulls are attempting to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above the overhead resistance zone, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair could resume the uptrend and rally to $0.22 and then to $0.235.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the pair again turns down from $0.175, it could extend its stay inside the range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently attempting to propel Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the $35.69 overhead resistance. If they succeed, the altcoin could resume the uptrend and rally to the all-time high at $39.5941.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/472ec693-c624-4ff0-9389-e33819ade7e4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to mount a stiff resistance at the all-time high but the upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory suggest that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above $39.5941, the BNB/USD pair could pick up momentum and start its journey towards $50.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the price turns down from the current levels and plummets below the 50-day SMA ($30). Such a move will suggest profit-booking at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) plummeted to $8.05 on Dec. 23 but rebounded strongly from the lower levels as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. The bulls again bought the dips on Dec. 24, indicating strong demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/2283b9ed-6f92-4422-8195-8f9fe36b82cb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to sustain the LINK/USD pair below $11.29 attracted buying from the bulls who pushed the price to $13.2448 on Dec. 27. However, the bears are in no mood to relent as they sold close to $13.28 as seen from the long wick on the candlestick.\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have flattened out and the RSI is just below the midpoint, which suggests a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 The bulls may gain an upper hand if they push and sustain the price above the downtrend line. Conversely, a break below $10 will suggest advantage to the bears.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently attempting to sustain Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) above the $0.14 support. However, any rise from the current levels could face selling at the downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.159) and then at $0.17.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/9075cdea-a668-4605-b036-ac8fa21f8f75.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, it increases the likelihood of a break below $0.14. The next support on the downside is at $0.11 and then $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls can push the price above $0.17, the XLM/USD pair may move up to the downtrend line. The sentiment is likely to remain negative as long as the price remains inside the descending triangle pattern.\par \par \uc2 A break above the downtrend line of the triangle will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup and that could result in a rally to $0.231655.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjAtMTIvNmM0NTg5ZTYtN2JmMC00MjI4LThhZmUtNzM2NzViZjhhZDFhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020201228egcs000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 2021 price outlook: BTC, ETH, XRP, LTC, BCH, LINK,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, DOT, XLM\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 2,277 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 December 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 It's a rosy outlook for Bitcoin and several altcoins as the cryptocurrency market is ending 2020 on a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  note.\par \par \uc2 The year 2020 was a forgettable one for many reasons including lockdowns and economic restrictions. The shutdowns resulted in the worst economic crisis seen in decades. At the same time, most governments and central banks have responded with unprecedented fiscal stimulus and monetary expansion measures to revive their economies.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, institutional investors who are wary of potential inflation \u8212\'20\'14 and possibly even hyperinflation \u8212\'20\'14 as a result, are scrambling to hedge their portfolios with assets that can protect them from gradual currency depreciation. Until now, gold was considered the best store of wealth, and it has not disappointed investors as it is up about 24% year-to-date.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/e018af0a-e15b-45df-9924-0d954856c3e1.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC vs. Gold vs. S&P500 2020 performance. Source: Ecoinometrics\par \par \uc2 However, this year has seen an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutions-rushing-into-19k-bitcoin-as-gbtc-premium-hits-6-month-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 influx of institutional investors}}}\uc2  into Bitcoin, whose gains have been increasingly difficult to ignore, particularly versus gold and the S&P500, as shown in the chart above. Some institutions have diversified their portfolios with Bitcoin while others even {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/record-gold-outflow-isn-t-going-into-ripples-only-bitcoin-says-fund-manager"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reduced their gold holdings}}}\uc2  to invest in Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 With Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s massive 244% rally this year, portfolios of several investors who had purchased early {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/portfolios-with-bitcoin-allocation-outperform-traditional-investments"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 will certainly outperform}}}\uc2  those without BTC exposure. This trend will force other investors to take note, increasing the possibility of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally to be more sustainable this time around, which may become a rising tide that may also lift other cryptocurrencies with it.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the long-term charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies and spot the critical levels that may pose stiff resistance. While such technical levels may not necessarily mark the top, they can be useful for traders to make informed decisions.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is in a clear uptrend and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hits-25-000-all-time-high-milestone-surpassing-visa-s-market-cap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 is now in price discovery}}}\uc2  after breaking the all-time high made in 2017. Since clearing the $20,000 resistance, the rally has been sharp and that has pushed the relative strength index (RSI) deep into overbought territory.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/c3a057f4-a2a9-458e-8afd-24ed02147e6b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 History shows that deeply overbought levels on the relative strength index (RSI) have resulted in sharp corrections. Therefore, the bears may try to pull down the price from the $25,000 psychological resistance.\par \par \uc2 The critical level to watch on the downside is $20,000. If the bulls succeed in flipping this to support during the next major correction, it will act as a new floor. That is likely to prepare the BTC/USD pair for the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 A strong bounce off $20,000 will open up the possibility of a rise to $30,000 and then to the next likely formidable resistance at $37,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  assumption, if the bears sink and sustain the price below $20,000 during the next correction, the aggressive bulls who have purchased above $20,000 may be forced to close their positions.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the price may extend its decline to the 20-week exponential moving average ($15,958). The deeper the fall below $20,000, the longer it could take for the uptrend to resume.\par \par \uc2 Nevertheless, the current bull market is showing no signs of letting up. Moreover, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/top-6-bitcoin-price-predictions-to-watch-in-2021"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 six-figure Bitcoin price predictions}}}\uc2  for 2021 are becoming quite common with some traders even anticipating "conservative" targets of $200,000 by next December.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is in the process of forming a large rounding pattern that will complete on a breakout and close above $800. This reversal pattern has a long-term target of $1,500.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/838bcbca-2796-4254-ad63-8924cbc745bd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently attempting to push and sustain the ETH/USD pair above the $625 resistance and resume the uptrend. However, the rally is likely to encounter stiff resistance in the $800 to $1,000 zone.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $800, the pair could enter a minor correction or consolidation for a few weeks. However, if the price remains above the 20-week EMA ($470), the possibility of a rise to $1,000 is high.\par \par \uc2 The bears will again try to stall the rally at $1000, but if the price does not fall below $800, it will boost the prospects of a breakout beyond $1,000. If that happens, the pair should retest the all-time high.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the price dips and sustains below the 20-week EMA.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-price-falls-24-in-24-hours-as-exchanges-begin-delisting"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 one of the most underperforming major altcoins}}}\uc2  in the past few months. The price is currently stuck in a large range of $0.10 to $0.80. The bulls attempted to propel the price above $0.80 but failed. That resulted in aggressive selling and the price has completely retraced the November gains.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/fa7c2264-9f47-43d2-8673-d7d099d6dad2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest that the bulls have lost their grip and the XRP/USD pair could stay inside the large range for a few more months.\par \par \uc2 In a large range, the bulls buy the dips aggressively and sell near the resistance. To change this trend, the price will have to either break above or below the range.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above the $0.80 to $1 overhead resistance zone, the XRP/USD pair may signal the start of a possible uptrend, which could surprise with a run to $2.50.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears will aggressively defend the overhead resistance zone, particularly as the negative news of the SEC lawsuit against Ripple is already {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-price-plunges-21-in-two-days-as-sec-targets-ripple-what-s-next"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 resulting in big losses}}}\uc2  for XRP holders. Therefore, the XRP/USD pair could remain in the given range for most of 2021.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) completed a rounding bottom pattern after the bulls pushed the price above the $80 resistance. This reversal setup has a minimum target objective of $136, just below the stiff resistance at $145.6725.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/63e64fd5-ab50-4575-affb-68fb94c57c68.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-week EMA ($73.18) and the RSI in the overbought territory suggest that bulls have the upper hand. An overbought level on the RSI is a sign of euphoria in a mature uptrend but is a positive sign when a new up-move is starting.\par \par \uc2 The up-move can now reach $145.6725 where the bears are likely to mount a stiff resistance. If the bulls give up a lot of ground, the LTC/USD pair may consolidate just below this level for a few months. A break below $80 will signal advantage to the bears.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls drive the price above $145.6725, it will clear the path for a rally to $180 and then to $220.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) is currently stuck inside a large range of $160 on the downside and $515 on the upside. The price had been trading in the lower half of this range for the past many months but the bulls are currently attempting to push the altcoin into the upper half of the range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/70167600-a47f-44ce-a94f-ff54414aa1b5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can sustain the price above $320, the BCH/USD pair could gradually move up to $400 and then to the stiff overhead resistance at $515.\par \par \uc2 The pair had turned down from $515 on two previous occasions, hence, the bears will again try to defend this level. If they succeed, the pair may reverse direction from close to $515 and extend its stay inside the range.\par \par \uc2 This range-bound action will be invalidated if the bulls propel the price above $515. If that happens, the pair could start a new uptrend that may reach $870.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) rallied from $1.36 in March to a high at $20.1111 in August. After that, the altcoin pulled back sharply before finding support close to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $8.5229.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/3f08c1a1-7ffc-4dc3-bdea-68f8e24c46bc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The subsequent rebound could not sustain above $16.39, which may have attracted selling by traders who had purchased at lower levels. The selling intensified after the bears broke the 20-week EMA ($11.63) support.\par \par \uc2 However, the long wick on the candlestick shows that the bulls again aggressively bought the dip below the $8.5229 support. The flattish 20-week EMA and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a few weeks of range-bound action.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above $16, the pair may retest the $20.1111 resistance. A break above this level may start a new uptrend that could reach $26.038.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bears sink and sustain the price below the $8.5229 support, the LINK/USD pair could start a new downtrend.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has completed a bottoming formation and started a new uptrend. The bulls flipped the previous stiff resistance at $0.10 to support (marked by the ellipse on the chart), which indicates a trend chage. The break above $0.1543051 also started a higher-highs and higher-lows formation.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/50e83603-d197-423f-b99a-4ef70e367d69.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The up-move is likely to face a strong hurdle in the $0.20 to $0.2360 overhead resistance zone. If the price turns down from this zone, but the bulls again manage to form a new high above $0.15, that will keep the uptrend intact.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above the resistance zone, the momentum is likely to pick up as there is no major resistance until the price reaches $0.40. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive zone suggest that bulls are in command.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated if the price turns down from the overhead resistance zone and breaks the higher-highs and higher-lows formation.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating in a $25.1247 to $33.3888 range for the past few weeks. The bulls pushed the price above the range last week but could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that bears are aggressively selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/de7a1aa8-cff3-451a-9daa-48de7e8dc383.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the upsloping moving averages and the RSI above 64 suggest that the bulls are in command. If the buyers can propel the price above $36, the BNB/USD pair could retest the all-time high at $39.5941.\par \par \uc2 This level may act as stiff resistance but if the bulls do not give up much ground, the possibility of a break above $39.5941 increases. If that happens, the pair could rally to the next target objective at $52.1335.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down sharply from the all-time high, the pair may remain range-bound for a few months.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 After the initial run-up in August, Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating in a large range between $3.50 and $6 for the past few weeks. The longer the time spent in consolidation, the stronger the breakout will be.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/0871854f-a780-4a06-8960-6b9979250bfe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 For the past five weeks, the price has been trading in the upper half of the range. This suggests that the bulls are not waiting for a drop to $3.50 to buy.\par \par \uc2 If bulls can propel the price above $6, a retest of the high at $6.8619 is possible. This level may again act as stiff resistance but if the bulls can push the price above it, the DOT/USD pair could start an uptrend.\par \par \uc2 This positive view may be invalidated if the pair sharply reverses direction from the $6 to $6.8619 resistance zone. If that happens, the pair may continue its range-bound action for a few more months.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) broke out of a long rounding bottom pattern on Nov. 24 with huge volumes but the bulls could not build upon this move and start a new uptrend. The price had been stuck in a range for the past three weeks, which suggests a lack of buyers at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/26d58636-80ca-4fb5-9ada-c6c7bbe52aef.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The failure to start a new rally could have attracted selling by the aggressive bears who are currently attempting to sustain the price below $0.16.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the XLM/USD pair could drop to the 20-week EMA ($0.118). A break below this support could signal that the breakout of the rounding bottom was a bull trap and the pair may spend some more time in the bottoming formation.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls again buy the dip to the 20-week EMA and drive the price back above $0.16, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 The pair could pick up momentum after the bulls push the price above $0.231655. The first target on the upside is $0.30 and then $0.35. This zone may act as a stiff resistance but if the bulls can propel the price above it, the pair may rise to $0.50.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjAtMTIvMGI2ZWZkODUtMTgzYy00MmEyLThhNjQtYjdmZjkzZjUxYTcwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020201226egcq0005l\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/23: BTC, ETH, XRP, LTC, BCH, LINK, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, XLM\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,857 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 December 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Money could flow out of altcoins and into Bitcoin due to the SEC lawsuit against Ripple.\par \par \uc2 The current crypto bull run has been spearheaded by Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ). As the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-chairman-jay-clayton-says-bitcoin-not-a-security-most-icos-likely-are"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previously}}}\uc2  hinted that Bitcoin is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-if-bitcoin-was-a-security-it-would-raise-substantial-issues"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 not a security}}}\uc2 , the regulator\u8217\'20\'19s current lawsuit against Ripple is unlikely to stop the institutional inflow of money into Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 However, a few altcoins that may be at risk of facing a similar fate as Ripple could face selling pressure. Due to a change in sentiment, retail investors may sell some of their altcoin holdings and shift to Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Even retail investors who plan to spend their {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-rises-5-after-us-congress-passes-900-billion-ad-for-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stimulus}}}\uc2  checks for buying crypto-assets may prefer Bitcoin over altcoins. So, while {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  faces selling pressure, the lawsuit may prove to be \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 The institutions have been pumping money into Bitcoin at an unprecedented pace. Grayscale {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-drops-to-23k-in-minutes-despite-huge-new-grayscale-buy-in"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 continued its buying spree}}}\uc2  and added 12,319 Bitcoin on Tuesday. That means Grayscale gobbled up about 44% of all the newly mined BTC in a month or around 28,000 Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s supply is not able to keep up with the institutional demand and if retail traders also turn net buyers, the price is only likely to boost further.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s look at the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies and establish their major trend.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 In a strong uptrend, the corrections usually last for about one to three days. Bitcoin closed in the red on Dec. 20 and 21 but the price turned up on Dec. 22 and the bulls are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-dominance-hits-1-year-peak-amid-xrp-sell-off-as-24k-briefly-returns"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 currently attempting to resume the up-move}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/e1678f1f-8244-4ca5-bc57-4af7adbb5d27.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above $24,302.50, the BTC/USD pair could rally to $26,958. The upsloping moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) close to the overbought zone suggest bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears defend the overhead resistance level, the pair may consolidate in a tight range of $21,934.83 to $24,302.50 before starting the next move.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  assumption, if the pair turns down and breaks below $21,934.83, a drop to $20,000 is possible. The zone between $19,500 and $20,000 is crucial because if it cracks, the pair may drop to the 50-day simple moving average ($18,529).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are aggressively defending the 20-day exponential moving average ($603). Although Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rose above the $622.807 resistance on Dec. 22, the price has turned down once again today. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/ee74c2ae-de6f-49ff-a0dc-485977690fa3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls are currently attempting to defend the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the ETH/USD pair could make one more attempt to rise above $640 and retest $676.325.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory suggest that bulls have the upper hand. A breakout of $676.325 may start the next leg of the uptrend, which has a target objective at $763.614.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price dips below the trendline of the triangle, the pair could extend the decline to $540 and then to $480.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls defended the $0.425 to $0.40 support on Dec. 22 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-price-falls-24-in-24-hours-as-exchanges-begin-delisting"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 but renewed selling today}}}\uc2  has broken the range. XRP has plunged below the $0.326724 support but bulls may attempt to provide support at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/77f59eae-1010-4968-a73b-50fff6d428cc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the 20-day EMA ($0.513) has turned down and the RSI has dropped close to the overbought territory, which suggests that the trend has turned in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 Even if the price rebounds off the current levels, the bears are likely to sell on relief rallies to $0.435 and then at the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below $0.326724, the XRP/USD pair could sink to $0.25. If that happens, the pair will complete a 100% retracement of the most recent leg of the up-move.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off $98.40 on Dec. 22 but the bulls could not push the price above the $118.6497 resistance. This suggests that traders are using rallies to offload their positions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/9a3ea34b-3a7d-4a5f-bf2b-b847567019bf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to sink the price below the $98.40 support and the 20-day EMA at $95. If they succeed, the LTC/USD pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($80). Such a move will suggest a possible change in trend from \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  to range-bound.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price again rebounds off $98.40, the pair may remain stuck in a tight range for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the RSI above 60 suggest that bulls have the upper hand. A break above the $118.6497 to $124.1278 resistance zone could indicate a resumption of the uptrend that may reach $140.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Dec. 22 candlestick shows that bulls purchased the dip to the 20-day EMA ($299). However, they could not build up on the rebound and renewed selling by the bears today has pushed Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) below the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/4f5dc62d-6bda-4186-8f72-982f6d029731.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink and sustain the price below the 50-day SMA ($281), the BCH/USD pair could drop to $250. The bulls may try to defend the zone between $230 and $250 and if they succeed, a strong rebound is likely.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears will try to stall any relief rally at the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the price may turn down and break below $230, which could result in a fall to the next critical support at $200.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the uptrend line on Dec. 22 but the bulls could not push the price above the moving averages. This suggests that bears are attempting to defend the 20-day EMA ($12.87).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/d9962aed-1fc0-428f-87d5-23180b681368.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The LINK/USD pair has currently slipped below the uptrend line, which suggests a possible change in trend. There is a minor support at $11.29 but if this level cracks, the pair may drop to $10.\par \par \uc2 The RSI has dipped below 43 and the 20-day EMA has started to turn down, which suggests that the momentum is shifting in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated if the pair rebounds off the immediate support and rises above $13.28. Such a move will suggest that traders are accumulating at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) dipped to the 20-day EMA ($30.88) on Dec. 22 but aggressive buying at lower levels propelled the price back above $33.3888. However, the bulls could not build upon this rebound and the price had again dropped to the 20-day EMA today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/3c014122-6f7d-4ea6-8a18-4cb55d3e788f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can keep the price above $32, the BNB/USD pair could trade in a tight range between $32 and $35.4338 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 A break above $35.4338 could resume the uptrend and open the doors for a rally to the all-time high at $39.5941. The upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory suggest that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, the pair may drop to the 50-day SMA ($29.50) and get stuck inside the $32 to $25.6652 range.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) back above the 20-day EMA ($0.153) on Dec. 22 but they could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that every minor relief rally is attracting selling by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/630be9c1-b49f-4c88-80de-612a4e3adba8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The sellers will now try to sink the price to the critical support of the range at $0.13. As bulls had purchased the dip to this support on two previous occasions, they may again try to defend the level.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair could extend its stay inside the $0.13 to $0.175 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bears sink and sustain the price below $0.13, the trend could turn in favor of the bears, and a drop to $0.12 and then to $0.11 may be on the cards.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 50-day SMA ($4.93) on Dec. 22 but the bulls have not been able to build upon the recovery, which shows traders are selling on rallies. The flat moving averages and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/78f839e8-f774-4d37-8cc5-978477c313b0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the price below the 50-day SMA and the $4.43 support, the DOT/USD pair could drop to the bottom half of the large $3.53 to $5.60 range.\par \par \uc2 The bulls are likely to buy the drop to the $3.80 to $3.53 support zone and a strong bounce off it could keep the pair range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up from the current levels and rises above $5.60, a new uptrend could start. There is a minor resistance at $6.0857. But if this level is crossed, the up-move may reach $6.8619.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 20-day EMA ($0.166) on Dec. 21 and the 50-day SMA ($0.14) today. However, the long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that bulls are buying aggressively at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/5bbbca4d-0533-4fec-a903-81c06442eab8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $0.14, the XLM/USD pair may move up to the 20-day EMA where it is likely to face resistance. The 20-day EMA has started to turn down and the RSI has dropped into the negative zone indicating advantage to the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the pair dips and sustains below $0.14, it will complete a descending triangle pattern that could intensify selling and pull the price down to the 78.6% Fibonacci retracement at $0.11535 and then to $0.083684.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated if the bulls can push the price above the 20-day EMA and the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjAtMTIvMDlmMDQ2NWUtYmU4Ny00NTI1LWFiZTAtNjZkOTgxYjEyNjA5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020201223egcn000bc\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Top 5 cryptocurrencies to watch this week: BTC, ETH, LTC,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,735 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 December 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Large-cap altcoins are attempting to rally higher but first bulls need to flip $24,000 to support.\par \par \uc2 When the price of an asset hits a new all-time high, momentum traders plow in as they sense an opportunity to ride the trade higher. The same was seen after Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price broke above the $20,000 mark on Dec. 16. By Dec. 19, the price had hit an intraday high at $24,197.46, a 21% rally in four days.\par \par \uc2 These sharp moves in Bitcoin price attract traders who use derivatives to try and amplify their gains or hedge their existing positions by buying downside protection. This resulted in the open interest on Bitcoin options hitting a new {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/record-6-5b-bitcoin-options-open-interest-follows-btc-all-time-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 all-time high}}}\uc2  at $6.5 billion earlier this week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/67c4d87a-fabf-4275-915c-25fb3da2dc96.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While professional traders use complicated options strategies to establish their positions, the retail traders generally buy naked options with a dream of earning a windfall on the options contract. This can be seen from the high open interest on the $36,000 strike price and the $52,000 call option.\par \par \uc2 For every option contract, there is a seller and a buyer and generally, professional traders prefer to sell the option contracts and pocket the premium when the expiry is worthless. Therefore, retail traders should make informed decisions before buying naked options contracts.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum on Bitcoin has pulled select altcoins higher. Let\u8217\'20\'19s look at the charts of top-5 cryptocurrencies that could offer trading opportunities in the coming week.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin picked up momentum after the price broke above the $20,000 overhead resistance but the quick rise of the past few days has pushed the relative strength index (RSI) deep into the overbought territory. This suggests the possibility of a consolidation or a correction in the next few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/bc31c970-cf69-42bd-8bca-79d631318e88.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Usually, after the price breaks above a critical level such as an all-time high, it turns down and retests the breakout level. In this case, the BTC/USD pair may turn down from the $25,000 to $26,000 resistance zone and retest the breakout level at $20,000.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this support aggressively, the bulls will again try to resume the uptrend. If they succeed, it will suggest that $20,000 is the new floor for the pair.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day exponential moving average ($20,356) and the $19,500 support, the pair may drop to the 50-day simple moving average at $17,960.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/6f95f81e-52f6-464b-b058-046235039b97.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the trend is up, the 4-hour chart shows that the bulls are finding it difficult to sustain the price above $23,795.29. This suggests that after the recent sharp up-move, the bears are attempting to stall the rally. The negative divergence on the RSI is a signal that the momentum may be weakening.\par \par \uc2 If the price dips below the 20-EMA, the pair could drop to the $22,272.63 support. This is an important short-term level to watch out for because if it cracks, the short-term traders may book profits. That could quickly pull the price down to the 50-SMA and then to $20,000.\par \par \uc2 This view will be invalidated if the price surges and sustains above $24,000. Such a move will suggest that momentum traders are in control.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke out of the ascending triangle pattern on Dec. 16 and the price rallied to $676.325 on Dec. 17 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels as seen from the long wick on the daily candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/b7a4aed0-d60b-4426-b523-a66865bfd1d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, a positive is that the bulls have not allowed the price to drop below the immediate support at $622.807. The price is currently stuck between $622.807 and $676.325.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can propel the price above $676.325, it could start the next leg of the uptrend that could reach the pattern target of $763.614. The upsloping moving averages suggest that the bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the price below $622.807, the ETH/USD pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($599). If the price rebounds off this support with strength, the bulls will try to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 The trend will turn in favor of the bears if the price drops below the trendline of the triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/fafd6383-548a-4da6-b9c9-7800b54ddb11.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows a symmetrical triangle formation, which generally acts as a continuation pattern. If the bulls can push the price above the triangle, the pair may resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price dips below the triangle, a drop to the $622.807 support is possible. If the bears sink the price below the 50-SMA, the pair may lose momentum and drop to the trendline of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) picked up momentum after breaking out of the symmetrical triangle on Dec. 16. The target objective of the breakout from the triangle was $119.77 and that was hit on Dec. 19.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/23def089-58f2-4e47-8e57-6578f49baf8a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the momentum is strongly in favor of the bulls. If the price does not dip below the 50% Fibonacci retracement at $101.868, it will suggest that the bulls are not booking profits in a hurry.\par \par \uc2 A shallow pullback will increase the possibility of a rally above $124.1278. If that happens, the LTC/USD pair could rally to $140.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price dips below $101.868, the pair could correct to the 20-day EMA ($90). A deeper correction will suggest that the momentum has weakened and that may result in a range-bound action for a few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/3c2243c7-c1b3-4a77-acfb-a55d0d40345c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The pair is currently witnessing a correction on the 4-hour chart that may reach the 20-EMA. A strong rebound off this support will suggest that the sentiment is positive and the bulls are buying on dips. If the bulls push the price above $124.1278, the uptrend could resume.\par \par \uc2 The RSI is showing signs of a negative divergence. If the price dips and sustains below the 20-EMA, it will suggest that the momentum has weakened and a deeper correction may be on the cards.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a $0.13 to $0.175 range for the past few days. The altcoin turned down from the overhead resistance on Dec. 17 but the bulls have not given up much ground. This shows that traders are in no hurry to book profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/8c7cc6f6-48d3-4f44-9037-eab0f7019f1d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory suggest that bulls have the upper hand, If the buyers can propel the price above the $0.175 to $0.1826315 overhead resistance zone, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair could rally to $0.22 and then to $0.235.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current levels but rebounds off the 20-day EMA ($0.154), the bulls will attempt to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the pair could drop to $0.13 and extend the stay inside the range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/216f5d87-8e3c-455e-9cec-4301187e502a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that the price is currently consolidating in a tight range of $0.16 to $0.17. The flattening 20-EMA and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the price below the 50-SMA, the pair could drop to $0.150 and such a move will increase the possibility of the continuation of the range-bound action.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the pair rises above $0.17, the bulls will try to push the price above the $0.175 to $0.1826315 resistance zone. If they succeed, the uptrend could resume.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) had been stuck in a $25.6652 to $32 range for the past few weeks. The bulls pushed the price above the overhead resistance on Dec. 19 and have followed that with another up-move today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/329a5a91-4443-4d8e-bbf7-b29e86c3e277.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USD pair has currently reached the $35.4328 overhead resistance from where the price had reversed direction on Nov. 25. If the bulls can push and sustain the price above this resistance, a retest of the all-time high at $39.5941 is possible.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($30) has started to turn up and the RSI is close to the overbought zone, which suggests that bulls have the upper hand. If the bulls can push the price above $39.5941, the uptrend could continue, with the next target at $50.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the price turns down from the current levels and dips back below $32. Such a move will suggest a few more days of consolidation.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/d739766d-9f8b-4771-a43a-5ee9af79b414.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that the bulls had pushed the price above the overhead resistance but could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that the bears are aggressively defending the $35.4338 level.\par \par \uc2 However, the upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the overbought zone suggest advantage to the bulls. If the bulls do not allow the price to slide below $33.3888, it will increase the possibility of a break above $35.4338.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the price below $33.3888, a drop to the 20-EMA and then to $32 is possible.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjAtMTIvNTJhOTkyZTUtOGFjNi00NWEwLWJmODItNzBjMTkxMmVlM2RiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020201220egck0008e\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/18: BTC, ETH, XRP, LTC, BCH, LINK,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, BNB, XLM\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,947 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 December 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The bulls may take a breather for a few days before resuming their Bitcoin and altcoins purchases.\par \par \uc2 Christopher Wood, the global head of equity strategy at Jefferies, has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/can-gold-and-bitcoin-coexist-goldman-sachs-says-yes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dumped}}}\uc2  five percent of their physical gold position in order to buy Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ). This move shows that a growing number of institutional investors consider Bitcoin to be at par or a better store of value than gold.\par \par \uc2 Wood also said that if Bitcoin were to have a big correction, he would buy more. The fact that institutional investors are content purchasing in the $16,000 to $20,000 range suggests that institutional investors are not worried about a pullback as they view it as an opportunity to accumulate for the long term.\par \par \uc2 One River \b \highlight22\uc2 Digital Asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  Management also recently revealed a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-is-a-convex-bet-says-ceo-of-institution-with-600m-btc-exposure"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $600 million}}}\uc2  bet on Bitcoin and Ether. CEO Eric Peters, said the hedge fund plans to buy more Bitcoin and Ether in the first half of next year to take the total allocation in the assets to $1 billion.\par \par \uc2 This is further signal that the institutional demand for crypto assets is likely to remain high going into 2021.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/2cee31f6-ffe5-4b8e-9870-c7203c5b38bc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Nigel Green, founder and CEO of deVere Group, expects Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s bull run to continue in 2021 as the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rally will be supported by the influx of \u8220\'20\'1Csome of the world\u8217\'20\'19s biggest institutions.\u8221\'20\'1D Green expects Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/devere-ceo-says-bitcoin-will-rise-50-and-possibly-double-in-2021"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 at least rise}}}\uc2  by 50% or even possibly double next year.\par \par \uc2 However, not everyone is convinced about the prospects of Bitcoin. Billionaire Mark Cuban said that Bitcoin is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-is-more-religion-than-solution-says-billionaire-mark-cuban"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 not a hedge}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cagainst doomsday scenarios\u8221\'20\'1D and it is \u8220\'20\'1Cunlikely to replace fiat currency anytime soon.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin correct in the short term and give a bragging opportunity to the naysayers, or will it continue to rally higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) picked up momentum after it crossed the $20,000 psychological barrier on Dec. 16. The up-move continued on Dec. 17 and the price hit a new all-time high at $23,795.29.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/d56f8d88-3d8f-411e-a15a-4cd8bde8e7e9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USD pair has formed an inside day candlestick pattern today, which usually acts as a continuation pattern. This pattern suggests that bulls are taking a break after the aggressive buying of the past two days.\par \par \uc2 However, the positive thing is that the price is close to the recent high, which suggests that bulls have not closed their positions in a hurry even after the sharp rally of the past two days. This indicates that traders expect the rally to extend further to $25,000 and then $26,000.\par \par \uc2 Although it is difficult to call a top in a market backed by strong momentum, the pair could face strong headwinds at $26,000.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the critical level to watch is $20,000. If the bulls flip this level to support, then the next leg of the uptrend could resume. However, if the price dips below the $20,000 support and fails to recover the pair could witness a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke above the $622.807 resistance on Dec. 16, which completed the ascending triangle pattern. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a target objective of $763.614.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/a6b8b921-181f-46fd-9172-750c72b1754c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, after the breakout from a pattern, the price usually retests the breakout level. Even in this case, the price has corrected to $622.807.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can flip $622.807 to support, it will suggest that traders are buying at this level. That increases the prospects of the continuation of the uptrend. The rising moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) above 64 suggest that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated if the price dips and sustains below $622.807. Such a move could suggest that the recent breakout was a bull trap. This narrative will be further strengthened if the price breaks below the trendline of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  broke above the downtrend line and the 20-day exponential moving average ($0.54) on Dec. 16, which suggests that the correction could be over. The bulls attempted to sustain the momentum on Dec. 17 but faced stiff resistance above $0.65.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/a1ed4920-b46c-4f94-9838-387adc9b731a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The inside day Doji candlestick pattern today hints at indecision among the bulls and the bears. If the price dips below the 20-day EMA, the XRP/USD pair may drop to $0.50 and then again to $0.435420.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, it will suggest that the pair may remain range-bound for a few days. A breakout of $0.6794 will invalidate this view.\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI oscillating between 43 and 57 also point to a possible consolidation in the near term.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) surged above the symmetrical triangle on Dec. 16 and followed that up with another strong move on Dec. 17. This move pushed the price above the $93.9282 resistance and the $100 psychological level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/a98cb90b-c27d-43f3-8f25-77cc593e43ac.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Dec. 17 candlestick shows profit booking at higher levels but the bulls did not allow the price to stay below the $100 support. This suggests that traders are buying on every minor dip.\par \par \uc2 However, the long wick on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that traders are again booking profits at higher levels. This is an early signal of exhaustion and if volume dries up the LTC/USD pair could correct to $93.9282 in the next few days.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this support, it will confirm it as the new floor. That could start the journey towards the next target level at $140. Conversely, if the price breaks below $93.9282, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($84).\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) broke above the $322.08 resistance on Dec. 17 but the price turned down from $331.69. This shows that the bears are aggressively defending this resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/7efc2fe8-9e48-4be8-a2fe-f72959d156c2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The inside day candlestick pattern today shows that the uncertainty continues as bulls buy on dips and bears sell on rallies. The rising 20-day EMA ($286) and the RSI above 59 suggest an advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 If bulls can propel the price above $338, the BCH/USD pair could rally to $371.70 and then to $400. Conversely, if the bears sink the price below $300, the pair may drop to the 20-day EMA. Such a move could keep the pair range-bound for a few days.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) formed a Doji candlestick pattern on Dec. 17 and has made another one today. This shows indecision among the bulls and the bears, but the positive sign is that the price has sustained above the $13.28 support for the past two days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/cc5f4723-e2ba-46da-9f63-7814b841c43c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above $15, the LINK/USD pair could rise to $16.39. A breakout of this resistance could signal the start of a new uptrend that may retest the high at $20.1111.\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the RSI just above the midpoint do not point to a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price again turns down from $15, the pair may remain range-bound for a few days.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned down from the $0.175 overhead resistance on Dec. 17 but the bears could not prolong the correction. The bulls purchased the minor dip and are likely to again try and push the price above $0.175.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/a166124c-fba8-433f-a544-ec379bdb80f2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the RSI in the positive zone suggest that bulls are in control. If the bulls can drive and sustain the price above 0.175, the next leg of the uptrend could begin. The next target on the upside is $0.20 and then $0.26.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price again turns down from $0.175, a drop to the 20-day EMA ($0.152) is possible. A strong bounce off this support will increase the likelihood of a break above $0.175.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair could drop to $0.14 and then to the 50-day simple moving average ($0.131).\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above the $5.5899 overhead resistance on Dec. 17 but could not sustain the higher levels. This shows that the bears are aggressively defending this resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/38f80bc0-7f81-4412-8737-0f02ca43faab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls have not given up much ground and are likely to make another attempt to push the price above $5.5899. If they can sustain the price above this resistance, the DOT/USD pair could rally to $6.0857 and then to $6.8619.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI above 57 suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside. This positive view will invalidate if the price again gets rejected at $5.5899. In that case, a drop to the 20-day EMA ($5) is possible.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) continues to oscillate between the $32 resistance and the $25.6652 support. In an established range, traders sell when the price nears the resistance as they expect the price to turn down.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/bd471913-d95e-440d-b45c-68c9e9b7fd56.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls purchased the dip to the moving averages today and will now make one more attempt to push the price above $32.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed in sustaining the price above the range, the BNB/USD pair could start the next leg of the uptrend that could retest the all-time high at $39.5941.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price again turns down from $32, it will suggest that bulls have not been able to overpower the bears. That could keep the pair inside the range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) broke out and closed above the $0.18 resistance on Dec. 16. This move suggests that the correction may be over. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive zone also suggest that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/7bd47b0f-e2e9-49ac-81b1-c7a77efcb077.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bears have not thrown in the towel yet. The long wick on the Dec. 17 candlestick shows that the bears are selling on rallies.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current levels or the 20-day EMA ($0.168), the bulls will once again try to resume the uptrend. A close above $0.21 could result in a retest of the $0.231655 resistance.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the XLM/USD pair may consolidate in a large range for a few days before starting the next trending move.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjAtMTIvNjk0MjYzODgtNjdlOS00ODJlLWE1MjktYWM0M2Q5YTVhMzg0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020201218egci000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/16: BTC, ETH, XRP, LTC, BCH, LINK,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, BNB, XLM\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,873 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 December 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s break above $20,000 boosted \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2  and triggered strong rallies from several altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Crypto traders and investors received an early Christmas gift today as Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price cleared the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-hits-20-000-for-the-first-time-in-history"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $20,000}}}\uc2  psychological milestone for the first time in history. Today's breakout is equally significant as it serves to heal the scars of the traders who may have bought right at the top in 2017 and held their positions until now.\par \par \uc2 The current uptrend in Bitcoin has been all about institutional adoption. The latest institutional investor to have announced a position in Bitcoin is the United Kingdom-based {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/u-k-investment-manager-shifts-allocation-to-bitcoin-from-gold-in-defensive-move"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 investment manager}}}\uc2  Ruffer Investment Company Limited.\par \par \uc2 As has been the case with most institutional purchases this year, Ruffer said that they bought Bitcoin as an \u8220\'20\'1Cinsurance policy against the continuing devaluation of the world's major currencies.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/a0b7e53b-1094-4d63-ba1c-1ac2015a9d46.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Institutional participation has been so high that the Bank of America Merrill Lynch Global Fund Manager {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-the-third-most-crowded-trade-in-global-fund-manager-survey"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Survey}}}\uc2  shows that respondents believe that Bitcoin is the third most crowded trade behind technology stocks and short positions on the U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 Institutional investors have continued to flock to Bitcoin because it has outperformed most major asset classes by a wide margin. Hence, institutional investors who were early to the Bitcoin party are most likely sitting on huge profits and their portfolios are outperforming other fund managers who only own legacy markets. As Bitcoin continues to draw more attention from the investor class, inquisitive clients may force more institutions to allocate a portion of their money to BTC.\par \par \uc2 Now that Bitcoin has resumed its uptrend let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to identify the target objectives on the upside.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has soared well above $20,000 with a strong breakout. This shows that several traders have jumped in after the break above the psychological round figure at $20,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/efb5c19f-989f-4934-b750-7a84e7f05eea.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Any asset that makes a new all-time high is in a strong uptrend. The BTC/USD pair has completed an ascending triangle pattern, which has a target objective of $22,808.98. If this level is also crossed, the pair may reach $25,000.\par \par \uc2 The relative strength index (RSI) has still not reached the overbought zone, which shows that the BTC/USD pair has room to rally to the upside before the markets get overheated in the short-term.\par \par \uc2 Usually, after every breakout, the price turns down and retests the break out level. If the bulls buy this dip, then the level acts as a new floor. In this case, if the bulls flip the $19,500 level to support, the uptrend will remain intact.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the price reverses direction and breaks below $17,500.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has surged today and reached the $622.807 to $635.456 overhead resistance zone. If the bulls can push and sustain the price above the zone, it will complete an ascending triangle pattern which has a target objective of $763.614.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/12322cb2-0d0a-4ce8-b3b6-930a1b45b7ae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI above 61 signal that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current levels or fails to sustain above the resistance zone, then a drop to the 20-day exponential moving average ($572) is possible. A strong rebound off this support may keep the uptrend intact.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that traders are booking profits at higher levels. Such a move could keep the ETH/USD pair range-bound for a few days.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  had found strong buying support at the $0.435420 level on Nov. 26 and the bulls again purchased the dip to this critical level today, which has resulted in a strong rebound.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/555fb484-3c3e-4216-8ff2-f57ed80a81a2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA ($0.530) and the RSI close to the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily. They will try to stall the current recovery at the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the downtrend line, the XRP/USD pair could drop to the 50-day simple moving average ($0.42). This is the final support because if it breaks down, the next stop could be $0.326.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls can push and sustain the price above the downtrend line, the pair could rise to $0.60.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) is trading inside a large symmetrical triangle. The bulls defended the 20-day EMA ($80) on Dec. 14 and 15, which could have attracted buying and the price has surged to the resistance line of the triangle today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/3beb849b-9dd4-48fd-ba17-2dd40f38aeb0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA and the RSI above 61 signal that bulls are in control. If the buyers can push the price above the triangle and the $93.9282 overhead resistance, the next leg of the uptrend to $100 and then to $140 could begin.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current levels, the LTC/USD pair may extend its stay inside the triangle for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the Dec. 14 candlestick shows strong buying by the bulls at lower levels. That was followed by another strong day on Dec. 15 and the buyers propelled Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) above the $280 resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/5b2449c9-b1d4-4037-8d63-6dcb88dbdede.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the Dec. 15 candlestick shows that the bears are trying to defend the $300 resistance. Today\u8217\'20\'19s price action shows buying by the bulls closer to $280 and selling by the bears near $300.\par \par \uc2 This tight range trading is unlikely to continue for long. The RSI has risen back into the positive territory and the 20-day EMA ($280) is attempting to rise, which suggests that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above $300, the BCH/USD pair could rise to $320 and then to $338. This positive view will be invalidated if the price turns down and breaks below the 50-day SMA ($273). Such a move could again pull the price down to $250.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance at $13.28 on Dec. 13 but the bears could not sink the price to the uptrend line. This attracted buyers who are currently trying to push the price above the $13.28 resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/0e17ab3a-abda-4327-9328-520fb5ebfdbe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls succeed, the LINK/USD pair could move up to $15 and then to $17.7777. If this level is also crossed a retest of the all-time high at $20.1111 is possible.\par \par \uc2 However, the flat moving averages and the RSI just above the midpoint does not signal a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, if the price turns down from the current levels, the pair may consolidate in a range for a few days.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rose above the $0.155 resistance on Dec. 14 but the price turned down from the downtrend line on Dec. 15. However, the bears could now sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.149). This attracted aggressive buying by the bulls who have propelled the price above the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/7ec59c1a-3896-4013-b2ad-9b921ab2d90d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The gradually rising 20-day EMA and the RSI above 59 suggest that bulls are in control. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair could now rally to $0.1750 and then to $0.1826315. If this level is also crossed, the next target is $0.20.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance then the pair may enter a range-bound action for a few days.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) broke above the downtrend line on Dec. 15, which suggests that the bears have lost their grip. The altcoin could now rise to $5.5899 where it is likely to face stiff resistance from the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/dde71307-b903-4904-aa67-5076cff440ad.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price again turns down from the overhead resistance, the DOT/USD pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($5). If the bulls buy the dip to the 20-day EMA, it will increase the possibility of a break above $5.5899. Such a move could start a new uptrend that may reach $6.0857 and then $6.8619.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current levels and drops to the moving averages, it will suggest a lack of demand at higher levels. In such a case, the price may waver near the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has bounced off the moving averages and the bulls will now try to push the price to the $32 overhead resistance. This level is likely to act as a stiff resistance as the price had turned down from it on three previous occasions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/102bce47-c203-4d3c-b88c-cfbb5470b53d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price again turns down from $32, the BNB/USD pair could fall to the moving averages and then to the critical support at $25.6652. The flat moving averages and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move could start if the bulls push the price above the $32 resistance or if the bears sink the price below the $25.6652 support. Until then, the price action may remain volatile and random.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) had turned down from the $0.18 overhead resistance on Dec. 14 but the positive thing is that the bulls defended the drop to the 20-day EMA ($0.16). The bulls are currently attempting to resume the uptrend by pushing the altcoin above $0.18.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/f2f61be8-c596-4aad-9a4f-00caa09d1388.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to slope up gradually and the RSI is trying to sustain in the positive territory, which suggests a minor advantage to the bulls. If the price closes above $0.18, the XLM/USD pair could move up to $0.205 and then to $0.231655.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls fail to sustain the price above $0.18, the bears will try to sink the price back to the 20-day EMA. If that happens, it could keep the pair inside the $0.14 to $0.18 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjAtMTIvZGFhYzYzZDMtYjdmZC00YzZlLThiN2EtM2YzMTY0OTgwMjA5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020201216egcg000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/14: BTC, ETH, XRP, LTC, BCH, LINK,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, BNB, XLM\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,840 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 December 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price regained the $19,000 level and continues to trade in a range, providing altcoins with the opportunity to steadily move higher.\par \par \uc2 Strategists at \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2  said in a note that MassMutual\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/massmutual-bitcoin-purchase-proves-crypto-demand-is-rising-jpmorgan-says"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $100 million}}}\uc2  Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) purchase shows that insurance firms and pension funds are now adopting Bitcoin. According to the analysts, typically this class of institutional investors is conservative in their style of investing so the recent allocation is quite significant.\par \par \uc2 However, the strategists said that even if the pension funds and the insurance companies in the U.S., Japan, the U.K., and the Euro area keep 1% of their assets in Bitcoin, that could amount to an additional inflow of about $600 billion into Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 These investments by institutions may have increased the confidence of traditional investors on Wall Street who can now easily allocate a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/jim-cramer-bought-bitcoin-while-off-nicely-from-the-top-in-17-000s"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 larger portion}}}\uc2  of their portfolio to Bitcoin.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/15701108-bdb9-4e12-b44a-3bd7cae50082.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 CNBC Mad Money host \uc2 Jim Cramer\uc2  revealed in a recent interview that he purchased Bitcoin on dips under $18,000 and will continue to add on declines as he wants to \u8220\'20\'1Cdiversify into all sorts of asset classes.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Another long-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign for Bitcoin is that the number of wallets containing a whole coin or more has risen to a new {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/big-gaps-and-bigger-buys-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 all-time high}}}\uc2 , according to on-chain analytics resource Glassnode. This shows that investors are not closing their positions at the all-time high but are buying more and withdrawing their Bitcoin from the exchanges to cold storage.\par \par \uc2 Now that several fundamental factors favor Bitcoin and altcoins resuming their uptrends, investors will be curious to see if BTC will at last snatch a new all-time high above $20,000.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 20-day exponential moving average ($18,492) on Dec. 11, but this proved to be a bear trap. The price quickly turned up and rose above the 20-day EMA on Dec. 12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/3375561a-e1ee-4045-8d9b-d0d615c5b436.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the Dec. 13 candlestick and today\u8217\'20\'19s Doji candlestick pattern shows that the bears are attempting to defend the $19,500 overhead resistance. However, the positive thing is that the bulls have not given up much ground.\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) above 58 suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above the $19,500 to the $20,000 overhead resistance zone, it will complete an ascending triangle pattern that has a target objective of $22,808.98.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price again gets rejected at the current levels and the bears sink the BTC/USD pair below the trendline of the triangle, a drop to the 50-day simple moving average ($16,888) and then to $16,191.02 will be on the cards.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $16,191.02, the pair may enter a few days of range-bound action.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke out of the descending channel on Dec. 13, which is the first sign that the correction could be over. If the bulls buy the current dip to the 20-day EMA (564) and do not allow the price to sustain inside the channel, it will indicate strength.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/2a8e770a-322f-47a0-99a8-f49885fdadf1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USD pair is in the early stages of forming an ascending triangle pattern that will complete on a breakout and close above $622.807. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a target objective of $763.614.\par \par \uc2 The gradually rising 20-day EMA and the RSI above 55 suggest that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will fail if the pair breaks below the 20-day EMA and the ascending triangle. Such a move could drag the price down to the 50-day SMA ($501).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls could not sustain {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  above the 20-day EMA ($0.53), and the price dropped to $0.485419 on Dec. 12. The bulls bought the lows and are attempting to keep the altcoin above the $0.50 level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/ff02e409-fd58-4306-bb47-750f716c83f9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the lack of a strong rebound suggests that bears are selling aggressively. If the price sustains below $0.4850, the XRP/USD pair could resume the correction and fall to the 50-day SMA at $0.41.\par \par \uc2 The gradually falling 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative zone suggest that bears are attempting to take control. This negative view will invalidate if the price rebounds off the current levels and rises above the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 50-day SMA ($71) on Dec. 11, and the bulls pushed the price above the 20-day EMA ($78) on Dec. 13. This suggests accumulation at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/9d02b629-2c07-4bcb-a997-731cd6e14dc8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The LTC/USD pair could be in the early stages of forming a large symmetrical triangle, which usually acts as a continuation pattern. The bears could defend the resistance line of the triangle, while the bulls may buy on weakness to the support line.\par \par \uc2 A breakout of the triangle could resume the up-move, while a break below the triangle will signal that bears have the upper hand. The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a possible consolidation for a few days.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) recovered from $256.10 on Dec. 11 and reached $282.21 on Dec. 13. However, the bears defended this level aggressively and have pushed the price back below the 50-day SMA ($271).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/6135550e-cb33-4268-8bda-ca91fd623db9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are flat and the RSI is just below the midpoint, which suggests a few days of range-bound action. The price may move back and forth between $231 on the downside and $280 on the upside.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls can propel the price above $280, the BCH/USD pair may rise to $300 and then to $320. However, if the bears sink the price below $231, the pair may drop to $200.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) broke below the uptrend line on Dec. 11, but the bulls purchased at lower levels and pushed the price back above the uptrend line on Dec. 12. This attracted further buying, and the altcoin reached the $13.28 overhead resistance on Dec. 13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/ae8d0623-037d-472a-afa0-fc386c87de5c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the price has turned down from $13.28 and dipped back below the moving averages. This suggests that the bears are defending the overhead resistance.\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have flattened out and the RSI is just below the midpoint, which suggests that the LINK/USD pair could remain range-bound for a few days. The price could seesaw between $13.28 and $11.43 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 A break below $11.43 could signal that bears have overpowered the bulls and that could result in a fall to $10. Conversely, a break above $13.28 will suggest advantage to the bulls.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke above the downtrend and the 20-day EMA ($0.147) on Dec. 13. This suggests that the correction could be over. However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/db038684-6009-49b9-acfb-603b66d82e93.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are currently trying to stall the recovery at $0.155. If the bears can sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the price can drop to $0.13. If the bulls again buy this dip, then the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair may remain range-bound between $0.13 and $0.155 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 However, the long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests buying at lower levels. The gradually upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI above 55 suggest that bulls have the upper hand. Above $0.155, the pair could rally to $0.175.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 The relief rally in Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has again hit a barrier at the downtrend line. This suggests that the sentiment is negative and the bears are trying to sell on minor rallies to the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/69f60666-52d2-4afb-8735-6c7db72e877d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA ($4.92) and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a few days of range-bound action. The price may consolidate between $4.54 on the downside and $5.10 on the upside.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears sink the price below $4.54, the down move could resume and the DOT/USD pair could drop to $4.20 and then $3.80. A break above $5.10 will be the first indication that bulls are attempting to gain an upper hand.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is currently stuck inside a large range between $32 and $25.6652. The crisscrossing moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint suggest that the range-bound action may extend for a few more days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/dbef241a-64f9-4226-85ef-e92b0b38b6ad.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USD pair has risen above the moving averages and the bulls will now try to push the price to the $32 overhead resistance. This level has previously acted as stiff resistance and the bears will again try to turn the price down from this level.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the pair may consolidate between $29 and $32 for a few days. On the other hand, if the bulls drive the price above the $32 to $33.3888 resistance, the next of the uptrend could begin.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) broke above the downtrend line on Dec. 13, which suggests that the correction could be over. However, the bears are not ready to give up their advantage without putting up a fight.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/30f6aac7-b8ea-4a3f-a2ac-720f177d42dd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The sellers are currently defending the $0.18 resistance. The flattish 20-day EMA ($0.16) and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. This could keep the XLM/USD pair range-bound between $0.18 and $0.14 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the pair may drop to $0.14. A break below the range will tilt the advantage in favor of the bears while a break above $0.18 will open the doors for an up-move to $0.205.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjAtMTIvNmZmNmQ3NzYtODkxNS00ZDMzLTlhYzEtMDY1YzFjOTMzM2Y0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020201214egce000dz\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/11: BTC, ETH, XRP, LTC, BCH, LINK,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, BNB, XLM\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,878 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 December 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The market-wide correction looks set to continue as Bitcoin and most major altcoins are facing selling at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price has been gradually giving up ground for the past few days and that has a few investors afraid that a sharp correction or a bear market similar to the one in 2018 could occur again. However, there are major differences between the previous bull market and the current one.\par \par \uc2 The most notable difference is the arrival of institutional investors. The latest institution to have taken a position in Bitcoin is Massachusetts-based insurance firm MassMutual, which recently purchased 5,470 BTC for roughly {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-institutional-player-massmutual-purchases-100m-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $100 million}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 To date, a variety of institutional players ranging from hedge fund managers to publicly listed companies and now a 169-year old insurance company have purchased Bitcoin.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/778388e4-20b1-499e-9ea0-84e178225440.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Usually, institutional investors do not dump their holdings with every correction because they buy only after considering the long-term fundamentals. Hence, most price drops are viewed as an opportunity to add to their holdings.\par \par \uc2 Ruchir Sharma, chief global strategist at \uc2 Morgan Stanley Investment Management\uc2 , has said that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-will-gain-from-distrust-in-traditional-finance-says-bank-strategist"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dollar\u8217\'20\'19s reign}}}\uc2  as the world\u8217\'20\'19s reserve currency could be coming to an end and Bitcoin could be the beneficiary due to the \u8220\'20\'1Cwidening distrust in the traditional alternatives.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 With several institutional investors echoing a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view on Bitcoin, any correction is likely to attract more institutions who may take advantage of the fall to buy.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the top-10 cryptocurrencies and spot the critical support levels where buyers may step in.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Dec. 9 candlestick shows that the bulls purchased the dip below the 20-day exponential moving average ($18,283) but they could not sustain the momentum on Dec. 10. Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) again succumbed to selling pressure and closed below the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/a26fc524-a055-4066-838d-1d8253fe3c40.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Today, the bulls are again buying on dips as seen from the long tail on the candlestick. This shows that lower levels continue to attract buyers. The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the relative strength index (RSI) is close to the midpoint, which suggests a short-term consolidation.\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USD pair is currently trading inside a descending channel. If the bears sink the price below the uptrend line, the next support is at the lower trendline of the descending channel. If this support also cracks, the decline could extend to the 50-day simple moving average at $16,525.\par \par \uc2 The bulls are likely to defend the $16,191.02 level aggressively. If the price rebounds off this support, it will indicate a possible consolidation in a large range. On the other hand, if the bulls can sustain the recovery and push the price back above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rise to the upper trend line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 A breakout of the channel could again result in a retest of the $19,500 to $20,000 overhead resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is currently trading inside a descending channel. The bulls could not build on the Dec. 9 rebound and the price turned down once again on Dec. 10. This shows that traders are selling on relief rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/ade2e30c-709f-409a-b8d0-ca5542ba6ebf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are currently attempting to sustain the price below the 20-day EMA ($558). If they succeed, the ETH/USD pair could decline to the next major support at $488.134, just below the 50-day SMA at $491. The bulls are likely to defend this zone aggressively.\par \par \uc2 If the pair rebounds sharply from this zone, it will suggest a large trading range between $488.134 and $622.807.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current levels and breaks above the channel, then it will indicate that the correction could be over. The bulls will then try to push the price to the overhead resistance at $622.807.\par \par \uc2 Both possibilities have an equal likelihood of occurring because the flat 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  rebounded off the $0.50 support and closed above the 20-day EMA ($0.54) on Dec. 9. The price again turned down today but the bulls are attempting to defend the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/4b9a22a7-1905-48d4-84de-a0fac091930c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears are losing their grip. The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI above 52 suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls push the price above $0.60, the XRP/USD pair could remain range-bound between $0.50 and $0.679 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 This view will be invalidated if the bears sink the price below $0.50. If that happens, the pair could drop to the 50-day SMA at $0.39.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) rebound on Dec. 9 only lasted for a day and the price again turned down on Dec. 10. This shows that bears are selling on every minor rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/73bedb1e-861d-406d-8de7-b416ef953f9f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently attempting to defend the 50-day SMA ($69.73), which is just above the $68.9008 horizontal support. If the price rebounds off this support and rises above the 20-day EMA ($78), the LTC/USD pair could consolidate in a large range for a few days.\par \par \uc2 On the other contrary, if the rebound again turns down from the 20-day EMA, the pair may decline to the $64.4482 support. The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI below 45 suggest bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 The moving averages act as support in an uptrend but behave as resistance when the sentiment turns \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) attempted a recovery on Dec. 9 but could not rise above the 50-day SMA ($271).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/3d783357-b75e-46b5-99fa-e90cf583e438.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This shows that traders sold on pullback to the 50-day SMA and the price has resumed its down move today. There is minor support in the $254.82 to $246.85 zone. A break below this zone could sink the price to $231.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this support, the BCH/USD pair could remain range-bound between $231 and $280 for a few days. But if the $231 support cracks, the pair may plummet to $200.\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($278) and the RSI in the negative zone suggest advantage to the bears. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the price breaks and sustains above the $280 resistance.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) bounce off the uptrend line turned down from the 50-day SMA ($12.69) on Dec. 10. The failure to rise above the downtrend line has attracted further selling that has pulled the price below the uptrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/1b9386f5-aa42-4dff-b94b-45939ee2c3b3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI has dipped below 41, which suggests that bears are in control. If the LINK/USD pair closes below the uptrend line, the drop could extend to $9.75.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated if the price turns around and breaks above the moving averages. Such a move will suggest strong buying at lower levels.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls could not build up on the sharp rebound in Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) on Dec. 9. This shows that the sentiment has turned negative and the traders are now selling on rallies to the 20-day EMA ($0.145).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/4a01a53b-7960-4bdb-831e-5f3b5ef249e3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair has a strong support at $0.13. If the price rebounds off this level and rises above the downtrend line, it will suggest that the short-term correction could be over. The next move on the upside could be to $0.155.\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are flattening out and the RSI just is below the midpoint, which suggests a few days of range-bound action.\par \par \uc2 This view will be invalidated if the bears sink the price below the $0.13 support and the 50-day SMA ($0.123). If that happens, the pair may slide to $0.117 and then to the $1 support.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 50-day SMA ($4.73) on Dec. 9 but the bulls could not even extend the recovery to the 20-day EMA ($4.97). This shows that traders are selling on every minor rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/48a3c08d-537e-4daa-84c5-cbb2ea4a8c4b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price turned down on Dec. 10 and has broken the 50-day SMA today. There is a minor support at $4.4342 but if the bulls fail to hold this level, the DOT/USD pair could drop to the $3.80 to $3.5321 support zone.\par \par \uc2 The falling 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative territory suggest that bears have the upper hand. This negative view will be invalidated if the pair turns around from the current levels and breaks above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 The recovery attempt on Dec. 9 fizzled out at $28.3853 and Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has again resumed its journey towards the critical support at $25.6652. This level could attract buyers as it has held twice before.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/d106f00a-852b-457b-a324-92df75a04c5c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off the critical support could keep the BNB/USD pair range-bound between $25.6652 and $32 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bears sink and sustain the price below $25.6652, the pair could drop to $22 and then to $18. The gradually downsloping 20-day EMA ($29) and the RSI below 41 suggest that bears have the upper hand at the moment.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) rebounded sharply on Dec. 9 and recovered to the downtrend line but the bulls could not push the price above the $0.18 resistance. This again attracted selling and the price has dipped below the 20-day EMA ($0.159).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/94e82e6b-3f4f-4269-a108-5503cb1958ef.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI close to the midpoint suggest a few days of range-bound action between $0.14 and $0.18. A break above $0.18 will signal advantage to the bulls and could result in a move to $0.21.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the XLM/USD pair breaks below $0.14, the selling may intensify and the decline could extend to the 50-day SMA ($0.118).\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjAtMTIvMGY1MzlmYjctNTA0Mi00OTRiLWEzOTctMzY2NjRmYzgwYjQ0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020201211egcb000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/9: BTC, ETH, XRP, LTC, BCH, LINK, DOT,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, XLM\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,895 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 December 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and several altcoins have recovered sharply from their intraday lows, a signal that there is healthy demand at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 In a recent Reddit \u8220\'20\'1CAsk Me Anything\u8221\'20\'1D session, billionaire Ray Dalio {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/a-flood-of-money-and-credit-ray-dalio-new-bitcoin-praise-echoes-microstrategy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 warned investors}}}\uc2  that the current astronomical pace of money printing is unlikely to stop in the near future and holding wealth in cash could lead to losses. Dalio said that Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) \u8220\'20\'1Ccould serve as a diversifier to gold and other such storehold of wealth assets.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-funds-see-near-record-inflows-as-capital-floods-out-of-gold"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new report}}}\uc2  from CoinShares shows that the transition from gold to crypto products may have already started. The report highlights outflows of $9.2 billion from gold investment products and inflows of $1.4 billion into crypto products during the same period. Interestingly, along with Bitcoin, Ethereum funds are also attracting investments.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/78f23fa8-35c4-4332-af42-ae0203598648.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While institutions are increasing their investments into the crypto space, \uc2 Galaxy Digital\uc2  founder and CEO \uc2 Mike Novogratz\uc2  recently told CNN that people should invest about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/mike-novogratz-has-50-of-net-worth-in-crypto-advocates-up-to-5-for-investors"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 5% of their net worth}}}\uc2  in Bitcoin and some in Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ). Novogratz did not rule out a 30-40% correction but asserted that Bitcoin will not go to zero.\par \par \uc2 On similar lines, the Winklevoss twins {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-s-market-cap-will-flip-gold-winklevoss-twins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 advised}}}\uc2  participants at the Singapore Fintech Festival to educate themselves about Bitcoin because they believe Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price will reach $500,000 in the future.\par \par \uc2 While the long-term picture looks \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , smaller-sized traders may find it difficult to HODL in the event of a sharp fall like the one seen in the last 24-hours.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies in order to spot the critical levels to keep an eye on.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) once again failed to rise above the $19,500 resistance on Dec. 6 and 7. This may have attracted profit booking from short-term traders and the downside move also pulled the price below the 20-day exponential moving average $18,314.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/92e6fece-2666-4498-9cc9-25e21168a8c6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the fall did not create panic among traders and the bulls continue to purchase the BTC/USD pair on dips. This is a positive sign as it shows that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The bulls will now try to push the price to the $19,500 resistance.\par \par \uc2 If the price fails to sustain above the 20-day EMA or rise above the $19,500 resistance, then another round of selling is likely. If the bears sink the price below $17,650, the pair could drop to the 50-day simple moving average at $16,314.\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) just above the midpoint suggest a few days of range-bound action.\par \par \uc2 A break below $16,191.02 will signal that bears have the upper hand, while a break above $19,500 will tilt the advantage in favor of the bulls. Until then, the pair may remain volatile between the two levels.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke below the trendline of the ascending triangle pattern and the 20-day EMA ($559) on Dec. 8. This move invalidates the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup, but the positive thing is that the bulls have purchased the dip and pushed the price back above the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/73a2141d-89f0-4537-8032-75ad97945ef1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can sustain the demand at higher levels, then the ETH/USD pair could again rally to the $622.807 to $635.456 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, the trendline may now act as a resistance. If the price turns down from this resistance, the bears will try to sink the pair below $530.487. If they succeed, the pair could drop to $488.134.\par \par \uc2 While these are the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  possibilities, the flat 20-day EMA and the RSI above 54 do not indicate an advantage either to the bulls or the bears. Therefore, the possibility of a few days of range-bound action is high.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 Although the bulls pushed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  above the downtrend line on Dec. 6, the demand dried up at higher levels. This pulled the price back below the downtrend line on Dec. 8 and the 20-day EMA ($0.543) today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/1eb43c99-f479-4c87-acf0-ec4af34d68be.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the dip to the $0.50 support today and are currently attempting to sustain the price above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the XRP/USD pair could remain range-bound for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. A break above $0.6794 will tilt the advantage in favor of the bulls and a break below $0.50 will signal that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The Dec. 7 Doji candlestick pattern showed indecision among the bulls and the bears about the next move. That uncertainty was resolved to the downside when \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) turned down and broke below the 20-day EMA ($79) on Dec. 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/346c4e02-c1d3-4b5a-892f-85e9833b9666.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The LTC/USD pair dropped to $71.9801 today, but the long tail on the candlestick shows strong buying at lower levels. The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint suggests a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 This could keep the pair range-bound between $68.9008 and $84.3374 for a few days. A break below the $68.9009 to $64 support zone will tilt the advantage in favor of the bears while a break above $84.3374 will indicate that the bulls are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 After staying above the $280 levels for the past few days, Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) plunged below it and the 50-day SMA ($271) on Dec. 8. The 20-day EMA ($281) has started to turn down and the RSI has dipped into the negative zone, which suggests that bears have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/6d3158cc-79a5-4cd2-9038-2c8fa5ae9506.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The current rebound is likely to face stiff resistance at $280. If the price turns down from this resistance, the BCH/USD pair could consolidate between $231 and $280 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls can push the price above $280, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels and that could result in an up-move to $300. If the bulls can sustain the price above this level, the momentum could pick up.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the downtrend line on Dec. 7 and broke below the 50-day SMA ($12.67) on Dec. 8. The bulls are currently attempting to defend the ascending trendline.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/06b1397c-437b-4077-bb29-9bf13a00258e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are likely to again face stiff resistance at the downtrend line. If the price turns down from this resistance, then a drop to $10 will be on the cards. Such a move will tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($13.17) has started to turn down and the RSI has slipped into the negative territory, which suggests that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated if the LINK/USD pair breaks above the downtrend line and the $13.28 overhead resistance.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 20-day EMA ($5) on Dec. 7 and the selling intensified on Dec. 8, which pulled the price down to the 50-day SMA ($4.7). The bulls purchased the dip to the 50-day SMA and are currently attempting to push the price back above the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/8c89715a-e806-4023-bd22-82bfa985d101.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to give up their advantage easily. They will try to defend the 20-day EMA and the downtrend line. If the price turns down from either resistance, it will increase the possibility of a break below the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the DOT/USD pair could drop to the $3.80 to $3.5321 support zone. The bulls are likely to buy a dip to this support and that could keep the DOT/USD pair range-bound for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls can push the price above the downtrend line, the pair will make one more attempt to rise above the $5.5899 resistance.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to sustain the price above the $0.155 level attracted selling and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) plummeted below the 20-day EMA ($0.146) on Dec. 8. However, a minor positive is that the price has rebounded off the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.1312.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/5a610504-2865-4b32-b975-3a19cb2b78f0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The relief rally will now face resistance at the 20-day EMA and again at $0.155. If the price turns down from either level, the bears will attempt to sink the price below $0.13 and the 50-day SMA ($0.122).\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair remains stuck between $0.13 and $0.155 for a few days. The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint also suggest a few days of range-bound action.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 50-day SMA ($29.21) and plunged to $26.9244 today. The altcoin is currently attempting a rebound, which is likely to face resistance at the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/cc54c4f9-1b1e-439c-9d26-077767999b96.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current levels or the moving averages, the bears will try to sink the BNB/USD pair below the $25.6652 support. If they succeed, the pair could drop to $22 and then to $18.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price breaks above the moving averages or if the bulls defend the $25.6652 support, the pair may extend its stay inside the range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) turned down from close to the downtrend line on Dec. 7 and plunged below the 20-day EMA ($0.158) on Dec. 8. However, today\u8217\'20\'19s sharp rebound off the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.140209 shows buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/9b0cb714-a79d-41a4-8cc1-71718fe57737.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The current rally is again likely to face resistance at the downtrend line. If the bulls can push the price above the downtrend line, it will suggest that the correction is over.\par \par \uc2 The XLM/USD pair may then rise to $0.18 and then to $0.19 and then consolidate in a range for a few days before attempting to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the downtrend line and plummets below $0.139, the pair could drop to the 50-day SMA at $0.115.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjAtMTIvMjAxZTdmY2ItNDEzYS00N2U0LWJjMGYtNDdiYWZhZjE2YzA5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020201209egc9000dz\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/7: BTC, ETH, XRP, LTC, BCH, LINK, DOT,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, XLM\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,911 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 December 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price continues to meet resistance at $19,500, a signal that further sideways action in BTC and altcoins is on the cards.\par \par \uc2 Recent news reports suggest that U.S. lawmakers may announce a new round of economic stimulus worth about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ft.com/content/9c174b9c-f8f0-479c-b1af-72ac208dc4c2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $908 billion}}}\uc2  before the end of today. This second package, if announced, will add to the existing debt pile and may send the U.S. dollar index (DXY) lower. The index is already trading near its lowest level since April 2018.\par \par \uc2 The slow economic recovery, expansionary monetary policy, overvalued stocks and negative bond yields are some of the reasons that have forced investors to search for alternative assets to safeguard their portfolios.\par \par \uc2 Gold has been one of the favorite safe-haven assets of investors for many decades. However, in 2020, a few institutional investors diversified into Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) because they believed it would outperform gold.\par \par \uc2 Investors who made this choice have benefitted from the sharp Bitcoin rally of the past few weeks and many are likely to hold their position given that most investors expect BTC price to rise higher.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/27e1d5f1-d61e-4bca-8eaf-6f92790ec0b5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin's recent stellar performance is no secret and the number of institutional investors attracted to the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  is likely to increase because few will want to be left behind in the race to buy the deflationary cryptocurrency.\par \par \uc2 Henri Arslanian, Global Crypto Leader at PwC, recently told Bloomberg that one day investors will {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-us-stimulus-brexit-and-20k-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 question}}}\uc2  the wisdom of fund managers who decided not to invest in Bitcoin\par \par \uc2 While the increased institutional inflow of money looks to be a certainty, the question one needs to ask is to what level will the institutions keep buying. There is not an exact answer to this question but investors should refrain from getting swept up in FOMO and buying Bitcoin just because everyone else is.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine which may offer lucrative opportunities.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to propel Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) above the pennant formation and the $19,500 resistance, but they are facing stiff resistance from the bears. To date, the $19,500 resistance is still acting as a major roadblock.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/65578f76-3fba-4914-952c-ab55b65ac6fc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bears will have to sink the price below the 20-day exponential moving average ($18,305) to dampen the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment.\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below the 20-day EMA, some short-term momentum traders may dump their long positions and that could drag the price down to the $17,200 support. A break below this support could result in a drop to the 50-day simple moving average ($16,053).\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bulls do not give up much ground, it could create FOMO among traders and that could boost momentum and drive the price above the overhead resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 In a strong uptrend, the path of least resistance is to the upside until proven otherwise. Above $20,000 the BTC/USD pair could rally to $21,140 and then to $23,043.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 The bears attempted to sink Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) below the 20-day EMA ($559) but failed. The strong rebound on Dec. 5 shows that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  as traders are buying on dips to the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/dc7f2e7e-a52e-4f46-828c-5900cd4f0c76.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls can push the price above the $622.807 to $635.456 resistance zone, the ETH/USD pair will complete an ascending triangle pattern that has a target objective of $763.61.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages suggest that bulls have the upper hand but the relative strength index (RSI) has formed a negative divergence, which warrants caution. If the RSI rises above the downtrend line, it will indicate that the momentum is favoring the bulls.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the price turns down from the current levels or the overhead resistance and plummets below the 20-day EMA. Such a move will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup and may pull the pair down to the $488.134 support.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  bounced off $0.543 and rose above the downtrend line. This is a positive sign as it suggests that the correction could be over. However, this does not mean that a new uptrend will start immediately.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/6094e461-a11b-480e-bef3-fab9514ace97.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are unlikely to give up easily. They will try to stall the up-move at $0.6794. If they succeed, the XRP/USD pair could remain range-bound between $0.6794 and $0.543 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The next directional move could start after the price breaks above or below the range. If the bulls can push the price above $0.6794, a retest of $0.780574 will be on the cards.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below $0.543, selling could intensify and pull the price down to $0.4365.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($79.79) on Dec. 5 and the price had risen above the overhead resistance at $84.3374. If the bulls can sustain the altcoin above this level, the up-move could reach $93.9282.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/dbed8e8c-a5d5-49ce-8b53-da2b778226be.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are sloping up and if the RSI can break above the downtrend line, it will suggest that the bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the LTC/USD pair turns down from the current levels and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that traders are covering their long positions on minor rallies.\par \par \uc2 The next support on the downside is the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $75.943 and if this level also gives way, the pair could drop to the critical support at $68.9008.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are buying the dips to the $280 support but they are struggling to push the price to $300. This suggests that buying dries up at higher levels. The bears will now try to sink Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) below $280.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/0ab51803-f6bf-4cc2-a36f-e94cd3168b75.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the BCH/USD pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($270) and then to $246.85. The flattish moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint suggest that the bulls are losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated if the pair rises from the current levels or the $280 support and rallies above $300. Such a move will indicate that the bulls are back in action. Above $300, the rally could extend to $320 and then to $338.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 50-day SMA ($12.60) on Dec. 5, which shows that traders bought this dip. However, the bulls are facing stiff resistance near the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/6ab3540d-c055-4c4f-8ab6-78095122764d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA ($13.40) and the RSI near the midpoint do not indicate an advantage either to the bulls or the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 50-day SMA, a drop to the uptrend line is possible. If this support also cracks, the LINK/USD pair could start a deeper correction to $10.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated if the bulls can push and sustain the price above the downtrend line. If they can do that, the pair may rise to $14.80.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to keep Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($5.09). However, the lack of a strong rebound suggests a lack of urgency among traders to buy at this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/5412f190-6ffe-41af-9748-13bb6e73f1eb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price does not pick up momentum and rally to $5.5899, the bears will try to sink the price to the 50-day SMA ($4.67). Such a move could keep the DOT/USD pair range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the pair rises from the current levels and breaks above the overhead resistance, it will suggest the possible start of a new uptrend. The levels to watch on the upside are $6.0857 and then $6.8619.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($0.147) on Dec. 5 and rose above the $0.155 resistance. However, the bulls are struggling to sustain the price above $0.155, which suggests that bears are selling on minor rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/3d6bafea-8fe5-4645-990e-12577d23477b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears again sink the price below $0.155, it will increase the possibility of a break below the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest that the bulls are no longer buying on dips, which indicates a change in sentiment.\par \par \uc2 Below the 20-day EMA, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair could drop to the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at ($0.141) and then to the 61.8% retracement level at $0.1312.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls defend the $0.155 support, the pair may rise to the downtrend line. A break above this resistance could suggest that the bulls are back in action.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the moving averages on Dec. 04. The bulls attempted to push the price back above the moving averages in the past two days but they have not been able to sustain the altcoin above the 20-day EMA (29). This suggests selling by bears on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/8182454e-0f24-404d-b135-a5fcb6dc3305.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the price below $28.6588, the BNB/USD pair could start its journey southward towards the $25.6652 support. The flat moving averages and the RSI close to 50 suggest range-bound action may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Trading in a range can be volatile and directionless. Hence, it is better to wait patiently until the price breaks above or below the range and starts a trending move.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($0.159) on Dec. 5, but the rebound has once again fizzled out near the downtrend line. This suggests that the bears are selling on every pullback to the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/4252a378-f27c-47de-926b-9f66e897dc44.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the RSI has dropped below 58, which suggests that bulls are losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the decline could extend to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.140209. This is an important support to watch because if it cracks, panic selling may set in.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price once again rebounds off the 20-day EMA and rises above the downtrend line, the XLM/USD pair could rise to $0.20 and consolidate for a few days before starting a trending move.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjAtMTIvZjYzM2Q4ZDUtMTliOC00NzAyLTk2YjAtOTBjMDA4MTViMjE2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020201207egc7000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/4: BTC, ETH, XRP, LTC, BCH, LINK, DOT,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, XLM\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,845 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 December 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Many altcoins are seeing sharp corrections as Bitcoin price struggles to hold $19,000 as support.\par \par \uc2 A few years back, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price was controlled by whales as the crypto market lacked depth and was relatively illiquid. If whales were selling in unison, no one wanted to venture out and buy. Similarly, the whale\u8217\'20\'19s concerted buying easily boosted prices higher.\par \par \uc2 However, that is not the case anymore. With the arrival of institutional investors, it appears that the whales are gradually losing their ability to influence BT price.\par \par \uc2 According to on-chain data, Grayscale Investments purchased about twice the number of Bitcoin mined in November. The steady inflow of institutional funds has boosted Grayscale\u8217\'20\'19s Bitcoin Assets Under Management to over {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whales-selling-to-institutions-as-grayscale-adds-7-188-btc-in-24-hours"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $10.5 billion}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/2c5f5b91-05cd-4b6b-9643-93835a203ffa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Some investors will wonder why institutions are buying Bitcoin when the price is near record highs but it should be noted that institutional investors usually buy with the long-term in mind. The fact that they are buying near record highs shows they believe Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price will be considerably higher in a few years.\par \par \uc2 Legendary investor Paul Tudor Jones said that the current crypto {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-is-the-wrong-price-for-the-possibilities-it-has-says-paul-tudor-jones"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 market capitalization}}}\uc2  of about $560 billion is minuscule compared to the $90 trillion equity market cap and \u8220\'20\'1CGod knows how many trillions of fiat currency.\u8221\'20\'1D In the next two decades, Jones anticipates every one to be using \u8220\'20\'1Csome type of digital currency.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 With such huge future potential, it's easy to believe that crypto prices will only move higher but this is a common misconception. Every bull phase witnesses violent corrections, and eventually crypto prices will pullback. These are the opportunities that savvy retail and institutional investors will be watching for.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine the critical support levels from where the price may rebound.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is in an uptrend and it is currently consolidating near the overhead resistance zone of $19,500 to $20,000. The bears are aggressively defending this zone but the positive sign is that the bulls have not given up much ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/aeb1bf77-427a-4c94-bd79-57e89691d3fb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This shows that bulls are not closing their positions in a hurry and are buying on every minor dip. The upsloping moving averages suggest that bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 The only \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  development on the chart is the negative divergence on the relative strength index (RSI). While this setup warrants caution, it gets invalidated in strong uptrends, hence a trade should not be taken on this setup alone.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above $20,000, the next level to watch on the upside is $22,727 and then $25,000.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break below the 20-day exponential moving average ($18,013) and the BTC/USD pair could start a deeper correction if the support at $17,200 cracks.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating near the $622.807 overhead resistance for the past few days. Usually, a tight consolidation near the resistance is a positive sign because it shows that the bulls are not booking profits aggressively as they expect the up-move to resume.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/f33663c9-1232-4854-ad75-715258ab4eb2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls keep the price above $560, the possibility of a break above the $622.807 to $635.456 resistance zone increases. Above this level, the ETH/USD pair could resume the uptrend and rally to $800.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls fail to achieve the breakout even after repeated attempts, that may attract profit-booking by short-term traders and shorting by aggressive bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price dips below the 20-day EMA ($548), it will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. Below this level, the pair may plummet to $488.134.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  is currently witnessing a correction in an uptrend. The altcoin has turned down from the downtrend line and if the bears sink the price below $0.574, the altcoin could drop to the 20-day EMA at $0.521.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/eecd672a-a6a7-4912-afb6-7a416a6ed718.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 In an uptrend, the bulls usually buy the dip to the 20-day EMA. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The buyers will then try to propel the price above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the XRP/USD pair could rally to $0.6794 and then to $0.780574. On the other hand, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, a deeper correction to $0.4365 is possible.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) is consolidating in an uptrend. The price had been stuck between the $84.3374 support and the $93.9282 resistance for the past two days, but the bears are currently attempting to sustain the price below the support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/334df5fa-6c2f-4e8c-915b-e9df90bf3137.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears manage to do that, the LTC/USD pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($78). If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will again try to propel the pair above $93.9282 and resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the pair could slide to the next support at $68.9008, which is just above the 50-day SMA at $65.6947. If the bulls defend this support zone, a few days of range-bound action is possible.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) formed successive inside day candlestick patterns on Dec. 2 and 3, indicating indecision. The bulls tried to resume the up-move today but the long wick on the candlestick suggests aggressive selling by the bears at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/cee75ca2-b8d5-4b05-a1a3-ef657ebf9e04.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to sink the price below the $280 support but the bulls are defending this level. Both moving averages are flattening out and the RSI is just above the midpoint, suggesting a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 A break below the $280 support could pull the price down to the 50-day SMA ($268) and then to $246.85. On the other hand, if the bulls sustain the price above $300, the BCH/USD pair may rise to $320 and then to $338.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the downtrend line and the bears are currently attempting to sink the price back below the$13.28 support. If they succeed, the altcoin could drop to the 50-day SMA at $12.46.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/2f577808-9a23-4186-8d0b-36bbf3ad0d2d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to push the price above the downtrend line suggests that the bears are aggressively defending the higher levels. The 20-day EMA ($13.48) has flattened out and the RSI has dropped to the midpoint, indicating that bulls are losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 A break below the 50-day SMA could pull the price down to the uptrend line. A break below this support will tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated if the price turns up from the current levels or rebounds off the 50-day SMA and rises above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USD\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) again turned down from the $5.5899 overhead resistance on Dec. 3. This suggests that the bears are aggressively defending this level. The price has now dipped back to the 20-day EMA ($5.09).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/9130998a-ca4c-48b7-8b94-fbc420281e7a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will once again try to propel the price above the $5.5899 overhead resistance. If they succeed, a rally to $6.0857 and then to $6.8619 may be on the cards.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the DOT/USD pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($4.61) and remain range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is currently correcting in an uptrend. If the bears sink the price below the $0.155 support, the altcoin could drop to the 20-day EMA ($0.144). The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory suggest that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/1070fcf1-08ec-4b11-be3e-c53f8bff4a94.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are likely to defend the 20-day EMA support, which is just above the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at ($0.141).\par \par \uc2 If the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair rebounds off the 20-day EMA and rises above the downtrend line, it will increase the possibility of resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, a deeper correction to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.131 is possible.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) formed consecutive inside day candlestick patterns on Dec. 2 and 3. Today, the altcoin has formed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  engulfing candlestick, which shows that the bears have asserted their dominance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/8beb0f36-8ceb-428e-a08f-85fc7f5dd055.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the price below the moving averages, the BNB/USD pair could drop to the $25.6652 support. This is an important level that has held twice before. Therefore, the bulls are likely to buy a dip to this support once again.\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the $32 overhead resistance to gain strength.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) formed an inside day candlestick pattern on Dec. 2 and a Doji candlestick pattern on Dec. 3, both indicating indecision about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/3b5d6898-e685-46d1-80a2-69c07328314d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the uncertainty has resolved to the downside today. The XLM/USD pair has broken below the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.17513 and it can now drop to the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.15767, placed just above the 20-day EMA ($0.155).\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up, hence, the bulls may buy the dip to the 20-day EMA. A strong bounce could take the price to the downtrend line but a weak rebound could increase the possibility of a fall to the 61.8% retracement level at $0.140.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up and breaks above the downtrend line, a rally to $0.22 could be on the cards.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjAtMTIvNGM3Yzc3NDYtYjg4YS00MWU0LWFlOTQtYTNmYTU1MmMwYmYwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020201204egc4000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 3 key ways 2021\u8217\'20\'19s Bitcoin bull run may differ from 2017\u8217\'20\'19s\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Marcel Pechman \par \uc2 1,104 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 December 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price has overtaken its 2017 high, but should investors expect the top-ranked altcoins to do the same?\par \par \uc2 After a rather lengthy wait, the Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price is finally back to the same price range it was in three years ago. Back in 2017, when the Bitcoin price peaked near $19,900, most altcoins also posted 200% or higher weekly gains.\par \par \uc2 Fast forward to the present time, and BTC\u8217\'20\'19s $19,100 price is virtually identical to where it was on Dec. 17, 2017. One might think that not much has changed, despite some altcoins crashing, but that couldn\u8217\'20\'19t be more distant from the truth.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/b4d2a8cf-d11e-4f5f-b333-45f57cd8e489.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 A lot has changed in the cryptocurrency sector, and compared to 2017, a significant amount of necessary infrastructure has been built.\par \par \uc2 Today, there are tightly regulated derivatives offered through CME and CBOE futures contracts, and the rapid growth of institutional investors is providing an unending source of demand for Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 A new host of multi-billion-dollar-market-cap decentralized finance platforms have also emerged. They support a new system of lending, synthetic swaps and interest-earning systems for a whole new set of investors.\par \par \uc2 Compared to 2017, there is a wealth of easily accessible data related to price and market capitalization ranking. This should help investors better understand how today\u8217\'20\'19s market differed from the market in 2017.\par \par \uc2 We can better understand how the cryptocurrency market may look in a couple of years by analyzing the differences.\par \par \uc2 What\u8217\'20\'19s changed since 2017?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/48147e4d-d1f2-4520-b3c8-f72b64f7a0cc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Top 24 cryptocurrencies in December 2017. Source: CoinMarketCap\par \par \uc2 Regarding the ranking of cryptocurrencies by market capitalization, four of the top five remained the same. Oddly enough, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s market cap are relatively the same at $69 billion and $28 billion, respectively. This movement happened despite both cryptocurrencies seeing a 15% \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2  since December 2017.\par \par \uc2 This effect is caused by the issuance of new coins. For example, Ether\u8217\'20\'19s coin supply rose from 96.4 million to 113.7 million. The equivalent inflation amounted to 17.9% over three years. For comparison, the total number of Bitcoin in circulation increased by 10.8% in the same period.\par \par \uc2 Apart from Bitcoin, Ether, and XRP, the remaining cryptocurrencies in the top-20 took on heavy losses. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/iota-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 IOTA}}}\uc2  lost 91%, Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) 84%, \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) 73%, and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) saw a loss of 70%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2020-12/607942e3-f69d-403e-8f5a-43690d41b574.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Top 24 cryptocurrencies in Dec. 2020. Source: CoinMarketCap\par \par \uc2 It is worth noting that out of the current top 15, the only newcomers are Chainlink (LINK), Polkadot (DOT), and Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ). It should also be noted that Polkadot was not in existence in 2017 or 2018.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, Ether competitors like Cardano, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/neo-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 NEO}}}\uc2 , Ethereum Classic ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/etc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETC}}}\uc2  ) and QTUM seem to be losing ground. In the past year, they have been replaced with interoperability tokens like Chainlink and Polkadot.\par \par \uc2 The current top three coins, BTC, ETH, and XRP, entice a $448 billion market capitalization, which is a 7% increase over three years. Meanwhile, the remaining 21 leaders currently add up to a $77 billion capitalization, which is a 41% decrease.\par \par \uc2 One would automatically assume that Bitcoin dominance vastly increased in this time, but it rose by only 2% to the current 63%. This effect is only possible by the addition of hundreds of new tokens. The three sectors that stand out are exchange tokens, stablecoins and lastly, the decentralized finance sector.\par \par \uc2 Institutional investors will impact prices going forward\par \par \uc2 As previously mentioned, neither CBOE nor CME futures existed back in Dec. 2017, let alone with relevant liquidity. The same can be said from institutional investors\u8217\'20\'19 praising and effectively investing in Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 More recently, even BlackRock CEO Larry Fink {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-ceo-bitcoin-has-caught-our-attention"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seems to be somehow optimistic}}}\uc2  about Bitcoin becoming an asset class by itself.\par \par \uc2 Derivatives instruments give Bitcoin and Ether an enormous competitive advantage for professional investors\u8217\'20\'19 money. Recent favorable comments from United States CFTC regulator chairman Heath Tarbert left {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-cftc-chairman-says-ether-is-a-commodity-eth-futures-coming-next"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH regulated futures launch a step closer}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Thus, the odds of BTC and Ether being flipped becomes smaller as time goes by. Besides their dominance in the derivatives markets, the BTC and Ether 97% concentration of Grayscale Investment funds provides some insight into this theory.\par \par \uc2 Key factors that will impact the next bull run\par \par \uc2 Trying to predict massive future market shifts is a daunting and usually ineffective strategy. Nevertheless, a few conclusions can be drawn from this comparison.\par \par \uc2 According to the Lindy effect, the life expectancy of some technologies is proportional to their age, and the longer their survival, the longer they can be predicted to exist.\par \par \uc2 If this paradigm is applied to the sector, one might conclude that the longer a cryptocurrency stays in the top 12, the higher the probability it shall remain relevant three years later.\par \par \uc2 For example, the Bitcoin and Ethereum \u8220\'20\'1Ckiller\u8221\'20\'1D narrative was incredibly popular in 2017 and 2018 when competitor blockchains were forecast to overtake the sector leaders because of their faster throughput, cheaper fees and enhanced scaling or \u8220\'20\'1Creal-world use.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Although those narratives may have sounded smart back in 2017, time has proven that the network effect stands. The best technology does not always win.\par \par \uc2 Another unique phenomenon in the crypto sector that investors should watch out for are hard forks and code-base clones. Back in 2017, Bitcoin Cash, Bitcoin Gold (BTG), Ethereum Classic, and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/dash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dash}}}\uc2  forked or had competitive clones launched. They prospered initially, but reviewing their price and market cap shows that their success was short-lived.\par \par \uc2 The total coin supply and the issuance rate of a cryptocurrency can also impact its price performance. Cryptocurrencies with high issuance might experience difficulty catching up in price. That includes XRP, Chainlink (LINK), Polkadot (DOT), Stellar ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ), Tron ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tron-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TRX}}}\uc2  ), and Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xtz-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 Even though each of these has plenty of convincing real-world applications and impressive partnerships, their massive coin supply makes sharp, upward price movements difficult.\par \par \uc2 Retail-driven flow will almost certainly push some altcoins higher, except this time around, there are some with real use cases.\par \par \uc2 Judging by the usage increase in 2020, the sectors likely to see increased interest include oracles, interconnectivity, decentralized exchange tokens, non-custodial lending and liquidity provision.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/noshitcoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 author}}}\uc2  and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjAtMTIvYjE4YmQ2YjktYWE1MS00NmUzLThiZjItZDA0NGFjYzljZTk1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020201204egc40008f\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 3 key ways 2021's Bitcoin bull run may differ from 2017's\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Marcel Pechman \par \uc2 1,107 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 December 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price has overtaken its 2017 high, but should investors expect the top-ranked altcoins to do the same?\par \par \uc2 After a rather lengthy wait, Bitcoin price is finally back to the same price range it was in 3 years ago. Back in 2017, when the Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https: